window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1501,"title":"Chapter 1501 Look At Yourself In The Mirror","paragraphs":["1501 Look At Yourself In The Mirror","The previous president of the perfume competition was Madam Leng. After she passed away, her student, Jiang Ying, took over this position. At this moment, Jiang Ying shouted angrily, “Du Ming! What have you done?!”","Du Ming was so scared that his entire body trembled. He stammered, “I... I thought Bright Moon was just an orphan with no one to rely on. I didn’t expect her to have so many backers!”","Jiang Ying flew into a rage. “An orphan with no one to rely on? Even if she’s an orphan, you can’t malign her! Tell me the truth now. What did you do in her lounge? Don’t think that I’ll believe you just because you took the initiative to resign from your position as a judge. Tell me the truth!”","At this moment, a middle-aged judge stood up to mediate the situation. “President Jiang, don’t be angry. Mr. Du wouldn’t sacrifice his future to wrongly accuse a contestant. Moreover, someone reported Bright Moon, so Mr. Du stood up to prove his innocence. Bright Moon is just a small fry. She relied on seducing the judges to get first place. There’s no doubt about that.”","Jiang Ying frowned, and her eyes were cold. “Judge Zhao, did you not investigate this matter at all and chose to believe Du Ming’s nonsense directly?”","Du Ming’s expression was extremely ugly. It was already very embarrassing to be scolded by a woman. They had worked together for so many years, so why didn’t Jiang Ying believe him?","Judge Zhao was the most experienced judge in this competition. His power was second only to Twilight’s. He snorted. “President Jiang, do you need to investigate this? I’ve seen many women like her who sell their bodies for the sake of getting to the top. There’s no need to waste time investigating.”","“Heh!” Jiang Ying sneered. “Judge Zhao, I’m afraid you don’t know what’s going on online!”","Judge Zhao looked impatient. “Of course, I know. That woman is a perfumer signed by Gu Corporation, so it’s understandable for Gu Corporation to speak up for her, but...”","“So you do know?! The lawyer’s letter has already been sent to my office. Don’t you know that?” Jiang Ying interrupted the other party angrily and said hatefully, “Other than Gu Corporation, Li City University has also spoken out online. They’ve even collected the signatures of all the teachers and students in the university to vouch for Bright Moon. There are also the Xue, Yin, and Qin families who have spoken out online!","“Do you know that Gu Corporation’s competitor, the Brook family, has also expressed online that they want to protect Bright Moon’s rights and interests to the death? You said that Bright Moon is a contracted perfumer of Gu Corporation, so it’s understandable for Gu Corporation to step forward to protect her. However, how do you explain other noble families also stepping forward to protect her? Could it be that other than signing a contract with Gu Corporation, she has also signed a contract with the Brook family?”","When Judge Zhao heard the names of these noble families, his breathing seemed to have stopped.","How was that possible? Why would these people appear together to vouch for Bright Moon? If Bright Moon really had so many powerful backers, there was no need for her to participate in the perfume competition. After all, the champion of this competition was already Kang Qingzhi.","Moreover, if Bright Moon really had such a powerful background, why would she seduce Du Ming?","At the thought of this, Judge Zhao looked at Du Ming coldly. His angry gaze seemed to burn a hole in Du Ming’s body.","Jiang Ying, who was at the side, looked at Du Ming in disdain and said in a mocking tone, “Once Bright Moon got into trouble, so many noble families spoke up for her. If she wanted the championship, it’d just be a matter of a few words. Why would she sell her body to seduce you?”","Any one of these noble families could make the International Perfume Competition compromise and let Bright Moon be the champion. Bright Moon had no reason to seduce Du Ming!","She heard that Bright Moon was young, beautiful, and capable. How could she take a liking to the old and greasy Du Ming? Hence, the claim of her seducing the judges was nonsense!","Jiang Ying looked away in disgust, not wanting to look at Du Ming anymore. “Du Ming, think carefully about how to explain this matter. You keep saying that Bright Moon seduced you, but where’s the evidence? You seem to only have a photo and your one-sided words. What else do you have? Behind Bright Moon is President Gu of Gu Corporation and the head of the Brook family. Those two are young, promising, handsome, and rich men. She could have seduced anyone, but she chose to seduce you. Why don’t you look at yourself in the mirror? Are you worthy?”","After saying this, Jiang Ying glared fiercely at Du Ming and left angrily.","The office was silent for a few seconds. Judge Zhao’s body stiffened as he slid from the sofa to the floor. It was as if all the strength in his body had been sucked away. Du Ming’s forehead was covered in a cold sweat. He was so scared that he could not say a word."]},{"number":1502,"title":"Chapter 1502 Chapter 1502 The Temptation of Money","paragraphs":["1502 Chapter 1502 The Temptation of Money","Du Ming was worried. Now that this incident was raging on the internet, once those families knew that he went to the lounge to force Bright Moon and in turn slandered Bright Moon for seducing him, how would those families deal with him?","He hurriedly rushed out of the office, walked to a corner where no one was around, and dialed Kang Qingzhi’s phone number, “Miss Kang...”","“I know everything.” The woman’s angry voice came from the other end of the phone. “Now that things have come to this, you absolutely can’t admit it. You have to stick to your previous words. As long as you don’t change your words, I’ll help you solve everything. However, if you change your words, I have the Kang family behind me. I’ll definitely be able to escape, but you’ll be in trouble. Think about the consequences!”","Du Ming was so scared that his body trembled. “No, no...”","“In any case, they can’t produce any evidence. Just insist that Bright Moon seduced you. It doesn’t matter if they believe you or not. Leave the rest to me.”","With that, Kang Qingzhi hung up heartlessly.","Du Ming’s cold sweat had already drenched his clothes. Since he had already accepted Kang Qingzhi’s money and walked on this path, he could not turn back.","Speaking of which, who was Bright Moon? How did she make Kang Qingzhi scheme against her?","However, Kang Qingzhi was right. It was meaningless even if these large families appeared to protect Bright Moon. They could not produce any evidence at all. As long as he insisted that Bright Moon seduced him, Bright Moon would still withdraw from the competition in the end.","Du Ming exhaled, and his expression softened a lot.","At the same time, in the Kang family.","Kang Qingzhi’s slender fingers held the cell phone tightly as she gritted her teeth. She originally thought that Qiao Xi would not have the chance to make a comeback. She did not expect so many people to stand up for Qiao Xi. Even Li City University, a famous university, stood up for her.","She had really underestimated Qiao Xi. This woman was much smarter than five years ago!","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with resentment. She made a call and gritted her teeth. “Are all of you dead? Why didn’t you continue to criticize her after accepting my money?”","The person on the other end was very helpless. “Miss Kang, so many noble families have appeared. If we continue to scold her, we’ll be suspected!”","Kang Qingzhi was so angry that her body was trembling. “A bunch of trash! Do you still want the rest of the money?!”","“Miss Kang, since you’ve already said so much, let’s make things clear. If we continue to insult Bright Moon online, Gu Corporation and the Brook family will definitely not let us off. Even if you give us money, we have to be alive to spend it!”","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth, her eyes filled with viciousness. “Five million. After this is done, you can take the money and leave Li City.”","The person on the other end suddenly fell silent.","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were bloodshot as she said angrily, “I don’t care what method you use. As long as you make Bright Moon withdraw from the perfume competition and ruin her reputation, I’ll give you five million yuan.”","“Uhh...”","Kang Qingzhi continued to persuade them. “Bright Moon doesn’t have any evidence now. Who knows if the claims online are true or not? If they want to sue you, they have to show evidence! If the matter is really exposed, just say that you were casually saying it and it was just a rumor. What can they do to you? You’ll be released after three years in prison at most, but you’ll get five million yuan. Do you think you can get a job that’ll earn you five million yuan in three years?”","In the end, the person on the other end of the phone could not resist the temptation of money. He gritted his teeth and said, “Alright! Give us the money first!”","After hanging up, Kang Qingzhi smiled proudly. So what if there were noble families protecting her? As long as Qiao Xi could not produce any evidence, Du Ming would insist that Bright Moon took the initiative to seduce her. Coupled with those people instigating things online, Qiao Xi could only suffer in silence.","Kang Qingzhi had a strong feeling that if Qiao Xi participated in the perfume competition, she would definitely snatch her title as the champion. Moreover, she would be exposed for faking the competition. At that time, she would fall into a quagmire and be unable to establish herself in the Kang family!","In the Perfume Association’s office.","Jiang Ying pinched the bridge of her nose and instructed, “Stabilize the news online first and restore Bright Moon’s right to participate.”","The assistant was in a dilemma. “But the matter hasn’t been investigated clearly, and Bright Moon can’t produce evidence to prove her innocence.”","“Then what evidence do we have to prove that she seduced the judges?” Jiang Ying was annoyed, and her tone became serious. “Just Du Ming’s one-sided statement has convicted Bright Moon. Is this the rule of the Perfume Association? We’ll inform Bright Moon to participate in the competition first and wait for the results of the investigation. If she really did that kind of thing, her results will be void. If Du Ming had wrongly accused her, he’ll be fired as a warning to others. We’ll also get him to apologize to Bright Moon in public. At that time, I’ll personally clarify things for Bright Moon online.”"]},{"number":1503,"title":"Chapter 1503 Can’t Change One’s Personality","paragraphs":["1503 Can’t Change One’s Personality","Jiang Ying thought for a long time. She could only wait for the results of the investigation before punishing the parties that needed to be punished and apologizing. If it was really Bright Moon’s fault, those noble families would not be able to continue protecting her.","The assistant was still in a dilemma. “But... Who knows if those noble families are really standing up for her or if there’s another reason? Maybe...”","“Whether those noble families are sincerely protecting her or not, we can’t malign an innocent person! Should a person with no one to rely on be trampled under our feet?” Jiang Ying questioned angrily.","What were these people thinking?","!!","Ever since Madam Leng passed away, she had wanted to get rid of the Perfume Association. However, these people were all blinded by money and benefits. This had already caused the perfume competition to go bad!","The assistant had never seen her so angry before. He hurriedly said while trembling, “I-I was just saying it casually. I’ll post a statement online now.”","With that, the assistant left in a hurry, but he was a little unconvinced. He had already accepted Du Ming’s money, so he naturally had to do what he was paid to do. Moreover, Xu Ling was behind this. Xu Ling was Kang Qingzhi’s good friend. How could they dare to offend her?","Among the entire competition’s organizers, Jiang Ying was probably the only one who did not know that the internal champion was Kang Qingzhi. She only wanted to be fair and selfless. What era was it now? Why was she still so old-fashioned?!","...","In the Kang family’s villa.","When Old Madam Kang saw so many noble families protecting Qiao Xi, she was angered to the point of looking ferocious.","Kang Qingzhi’s posture was weak, so she sighed. “No wonder my sister doesn’t need my brother’s help. It turns out that she has so many backers. She’s cheerful and healthy, so she has so many friends. However, I’ve been weak and sick since I was young. I can’t go out and can’t make new friends at all. I’m really envious of Sister Xi Xi.”","When Old Madam Kang heard this, anger instantly surged in her heart. She spat on the floor. “Pfft! She’s a vixen. She’s relying on her face to seduce men! How shameless!”","At this moment, Kang Jichuan realized that Kang Qingzhi had her head lowered and her eyes were filled with tears. She looked aggrieved, and he hurriedly asked, “Qingzhi, what’s wrong? Did Xi Xi look for you?”","Kang Qingzhi’s body trembled. She slowly looked up like a frightened little white rabbit. Tears welled up in her eyes, and her lips trembled. “Brother, I...”","“Tell me quickly.” Kang Jichuan frowned as if he had already expected something.","Tears trickled down Kang Qing’s face, and her voice was a little choked. “Sister Xi Xi did look for me. She said... She said that the perfume recipes I used to participate in the competition are all hers, but I had never seen her before this. How could I have stolen her perfume recipes?","“It’s probably because we happened to use the same spices that Sister said that. Brother, don’t blame Sister. She doesn’t have any ill intentions.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Old Madam Kang slammed the table, her eyes filled with resentment. “Nonsense! This little b*tch actually dares to slander you? She’s just a b*tch who only knows how to seduce men. She doesn’t have any ability, yet she wants to snatch your perfume recipes. Does she have any shame?!”","Old Madam Kang thought that Kang Qingzhi and Qiao Xi had never met, but only Kang Jichuan knew very well that they had already met five years ago. However, hadn’t Xi Xi lost her memory? How could she say such things?","That shouldn’t be the case! If she really remembered, why didn’t she say anything? She would definitely complain to her father and publicize it so that he and Qingzhi would pay the price.","Kang Jichuan thought about it and roughly understood that Qiao Xi had not recovered her memory. Although five years had passed, her character could not be changed. Qiao Xi was just slandering Qingzhi for stealing her perfume recipes.","“Qingzhi, do you believe that Xi Xi seduced the judges?” Kang Jichuan suddenly asked.","Kang Qingzhi was at a loss. “I... I don’t believe it, but Xu Ling told me that her lounge was next to Sister Xi Xi’s. She saw it with her own eyes. But it’s possible that she saw it wrongly.”","Kang Jichuan took a deep breath as if he had made an important decision. A trace of coldness flashed past his eyes. “Qingzhi, I won’t let you suffer. Even if that person is my biological sister, she can’t bully you!”","When Kang Qingzhi heard these words, her eyes were filled with gratitude. Then, she said in a panic, “Brother! Could it be that you... You can’t! Brother, you can’t do this. Sister Xi Xi is your biological sister. If you offend her for me, she’ll never acknowledge you as her brother!”","“It doesn’t matter if she acknowledges me or not. Since she made a mistake, she has to bear the consequences!” Kang Jichuan’s expression was extremely gloomy."]},{"number":1504,"title":"Chapter 1504 Deal With This Little B*tch","paragraphs":["1504 Deal With This Little B*tch","Ten minutes later, public opinion erupted online again.","[Kang Jichuan posted on his company account that everything Du Ming said is true. Could it be that Bright Moon really seduced Du Ming?]","[I’m dumbfounded! Who’s telling the truth?! Speaking of which, the noble families who spoke up for Bright Moon weren’t even present. How can they be sure that Bright Moon wouldn’t do such a thing?]","[Kang Qingzhi was at the scene. Since her brother spoke up, doesn’t that mean that Kang Qingzhi saw something?]","[Qingzhi won’t lie. Bright Moon, you vixen, quit the competition! Let there be peace in the perfume world!]","Kang Qingzhi watched as the internet stirred up waves again and smiled in satisfaction. Now that Kang Jichuan had released a statement, Qiao Xi would never forgive the Kang family. No matter what the final outcome was, with Qiao Xi’s character, she would never return to the Kang family.","...","After the competition’s organizers informed Bright Moon that the semi-finals were about to start, the contestants had to concoct perfumes within six days. However, the perfumes that were made had to be placed in an airtight container to be mellowed. The longer they were stored, the better the fragrance would be. Hence, six days was not enough at all. An outstanding perfumer would use the shortest time to mellow the perfumes so that they would emit the most perfect fragrance.","On the day of the competition, the contestants entered the venue to prepare. Gu Yao was guarding the door with a group of friends, his sharp eyes scanning the door.","“F*ck! Isn’t that the internationally renowned perfumer, Sofia? I’ve even used her perfumes before! They smell really good!”","“Wow! What’s that person’s name again? He looks so familiar! I heard that he can enter the finals every time. This time, he even said in an interview that he wants to compete for the championship!”","Gu Yao’s friends were chattering at the side. They were very excited to see these famous perfumers.","At this moment, the young master of the Yang family, Yang Xu, immediately shouted, “Look! That two-faced b*tch is here!”","“Where?”","“Let me see what she looks like.”","The door was already crowded. A group of noble socialites and young masters raised their heads and looked not far away. Kang Qingzhi was wearing a simple light pink dress and smiling gently. The three people from the Kang family were beside her as they walked into the event location.","“F*ck! This woman is obviously a two-faced b*tch! She looks gentle and weak, but she’s full of evil tricks!”","“To be honest, she’s quite good-looking, but she’s inexplicably annoying.”","“She’s considered good-looking? You men are so shallow. The truly good-looking woman is Gu Yao’s sister-in-law! Kang Qingzhi doesn’t hold a candle to her!”","“Kang Jichuan even posted online that Sister-in-law seduced that wretched man. Is the Kang family crazy? With Sister-in-law’s identity, does she need to seduce the judges?”","Hearing the crowd’s clamor, Gu Yao looked up at Kang Qingzhi, who was not far away. In front of everyone, she looked like an elegant and gentle socialite, but that was all on the surface. Kang Qingzhi actually had a vicious heart.","As for the rest of the Kang family...","Gu Yao frowned. Qiao Xi had clearly found her biological father, but her father and brother were both biased toward the family’s adopted daughter. They did not care about her at all. What was the point of finding such a family?","After half an hour, the contestants gradually entered. There were no longer many people at the door. Yang Xu asked anxiously, “Ah Yao, tell me, how should we deal with that b*tch today?”","“Qiao Xi asked us to wait for her here.” After Gu Yao finished speaking, a car stopped at the door the next second. A slim figure appeared in front of everyone.","“Wow! Sister-in-law is here!” Yang Xu shouted.","“Qiao Xi!” Gu Yao hurriedly went forward.","“I’m sorry I’m late.” Qiao Xi smiled at everyone.","Before Gu Yao could say anything, a group of noble socialites and young masters rushed forward and waved their hands with a smile. “It’s okay. We don’t mind waiting for Sister-in-law. We’ll definitely do our best!”","Qiao Xi smiled gently. “Thank you in advance. I hope you can accidentally spread the news of what happened today. It’s best if everyone in Li City’s high society knows about it.”","The Kang family valued their reputation the most. If news of this got out today, the Kang family would lose all their dignity. At the same time, everyone would see what kind of people the ‘gentle and humble’ Kang family was!","“Accidentally?” Yang Xu pondered for a moment and had an idea. “I understand now. I accidentally saw these things and accidentally spread the news.”","“That’s simple!” A girl at the side said excitedly, “I know that there’s a small banquet hall beside the International Perfume Competition’s venue. We can get some friends to gather here!”"]},{"number":1505,"title":"Chapter 1505 Being Preempted","paragraphs":["1505 Being Preempted","“The small banquet hall is connected to the competition venue. We can pretend to have walked into the wrong place. Even if they suspect us, they can’t do anything to us!”","As soon as the girl finished speaking, everyone nodded. Qiao Xi also gave her a thumbs up. “Good idea. Then I’ll have to trouble you. Have fun. I’ll foot the bill!”","Gu Yao shrunk his neck. “If Gu Zheng finds out that I asked you for money, he’ll definitely skin me alive. Since I’m the one who asked everyone for help, of course, I’ll be the one paying. I still have this bit of money! Everyone, call your friends! The more the merrier!”","The group of people walked away while laughing. They were about to rent the banquet hall beside them but Gu Yao still stood at the side. He wanted to say something but hesitated. After a long time, he comforted Qiao Xi softly. “Q-Qiao Xi, don’t be sad.”","!!","Qiao Xi had a calm expression as she raised her eyebrows. “What makes you think I’m sad?”","“I saw the thread online. Kang...” Gu Yao suddenly paused and sized up Qiao Xi from the corner of his eyes, afraid that he would hit a sore spot.","So many people had stepped forward to protect Qiao Xi. They were clearly not related by blood, but they believed that Qiao Xi would not do such a thing. However, the Kang family, as her family, chose to abandon her and even posted such a thing online. They were clearly stabbing Qiao Xi in the heart!","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “Oh, Kang Jichuan’s post. I saw it too.”","Gu Yao’s expression was complicated. After a moment of silence, he seemed to have made a major decision. He gritted his teeth and looked like he was sacrificing himself. He said seriously, “Qiao Xi! If you’re really sad, treat me as Kang Jichuan and beat me up to vent your anger!”","Qiao Xi was dumbfounded: “!!!” Gu Yao was really cute!","After a while, Yang Xu rushed back with a lonely expression. “Has Sister-in-law entered?”","Gu Yao replied, “She’s in. There’s no rush. She’ll only make a move after the competition begins. We can just find a chance to enter. Have you rented the banquet hall?”","Yang Xu spread his hands helplessly. “No, someone else rented it first. If our original plan doesn’t work, won’t it be too deliberate if we keep guarding outside?”","Gu Yao was also a little surprised. Why was the banquet hall rented out at nine in the morning?","“What’s the name of the person who rented the banquet hall?”","Yang Xu said, “That manager refused to tell me, but he did after I gave him some money. His name is Twilight. This name is strange. I don’t know where to find this guy.”","Gu Yao thought for a moment. He had never heard of Twilight either.","Just as everyone was at a loss, a young man in a suit and leather shoes rushed over. “Are you Mr. Gu Yao?”","Gu Yao sized up the person in front of him warily and nodded.","Seeing this, the young man smiled and said, “Hello, I’m Mr. Twilight’s assistant. Mr. Twilight wants to invite everyone to meet him. Mr. Twilight said that he’s willing to give the banquet hall to you.”","Everyone was stunned. They did not know where to look for Twilight, but this person took the initiative to look for them and was even willing to give the banquet hall to them!","Yang Xu was so excited that he almost jumped up. “Gu Yao, let’s go over quickly!”","Gu Yao was a little hesitant, but he saw that this assistant had no ill intentions. There were many of them, and they were all from Li City’s high society. He was not afraid that the other party would harm them, so he followed the assistant into the banquet hall.","At this moment, a man in a black suit was standing in the middle of the banquet hall. He was tall and exuded a cold aura. His back was facing everyone.","“Hiss...” Yang Xu narrowed his eyes and grabbed Gu Yao’s arm. “Gu Yao, this person looks like your brother! Maybe I was wrong. It’s just that the back view looks similar.”","When Gu Yao saw the man in front of him, his expression froze.","These young masters and socialites were still young and had not taken over their families’ businesses. Hence, they did not have much contact with Gu Zheng. Most of them had only seen him a few times from afar at banquets. However, as Gu Yao looked at this man’s back, he was certain that this man was Gu Zheng.","The two brothers had grown up together since they were young. He had been beaten up by Gu Zheng countless times, so when he saw Gu Zheng, he felt inexplicably afraid. Moreover, this man exuded an aura that kept strangers away. He was clearly Gu Zheng!","However, wasn’t this banquet hall rented by Twilight? If Gu Zheng had rented it, he could have just told him. Why did he have to invite them over in Twilight’s name?","Yang Xu, who was at the side, had already begun to greet the man warmly. “You must be Mr. Twilight. I’ve heard a lot about you. Thank you so much for being willing to give up the banquet hall!”"]},{"number":1506,"title":"Chapter 1506 Show Your Intellect","paragraphs":["1506 Show Your Intellect","The banquet hall was silent for a few seconds. The man in front slowly turned around. He was wearing a black mask. His light brown eyes were calm, and his thin lips were slightly curled. Although he was smiling, he gave off a distant feeling.","Gu Yao: “...” Damn! This was Gu Zheng, that bastard!","Twilight’s assistant said respectfully, “Our master once met Second Young Master Gu at a banquet, so when he heard that Second Young Master Gu wanted to use the banquet hall, he decided to give it to you.”","Yang Xu’s face was instantly filled with admiration. “Ah! Gu Yao! You’re still the best!”","Gu Yao smirked: “...” ‘I’m awesome!’","Twilight glanced at Gu Yao casually and said, “Second Young Master Gu, can we talk alone?”","Gu Yao pursed his lips, gritted his teeth, and followed Twilight into the lounge next door.","Yang Xu and the others were all about the same age as Gu Yao. They yearned for freedom and were unwilling to take over their family’s businesses. Their lives only comprised of eating, drinking, and playing, so they were all very naive. Just like Yang Xu, who clearly thought that Twilight’s back view was similar to Gu Zheng’s, but he did not suspect anything. He even naively thought that Twilight and Gu Yao would just chat alone.","“Time is tight. Let’s quickly set up. When the time is right, we’ll pretend to be in the wrong place.” Yang Xu waved at everyone. Everyone got busy.","At the same time, Gu Yao was looking at the man in front of him with a hopeless expression. Then, he said in disdain, “Gu Zheng, do you think I won’t be able to recognize you just because you’re wearing a mask? If you like to role-play, go home and play. Don’t embarrass yourself outside every day!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the man took off his mask and revealed his true face.","Gu Yao rolled his eyes and suddenly thought of something. “Twilight? This name sounds so familiar! You were also the person at the cultural relic restoration event? Is there something wrong with you? Why did you act so mysterious even when you were helping Qiao Xi?","“Besides, you’re just wearing a mask. Those who are familiar with you can recognize you.” Gu Yao continued, “Even I haven’t been deceived by your disguise. Can you deceive others?”","Gu Zheng glanced at him and said casually, “That’s because I’m not pretending in front of you. As long as you’re not stupid, you’ll be able to recognize me.”","Gu Yao: “...” Why did he feel like he was being mocked? In order to let him recognize him, Gu Zheng did not disguise himself? This bastard was insulting him!","He sat on the chair and cleared his throat. “If you have something to say, say it quickly. My time is precious.”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before looking at him meaningfully. “Use your intelligence to look for trouble with the Kang family.”","Hearing this, Gu Yao was instantly interested. He had been a good-for-nothing for so many years and was best at causing trouble for others. However, ever since he took over the company, he had been extremely busy every day and had to take care of his image, so he had not let loose for a long time.","Gu Yao was excited. “Alright! I like to cause trouble for others, but...”","He paused for a moment and was slightly troubled. “But the Kang family is related to Qiao Xi by blood, after all. If I do something overboard, will the Kang family blame her?! I don’t want Qiao Xi to be sad.”","Gu Zheng glanced at him. “Didn’t I tell you to display your intelligence? You can do it secretly. It doesn’t matter if you’re really discovered. Just do it.”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Gu Yao understood. His mission this time was very important. He patted his chest and promised, “I promise to complete the mission!”","“I’ll get going first.” Gu Zheng nodded, stood up, put on his mask, and left in a hurry.","Gu Yao looked at Gu Zheng’s figure, his heart filled with doubts.","Since Gu Zheng was at the scene, why did he ask him to do such a thing? Could it be that Qiao Xi did not know that Twilight was Gu Zheng at all? However, Gu Zheng had already revealed his identity to him, so why was he unwilling to tell Qiao Xi?","At the event location of the perfume competition.","The three members of the Kang family were sitting in the audience seats and looking at Kang Qingzhi from the competition area with loving eyes. Actually, according to the rules of the perfume competition, the audience did not need to be present in the semi-finals. The audience would only be invited to the finals. The three members of the Kang family could enter because of their noble status. They owned a perfume company and were the family of the two-time champion, Kang Qingzhi.","Xu Ling hurriedly pulled Kang Qingzhi’s sleeve and said excitedly, “Qingzhi! Your family is here!”","Seeing this, Kang Qingzhi hurriedly put down the things in her hand and ran to the audience. Her cheeks were red as she shouted cutely, “Dad, Brother, Grandma!”"]},{"number":1507,"title":"Chapter 1507 I Apologize On Her Behalf","paragraphs":["1507 I Apologize On Her Behalf","Matriarch Kang pulled Kang Qingzhi into her arms and stroked her head gently. She shouted affectionately, “My good granddaughter!”","Everyone looked at them. Actually, everyone knew very well that there was a high chance that Kang Qingzhi would be the champion this time. It was not only because she was capable but also because she had a good family background. No one else was her match.","“Qingzhi, are you feeling well?” Kang Jichuan was a little worried.","Kang Qingzhi smiled and replied, “I’m fine. Brother, don’t worry. I’ve already made preparations. No matter what the questions are this time, I’ll be fine!”","!!","“Our Qingzhi is indeed outstanding. Um...” Old Madam Kang wanted to say something, but she suddenly stopped. Then, she frowned unhappily. “That kind of person shouldn’t be standing on the same stage as Qingzhi.”","Kang Qingzhi held Old Madam Kang’s hand and said in a gentle and helpless voice, “Grandma, don’t say that. Sister Xi Xi is also...”","“Qingzhi! You’re still defending her at a time like this!” At the mention of Qiao Xi, Old Madam Kang could not suppress the anger in her heart and snorted. “I get angry whenever she’s mentioned! How unlucky!”","Old Madam Kang was burning with anger. Coincidentally, the event location was very quiet at this time, so everyone heard her voice and looked over.","Actually, everyone knew very well that the person Old Madam Kang was talking about was Bright Moon, the perfumer who was almost eliminated from the competition. The contestants did not have much of a reaction when they found out that Bright Moon had seduced the judges. Why was Old Madam Kang so angry? Could it be that she was afraid that Bright Moon would snatch Kang Qingzhi’s championship title?","Kang Qingzhi saw the strange gazes around her and pretended to be worried. “Grandma, I believe my sister wouldn’t do such a thing. There must be a misunderstanding...”","“Miss Kang!” A voice from afar interrupted Kang Qingzhi. The other party was a staff member of the perfume competition. “Miss Kang, the competition is about to start. Hurry up and return to the competition area!”","Kang Qingzhi nodded and looked at Old Madam Kang pitifully. “Grandma, just listen to me this once. Don’t blame Sister.”","With that, she looked at Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru. Her eyes turned slightly red. “Brother, Dad, I know... I’ve let my sister down. It’s all because of me that she was misunderstood. After the competition ends, I have to vouch for my sister. Even if I have to lose my future, I have to clear my sister’s name.”","Old Madam Kang’s voice was sharp. “Qingzhi! Are you crazy?”","Kang Qingzhi’s tears trickled down. She leaned into Old Madam Kang’s arms and sobbed softly. “Grandma, she’s Dad’s biological daughter, after all! It wasn’t easy for Dad to find her. I don’t want Dad to be sad. Moreover, I don’t think Sister Xi Xi would do such a thing. Even if everyone criticizes her, I have to protect her...”","Kang Jichuan widened his eyes with complicated emotions. Xi Xi had made things difficult for Qingzhi time and again, but Qingzhi still wanted to clear Xi Xi’s name.","However, after Qingzhi won the championship, wouldn’t it affect her reputation if she defended someone who seduced the judges?","At this moment, Xu Ling walked over with a few friends. One of the female participants said in a disdainful tone, “Does Bright Moon still have the cheek to participate in the competition? She seduced the judges. How disgusting!”","When Kang Qingzhi heard this, she instantly turned around and said in a trembling voice, “I won’t allow you to say that. The matter of Sister Bright Moon seducing the judges hasn’t been investigated clearly. Moreover, she has already withdrawn from the competition. Don’t insult her.”","When she said the last sentence, Kang Qingzhi’s voice carried a trace of tears. She even bowed 90 degrees to everyone. “She might have done something wrong, but that doesn’t mean that she’s that kind of person. She might have had her reasons. I apologize on her behalf. If you have to scold someone, scold me.”","Xu Ling hurriedly went forward to comfort her. “Qingzhi, what does this have to do with you? She doesn’t love herself and did such a scandalous thing. Why are you protecting her? No matter how much you sacrifice for her, she won’t be grateful to you!”","Everyone knew that Kang Qingzhi’s status was noble, so they all comforted her. “Yes! Miss Kang, Bright Moon relied on selling her body to get to where she is today, while you relied on your ability and talent. The two of you are worlds apart. You don’t have to suffer for such a woman!”","“It’s been so many days. So many people have stood up for her, but she doesn’t dare to say a word. Miss Kang, your health isn’t good to begin with, yet you still have to explain yourself for that kind of woman. Bright Moon is really heartless!”"]},{"number":1508,"title":"Chapter 1508 Sorry, Im Late","paragraphs":["1508 Sorry, I’m Late","When Kang Jichuan heard everyone’s discussion, he was even angrier. Qingzhi had already explained everything for Xi Xi, but Qiao Xi did not thank her at all. She even said that Qingzhi had stolen her perfume recipes.","He knew that Qingzhi was obedient. She had always felt guilty toward Xi Xi, so she tried her best to protect her. However, why was Xi Xi still unwilling to let Qingzhi off?","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with tears. She looked pitiful. “Brother, you must believe Sister. She wouldn’t...”","Kang Jichuan’s heart ached. Five years ago, Qingzhi also tried to please Xi Xi. In order to be able to stay in this family, she humbled herself.","!!","At first, when the two of them had a conflict, he chose to believe Qiao Xi. However, later on, he realized that something was wrong. No matter what Xi Xi said, Qingzhi never retorted. She always hid and wiped her tears alone. After he carefully investigated, he found out that Xi Xi had deliberately wronged Qingzhi. Qingzhi was wronged, but she endured it and did not dare to say anything. She could only cry in the dead of the night.","Kang Jichuan’s heart ached. Qingzhi had suffered so much back then. He could not repeat the same mistake.","“Qingzhi, stop crying. Just focus on the competition. The competition’s organizers are still investigating Bright Moon. I believe it won’t be long before the results are out. Don’t interfere with anything.”","“I... I owe my sister. I want to help her...”","“Qingzhi!” Kang Jichuan was extremely annoyed and raised his voice a little. “You’ve been helping her absolve herself, but she’s always thinking of making things difficult for you! Don’t care about these things anymore. The competition is the most important thing.”","Kang Qingzhi nodded obediently, wiped her tears, and followed Xu Ling on stage.","Old Madam Kang looked at Kang Qingzhi’s back view, and her heart ached. Then, she gritted her teeth and said, “Qiao Xi is really a jinx. She caused chaos in the Kang family before she even officially returned. She seduced the judges, bullied Qingzhi, and even slandered Qingzhi for stealing her perfume recipes. She even used her dirty methods on us! Little b*tch!”","Faced with Kang Qingzhi’s forbearance and grievances, the Kang family was already disgusted with Qiao Xi. Even Kang Ru, whose heart was filled with guilt, was increasingly disappointed in her.","If they really wanted to bring Xi Xi back to Y Nation, they could not let her go out often. If others found out that she was Bright Moon, who had seduced the judges, the Kang family would definitely lose all their dignity!","Not long after, the competition officially began. The contestants went on stage according to their numbers. The emcee announced, “Everyone, please draw lots to decide the perfume mixer you’ll use for the competition. Participant No. 1 will start drawing lots.”","Xu Ling whispered in Kang Qingzhi’s ear, “Bright Moon won’t appear considering the situation now. She thought that by seducing the judges, she could enter the finals. Unexpectedly, the truth always prevails. There’s no concealing it. She was even photographed. How laughable!”","Kang Qingzhi shook her head helplessly. “Previously, when my sister was participating in the competition, I even took the initiative to help her, but she refused. In the end, she relied on this method to get first place. In the end, it’s all my fault. If I had...”","“Qingzhi, you’re too kind. People like her shouldn’t participate in the competition. Now that I’ve reported her and she’s withdrawing from the competition, don’t you think the air is fresher here? She’s just a sl*t. She reeks of a vixen and siren!”","Xu Ling’s words were vulgar, and she did not hide the jealousy in her eyes. “She’s seducing men everywhere just because she has a good-looking face. I don’t know how many people have slept with her. She’s so cheap!”","Kang Qingzhi tugged at the corner of her shirt and said softly, “Ling Ling, don’t say that.”","The emcee spoke again, “The drawing of lots has ended. All participants, please head to the perfume table according to the number you’ve drawn. Later, we—”","Before the emcee could finish, the door of the venue suddenly opened. A cold female voice came from outside. “Sorry, I’m late!”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a slim figure slowly walking over from the door. She was wearing a dark blue dress and had a slender figure. Her dark and beautiful hair fell casually, and her skin was fair like jade. Her nose was small and exquisite, and her eyes were curved as she looked at everyone. She had the cuteness of a young woman and the charm of a woman.","The event location was silent for a few seconds before Xu Ling reacted. She pointed at Qiao Xi and roared, “Bright Moon! You still have the cheek to come and compete?!”","Bright Moon? She was Bright Moon?","Everyone instantly reacted. So, she was the perfumer who seduced the judges and was disqualified from the competition! She had already done such a scandalous thing. How could she still have the cheek to participate in the competition?","Qiao Xi’s cold gaze swept past everyone before finally landing on Xu Ling.","Xu Ling...","Xu Anran and Xu Ling were both surnamed Xu. What was their relationship? Or was the Xu family Kang Qingzhi’s chess piece?"]},{"number":1509,"title":"Chapter 1509 Why Are You So Uninformed?","paragraphs":["1509 Why Are You So Uninformed?","At this moment, a man rushed out of the crowd. His tone was filled with mockery. “Can someone who seduced the judges and cheated participate in the competition?”","The moment that was said, everyone looked at the girl in front of them in disdain. She had done such a scandalous thing. How could she still have the cheek to come to the event location of the semi-finals?","Under the burning gazes of everyone, Qiao Xi chuckled. Her beautiful lips curled up slightly as she said lightly, “I’m a participant, so why can’t I come?”","The judges also stood up one after another and said unhappily, “Miss Bright Moon, your qualifications for the competition have been revoked. Please leave immediately.”","!!","Seeing that Qiao Xi had no intention of leaving, the judges immediately gestured for the staff to call the security officers.","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “What? Don’t all of you know yet? I’ve already received the notice that my qualifications to participate in the competition have been restored. Why are you so uninformed?”","The entire venue was in an uproar. Bright Moon had actually recovered her qualifications to participate in the competition?","A judge said angrily, “Bright Moon, the things you did have spread online. You’re immoral and broke the rules of the competition. How could your qualifications to participate be recovered? Moreover, even if that’s the case, why don’t we know about it?”","At this moment, the specially invited audience below the stage was also very displeased. This was the International Perfume Competition, yet such a scandal had actually happened. The entire Li City was going to be embarrassed by Bright Moon, yet she still shamelessly wanted to participate?","Old Madam Kang was angered to the point her face turned red, and her breathing quickened. She pointed at Qiao Xi, who was not far away, and roared angrily. “Ah Ru, look! This is the daughter you’ve been longing to bring home! Our Kang family has been innocent for generations. What right does she have to enter the Kang family?! A little b*tch wants to replace Qingzhi? Is she worthy?","“She was disqualified for seducing the judges. She should have kept her tail between her legs and not shown her face, but she insisted on coming to the event location to fool around. I think she’s doing it on purpose. She wants everyone to know that Qingzhi is her sister and make Qingzhi lose her reputation with her! This damned b*tch!”","At this moment, most of Kang Ru’s guilt toward Xia Yunqiu and Qiao Xi had dissipated. He comforted her helplessly. “Mom, calm down. I’ll persuade Xi Xi to leave now.”","“You’re not allowed to go!” Old Madam Kang’s voice was sharp. “If you go, everyone will know that she’s related to our Kang family. We can’t let Qingzhi lose her dignity! Let this little b*tch cause trouble. Anyway, the person whose reputation will be ruined in the end will be her!”","Kang Ru’s body stiffened as he stood on the spot awkwardly and sighed. “Why is Xi Xi doing this?!”","Kang Jichuan frowned, his expression dark. “She... She’s hopeless.”","Qiao Xi ignored the gazes of the Kang family and said coldly, “Do you think I’m lying?”","“Bright Moon, we see that you’re a woman. We don’t want to be rough with you. If you continue to fool around at the event location, don’t blame us for being nasty!”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and stood indifferently on the spot, but the smile in her eyes grew stronger and stronger. Looking at her smile, the judges seemed to have a bad feeling, and a chill arose in their backs. They immediately shouted, “Security officers! Chase this crazy woman away—”","“Stop right now!” A dignified female voice came from the entrance of the lounge. Jiang Ying walked in front of everyone with her head held high. Her eyes were filled with anger as she glanced coldly at the judges and questioned coldly, “I’ve already restored Bright Moon’s qualifications to participate in the competition. Is there a problem with her participating?”","The event location instantly exploded.","Jiang Ying was the president of the Perfume Association, the initiator of this competition, and the only student of the founder of the Perfume Competition, Madam Leng. She was also the person with the most power in this competition. She had restored Bright Moon’s qualifications to participate in the competition, so no one had any reason to chase her away.","Kang Ru’s anxious heart instantly calmed down as he exhaled. “So it was Jiang Ying who restored Xi Xi’s qualifications to participate in the competition!”","“Impossible!!” Old Madam Kang slammed the chair and glared at her. She cursed softly, “This little b*tch seduced the judges and faked her results. How could she still participate in the competition? She must have seduced another man to get this opportunity. How did such a shameless b*tch appear in the Kang family?!”","At this moment, the judges present were dumbfounded. Before they could react, they heard Jiang Ying sneer. “I’ve already instructed everyone to restore Miss Bright Moon’s qualifications to participate in the competition, but none of you received the notice. Who did something behind the scenes?”"]},{"number":1510,"title":"Chapter 1510 Boycotting Bright Moon","paragraphs":["1510 Boycotting Bright Moon","“There’s no concrete evidence of the rumors about Miss Bright Moon. Various major companies and wealthy families vouched for her. Even a famous university like Li City University didn’t hesitate to bet on the university’s reputation to protect her. Why do you have to believe Du Ming’s one-sided story?”","Hearing Jiang Ying mention his name, Du Ming’s face turned livid. “President Jiang...”","“By the way, Mr. Du Ming, didn’t you say that you wanted to resign from your position as a judge in this perfume competition? Why are you here today?” Jiang Ying’s eyes were filled with mockery as she snorted. “Mr. Du, you can’t even fulfill this promise, so how can you make me believe you?”","Du Ming’s expression turned sour. Before he could explain, Jiang Ying looked coldly at the person beside him and shouted angrily, “Judge Zhao!”","Judge Zhao’s body trembled, and his eyes were filled with uneasiness. “President Jiang, I’ve already informed them, but...”","Jiang Ying stared at him coldly, waiting for him to continue.","“But...” Judge Zhao’s mind raced as he finally thought of an excuse. “But Bright Moon is involved in such a scandal. The contestants and judges don’t want her to participate in the competition. Moreover, even if nothing was going on between her and Du Ming, it’s a fact that she secretly invited a judge to her lounge! Our perfume competition has been held for so many years. We strictly prohibit such underhanded actions. We can’t ruin the fairness of the competition because of a contestant with bad morals.”","Judge Zhao’s words hit the nail on the head. Everyone echoed his sentiments.","Jiang Ying’s expression was terrifyingly gloomy as she roared, “Zhao Xiang!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. She roughly understood that these judges had all accepted Kang Qingzhi’s money. Kang Qingzhi was already the internal champion, but Madam Jiang Ying did not seem to know about this.","Madam Leng’s only student was different from the rest. It was already not easy for her to maintain her true nature in the perfume competition.","Zhao Xiang looked at Kang Qingzhi uneasily, then said helplessly, “President Jiang, we know that you don’t want to malign innocent people. Without evidence, we can’t disqualify the contestants, but we’ve worked with Du Ming for so many years. Everyone knows what kind of person he is. We believe that Du Ming won’t lie. We don’t want to see a woman who seduced the judges taint the perfume competition.","“Miss Bright Moon, please leave immediately. Don’t delay the competition. If you wait for the security officers to chase you out, I’m afraid you’ll lose your dignity.”","Du Ming stood up and bowed to everyone. “Everyone, this matter is related to me, after all. I apologize to everyone. I made a mistake in a moment of confusion. I’m willing to accept everyone’s criticism. Miss Bright Moon used such a method to get first place. This is unfair to the other participants. I hope she can realize her mistake and return peace to the perfume competition!”","“Security officer, invite Miss Bright Moon out!”","Jiang Ying’s expression darkened.","Before the security officers arrived, Qiao Xi took a step forward and said slowly, “Mr. Du, Judge Zhao, why are you in such a rush to chase me away?”","Their expressions changed.","“Bright Moon! Are you done?!” Xu Ling looked at Qiao Xi’s beautiful face and went crazy with jealousy. She pointed at Qiao Xi’s nose and shouted, “This is the International Perfume Competition. You seduced the judges to obtain first place. Everyone worked so hard to participate in the competition, but you came here to mess with us! You trampled on others’ hard work and used inappropriate methods to participate in the competition. Yet you still have the cheek to appear at the event location. Do you have any shame?!”","Xu Ling’s eyes were filled with disdain as she cursed, “You’re seducing men everywhere just because you’re good-looking. Someone like you isn’t worthy to be a perfumer at all. Who dares to use the perfumes you make?!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the event location became noisy. The impatient participants and specially invited audience were also discussing in low voices. Their disdainful gazes landed on Qiao Xi.","Seeing that everyone was on his side, Du Ming raised his head proudly and said in a disdainful tone, “Bright Moon, you’ve seen it all. No one wants you to participate in the competition. You’ve already been boycotted by the contestants and judges. I’m not in a rush to chase you away, but as a judge of the perfume competition, I have to abide by the rules. Seeing that you won first place through inappropriate means, I can’t ignore it. After all, everyone has to put in time and effort to participate in the competition. If you continue to participate, what will the other contestants think?","“Bright Moon, I advise you not to be stubborn. It won’t do you any good if you continue fooling around.”"]},{"number":1511,"title":"Chapter 1511 Who’s The Woman Speaking?","paragraphs":["1511 Who’s The Woman Speaking?","The entire venue was silent. Everyone felt that Du Ming’s words made sense. If Bright Moon could still participate in the competition, then what about their efforts these past few days? If they had known earlier that they did not have to pay the price, they could have chosen to use improper methods. After all, after being exposed, they could still continue to participate in the competition.","At this moment, everyone’s eyes were filled with anger as they looked at Qiao Xi.","However, under everyone’s hostile gazes, this woman actually laughed. Her laughter was as clear and beautiful as a silver bell, but it seemed a little abrupt on such an occasion. She glanced at everyone, and the smile on her lips still lingered. “What Mr. Du said makes sense, but...”","She suddenly paused and raised her voice. “But how can you be sure that I have no evidence, Mr. Du?”","!!","Du Ming’s heart trembled, and a cold sweat broke out on his forehead. The blood in his body seemed to freeze in an instant.","She had evidence? How was that possible? If she had evidence, she would have used it to prove her innocence when the rumors on the internet were all over the place. Why would she wait until now?","Qiao Xi gently clapped her hands twice, and in an instant, a voice came from the speakers.","“Mr. Du, I don’t wish to trouble you. But a friend of mine admires you very much. If you have time, can you go see her? She’s in Room 306.”","The next second, Du Ming’s voice sounded. “In that case, I’ll go see your friend first.”","The moment she heard the recording, Kang Qingzhi’s pupils constricted, and even her breathing stopped. The smug expression on Du Ming’s face instantly stiffened, and his eyes almost popped out of their sockets.","When everyone heard the recording, they were also dumbfounded. They hadn’t realized who the female voice belonged to, but that man’s voice was clearly Du Ming’s!","Room 306 was Bright Moon’s lounge. In that case, someone had told Du Ming that Bright Moon was waiting for him in Room 306. Who was the woman who spoke?","The moment Kang Jichuan heard the recording, he could tell that the woman who spoke was Kang Qingzhi. However, Qingqing was kind-hearted. How could she frame Xi Xi? Qingzhi must have wanted Xi Xi to get to know the judges, so she asked Du Ming to go to her lounge. However, in order to prove her innocence, Xi Xi wanted to drag Qingzhi down to take the blame?","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale. She bit her lip and told herself over and over again that she had to calm down. Besides, Du Ming had also said, ‘Miss Kang, rest well’ at the time. However, this was not heard in Qiao Xi’s recording. It must be because she did not record this sentence. Thus, it could not prove that the person in the recording was her.","Even if Qiao Xi really proved that the person in the recording was her, she had long thought of an excuse to explain herself.","This recording could only prove that Qiao Xi did not take the initiative to ask Du Ming to her lounge, but it could not prove that she did not seduce the judges. After all, the two of them were in the same room. Who would know what had happened?","At this moment, everyone was filled with doubts. Could it be that someone wanted to frame Bright Moon and lead Du Ming to Room 306? The meaning of the woman’s words in the recording was very clear. She was hinting to Du Ming that there was a woman who wanted to seduce him. They could tell that, so Du Ming probably understood it as well.","Everyone looked at Du Ming with doubt in their eyes.","Qiao Xi asked in a timely manner, “Mr. Du, are you still insisting that I seduced you?”","Du Ming lowered his head, and cold sweat dripped down his forehead. He did not expect Bright Moon to have obtained the recording. He knew very well that Kang Qingzhi wanted to frame Bright Moon, so he deliberately lured him to Room 306. However, Kang Qingzhi was the daughter of the Kang family, so he did not dare to offend her. If he said Kang Qingzhi’s name in public, she would definitely deny it. At that time, the Kang family would definitely not let him off!","After hesitating for a moment, Du Ming gritted his teeth and retorted, “You seduced me. You deliberately found a woman to pass a message to me. After I entered, you asked me to use my position to help you advance in the competition!”","Although Du Ming’s words were a little far-fetched, it was not impossible. Bright Moon might have been afraid that the matter would be exposed, so she got another person to lure Du Ming to her lounge. After all, she must have thought of this since she could think of ways to seduce the judges.","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. “In that case, Mr. Du, tell me who that woman is. You were probably at the entrance of the lounge at that time. The only people who could appear there were the contestants and their assistants, so there’s a high chance that this person was at the scene. Moreover, from your tone, you must know this person. It hasn’t been long since the incident, so I presume you haven’t forgotten who she is!”","Du Ming gasped.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Moreover, why do I feel that this woman’s voice sounds a little familiar...”"]},{"number":1512,"title":"Chapter 1512 Kang Qingzhi Is The Most Agitated","paragraphs":["1512 Kang Qingzhi Is The Most Agitated","Qiao Xi’s gaze lightly looked at Kang Qingzhi. Everyone seemed to understand something and looked at Kang Qingzhi.","Kang Qingzhi’s thin body trembled violently. Fear surged up like a tide and wrapped tightly around her body, making her unable to breathe.","‘Qiao Xi! This b*tch!’","Below the stage, Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan frowned when they saw Kang Qingzhi’s body tremble. Old Madam Kang gritted her teeth hatefully and wished for nothing more than to rush over and slap Qiao Xi.","Kang Qingzhi slowly looked up. Her eyes were wet, and tears fell like pearls. “Miss Bright Moon, this really has nothing to do with me. You... Why are you suspecting me?”","“Miss Kang.” Qiao Xi chuckled. “I didn’t say that this matter is related to you. Why are you in a rush to explain yourself?”","Kang Qingzhi gasped as a chill ran down her spine. The blood in her body seemed to have frozen.","Qiao Xi said with a smile, “I just said that the woman in the recording should be at the scene, so I subconsciously looked at all the girls. No one else reacted, except for Miss Kang... I haven’t said anything yet. Why is Miss Kang already crying?”","Qiao Xi blinked her big watery eyes and asked in confusion, “So is the woman in the recording Miss Kang?”","“It wasn’t me!” Kang Qingzhi shouted agitatedly, her voice a little hoarse.","Qiao Xi looked shocked as she widened her eyes in surprise. “Then so be it. Miss Kang, why did you yell?”","Kang Qingzhi’s face was as pale as paper. When she thought of Qiao Xi’s words, she felt as if she had fallen into an ice cave. Qiao Xi said, “I looked at all the girls, but no one else reacted. You’re the only one who’s agitated.”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with doubt. After Qiao Xi’s reminder, they increasingly felt that the woman in the recording was Kang Qingzhi. However, the voice in the recording was a little hoarse as if she was deliberately lowering her voice. Moreover, Miss Bright Moon had not said anything, yet Kang Qingzhi was so agitated. It was obvious that she was guilty!","Could it be that... the woman in the recording was Kang Qingzhi?","If the woman who passed the message was really Kang Qingzhi, then why didn’t she stop Bright Moon from seducing the judges? Why did she send the message to Bright Moon? Of course, there was another possibility. Kang Qingzhi deliberately lured Du Ming to Room 306 to frame Bright Moon.","At this moment, everyone could not help but think of Bright Moon’s results in the previous stage of the competition. She had won first place. If she really had the ability, then the meaning of Kang Qingzhi’s actions was very obvious.","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale as tears streamed down her face. Her voice trembled as she defended herself. “Miss Bright Moon, it really... It really wasn’t me. I wouldn’t frame you.”","Below the stage, Kang Jichuan could not take it anymore. He knew Qingzhi well. Even if she had suffered a great grievance, she would not attack Qiao Xi. On the other hand, Qiao Xi was making things difficult for Qingzhi in front of everyone. She had done countless things to Qingzhi behind their backs!","He knew that the female voice in the recording was Qingzhi, but he believed that Qingzhi would not frame Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi must have threatened Qingzhi to look for Du Ming. Now that the matter had been exposed, Qiao Xi wanted to pin this crime on Qingzhi! Why was she so selfish?!","Kang Jichuan stood up abruptly and said in an extremely serious voice, “Miss Bright Moon, what evidence do you have to prove that the person in the recording is Qingzhi? If you have the time to push the blame on others, why don’t you explain why you let Mr. Du into your lounge? If you had been unwilling, how could Mr. Du have entered?”","Qiao Xi turned around slightly and looked coldly at Kang Jichuan. She sneered. “Young Master Kang, you really are a good brother. I haven’t even said anything yet, yet you’re already standing up for Miss Kang.”","Kang Jichuan could hear the ridicule in Qiao Xi’s tone, but for the sake of the Kang family’s reputation, he could not expose his relationship with Qiao Xi. He could only say in a distant tone, “Qingzhi and I grew up together. She’s kind-hearted and understanding. If she had known that Du Ming was scheming against you, she’d definitely stand up to stop him!”","“Young Master Kang, you said that Miss Kang is kind-hearted and you believe that she won’t lure Du Ming to my lounge... Why are you so sure that I seduced Du Ming?”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s question, Kang Jichuan frowned.","Someone had seen Du Ming enter her lounge. Wasn’t it obvious enough? Moreover, Qingzhi had told him this. She wouldn’t lie. Even if Qiao Xi didn’t seduce Du Ming, she must have made a deal with him.","At this point, Qiao Xi did not have the slightest intention of repenting. She even came to the event location to cause trouble. Was she crazy?"]},{"number":1513,"title":"Chapter 1513 Betting That She Has No Evidence","paragraphs":["1513 Betting That She Has No Evidence","Qiao Xi stared fixedly at Kang Jichuan. After a long silence, she suddenly smiled. “Young Master Kang, you’re tacitly agreeing to it, right? So you think I seduced Du Ming.”","She looked at the Kang family. Old Madam Kang’s gaze was vicious, Kang Jichuan was disgusted, and Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with guilt and confusion. However, this trace of guilt was useless. He still sat on the chair and quietly watched her be doubted.","At this instant, Qiao Xi’s last bit of hope for Kang Ru vanished. She slowly said, “Since you doubt me, Young Master Kang, it looks like I have to produce some evidence.”","The moment that was said, Kang Qingzhi’s eyelids twitched crazily. She had a bad feeling.","At this moment, a foreign contestant said in a low voice, “Didn’t Bright Moon already play the recording? At the very least, it’s been proven that she didn’t ask Du Ming to go to the lounge. We didn’t question the Kang family at all, so why are they so agitated?”","Another person echoed, “I think it’s strange too! Why doesn’t Kang Qingzhi’s family want to listen to Bright Moon’s explanation?! Could it be that they’re afraid that Bright Moon will snatch Kang Qingzhi’s championship title, so they want to help Kang Qingzhi get rid of her competitor?”","“I remember that many noble families have appeared to protect Miss Bright Moon in the past few days. If she really wanted to cheat, she could have just begged the people around her. Why would she seduce Du Ming?”","Everyone from the Kang family was ashen. Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists tightly, her sharp nails digging into her palms. Her eyes were red as tears streamed down her face. She choked and said, “Miss Bright Moon, my family only said a few words because they’re worried that I’ll suffer. They don’t want to see immoral people taint the perfume competition. Of course, I don’t think you’d do such a thing.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Kang Qingzhi’s words were meaningful!","“Miss Kang, since you have no intention of stopping me, I’ll continue.”","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists tightly. The pain in her palms made her stay rational. She subconsciously glanced at Du Ming, scaring him so much that he broke out in a cold sweat.","Du Ming knew very well that the Kang family had a noble status and Kang Qingzhi was the beloved daughter of the Kang family. If he offended Kang Qingzhi, he would not have a good ending. If he braced himself and took the blame for Kang Qingzhi, the Kang family would help him clear his name or give him a sum of money to clean up the mess.","Qiao Xi’s cold gaze landed on the pale and evasive Du Ming. She asked slowly, “Mr. Du, let me ask you again. Do you still insist that I seduced you?”","Hearing her voice, Du Ming trembled uncontrollably. He still felt that Bright Moon had no evidence. If she had evidence, she would have taken it out a long time ago. Hence, she must be lying to him.","Bright Moon looked confident, but she did not have any evidence. She could only bet that he would not be able to withstand the questions and doubts and take the initiative to tell the truth. He had to admit that Bright Moon did have some tricks up her sleeve, but she was still too young. He had been in the perfume world for so many years and could be considered someone who had seen the world. Many people had played such tricks in front of him in the past, but he did not fall for them. This time, he naturally would not fall for Bright Moon’s tricks.","Bright Moon had underestimated him too much!","Du Ming was silent for a moment before he suddenly gained confidence. He pointed at Qiao Xi and berated, “Bright Moon! You’ve already asked me and I’ve answered you. Why are you still asking me over and over again? Even if you ask me a hundred times, you won’t be able to change this fact.","“I did make a mistake, and I’ve repented. Bright Moon, you’re arrogant and unwilling to lower your head, but it’s not embarrassing to admit your mistake. Don’t make another mistake!”","Qiao Xi looked coldly at the hypocritical man in front of her. Was he still stubborn at this point? She just did not know what his expression would be when he saw the evidence.","“Mr. Du, you’re really brilliant...” Qiao Xi clapped, her voice filled with ridicule. “Mr. Du, you’re really fair and selfless. Everything you say makes sense. If I didn’t know who you are, I would’ve been deceived by you!”","When Du Ming heard this, he was even more sure that Qiao Xi had no evidence. He curled his lips in disdain. “Bright Moon, I advise you to immediately apologize to Miss Qingzhi and me before leaving—”","“Mr. Du,” Qiao Xi said coldly, and the corners of her mouth were pulled into a smile. “You’re betting that I don’t have any evidence, right? But if I don’t have any evidence, why would I be here?”","The words in Du Ming’s mouth were suddenly stuck in his throat. His proud expression instantly vanished, and a trace of horror appeared in his eyes.","When everyone heard this, they all looked at Qiao Xi. They were shocked, doubtful, and mostly curious. What evidence did she have?"]},{"number":1514,"title":"Chapter 1514 Being Beautiful Is Also A Crime","paragraphs":["1514 Being Beautiful Is Also A Crime","At this moment, Kang Ru suddenly looked up, while Kang Jichuan was flustered. Kang Qingzhi, who was on the stage, felt her heart almost jump out of her throat.","Her eyes were filled with panic. Did Qiao Xi really have evidence?","At this moment, Du Ming’s legs went weak, and he almost fell to the floor. However, he still supported himself on the chair.","Impossible! She did not have evidence! It was all fake. Bright Moon was deliberately lying to him. She wanted to use this method to break his psychological defense and make him take the initiative to tell the truth. He could not fall for Bright Moon’s trap!","Du Ming forced himself to calm down, and his voice trembled slightly. “Miss Bright Moon, don’t waste our time anymore. You clearly seduced me. What evidence do you have?”","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not retort, Du Ming became even more confident. “If you admit your mistake immediately, I’ll give you a chance on the account that you’re still young. Although you can’t participate in this competition in the future—”","Before he could finish, the screen behind everyone suddenly flashed. A video appeared. Everyone present could tell at a glance that the scene took place in a lounge.","The door of the lounge was pushed open. Du Ming walked in with a wretched smile and pounced on Bright Moon. Bright Moon nimbly dodged, but Du Ming still refused to give up. He rubbed his hands and continued to pounce on her. This time, Bright Moon did not have time to dodge. Du Ming grabbed her hand and even wanted to kiss her cheek.","Everyone widened their eyes at this scene.","Was this Du Ming’s so-called seduction? It was clearly Du Ming who took the key and barged into Bright Moon’s lounge. He even wanted to force Miss Bright Moon!","When Kang Ru saw the scene in front of him, the guilt in his heart instantly surged. He said excitedly, “I knew Xi Xi wouldn’t do that!”","Old Madam Kang stood up abruptly and said in an extremely sharp voice, “She’s a b*tch! She seduced the judges. Otherwise, why would Du Ming target her? She was just playing hard to get. She has the face of a vixen and seduces men everywhere! Why doesn’t she just die?! She’s a vixen! A b*tch! If this were in ancient times, she would’ve been thrown into a pigsty!”","Such crazy curses attracted everyone’s attention. They looked at Old Madam Kang in shock and confusion.","Kang Jichuan lowered his head with a complicated expression. Had he really wronged Xi Xi? However, Qingzhi would not lie, right?","Before he could think clearly, Old Madam Kang, who was beside him, could no longer suppress her anger. She cursed like a shrew in the market, and everyone looked over.","“This old madam is too vicious! Bright Moon has proven her innocence, yet she’s still cursing her to die. Bright Moon is the victim! Is it a mistake to be beautiful?”","“Has Bright Moon ever offended her?”","“It’s probably for Kang Qingzhi. After all, after Bright Moon recovers her qualifications to participate in the competition, she’ll definitely threaten Kang Qingzhi’s status. That’s why Old Madam Kang is cursing.”","“Isn’t the Kang family too selfish? Does the champion of the International Fragrance Competition have to be Kang Qingzhi? Is the person who surpasses Kang Qingzhi a b*tch? Now, I can’t help but suspect that the matter of Bright Moon being framed is related to the Kang family.”","When Kang Jichuan heard the last sentence, his body instantly tensed up. He immediately stopped his grandmother. “Grandma! Stop talking!”","If she continued to scold Qiao Xi, Qingzhi’s reputation would be affected. At that time, the billions that the Kang family had invested would go down the drain.","At this moment, the recording on the big screen suddenly stopped. Qiao Xi slowly turned around and looked at Du Ming, who had fallen onto the chair with a stiff body. She said with a smile, “Mr. Du, why aren’t you saying anything?”","Du Ming lowered his head and did not move. He was like a corpse.","Qiao Xi retracted her gaze and looked coldly at Kang Qingzhi. The corners of her mouth curled up slightly. “Miss Kang, you have nothing to say?”","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale. She leaned weakly against Xu Ling as if she was about to break down.","‘That b*tch! Why is she asking me? Grandma’s right. Why can’t the little b*tch just die? Qiao Xi should have died in the sea five years ago. Why did she come back to snatch my things?!’","After cursing in her heart for a long time, Kang Qingzhi tilted her head. A tear fell from the corner of her eye. She held her heart and said weakly, “Miss Bright Moon, you’ve proven your innocence now. I’m happy for you, but you... Why must you target me?”","Kang Qingzhi wiped her tears and said awkwardly, “Moreover, there’s no audio in this video. We don’t know what you and Du Ming said. This can’t be considered evidence, right?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xu Ling, who was at the side, seemed to be on steroids as she shouted, “Yes! There’s no audio in the recording. Maybe you and Du Ming are old flames and were deliberately playing around with each other!”"]},{"number":1515,"title":"Chapter 1515 I Have A Witness","paragraphs":["1515 I Have A Witness","At this moment, Du Ming, who was like a corpse, hurriedly said, “Yes! That’s right. Actually, I didn’t want to say it, but at this point, I can’t accept this injustice. The two of us have known each other for a long time. I didn’t force her. The scene in the video was just for fun. Moreover, this was all her request.”","Everyone was instantly stunned.","Du Ming’s explanation was too far-fetched!","Fun? Although they could not hear anything, Bright Moon’s eyes were clearly filled with disgust when she looked at Du Ming! Moreover, Bright Moon was so beautiful. Would she like a greasy old man like Du Ming?","Qiao Xi sneered. “Miss Kang, Miss Xu, I really don’t understand! Just now, I took out the recording to prove my innocence, but you didn’t believe me. Now that I’ve played the video, you’re saying that there’s no sound in the video and that Du Ming and I were having fun? Are you looking for trouble?!","“I’m the victim in this farce, but you’re always denying me. If I play an audio recording, how will you deny me then?”","Qiao Xi hissed and said slowly, “How did I offend all of you? Why did all of you join forces to bully me? I’ve brought out evidence, but you don’t believe me and insist on accusing me of seducing the judges. The other participants don’t have any objections, but you just have to be so agitated!”","Everyone felt that Bright Moon’s words made sense. She had produced evidence. It was not strange for Du Ming to deny Qiao Xi, but why was Kang Qingzhi also targeting Bright Moon?","Kang Qingzhi instantly panicked, and her heart thumped violently.","Kang Jichuan frowned. Why did Xi Xi say this in front of everyone? Her words would definitely make everyone misunderstand!","Qingzhi had raised some guesses, but these guesses were reasonable. Xi Xi was questioning Qingzhi in public. She was clearly trying to frame Qingzhi!","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with disappointment. Xi Xi still could not tolerate Qingzhi like before and tried her best to slander her.","After a long silence, Kang Qingzhi held back her tears and said aggrievedly, “Miss Bright Moon, I wasn’t targeting you. I was just raising some doubts. If you don’t like it, I won’t say anything else.”","Xu Ling instantly stood up and shouted, “If you’re really innocent, why are you afraid of being questioned by others? You’re just afraid that we’ll overturn your evidence and you won’t be able to prove yourself. You’re just guilty!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were calm as she said with a smile, “The two of you can raise your doubts. I’ll continue to show the evidence.”","Kang Qingzhi’s heart skipped a beat when she heard this. She abruptly raised her eyes and met Qiao Xi’s cold eyes that were filled with ridicule.","Before Kang Qingzhi could come back to her senses, Qiao Xi said slowly, “What I presented to everyone just now was physical evidence. Of course, I have a witness too.”","Kang Qingzhi’s body instantly stiffened.","Witness? Where did she get a witness? This was absolutely impossible!","However, if Qiao Xi really had a witness, what could she do then?","Xu Ling instantly exploded and shouted like a lunatic, “What’s the use of a witness? That person must have been bribed! You’re just a little b*tch who seduced the judges. Don’t even think about escaping punishment!”","“Ling Ling!” When Kang Qingzhi heard this, her heart twitched. She hurriedly stopped her.","“What’s the use of a witness?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows, and her eyes were extremely cold. “Miss Xu, do you mean that I can’t exonerate myself today?”","“I showed physical evidence, but you tried to deny it. My witness hasn’t appeared, but you’re so sure that I bribed the other party. Aren’t you being too arbitrary? I’ve always been very curious. I have no grudge against you, Miss Xu. Why must you slander me?”","Everyone looked at Xu Ling in dissatisfaction. It was fine if she did not believe in the physical evidence previously shown, but Bright Moon had a witness who had yet to appear, yet Xu Ling insisted that Bright Moon had bribed the other party.","Whether the evidence was fake or not, it would be determined by the people from the Perfume Association. What right did Xu Ling, a participant, have to point fingers here? Moreover, everyone could tell that Xu Ling did not want Bright Moon to produce evidence and the truth to be made public.","Xu Ling instantly choked, then widened her eyes and shouted, “Why I don’t believe you? Do I need to believe you just because you’re good-looking? You’re...”","“Miss Xu, don’t be so agitated. Don’t you want to see who my witness is first?” Qiao Xi slowly interrupted Xu Ling, and a trace of a bright light flashed through her eyes."]},{"number":1516,"title":"Chapter 1516 Welcome Back To The International Fragrance Competition","paragraphs":["1516 Welcome Back To The International Fragrance Competition","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Kang Qingzhi’s heart trembled. What right did Qiao Xi have to be so confident? How could she confirm that everyone would believe her after the witness appeared?","Xu Ling was not as smart as Kang Qingzhi. She immediately shouted arrogantly, “Alright! Let them come out! I want to see who’s so blind as to testify for you!”","“I’m sorry to disappoint you, Miss Xu. I’m not blind.” A cold and low voice came from not far away, making everyone find it extremely familiar.","Xu Ling was not afraid at all. Since this man dared to testify for Bright Moon, she had to take the opportunity to accuse Bright Moon of seducing a man again and let everyone know that she was a vixen!","!!","She looked in the direction of the voice and was about to curse when the words in her mouth were instantly stuck in her throat.","Everyone present was dumbfounded. The venue fell silent.","Twilight was wearing a black suit as he walked steadily in front of everyone. He looked at Xu Ling with his light brown eyes. Time seemed to have stopped in an instant.","After a few seconds, everyone came back to their senses. Bright Moon’s witness was Twilight?","At this moment, Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with resentment, and her forehead was covered in sweat. Xu Ling, who was at the side, seemed to be strangled and could not say a word.","She could slander other men for being bribed or seduced by Bright Moon, but she did not dare to slander Twilight. This man was the idol of the perfume world. He had always been known for being fair because he did not lack money. He had a noble status and did not get close to women!","She could question Bright Moon endlessly, but if she refuted Twilight, she might not be able to walk out of this venue today. She would be surrounded by Twilight’s supporters. Moreover, it was rumored that Twilight was powerful. If she angered him, Twilight would make her disappear from Li City without anyone needing to do anything.","But why was Twilight testifying for Bright Moon? Why was he defending that b*tch?","At this moment, the judges stood up one after another and asked tentatively, “Mr. Twilight, y-you’re Bright Moon’s witness?”","Twilight curled his lips. “Can’t I? Or do you suspect that I’ve been bribed by Bright Moon?”","“No! Absolutely not!” The judges denied it without hesitation. They even glanced fiercely at Xu Ling, blaming her for spouting nonsense and almost angering Mr. Twilight.","Twilight’s words proved that he was Bright Moon’s witness. With such a witness, who would question Bright Moon’s innocence?","Xu Ling stood on the spot as if her head had exploded. Her ears were buzzing. She really did not expect Bright Moon’s witness to be Twilight!","The judges looked at each other. They did not care if Bright Moon was wronged, but if the matter was related to Mr. Twilight, they could not ignore it.","At this moment, Judge Zhao fell onto the chair weakly. He had accepted Du Ming’s money to help Kang Qingzhi deal with Bright Moon. He thought that even if Bright Moon was wronged, she would not have a chance to make a comeback. Unexpectedly, Bright Moon actually invited Twilight to testify.","If Bright Moon wanted to settle this score carefully, he would be implicated as well.","Seeing that the situation was not looking good, the judges immediately criticized, “Du Ming! You had ulterior motives and tried to force Miss Bright Moon. You actually bit back and caused Miss Bright Moon to suffer injustice. We’ll now fire you on behalf of the Perfume Association!”","Then, the judges looked at Bright Moon obsequiously and said softly, “Miss Bright Moon, we’re really sorry to have let you be wronged for so long. You’re welcome to come back to the International Fragrance Competition. I believe that with your strength, you’ll definitely win the competition!”","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists and gritted her teeth. She comforted herself in her heart. Although she had not successfully framed Qiao Xi, it was already very good that she was not implicated. She could not ask for too much.","This time, Qiao Xi was lucky. When Du Ming went to the lounge to look for her, Twilight happened to be nearby, but Qiao Xi would not always be so lucky.","After the judges announced the results, they looked at Twilight and Bright Moon expectantly, hoping that they could accept this outcome and not pursue the matter. Apart from Du Ming, no one else would be affected. Everyone would be happy.","After a moment of silence, Bright Moon suddenly chuckled. “Welcome back to the competition?”","“Yes... Yes!” The judges looked away awkwardly, but there were also people who looked unhappy. “Miss Bright Moon, today is the semi-finals. It’s better not to delay the competition for personal reasons. After the competition, we’ll discuss the other things. I hope you can take the overall situation into consideration.”"]},{"number":1517,"title":"Chapter 1517 I’ll Leave With You","paragraphs":["1517 I’ll Leave With You","“Take the overall situation into consideration?” Qiao Xi stared at the judge with a burning gaze. “If you really welcome me to continue participating in the competition, then you should investigate why Du Ming got the key to my lounge. Who was the woman in the recording who instigated Du Ming to look for me? Who took that photo and reported me? You haven’t investigated these things clearly yet. Are you going to pretend that you don’t know anything and resume the competition?”","The judges instantly frowned and said unhappily, “Then what do you think we should do, Miss Bright Moon?”","Qiao Xi said casually, “Do you need me to teach you such things? Of course, you need to investigate the person who instigated Du Ming and the person who reported me. You have to clarify things for me on the official account of the International Fragrance Competition and clearly list all the evidence and the person who framed me.","“At the very least, you have to find out who the woman in the recording and the person who reported me are. These two are clearly framing me. If you don’t give me justice, how can I participate in the competition in peace?”","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head and bit her lip.","Xu Ling had just recovered from the shock of Twilight’s appearance. Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, fear surged like a tide as she looked at Kang Qingzhi for help.","The judges all knew that Kang Qingzhi was the beloved daughter of the Kang family, so they did not dare to offend her. However, Bright Moon refused to let the matter go. The judges gritted their teeth and said, “We’ve already told you that we’ll investigate. We can’t let your private matters affect the progress of the competition. If you’re really not in the right state to participate in the competition, you can take the initiative to withdraw from the competition. We won’t force you.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. They said that they would investigate after the competition, but they were just brushing her off. After the competition ended, they would definitely find an excuse to fool her.","Xu Ling instantly heaved a sigh of relief when she heard the judges’ words. So what if everyone knew that Bright Moon was wronged? If news of this got out, the officials of the International Fragrance Competition would definitely be insulted by netizens. The netizens would say that they did not investigate clearly and slandered Bright Moon. Hence, they could let Bright Moon continue participating in the competition, but it was impossible for them to clarify things for her online.","The entire venue was silent. Qiao Xi’s cold gaze swept past everyone, and the corners of her mouth curled into a mocking smile. “Since everyone isn’t willing to investigate this matter, then let me do it myself!”","After hearing this, one of the judges immediately stood up and criticized, “It’s not that we don’t want to investigate, but we want to do it after the competition. Are you going to let so many people wait for you to investigate? You’re too selfish!”","The judge became more and more confident as he spoke. He could not help but look at the tall and mighty man beside him. “Mr. Twilight, what do you think?”","The surroundings instantly fell silent. Everyone looked at Twilight and quietly waited for him to speak. The man smiled and said in a magnetic voice, “Yes.”","Huh? Did he agree with the judge?","Kang Qingzhi abruptly looked up, her eyes filled with joy. Previously, there were rumors that Twilight admired her very much. This time, Qiao Xi was making things difficult for her, so Twilight would definitely stand on her side.","Moreover, he had already agreed with the judge. If Qiao Xi continued to fool around, even if she was the victim, she had to withdraw from the competition to avoid affecting the competition’s environment.","Xu Ling smiled proudly. “Bright Moon, don’t delay the competition because of personal reasons. Mr. Twilight has already spoken. If you continue to fool around, you’ll have to immediately withdraw from the competition!”","The judges echoed one after another and glared at Qiao Xi unhappily. However, she stood on the spot and did not say a word. She only looked at everyone with a mocking expression.","Just as the judges were about to reprimand her again, Twilight suddenly looked up and scanned the crowd with his light brown eyes. The temperature seemed to have dropped wherever he looked. His cold lips curled up slightly. “Everyone, I do agree, but...”","Everyone’s hearts trembled. Kang Qingzhi felt her scalp tingle when she met Twilight’s eyes.","The next second, Twilight’s voice was magnetic and low. He said slowly, “Bright Moon, I agree to let you continue your investigation. If you’re unwilling to seek justice for yourself in the International Fragrance Competition, then withdraw from the competition.”","Qiao Xi naturally knew that Gu Zheng would not let her suffer, so what did this man mean?","Before she could think it through, Twilight sneered. “If you withdraw from the competition, I’ll withdraw with you. After all, I’m a witness to this farce. Since no one is willing to investigate this matter, there’s no point in me staying here.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he took a few steps toward Qiao Xi and bent down slightly. He stretched out his hand like a gentleman. “Miss Bright Moon, let’s go.”"]},{"number":1518,"title":"Chapter 1518 Who’s The Mastermind?","paragraphs":["1518 Who’s The Mastermind?","Everyone’s breathing trembled. The judges’ expressions that were filled with pride just now instantly stiffened, and their hearts stopped beating.","If they did not seek justice for Bright Moon, Twilight would withdraw from the competition?","No! They could not let that happen!","It was not easy for Twilight to agree to be a judge in this competition. Many contestants were here for Twilight, and the audience’s eyes were all on him. If he withdrew because of this matter, it would definitely cause an uproar. At that time, no one would blame Qiao Xi for not letting the matter go. Instead, they would think that the competition’s organizers were negligent and were protecting Du Ming and the mastermind. Mr. Twilight was unwilling to be associated with people like them, so he withdrew from the competition.","!!","Twilight was a god-like existence in the perfume world. His withdrawal would definitely cause an uproar. When everyone found out the truth, everyone related to this matter would face the suppression of the netizens.","In less than ten seconds, the judges had already thought of many consequences. They shouted in a panic, “Mr. Twilight! Don’t worry, we’ll definitely investigate this matter clearly. Don’t leave, you can’t leave!”","Seeing that Twilight did not respond for a long time and was looking at Bright Moon with her deep eyes, the judges were instantly enlightened. They immediately said respectfully, “Miss Bright Moon, we’re really sorry. We’ll definitely investigate this matter clearly. I hope you won’t withdraw from the competition!","“We’ll send someone to investigate the person who reported you and the person in the recording. We’ll clarify this matter on the official website according to your request. We’ll definitely clear your name! Moreover, you’ll still retain your rank as the first place in the previous stage of the competition!”","The moment that was said, the surroundings instantly fell silent.","Kang Qingzhi’s weak body swayed as if she had lost all her strength. She seemed to be about to faint the next second.","Now that Qiao Xi had recovered her qualifications to participate in the competition and had snatched away her ranking, if this competition continued, her position as the champion would be snatched away by Qiao Xi too!","At this moment, Qiao Xi turned around slightly and narrowed her eyes as she coldly glanced at the Kang family. Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan had complicated expressions. Their lips moved, but they could not say anything.","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with guilt, while Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with shock and confusion. Had he really misunderstood Xi Xi? But Qingzhi would not lie!","Kang Jichuan’s heart seemed to be suspended in midair. It was painful and bitter. He had just criticized Xi Xi in public. When so many people stood up for Xi Xi, he firmly believed that she had seduced the judges. He was even afraid of being implicated, so he cut ties with her. Presumably, Xi Xi already hated him to the core and would not acknowledge him as her brother.","Qiao Xi’s gaze stopped on the Kang father and son for a few seconds before she looked away coldly. She could already guess what they were thinking. They knew that they had misunderstood her, but they were still unwilling to admit their mistake, much less believe that Kang Qingzhi was the mastermind behind this matter. In their hearts, all the dirty schemes had nothing to do with Kang Qingzhi. She was just a pure and weak little girl.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi crossed her arms and looked at the flustered judges with interest. “Since that’s the case, let’s start the investigation.”","Kang Qingzhi’s body trembled violently. She suppressed the uneasiness in her heart and said weakly, “Miss Bright Moon, the competition’s organizers have already agreed to investigate. Why are you in such a rush? Everyone’s time is very precious. We can’t waste it on you alone, right?”","That was right. Qiao Xi taking up the time of the competition was selfish!","Kang Jichuan frowned and also thought that Qiao Xi should not be doing this. She had already proven her innocence, so why did she have to find out the identities of those two people? They would investigate after the competition. Those two people would not run away. Moreover—","“The other contestants have no objections, so why is Miss Kang stopping the investigation time and again?” Twilight’s voice was low with a hint of mockery. “Moreover, I’m very curious about the person who reported Bright Moon. Is there a problem with taking up everyone’s time?”","Kang Qingzhi instantly choked.","“Of course, there’s no problem!” The judges echoed. Of course, they did not dare to offend Twilight. If he withdrew from the competition, it was uncertain if the perfume competition could be held next year!","Twilight’s meaning was obvious. If they did not investigate clearly today, they would all pay the price!","Zhao Xiang was the most experienced among the crowd. He subconsciously glanced at Kang Qingzhi and hesitated for a few seconds before saying seriously, “Investigate immediately!”","Most of the contestants present supported Bright Moon. They did not care about this bit of time and also wanted to know who the mastermind was. If they did not find out who it was, everyone would be in danger. How could everyone compete in peace?"]},{"number":1519,"title":"Chapter 1519 B*tches Are Pretentious","paragraphs":["1519 B*tches Are Pretentious","“Miss Kang, isn’t Bright Moon a little too serious? Is there a need to investigate such a small matter? She has already proven her innocence,” the girl beside Kang Qingzhi said in a low voice.","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists tightly and sighed helplessly. “Bright Moon is the victim. She definitely has to find a chance to vent her anger. I’m not afraid of waiting, but I’m just afraid that everyone won’t want to wait.”","“Making perfumes is very important. Perhaps everyone was in a good state just now, but they won’t be in a good state later. It won’t be good if this affects everyone’s competition.”","Kang Qingzhi’s words hit home with some of the perfumers. They did not want to waste their time, but since Mr. Twilight wanted to investigate, they naturally did not dare to say anything.","!!","Xu Ling was like a powder keg as she roared, “What right does she have to take up our time?! B*tch, you’re so pretentious!”","Everyone paid no attention to Xu Ling’s roar. Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as if she did not hear her.","After a while, the judges returned to the event location with the evidence. The judges all had serious expressions. They did not dare to offend Kang Qingzhi, but that big shot had already said that if they insisted on protecting Kang Qingzhi, then there was no need for the perfume competition to exist.","Zhao Xiang calmed down for a long time. Just as he was about to speak, Qiao Xi suddenly said with a smile, “Wait, I have something to say.”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi, only to see her gaze land on Kang Qingzhi. She asked slowly, “Miss Kang, ever since I brought out the evidence just now, you’ve been targeting me. Then, you accused me of wasting everyone’s time and affecting everyone’s performance in the competition...”","Kang Qingzhi gasped. She had deliberately lowered her voice just now, but she did not expect Qiao Xi to hear her.","Qiao Xi stared fixedly at Kang Qingzhi and said word by word, “You’ve been trying your best to stop me from investigating the truth. Were you the one who reported me?”","Kang Qingzhi’s head exploded. Her eyes instantly turned red, and her voice was delicate. “I... I didn’t. Miss Bright Moon, why do you always misunderstand me?!”","Below the stage, Old Madam Kang had a vicious expression as she shouted at the top of her voice, “Bright Moon! What nonsense are you talking about?! Qingzhi is just doing this for everyone’s sake. Don’t pin your dirty thoughts on Qingzhi!”","Little b*tch! She should have died with that b*tch, Xia Yunqiu! She made things difficult for Qingzhi in front of everyone and made Qingzhi suffer countless grievances!","Kang Jichuan frowned. He knew that Xi Xi had been wronged, but she could not vent her anger on Qingzhi!","He had misunderstood Xi Xi just now, so in order to make Xi Xi feel better, he would not speak up for Qingzhi anymore. He felt that he had already done enough.","However, Xi Xi would offend many people by doing this. At the same time, it would be difficult for her to establish herself in the perfume world. She would definitely regret her actions today in the future!","“Oh?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Perhaps I misunderstood.”","Old Madam Kang was in the right, so how could she let Qiao Xi off so easily? She shouted loudly, “Apologize to our Qingzhi immediately! Our Qingzhi is the champion for two consecutive years. Why should she be slandered by you, you wretched girl?”","Twilight’s expression turned cold, and his eyes were filled with danger.","Qiao Xi was not angry in the slightest. She chuckled and said, “I can apologize, but that’s only if the person who framed me isn’t Kang Qingzhi.”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip aggrievedly, but she cursed Qiao Xi in her heart for being an idiot. She was the daughter of the Kang family. Why would the judges expose her?","She immediately looked at the judges, her eyes filled with warning. Zhao Xiang’s heart trembled. He took a deep breath and announced loudly, “The person who reported Bright Moon is—”","Everyone’s gazes shifted to Kang Qingzhi and Qiao Xi. If it were not for Kang Qingzhi, Qiao Xi would have to apologize to her in public.","“Xu Ling!”","Zhao Xiang’s voice echoed in the venue, and everyone looked at Xu Ling.","Xu Ling was terrified to the point her entire body trembled, and her expression suddenly stiffened. Her eyes were still filled with resentment and smugness that had not dissipated. This was all exposed to everyone.","“You—” Her voice was hoarse, but she could not say a word. Before she could say anything, Old Madam Kang shouted impatiently, “Bright Moon! The person who reported you is Xu Ling. It has nothing to do with Qingzhi! You slandered Qingzhi in public. Kneel down and apologize to her immediately!”","Initially, Xu Ling wanted to explain herself, but Old Madam Kang’s words convicted her. She could only look at Kang Qingzhi for help."]},{"number":1520,"title":"Chapter 1520 Punishment","paragraphs":["1520 Punishment","The venue was silent for a moment. Qiao Xi blinked and said slowly, “So the person who reported me is Xu Ling! But just now, both Miss Kang and Miss Xu kept finding excuses to stop me from investigating. I think that Miss Kang is related to this matter!”","Kang Qingzhi’s tears welled up in her eyes, and her voice trembled. “Bright Moon, I’m sorry. I misunderstood you just now.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Kang Qingzhi apologized first. If she did not apologize for her actions just now, she would be the one who would be insensible.","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not speak for a long time, Kang Qingzhi’s tears surged out as her weak body swayed. “Miss Bright Moon, I admit that I misunderstood you. It’s because Ling Ling is my friend that I believed her words, but I’ve already apologized. I hope you can forgive me.”","Qiao Xi did not answer and looked at her with a playful expression.","Old Madam Kang’s sharp voice came from below the stage. “Qingzhi has already apologized. Aren’t you going to say anything?”","Kang Ru stared fixedly at Qiao Xi, his eyes filled with complicated emotions. Xi Xi was his daughter, so of course, his heart ached. However, this matter had nothing to do with Qingzhi. Qingzhi only misunderstood Xi Xi because she believed her friend’s words. She had already apologized, so why was Xi Xi still unwilling to let the matter go?","Kang Jichuan also said unhappily, “Bright Moon, the people who really wronged you are Du Ming and Xu Ling. What did Qingzhi do wrong? She just believed her friend’s words. This means that she values friendship. Moreover, she has already apologized. You don’t have to hold on to this small mistake. Since you’ve already found the person who reported you, don’t waste everyone’s time. Hurry up and compete!”","Everyone thought that this was the end of the matter, but Bright Moon suddenly looked up with a mocking smile. “Young Master Kang, although we’ve already found the person who reported me, the matter isn’t over yet. If one does something wrong, one will be punished!”","Kang Jichuan’s heart naturally ached for his biological sister, and he agreed with Qiao Xi’s actions. He nodded and said, “You’re right. One of them slandered you for seducing a judge, while the other took a photo to report you. They’re so vicious, so they should indeed be punished.”","Qiao Xi obtained a satisfactory answer and smiled brightly. Kang Jichuan had personally said that the person who framed her was vicious and should be punished.","Old Madam Kang no longer had the patience. She glared at Qiao Xi with resentment. “What nonsense are you spouting?! You slandered Qingzhi, so apologize to her immediately. Otherwise, don’t even think about walking out of this door today!”","Qiao Xi ignored her and looked at Zhao Xiang. Under Qiao Xi’s questioning and suppressive gaze, cold sweat trickled down Zhao Xiang’s forehead.","He looked up guiltily at Bright Moon, then at Twilight. No matter what, he could not offend Twilight. Moreover, Mr. Twilight said that as long as he told the truth, he would protect him. However, if Zhao Xiang did not tell the truth, Mr. Twilight would immediately make him pay the price!","Even if the Kang family really wanted to deal with him, they would not dare to do it brazenly. However, if Mr. Twilight wanted to deal with him, it was just a matter of words.","Zhao Xiang thought about it and cleared his throat. “Everyone, I... I’m not done.”","Everyone was stunned for a moment and did not understand what Zhao Xiang meant. He hurriedly said, “The person who reported Miss Bright Moon is Xu Ling...”","Kang Qingzhi stared fixedly at Zhao Xiang. Suddenly, she realized that something was wrong, and her heart thumped violently.","Under everyone’s puzzled gazes, Zhao Xiang subconsciously glanced at Kang Qingzhi. The next second, he said as if he was facing death, “It’s Xu Ling and Kang Qingzhi!”","Kang Qingzhi?","Everyone gasped and looked at Kang Qingzhi in unison.","At this moment, her face was pale, and her eyes were filled with horror. Her ears were buzzing as if she had instantly fallen to the bottom of the sea. Everything around her became blurry.","With her last bit of rationality, she forced herself to remain calm and stand on the stage.","Zhao Xiang! He actually exposed her!","“Say that again?” Old Madam Kang stood up abruptly, her sharp voice breaking the silence.","At this moment, this noble old madam did not care about her image at all. The muscles on her face were trembling, and her turbid eyes were filled with blood. Her voice was as ear-piercing and hoarse as a crow’s. “You bastard, you’re actually slandering Qingzhi? Do you want to die?! Do you know that Qingzhi is the daughter of the Kang family? If you offend our Kang family, I won’t let you have an easy time! I’ll make sure you can’t survive in the perfume world anymore!”","Old Madam Kang cursed like a shrew. She placed one hand on her waist and pointed at Zhao Xiang with the other. She wished she could rush over and slap him the next second."]},{"number":1521,"title":"Chapter 1521 Relatives Standing Up For You","paragraphs":["1521 Relatives Standing Up For You","Zhao Xiang lowered his head, his face ashen. It was obvious that Kang Qingzhi wanted to deal with Bright Moon and bribed the judges to suppress her. Kang Qingzhi did such a shameful thing just because she was the daughter of the Kang family. Did he have to take the blame?","Now that the matter was exposed, no one could blame him. If she wanted to blame someone, she could only blame herself. If she were not the daughter of the Kang family, who would tolerate her until now?","Moreover, he had already tried his best to protect Kang Qingzhi, yet Old Madam Kang actually cursed and threatened him in public. She did not take him seriously at all!","At the thought of this, the anger in Zhao Xiang’s heart surged. He said angrily, “Old Madam Kang, if you don’t believe me, I’ll bring out the evidence. At that time, the person who’ll be embarrassed will be Miss Kang. Don’t regret it!”","!!","Old Madam Kang was angered to the point her face was livid. Just as she was about to rush over and argue with Zhao Xiang, she suddenly paused and glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. She gritted her teeth and said, “Bright Moon! You b*tch, you bribed this judge and got him to slander our Qingzhi, right? Qingzhi is the champion of two consecutive perfume competitions. She doesn’t have to target a wild girl like you. In order to deal with Qingzhi, you actually used such despicable methods. Why don’t you just die?!”","Qiao Xi said coldly, “Miss Kang, no wonder you wanted to report me. Even when the truth is exposed, your relatives are still standing up for you. Now, it’s my fault even though I’m the victim?”","Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan’s hearts trembled.","‘Your relatives are still standing up for you?’","Kang Ru’s heart seemed to be squeezed tightly. What was Xi Xi talking about? They were also Xi Xi’s relatives! If Xi Xi encountered difficulties, they would protect her. Could it be that she was already extremely disappointed in them?","Perhaps they were biased toward Qingzhi, but Qingzhi had been by their side for more than ten years. They naturally had a deep relationship. Moreover, Qingzhi’s health was not good, so it was reasonable for them to protect her!","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth and racked her brains to think of a countermeasure.","If she tried her best to retort when Zhao Xiang said this in public, he would definitely bring out the evidence. At that time, everyone would think that she was unrepentant.","Originally, she wanted Xu Ling to confess, but she did not expect Zhao Xiang to stand up for Qiao Xi. Was he not afraid of offending the Kang family and not being able to survive in the perfume world anymore?","Qiao Xi was extremely satisfied with the scene before her and said casually, “I was wondering why Miss Kang denied my evidence just now and stopped me from investigating the truth. She even accused me of wasting everyone’s time. It turns out that Miss Kang was the one who secretly reported me and framed me!","“Tsk tsk... I have to say that your acting skills are really good.”","Everyone was shocked.","“It’s actually Kang Qingzhi...”","“Before Bright Moon came just now, Kang Qingzhi was still speaking up for her in front of everyone. I thought she was kind-hearted, but I didn’t expect her to be just pretending!”","“She has a pitiful face but has done some vicious things behind our backs. I really don’t know how such a person managed to win the championship for two years!”","Kang Qingzhi’s body stiffened as she clenched her fists tightly. Her eyes were filled with anger and unwillingness. She felt that she was surrounded by disdainful gazes, making her unable to breathe.","She bit her lip, and the taste of blood spread from her mouth. She would always remember the pain at this moment and the humiliation today. Sooner or later, she would make Qiao Xi pay for it!","“Huh? The people who reported Miss Bright Moon are Xu Ling and Kang Qingzhi, so who’s the woman in the recording? Is it one of them too?”","“I almost forgot about that. She lured Du Ming to Miss Bright Moon’s lounge and took the opportunity to take a photo. Wasn’t she deliberately framing her?”","“Right! Just now, Kang Jichuan even said that the person who framed Bright Moon is vicious and should be punished. Now that he realizes that the person who framed Bright Moon is his sister, let’s see how he’ll protect her. I’m embarrassed for them.”","“You can’t judge a book by its cover! Kang Qingzhi is really too disgusting!”","At this moment, the venue was filled with everyone’s discussion. Kang Qingzhi stood rooted to the ground in a daze and heard everything clearly. The hatred in her heart surged like a monstrous fire.","She was the daughter of the Kang family. Who were they to dare insult her?","Kang Qingzhi panted angrily and suppressed the anger in her heart. She comforted herself in her heart over and over again. Fortunately, this was not a live stream. It was just the event location for the semi-finals. As long as she threatened the competition’s organizers not to spread what had happened today, no one outside would know.","Below the stage, Kang Jichuan also thought of this. Previously, Qiao Xi had requested to announce the person who framed her online and list all the evidence to prove her innocence, but Qingzhi was one of them..."]},{"number":1522,"title":"Chapter 1522 Why Would Qingzhi Lie?","paragraphs":["1522 Why Would Qingzhi Lie?","Kang Jichuan frowned, feeling uneasy.","Qingzhi was Xi Xi’s younger sister, after all. As long as they were sentimental and reasonable, Xi Xi should forgive Qingzhi. If Qingzhi’s name was really posted online, her future would be ruined. Xi Xi would not be so heartless.","Kang Ru rubbed the space between his eyebrows and said helplessly, “Jichuan, Xi Xi doesn’t deserve this...”","Kang Jichuan pursed his lips tightly, and his tone carried a trace of anger. “She has been wronged, but she shouldn’t be causing trouble at the event location. It doesn’t matter if she wants to punish others, but this concerns Qingzhi. Can’t she think about Qingzhi? She just can’t tolerate Qingzhi. She wants to ruin Qingzhi whenever she finds a chance!”","At this moment, the judges gathered together to discuss the punishment for Xu Ling and Kang Qingzhi. The other contestants could rest during the intermission while Kang Qingzhi returned to the Kang family’s side in tears.","Kang Ru said unhappily, “Qingzhi, did you really do it?”","Kang Qingzhi was extremely aggrieved and choked. “Dad, I... Why would I harm Sister Xi Xi? It was Ling Ling who said that she saw someone seduce the judges. She lied to me. She asked me to report that person for her.","“I’ve always liked perfumes, so I respect the perfume competition very much. I was very disappointed to know that someone had done such a thing. Because it was Ling Ling who told me, I believed her and reported it with her. However, I didn’t know that that person was Sister Xi Xi at first. I’m sorry... It’s all my fault!”","With that, Kang Qingzhi’s tears trickled down. Her tears fell to the floor.","Kang Ru’s heart ached when he saw this. He could not bear to reprimand her and comforted her softly. “I was just asking. I’m not blaming you. Don’t cry.”","Kang Jichuan, who had been silent for a long time, knew very well that the person who lured Du Ming to the lounge was Qingzhi. His heart was a mess as he looked at Kang Qingzhi suspiciously. His voice also became serious. “Qingzhi, did you really not know that Xu Ling wanted to frame Xi Xi?”","Kang Qingzhi’s heart skipped a beat. She subconsciously lowered her eyes, which were filled with unwillingness and anger. Why did her brother not believe her anymore? Was he going to abandon his sister, who had been by his side for more than ten years, for that little b*tch?","Her eyes were filled with resentment, but when she looked up again, they were filled with grievance and sorrow. Tears blurred her vision, and her round eyes were red. She sniffled. “Brother, you don’t believe me? We grew up together. Don’t you know what kind of person I am? If I knew that Ling Ling framed Sister Xi Xi, why would I report Sister with her?","“I know that I’m occupying my sister’s identity. I owe her a lot. I’ve always wanted to compensate my sister, so it’s impossible for me to frame her! But Brother... are you suspecting me?”","Tears welled up in her eyes. Kang Jichuan’s heart ached, and his voice softened. “Qingzhi, I... I’m not suspecting you.”","He was muddle-headed! Why would Qingzhi lie?","“Jichuan, are you crazy? You actually suspect Qingzhi?” Old Madam Kang’s eyes were bloodshot as she shouted at the top of her voice, “That little b*tch is indeed innocent, but she’s slandering our Qingzhi. Instead of comforting Qingzhi, you’re actually questioning her like that little b*tch. What kind of brother are you?”","“Grandma...” Kang Jichuan pinched the space between his eyebrows.","However, before he could finish, he heard a cold voice. “Young Master Kang asked me to come over to talk, but I heard Old Madam Kang scolding me the moment I arrived. Talk about sincerity!”","Everyone from the Kang family hurriedly looked up and saw Qiao Xi with her arms crossed as she looked at them with ridicule.","Kang Jichuan’s expression was ugly as he looked away guiltily. “Xi Xi, don’t mind her. Grandma is just worried about Qingzhi, so she said a few harsh words. I really do have something to tell you.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as she glanced at the passageway behind the audience. She saw Yang Xu shoot her a look, then asked casually, “What do you have to say to me?”","Kang Jichuan looked at her cold gaze and distant tone. He recalled her words just now. ‘Miss Kang has her relatives to stand up for her.’ His heart was filled with guilt, and his voice became gentle. “Xi Xi, we’re also your family. We can protect you too.”","“Is that so?” Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Young Master Kang, don’t waste time and be straightforward.”","Kang Jichuan instantly choked, and the words in his mouth were stuck in his throat. However, if he did not say anything, what would Qingzhi do?","He took a deep breath and braced himself. “Xi Xi, Qingzhi was also deceived by Xu Ling. She didn’t know that you were the one Xu Ling wanted to report. She just didn’t want anyone to break the rules of the competition, so she went with Xu Ling to report the matter.”"]},{"number":1523,"title":"Chapter 1523 Won’t Agree To This Unreasonable Request","paragraphs":["1523 Won’t Agree To This Unreasonable Request","“Qingzhi denied your evidence because Xu Ling influenced her. She treated you as her biological sister and didn’t want to see you go astray. She wanted you to realize your mistake and change. Now that she knows that she has misunderstood, she blames herself very much. She was even scolded by so many people...”","Kang Jichuan’s voice carried a hint of pleading. “Qingzhi has already apologized to you in public and paid the price. No matter what, Qingzhi is your younger sister. Don’t announce her name online, alright?”","He thought for a long time. Qingzhi and Xu Ling’s names could not be posted online. After all, everyone knew that Xu Ling was Qingzhi’s good friend. If Xu Ling was the one who reported it, it was inevitable that the netizens would be suspicious. Hence, he wanted to think of a method where they could clarify that Xi Xi was wronged but without announcing the names of the people who framed her. This way, it would not affect Qingzhi.","Qiao Xi could not help but roll her eyes. She sneered. “Young Master Kang, are you saying that although I’ve already proven my innocence, I can’t announce the people who framed and slandered me online? I just need the officials of the International Fragrance Competition to clarify things, right?”","Kang Jichuan nodded, his throat a little dry.","“Young Master Kang.” Qiao Xi’s voice was cold. “Kang Qingzhi and Xu Ling joined forces to frame me, causing everyone to think that I seduced the judges and cheated. If I don’t explain the ins and outs of the matter and rashly release a clarification message, what will the netizens think of me?","“They’ll probably think that I seduced another man or used my power to threaten the competition’s organizers to regain my qualifications to participate in the competition. I’m a victim to begin with. What’s wrong with me proving my innocence? Why should I suffer to protect the perpetrator?”","“Xi Xi!” Kang Jichuan’s tone was a little impatient. “Then what do you want? Could it be that you want to destroy Qingzhi?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “I’ve been scolded by others for so many days. Can’t I clarify things? In your eyes, Kang Qingzhi can’t suffer any grievances. Even if she frames someone else, she can’t pay the price she deserves. Meanwhile, I deserve to be wronged? Even if I’ve proven my innocence, I can’t clarify things online? Listen to yourself. Don’t you think you’re too biased?”","Kang Jichuan’s expression changed, and his legs went weak. He could not help but take a few steps back.","He... He was not being biased. He had no intention of hurting Xi Xi!","“Sister Xi Xi, Brother said that for me. If you want to blame someone, blame me!” There were still tears on Kang Qingzhi’s face as she looked at Qiao Xi with grievance and fear. “Actually, Brother isn’t biased toward me. It’s because of the Kang family’s business. We’ve invested a lot of money in the perfume business. If my image is damaged, our family will lose a lot of money.","“Sister, I... I beg you. Can you not post your name online? You can punish me however you want...”","“Will the Kang family lose money if your image is damaged?” Qiao Xi asked, then snorted coldly. “Miss Kang, does the Kang family losing money have anything to do with me? Your Kang family is protecting the perpetrator and forcing me, the victim, to compromise. I really can’t agree to this unreasonable request. It’s impossible for anyone with a brain to agree!”","Kang Ru’s and Kang Jichuan’s eyes were very complicated.","Yes! This was indeed difficult for Xi Xi to accept, but...","Kang Qingzhi was anxious and uneasy. Her voice was filled with pleading. “Sister Xi Xi, you can hate me, but on the account of Dad and Brother, how can you...”","“Miss Kang, do I need to remind you that I’ve never eaten a single bite of the Kang family’s food or spent a single cent of their money? I don’t have any feelings for them either. What right do you have to ask me to sacrifice myself for the Kang family? Moreover, what right do you, an adopted daughter who’s occupying my identity, have to persuade me?” Qiao Xi’s words hit Kang Qingzhi’s heart hard.","Kang Qingzhi’s round eyes were filled with sorrow and fear. Tears welled up in her eyes. She took a few steps back in horror like a frightened rabbit and said in a trembling voice, “Sister, I... I beg you...”","“You b*tch! I’ll tear your mouth off!” Old Madam Kang roared angrily and stood in front of Kang Qingzhi. She glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “You have to agree even if you don’t want to! If you dare to make things difficult for Qingzhi and ruin her reputation, I’ll let you die without a complete corpse!”","Kang Jichuan remembered that Old Madam Kang had been calling Xi Xi a b*tch today. He was a little dissatisfied and was about to speak up for Xi Xi when he turned around and saw Qingzhi pulling the corner of his shirt aggrievedly."]},{"number":1524,"title":"Chapter 1524 Causing An Uproar","paragraphs":["1524 Causing An Uproar","Kang Qingzhi’s gaze made the guilt in Kang Jichuan’s heart instantly dissipate. His tone was serious. “Xi Xi, you heard Qingzhi being scolded just now. If her name is really announced online, I don’t know how those netizens will attack her. At that time, the Kang family’s company will be affected. Are you going to watch our investment fail? The Kang family’s blood flows in your veins. How can you be so heartless?”","Qiao Xi looked at him coldly. “So I have to bear these consequences? I have to continue to be suspected and insulted by the netizens and bear everything in the place of your Kang family?”","Kang Jichuan took a deep breath. “Xi Xi, this concerns the Kang family’s business. Can you stop being unforgiving?!”","Kang Qingzhi tugged at the corner of Kang Jichuan’s shirt, her eyes filled with pride.","Qiao Xi was the biological daughter Kang Ru had always been thinking about! He had been looking for her for so many years, but in the end, she could not compare to her, the adopted daughter, who was favored!","The current Qiao Xi should be in despair, right? They were clearly related by blood, yet they were unwilling to help her. They even wanted Qiao Xi to sacrifice herself to fulfill the family’s adopted daughter’s wish. Was it very painful?","Five years ago, she was unable to kill Qiao Xi. After that, she got Xu Ling to incite Xu Anran, and Xu Anran was unable to kill her. Now that they were going against each other again, she would absolutely not let Qiao Xi off!","Kang Qingzhi raised her head proudly and looked straight at Qiao Xi with resentment and a trace of disdain.","Qiao Xi met her gaze, and the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile. However, her eyes were quickly filled with disappointment. “Old Madam Kang is threatening my life. How can I resist? I can’t let the Kang family’s business be damaged, nor can I snatch Kang Qingzhi’s title as the champion. In the end, it’s all because I’m useless. I don’t have a powerful family like the Kang family behind me. If I had such a powerful family, how could I be wronged and slandered?","“So I deserve to be wronged. I need to sacrifice myself to help others. It’s all my fault for being useless!”","With that, she left heartlessly without even looking at anyone.","Kang Jichuan looked at her lonely back view, and his heart seemed to be squeezed into a ball.","How could Xi Xi say that?","Did she deserve to be wronged because she did not have the Kang family behind her? However, the Kang family was her family!","They had made Xi Xi suffer, but they were just thinking about the big picture. If she encountered any difficulties in the future, the Kang family would naturally protect her. Why didn’t she understand?","Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan were filled with guilt, but they were still firm on this thought.","As long as Xi Xi took a step back, the Kang family could let Qingzhi become the champion. The Kang family’s perfume business would then rise to another level. They would make it up to Xi Xi after this.","Qingzhi knew that she was in the wrong, and she had already apologized. Why did Xi Xi have to compete with Qingzhi?","On the other hand, when Zhao Xiang saw Qiao Xi return, he said in a flattering tone, “Miss Bright Moon, we’ve already investigated the people who framed you. Can we start the competition now?”","In the beginning, Zhao Xiang looked down on Bright Moon, but now, he had no choice but to lower his voice.","Qiao Xi nodded and casually glanced at the audience.","Zhao Xiang’s heart finally relaxed. He was afraid that Qiao Xi would go back on her word, so he hurriedly said, “Alright! I’ll announce the start of the competition now!”","At the same time, in the small banquet hall at the side, everyone saw the video sent by Yang Xu and was extremely angry. Gu Yao’s expression darkened.","The video that Yang Xu took was a little blurry and shaky. It was as if he had walked into the wrong place and accidentally recorded it.","After a while, Yang Xu posted the video on his WeChat Moments. He was the young master of the Yang family and was quite popular in high society. He also had many friends. The contents of the video instantly spread.","When everyone saw that Gu Yao had liked it and reposted it, they all understood what Gu Zheng meant. He wanted to protect Gu Corporation’s perfumer, Bright Moon. Moreover, this perfumer’s identity was not ordinary!","Perhaps the people at the event location did not know who Xi Xi was, but everyone in high society knew that Gu Zheng’s wife was called Qiao Xi. No wonder President Gu and Gu Yao were focused on protecting Bright Moon.","20 minutes later, not long after the competition began, the video that Yang Xu accidentally recorded caused an uproar in Li City’s high society.","Twilight sat on the judge’s seat and saw Gu Yao reposting Yang Xu’s WeChat Moments.","Baby Yang: [My group of friends is having a gathering today and we booked a banquet hall. I was recording a video and accidentally went to the wrong place. I realized that on the other side of the corridor is the event location of the perfume competition. I happened to record a very interesting scene. I was shocked!]"]},{"number":1525,"title":"Chapter 1525 Deferred Cooperation","paragraphs":["1525 Deferred Cooperation","Upon clicking on the video that Yang Xu had recorded, a shaky image would come into view. Then, a slightly drunk voice came from the video. “Dear Dad and Mom, look... I’m in the banquet hall. I’m gathering with my friends today. I promise... I’ll definitely be home before dark. I’m really not fooling around! Ah? Where is this? Where are my friends? Where’s Gu Yao? I think... I’m in the wrong place.”","After a while, a staff member came forward. “Sir, this is the event location of the International Fragrance Competition. The banquet hall you rented is beside it. The two venues are connected. Let me help you back.”","Yang Xu replied. Just as he was about to turn around and leave, he heard a commotion not far away.","“Qingzhi did report you, but it’s because she believed Xu Ling’s words and was afraid that you would go astray. You’ve already proven your innocence. Qingzhi has already apologized to you in public, and she has also paid the price. No matter what, Qingzhi is your younger sister. Don’t announce her name online, alright?”","!!","Yang Xu stopped in his tracks and muttered drunkenly, “What are they talking about?”","The rest of the conversation was recorded by Yang Xu.","“Xi Xi, what do you want? Are you going to ruin Qingzhi?”","“Kang Qingzhi schemed to frame me and even reported me. I’m the victim. Why should I suffer to protect the perpetrator?”","“Xi Xi! If Qingzhi’s reputation is damaged, the Kang family’s company will be affected. Are you going to watch our investment fail? The Kang family’s blood flows in your veins. How can you be so heartless?”","“You b*tch! I’ll tear your mouth off! Even if you don’t agree, you have to agree! If you dare to make things difficult for Qingzhi and ruin her reputation, I’ll make sure you die without a complete corpse!”","The Kang family was still endlessly criticizing and even cursing. In the end, Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Old Madam Kang is threatening my life. How can I resist? I can’t let the Kang family’s business be damaged, nor can I snatch Kang Qingzhi’s championship title. In the end, it’s all because I’m useless. I don’t have a powerful family like the Kang family behind me. If I had such a powerful family, how could I have been wronged and slandered?","“So I deserve to be wronged. I need to sacrifice myself to help others. It’s all my fault for being useless!”","The conversation in the video was very clear. Everyone who heard it understood what was going on. Yang Xu even commented on his WeChat Moments: [A noble family from Y Nation? An earl? Won two consecutive championships in the perfume competition? So this is what they’re like behind the scenes! I’ve really learned something!]","Not long after, someone posted this matter online. In order to avoid trouble, the other party did not upload the video directly. Instead, they described the contents of the video.","Most of the people who could appear on Yang Xu’s WeChat Moments were socialites and young masters from Li City. They were not all afraid of the Kang family’s power. Even Yang Xu did not know who posted this matter online. This news was quickly reported and deleted by Kang Qingzhi’s fans. Those fans even clamored for the person who posted the news to publicly apologize. Otherwise, they would not let them have an easy time.","However, the person who dared to release the news was naturally a proud and noble socialite or young master. When they heard the threat from Kang Qingzhi’s fans, they simply uploaded the video and made Kang Qingzhi’s fans shut up.","At this moment, the semi-finals had just ended. Before the officials of the International Fragrance Competition could clarify things, the matter had already spread like wildfire online.","According to the rules of the competition, the results would be released three days after the competition ended. Qiao Xi handed in the perfume she had concocted and was about to leave.","“Xi Xi!”","Kang Jichuan quickly walked in front of her with a frown. He sounded a little annoyed. “Xi Xi, didn’t you say that you wouldn’t post Qingzhi’s name online? Why are you doing this?!”","Qiao Xi instantly understood what was going on. She did not expect Yang Xu to move so quickly. The Kang family had already seen the video that was circulating online.","Kang Jichuan stared fixedly at Qiao Xi, his eyes filled with disappointment.","Xi Xi had the Kang family’s blood. She was also a part of the Kang family. Moreover, she had promised to let Qingzhi off, so why did she post such a video and cause the entire Kang family’s reputation to be damaged?","20 minutes ago, Kang Jichuan received a call from an investor. “Young Master Kang, let’s postpone the collaboration this time. We’ve encountered a problem here...”","Kang Jichuan did not think too much about it. He thought that there was something wrong with the other party’s funds. Anyway, there were so many people who wanted to collaborate with the Kang family, so there was no need for him to humbly ask an investor to stay. However, not long after, he received another similar call."]},{"number":1526,"title":"Chapter 1526 She’s The One Who’s Disappointed!","paragraphs":["1526 She’s The One Who’s Disappointed!","A few minutes later, Kang Jichuan received a call from his perfume raw materials partner. “Mr. Kang, I’m really sorry. We can’t provide this batch of raw materials...”","Two consecutive calls to terminate their collaboration gave Kang Jichuan a bad feeling. Not long after, he received a third call. He suppressed his anger and asked, “Why are you suddenly terminating the contract?”","The other party was a company in charge of the packaging of perfumes. Although they wanted to terminate the contract, there was no need to offend the Kang family. Hence, their tone was very gentle. “Mr. Kang, I’m really sorry. We really can’t work with Miss Kang...”","He felt that Kang Jichuan should already know about the video. Although he was being tactful, Kang Jichuan could understand. However, the next second, Kang Jichuan’s voice was filled with a threatening tone. “President Jin, we signed the contract a long time ago. What right do you have to terminate the contract just like that? Do you know how much loss this will cause the Kang family? Will you compensate for these losses?”","President Jin was stunned for a few seconds before he snorted. “You want me to compensate? We’ve already done our best by not asking your Kang family to compensate! Kang Qingzhi’s reputation is ruined, which is why we’re terminating the contract. This is clearly your Kang family’s fault! Don’t think that just because your Kang family is a noble in Y Nation that we’re afraid of you. The Kang family’s video has already spread online. Mr. Kang, you’ll have many problems to solve, so you probably won’t have time to take revenge on us.”","As soon as he finished speaking, President Jin hung up mercilessly.","Kang Jichuan’s face was ashen as he suddenly recalled President Jin’s words. How did Qingzhi’s reputation get ruined? What video?","Kang Jichuan’s heart trembled as he suddenly realized that something was wrong.","At this moment, his phone vibrated. A notification appeared in front of him. Kang Jichuan subconsciously glanced at it and instantly felt as if he had fallen into an ice cellar.","Someone recorded their conversation with Qiao Xi and uploaded it online. It had already been posted online for a long time, so it was too late to remove the trending topics.","Kang Jichuan’s face alternated between white and green as anger surged in his heart. He held his cell phone tightly. Xi Xi had clearly agreed not to pursue this matter anymore, so why was the video still uploaded online?","After a while, the Kang family all found out about this news. Their expressions were ugly as if they had eaten a fly. Even though Kang Ru’s heart ached for Kang Qingzhi, he could not help but blame her for ruining the perfume business.","Old Madam Kang cursed at the top of her voice. Kang Jichuan hurriedly stopped her to avoid being caught. He thought that after the competition ended, he would definitely ask Qiao Xi about it.","At this moment, Kang Jichuan stared fixedly at Qiao Xi and went straight to the point. “Xi Xi, this video has caused a lot of negative impact on the Kang family. Many partners have already called to terminate the contract. If this continues, the Kang family will definitely suffer irreversible losses. You have to help the Kang family solve this problem.”","Qiao Xi was stopped by the Kang family. Twilight’s eyes suddenly turned cold.","Zhao Xiang noticed Twilight’s cold expression and asked while trembling, “Mr. Twilight, do you want me... to help Miss Bright Moon?”","Everyone present had also seen the video that was circulating online. They did not expect the impact to be so big. The Kang family must also know the news, so they wanted to look for trouble with Bright Moon.","Zhao Xiang was afraid that the Kang family would anger Bright Moon and Twilight would withdraw from the competition. At that time, the already criticized perfume competition would definitely not be able to continue next year.","Twilight pursed his lips. After a long time, he said casually, “She can handle it herself.”","Zhao Xiang was a little surprised. He could tell that Mr. Twilight cared a lot about Miss Bright Moon. He had defended her in public just now, so why was he not worried now?","Although he was curious, he did not dare to ask about Mr. Twilight’s private matters.","At the entrance of the lounge, Qiao Xi replied coldly, “Why should I help the Kang family?”","Kang Ru’s tone was also unfriendly. “Xi Xi, you’ve been wronged, but you can’t vent your anger on the Kang family’s reputation and business. You’ve already agreed not to pursue the matter. Since you’ve promised us, you shouldn’t go back on your word!”","“Go back on my word?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and looked at Kang Ru indifferently.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was clearly so casual, but it scared Kang Ru so much that his heart skipped a beat and his body trembled uncontrollably. He could tolerate the people around him making mistakes, but he did not like others going against his wishes. This concerned the Kang family’s reputation and interests. He berated coldly, “You didn’t do what you promised. Xi Xi, I’m very disappointed in you.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Kang Ru had the cheek to say that he was disappointed? She was clearly the one who was truly disappointed!"]},{"number":1527,"title":"Chapter 1527 Not Keeping The Promise","paragraphs":["1527 Not Keeping The Promise","Kang Ru seemed to have sensed the coldness in Qiao Xi’s eyes, and he did not want to reprimand his daughter in public, so his tone softened a little. “Xi Xi, didn’t we agree long ago? You already agreed not to pursue the matter with Qingzhi, so why did you post the video online?”","Kang Jichuan’s tone softened a little. “Xi Xi, Dad and I know that you’ve been wronged. We understand that you hate Qingzhi, but Qingzhi has been by our side for more than ten years, after all. Can’t you forgive Qingzhi on Dad’s account?”","“The Kang family invested four billion yuan in the perfume business. If we take the wrong step, all the Kang family’s investments will be in vain. You’re the daughter of the Kang family. How can you take revenge on us for your own happiness? Do you treat us as your family?”","Qiao Xi blinked and said slowly, “You came to look for me because your business partners all terminated their contracts because of Kang Qingzhi. You want me to help Kang Qingzhi clarify things and recover the Kang family’s losses?”","Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru nodded and looked at her with anticipation. After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi’s beautiful eyes curved into crescents as the corners of her mouth curled into a mocking smile. “Does the Kang family’s loss have anything to do with me?”","The Kang father and son gasped, their eyes filled with shock. How did the Kang family’s loss have nothing to do with her? She was from the Kang family!","Seeing this, Old Madam Kang was finally unable to suppress the anger in her heart. Her eyes almost popped out as she raised her hand and attacked Qiao Xi. “Little b*tch! I’ll beat you to death!”","This sharp roar instantly attracted everyone’s attention. They all looked over and saw the Kang family and Bright Moon standing together. Old Madam Kang raised her hand and aimed for Bright Moon’s delicate cheek, but the next second, Qiao Xi firmly grabbed Old Madam Kang’s wrist and said in a cold voice, “Old Madam Kang, are you going to attack in front of everyone? You’re the madam of a noble family, after all. You have to take care of your image.”","Kang Jichuan immediately berated, “Xi Xi, you broke your promise first. What’s wrong with Grandma reprimanding you? Stop fooling around!”","Before the video was exposed, Kang Ru’s heart was filled with guilt. However, now that he saw the Kang family’s business being affected and Qiao Xi’s indifferent expression, his heart was filled with anger and disappointment.","Qiao Xi’s arm was slender, but she firmly grabbed Old Madam Kang’s wrist, making her unable to move. The old madam could only roar in exasperation, “Damn girl! Let go of me!”","“You must have gotten someone to release the video. Who else but you would scheme against our Kang family? You b*tch! I should have killed you earlier so that you wouldn’t have come to harm us! Why didn’t you die with Xia Yunqiu?”","After Old Madam Kang finished roaring, she raised her other hand and hit Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi nimbly dodged and shook Old Madam Kang off.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was extremely clear that Old Madam Kang hated her not because she was afraid that she would threaten Kang Qingzhi’s status but because she hated her mother. Hence, she started to hate the old madam from the bottom of her heart.","When Zhao Xiang saw the scene in front of him, he was so scared that he gasped and hurriedly went forward to stop Qiao Xi. Old Madam Kang’s body swayed twice after being flung by Qiao Xi, and she fell onto Kang Jichuan. She was angered to the point her face was livid as she cursed at the top of her voice, “B*tch! You actually dare to hit me? I’m old, yet you actually dare to attack me? Jichuan, teach her a lesson!”","Kang Jichuan frowned and looked at Qiao Xi unhappily. “How could you attack Grandma? Don’t you know how to respect your elders?”","At this moment, Kang Ru realized that everyone in the venue was looking over. His expression was extremely ugly as he lowered his voice and reminded her, “Mom, so many people are watching. Don’t scold Xi Xi anymore.”","“Xi Xi, your Grandma is an elder. No matter what, you can’t attack an elder. Moreover, you didn’t keep your promise, so she wanted to teach you a lesson. You—”","Kang Ru thought that his attitude was good enough, and Qiao Xi would definitely understand his difficulties. However, before he could finish speaking, he heard applause from the audience behind him.","Clap, clap, clap!","“How exciting! The Kang family’s behavior gives me a reason to suspect that Kang Qingzhi’s two championships were all fake. Perhaps there were outstanding contestants like Miss Bright Moon in the past, but because they threatened Kang Qingzhi’s status, they were secretly dealt with by the Kang family.”","Kang Ru gasped.","At this moment, everyone at the event location looked at the Kang family in disdain. One of them, who was dressed in a suit and leather shoes and looked like a distinguished guest, slowly said, “Mr. Kang, you said that Miss Bright Moon didn’t keep her promise, so it’s only right for Old Madam Kang to teach her a lesson? But why should Miss Bright Moon keep such an unfair promise? Why should she think about the Kang family’s interests? Do you think you’re the sun and everyone else has to revolve around you?”"]},{"number":1528,"title":"Chapter 1528 They Set Up A Trap","paragraphs":["1528 They Set Up A Trap","Kang Ru had a noble status and was once an earl of Y Nation, so he was respected and flattered no matter where he went. He had never been mocked like this in public. He immediately retorted loudly, “It doesn’t matter what the promise is. Since Bright Moon has already agreed not to pursue the matter, why did she suddenly go back on her word and let Qingzhi suffer the insults of netizens?”","“Mr. Kang, have you forgotten that Miss Bright Moon was competing on stage just now? She didn’t have time to take a video at all. What right do you have to blame her without distinguishing right or wrong?”","Kang Ru instantly choked.","Everyone in the venue also looked at the Kang family in disdain and defended the injustice. “Yes! Miss Bright Moon was making perfume just now and hasn’t left the venue since. How could she have time to take a video or send a message?”","!!","“You didn’t watch the video carefully, right? Young Master Yang was in the banquet hall at the side and accidentally went to the wrong place. He recorded your conversation and posted it on his WeChat Moments. He didn’t want to blow things up, but someone posted this matter online. Kang Qingzhi’s fans were unconvinced and insisted that the other party show some evidence, so the other party posted the video online. This matter is clearly Kang Qingzhi and her brainless fans’ fault. What does it have to do with Miss Bright Moon?”","“Moreover, even if Miss Bright Moon posted it online, she’s not in the wrong. She was wrongly accused of seducing the judges and suffered countless curses. Now that she has proven her innocence, you’re not letting her clarify things. It’s clearly Kang Qingzhi who’s jealous of her and framed her to report her. However, Old Madam Kang even attacked Miss Bright Moon personally. Instead of realizing your mistake, you’re accusing Bright Moon. Isn’t this too much?”","Kang Ru’s face was livid from the reprimand. The words in his mouth were stuck in his throat, and his pale lips moved. Looking at everyone’s disdainful gazes, he could not say a word.","Things had blown up. Everyone knew what Qingzhi had done. What should they do?","Kang Qingzhi had just left the venue. When she heard that the video had been uploaded online, her vision darkened and she almost fainted.","Her fans were clamoring for the other party to produce evidence, so that person uploaded the video online?","“Miss Kang, I didn’t expect you to be such a person. You don’t dare to bear the consequences of your mistake, and you let your family oppress Miss Bright Moon with their power. Don’t think that just because you’re a two-time champion of the perfume competition that you can be lawless. Who knows if your championship is real or not?!”","The contestants looked at her in disdain. Those who used to curry favor with her all stayed far away, afraid of being implicated.","Kang Qingzhi’s mind was a mess. Her face was pale as she leaned against the armrest and forced herself to stand.","Hearing everyone’s words, she gradually realized what had happened. She thought that Qiao Xi would eventually compromise under the pressure of the Kang family, but she never expected that she would still be tricked by Qiao Xi.","How could Young Master Yang have taken the wrong path and recorded that video? He was clearly instructed by Qiao Xi! Moreover, Yang Xu was Gu Yao’s friend. If Gu Yao had not agreed, how could Yang Xu have uploaded the video to his WeChat Moments?","Gu Yao was Gu Zheng’s younger brother. They were all family. In order to protect Qiao Xi, they set up this trap. Even without Qiao Xi’s help, they could make the Kang family pay the price!","Only then did Kang Qingzhi understand that this was Li City, Gu Zheng’s territory. The Kang family did not have the chance to display their skills here at all. They would be completely led by the nose by Gu Zheng.","As long as Gu Zheng was by Qiao Xi’s side, she would never be able to defeat Qiao Xi. Now, not only was Qiao Xi’s reputation not ruined, but the Kang family’s perfume business had also suffered a huge loss!","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists tightly, her eyes filled with resentment. After a long silence, she suddenly looked up. Her eyes calmed down, and she revealed a sinister smile.","A man like Gu Zheng was probably willing to marry Qiao Xi because he had taken a liking to her face, but he would get tired of her one day. He liked Qiao Xi just for the sense of novelty, but she was more outstanding than Qiao Xi and had tricks up her sleeve. Would Gu Zheng like her?","Kang Qingzhi’s gaze landed on Gu Zheng. If she wanted to gain Gu Zheng’s favor, she must not take the initiative to seduce him. An outstanding man like him must have long gotten used to seeing women curry favor with him. If she was like other women, how could she pique Gu Zheng’s interest?","Now that the matter had blown up and their conversation had been recorded, Kang Qingzhi knew that no matter how she defended herself, no one would believe her. She just quietly endured the mockery and disdain around her."]},{"number":1529,"title":"Chapter 1529 A Desperate Dog","paragraphs":["1529 A Desperate Dog","Not long after, Kang Qingzhi posted an apology statement online. Although it was an apology, she pushed all the blame on Xu Ling. Some fans believed that their idol would not do such a thing, but most people did not believe her. Moreover, no matter what Kang Qingzhi said, it could not recover the Kang family’s losses.","At this moment, the Kang father and son were like cats on a hot tin roof. Kang Ru only liked women and was not good at business. He pushed the responsibility of the company to Kang Jichuan.","Kang Jichuan was anxious. As he thought of countermeasures, he was worried that Kang Qingzhi would not be able to withstand the curses online. However, Kang Qingzhi seemed to know what he was thinking. She said that the company’s matters had already annoyed her brother and he did not need to think about her. She had only been scolded a few times, so she did not care.","“Actually, this is my fault. It’s only right for me to be scolded. Sister Xi Xi just wants to take revenge on me. If you speak up for me, Sister Xi Xi... She’ll definitely be even angrier. She’ll think that you and Dad don’t like her and only dote on me, the adopted daughter. I don’t want you and Dad to be in a difficult position.","“No matter how I explain it now, Sister Xi Xi won’t believe me. She thinks that I framed her, so it’s reasonable for her to hate me. If being scolded can appease Sister Xi Xi’s anger, I really don’t care.”","As Kang Qingzhi spoke, tears trickled down her face. Her voice gradually choked. “Brother, I... I’m really fine. Don’t stand up for me anymore. Otherwise, Sister Xi Xi will definitely go farther and farther away from you...”","Kang Jichuan agreed with Kang Qingzhi, but he could not help but feel sorry for her. She had never been wronged since she was young, but this time, she was insulted by the entire internet.","At this moment, a trace of regret surged out of Kang Jichuan’s heart. If he had not reunited with Xi Xi back then, would there not have been such trouble later?","Kang Qingzhi knew very well that her father and brother still blamed her, but as long as she lowered her status and gave in, the Kang family would not be able to bear to blame her. Instead, they would think that all of this was Qiao Xi’s fault.","Although she had been seriously dealt with this time, it was not impossible to salvage the situation. She had other methods.","...","Now that the semi-finals of the International Fragrance Competition had ended, the results of the competition would be released in three days. The finals would be held a week later. The finals would be broadcasted live and the champion would be contested on the spot.","In order to increase the fun and fairness of the competition, after the judges gave the final results, they would also let the participants in the finals comment on everyone’s perfumes. If more than half of the participants felt that the rankings were inappropriate, the judges would discuss again to give the final results.","After Qiao Xi heard Zhao Xiang explain the rules, her expression was indifferent. It was probably because there were some situations that had happened in past competitions, so they had to be fair in everything now.","She stood up and left the office. As soon as she pushed the door open, she saw Twilight standing in the corridor. The corners of his lips curled up slightly, and his voice was low and hoarse with a trace of unique charm. “Miss Bright Moon, aren’t you worried about Kang Qingzhi cheating?”","“I’m not worried.”","Twilight’s smile grew wider. “You’re so confident?”","Qiao Xi said, “If I don’t even have this bit of confidence, why would I participate in the competition?”","Kang Qingzhi was now a cornered dog. In order to protect her reputation, she would definitely think of ways to win the championship. Anyway, her reputation was already like this. So what if she bribed the judges and suppressed her opponent?","However, the perfume recipes Kang Qingzhi used were left behind by her five years ago. Kang Qingzhi would definitely be worried that Qiao Xi had surpassed now that five years had passed, so she had to be prepared and unscrupulous to win the championship.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and looked at the man in front of her. “When you first came into contact with perfumes, you probably encountered people who were jealous and framed you. How did you deal with them?”","Twilight did not answer immediately. He stared at the girl in front of him with light brown eyes and said casually, “I became famous as soon as I entered the perfume world and was invited to be a judge in the perfume competition, so I’ve never encountered such a thing. Actually, it’s a pity for you to be a participant. You should sit on the judge’s seat.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. This man clearly knew her identity, yet he still said it so vaguely. He was probably afraid of exposing that he was Gu Zheng!","She smiled slyly. “It’s so boring to be a judge! I like the feeling of competing in competitions. Moreover, I believe that Mr. Twilight is the fairest judge. If I encounter trouble, you’ll definitely help me!”","Twilight looked at the cute girl with eyes full of affection and tenderness. He turned his face away unnaturally and did not dare to look at her. His voice was hoarse. “As long as you need me, of course, I won’t refuse.”"]},{"number":1530,"title":"Chapter 1530 No One Will Think You’re Mute If You Don’t Speak","paragraphs":["1530 No One Will Think You’re Mute If You Don’t Speak","Qiao Xi smiled in satisfaction. When she reached the entrance of the venue, she bumped into Gu Yao, Yang Xu, and the others.","Gu Yao immediately leaned forward and shouted excitedly, “Qiao Xi, the video was recorded well, right?!”","Yang Xu was also extremely excited. “Sister-in-law, we helped you deal with that b*tch. The entire internet is scolding her now!”","Qiao Xi had not looked at her cell phone the entire time, but from the disdainful gazes of everyone at the event location, she could tell that this incident had a huge impact on the internet.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi revealed a meaningful smile. Seeing her like this, Gu Yao had a bad feeling. The next second, he heard her ask slowly, “Gu Yao, actually, you should thank Mr. Twilight for successfully attacking the Kang family this time. You must’ve seen him before, right?”","Gu Yao: “...”","His gaze changed, and his originally excited expression froze. He had promised Gu Zheng to hide it from Qiao Xi, but why did Qiao Xi mention Twilight in front of him? Was she testing him?","The naive Second Young Master Gu was flustered and guilty. He did not dare to speak for a long time.","Yang Xu broke the silence first. “Of course, we’ve met him. The banquet hall beside us was given to us by Mr. Twilight. We should indeed thank him!”","Gu Yao said, “Yes! We should thank him!”","Qiao Xi stared at Gu Yao and could not control the smile on the corners of her mouth.","Gu Yao lowered his head and did not dare to meet Qiao Xi’s gaze. He kept begging Qiao Xi not to ask anymore. With his IQ, he would definitely be exposed!","However, the next second...","Yang Xu said generously, “Mr. Twilight even chatted with Ah Yao alone! Moreover, I keep having the feeling that Mr. Twilight and Ah Yao’s brother look alike!”","Gu Yao: “!!!” No one would think that he was mute if he did not say anything!","“Oh? He looks like Gu Zheng?” Qiao Xi’s tone carried a trace of ridicule.","When Gu Yao heard Qiao Xi’s voice, he felt his heart almost jump out of his chest. His voice trembled. “We... We just chatted for a while. We talked about the matter of renting the banquet hall...”","Damn! Qiao Xi’s tone must be filled with doubt. If Qiao Xi really found out, would Gu Zheng think that he was the one who exposed him?! But he did not say anything!","Just as Gu Yao was feeling flustered, Qiao Xi chuckled. “Thank you for today! Hurry up and go home. I’ll treat you to a meal another day.”","No matter how stupid Yang Xu was, he could sense that Gu Yao was nervous. Was Ah Yao so afraid of his sister-in-law? However, his sister-in-law looked very good when she smiled and spoke very gently!","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Yao nodded like a chick pecking on rice. “Alright! I’m a little tired too. We’ll go back and rest. Um... Let’s meet another day!”","Yang Xu was still confused when he was pulled away by Gu Yao.","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Yao, who was escaping crazily, and smiled like a fox.","She knew that Gu Zheng would not expose himself, but Gu Yao’s expression had already betrayed him. It was just that Qiao Xi really did not understand why Gu Zheng had to hide it from her.","After returning to Longwan Residential, Qiao Xi had just walked to the door when Xiao Lan hurriedly ran over and said excitedly, “Young Madam, I saw the news online. Everyone is scolding Kang Qingzhi. How satisfying!”","Uncle Sheng also smiled and echoed, “That’s right! Young Madam has finally recovered her innocence. It’s worth celebrating!”","With that, Uncle Sheng handed Qiao Xi an invitation. Qiao Xi lowered her head to take a look. “An invitation from Grandma?”","Uncle Sheng nodded. “Yes, the Gu family’s company is being managed by Young Master Gu Yao now. Chairman Gu doesn’t have any real power either. He’s just in the Gu family by name. However, there have always been rumors in Li City that Young Master Gu Yao isn’t a descendant of the Gu family and doesn’t have the right to manage the Gu family’s company. Although these rumors don’t affect Young Master Gu Yao much, Old Madam Gu has been thinking about holding a banquet.”","“Hold a banquet to confirm Gu Yao’s identity?” Qiao Xi asked.","Uncle Sheng cleared his throat and said, “It’s to get Chairman Gu to hand over the shares and announce the ownership of the inheritance.”","This way, no one would say anything.","Qiao Xi: “...”","Old Madam Gu knew very well that Gu Yao was not a descendant of the Gu family. This matter could not be hidden, so there was no need to hide it. However, so what if he was not a child of the Gu family? With parents like Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan, he was lucky to not be a descendant of the Gu family!","Gu Yao had grown up by Old Madam Gu’s side. Old Madam Gu had long treated him as her biological grandson. Moreover, her two grandsons were both capable and their relationship was so good. If the brothers joined forces, they would definitely be able to manage the Gu family’s assets."]},{"number":1531,"title":"Chapter 1531 Bad News","paragraphs":["1531 Bad News","At this banquet, Old Madam Gu wanted to tell everyone that Gu Yao had her and Gu Zheng behind him. If anyone dared to question Gu Yao’s identity, they would be going against her and Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi took the invitation and called Old Madam Gu.","When Qiao Xi was about to sleep, Gu Zheng had not returned home. When she woke up the next day, Qiao Xi realized that her side was also cold. There were no traces of him sleeping there.","After washing up, she went downstairs and found Gu Zheng sitting on the sofa. He was staring at the document in his hand with a serious expression. He slammed the document on the coffee table. “Remake it.”","!!","Song Shijing did not even dare to breathe loudly. Yesterday, there was a problem with Gu Corporation’s project. All the higher-ups had an emergency meeting that ended at six in the morning. Moreover, they had to face even more troublesome problems today. The employees could sense the coldness around the president. Everyone was careful, afraid that they would anger him.","On the way back, the president slept for a while. After entering, Song Shijing could still feel the low pressure on the president, making him jump.","Just as he was on the brink of tears, footsteps came from behind.","Song Shijing looked up in surprise. The moment he saw Qiao Xi, it was as if he had seen his savior. Her body was glowing with golden light.","Young Madam! Young Madam had finally appeared!","No matter how angry and frustrated the president was, as long as Young Madam appeared, he would definitely become gentle.","Qiao Xi: “???”","Was there something on her face? Why was Song Shijing looking at her like that?","Gu Zheng also saw her. The low pressure on his body instantly dissipated, and his tightly furrowed brows relaxed. His voice was extremely gentle. “Xi Xi, have you received Grandma’s invitation?”","“Yes, I’ve already told Grandma that I’ll be there on time. The banquet this time should be very large, right?” Qiao Xi went downstairs and sat beside Gu Zheng, lazily leaning on his shoulder.","Gu Zheng reached out his arm and hugged her gently. His slightly cold thin lips kissed her forehead as he said softly, “The noble families of Li City have all been invited, but not the Kang family.”","The things the Kang family had done in Li City these past few days had already spread online, but Old Madam Gu only woke up for a short period of time every day. The people around her probably would not talk about these things in her ears, so Qiao Xi was a little surprised that Old Madam Gu did not invite the Kang family.","However, even if Old Madam Gu really invited them, Gu Yao would probably stop her.","Gu Zheng’s vision was a little blurry, and he could not help but frown. Song Shijing said quickly, “President, it’s still early. You can sleep for a while.”","Gu Zheng ignored him and lowered his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. “Aren’t you curious about what I’ve been busy with recently?”","“If you want to tell me, then tell me. If you don’t want to, I won’t force you.”","Gu Zheng suddenly smiled, and his chest trembled slightly. He pinched Qiao Xi’s face and said in an extremely gentle voice, “Xi Xi, there are some things I can’t tell you yet. You’ll know after this matter is over.”","With that, Gu Zheng went upstairs to rest. Qiao Xi logged into Black Tide’s account and investigated Gu Corporation, but she found nothing. She looked at Song Shijing.","Song Shijing took a few steps back and looked helpless. “Young Madam, don’t make things difficult for me. I really can’t say anything.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. It was fine if they did not want to say it. She did not have to know. She was just a little curious about what could make Gu Zheng so vigilant and not even come back for the entire night. Who had the ability to make Gu Zheng nervous?","Speaking of which, Huo Yuzhou had recently come to Li City. However, with Huo Yuzhou’s character and ability, he probably would not play dirty tricks, right?","For the entire day, Qiao Xi was not interested in doing anything. Her mind was filled with thoughts about Gu Corporation.","In the study.","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and wrote down a perfume recipe. After Gu Zheng woke up, he dealt with official matters in the study with a frown.","After a while, Song Shijing rushed in with a gloomy expression. “President, something happened.”","“What’s wrong?” Gu Zheng looked up slightly and pursed his thin lips.","Song Shijing said quickly, “Half an hour ago, the old madam got into a car accident—”","Gu Zheng’s expression instantly turned cold, and Qiao Xi’s heart trembled.","Before Song Shijing could finish, Gu Zheng stood up abruptly. He was a little flustered and said with a pale face, “To the hospital.”","“Old Madam is in Mr. Ye’s hospital, but she’s not injured,” Song Shijing added. His expression was a little strange, and he hesitated.","Qiao Xi had never seen Gu Zheng so flustered. Fortunately, Old Madam Gu was fine.","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks in a panic and looked at Song Shijing. “Get straight to the point.”"]},{"number":1532,"title":"Chapter 1532 No Matter How You Look At It, She Had Ulterior Motives","paragraphs":["1532 No Matter How You Look At It, She Had Ulterior Motives","Song Shijing subconsciously glanced at Qiao Xi, then at Gu Zheng. He braced himself and said, “Old Madam Gu wasn’t injured because someone pushed her away in a car accident, but that person is seriously injured and is still in the hospital.”","Qiao Xi thought that since that person was injured in order to save Old Madam Gu, they should visit them and compensate them. Why did Song Shijing have such an expression?","Gu Zheng knew Song Shijing well and had a guess.","The next second, Song Shijing frowned and said with a complicated expression, “But it was Kang Qingzhi who saved Old Madam Gu.”","Qiao Xi was instantly enlightened. She was still thinking about what method Kang Qingzhi would use to make a comeback. After all, the video online was enough to explain everything. Moreover, the evidence provided by the perfume competition also caused Kang Qingzhi to be overwrought. At this moment, perhaps only a donation could help Kang Qingzhi salvage some of her reputation. However, the Kang family’s wealth was not as deep as the He family’s. They had already lost billions, so they were definitely unwilling to donate.","Hence, after thinking about it, Kang Qingzhi came up with a good idea—taking advantage of others!","Qiao Xi had just taken down Kang Qingzhi, but right on the heels of that, Kang Qingzhi was sent to the emergency room because she saved Grandma Gu. Was there really such a coincidence?","Grandma Gu was extremely important to Gu Zheng. Now that Kang Qingzhi had saved Grandma Gu, on the account that she had saved her life, Gu Zheng should help Kang Qingzhi repay this kindness.","This was Kang Qingzhi’s plan to save herself. Qiao Xi had to admit that she was a little smart!","“Kang Qingzhi?” Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold.","Song Shijing said, “Yes, Old Madam Gu has been in a good state recently, so I asked the chauffeur and Aunt Fang to bring her to the square to relax. Unexpectedly, as soon as Old Madam Gu got out of the car, a car nearly crashed into her. Old Madam Gu couldn’t move fast enough and couldn’t dodge in time. Kang Qingzhi rushed out from the side and pushed her away. She’s seriously injured.","“At that time, Old Madam Ye immediately sent a chauffeur to send Kang Qingzhi to Mr. Ye’s hospital. As there were many people in the square, the onlookers took photos and posted them online. Everyone also recognized that the person who saved her was Kang Qingzhi.”","Gu Zheng nodded, put on his jacket, and walked out.","Song Shijing glanced at Qiao Xi tentatively. If Old Madam Gu asked the president to repay Kang Qingzhi for saving her life, Young Madam would definitely be unhappy!","It was rare for the old madam to go out, but she happened to encounter a car accident. The person who saved her was Kang Qingzhi. No matter how one looked at it, she definitely had ulterior motives!","...","In the hospital.","The Kang family rushed to the hospital. Aunt Fang bowed slightly to them. “I’m sorry, but Miss Kang is still in the emergency room...”","Kang Ru was mentally and physically exhausted. Before the company’s matter was resolved, Qingzhi was injured because she saved someone. He was extremely annoyed, but his heart ached more.","In the past two days, Qingzhi had already been scolded, but she was still so kind-hearted and saved others without hesitation.","Kang Jichuan stared at the emergency room with a gloomy expression. After knowing that Qingzhi had been hit by a car, he and his father rushed to the hospital but did not tell Old Madam Kang. They were afraid that she would come to the hospital and cause a scene.","Qingzhi was injured, so the other party would definitely compensate her. However, if Grandma caused too much trouble, it would be annoying. At that time, Qingzhi would have suffered in vain.","If Qingzhi had saved a big shot from Li City this time, she might be able to use this matter to make a comeback. Even if it was just an ordinary person, she could let everyone know that she was a kind-hearted woman and take the opportunity to clear her name.","“Young Master Kang?” Aunt Fang called out softly, interrupting Kang Jichuan’s thoughts.","Kang Jichuan nodded slightly.","“I’m the old madam’s personal servant. Young Master Kang, you can just call me Aunt Fang. Don’t worry, Young Master Kang. Miss Kang’s life isn’t in danger. Our Gu family will also do our best to pay for Miss Kang’s medical expenses until she recovers completely.”","Kang Jichuan nodded and widened his eyes.","The Gu family? Old Madam Gu?","Could it be that the old madam Qingzhi saved was... Gu Zheng’s grandma?","Before he could recover from his shock, the lights in the emergency room were switched off. A doctor walked out. “Who’s the patient’s family member?”","“I’m her father.” Kang Ru took a step forward.","“The patient has many abrasions on her body. Her right hand is fractured, and there are two wounds on her leg. She also has a slight concussion and needs to be hospitalized for observation. The family needs to sign this document.”","After Kang Ru signed the document, Kang Qingzhi was pushed to a high-class ward arranged by the Gu family by the nurses. She quickly woke up.","When Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi arrived at the ward, the first thing they saw was Old Madam Gu sitting by Kang Qingzhi’s bed, her eyes filled with gratitude."]},{"number":1533,"title":"Chapter 1533 Her Eyes Are Filled With Scheming","paragraphs":["1533 Her Eyes Are Filled With Scheming","In Old Madam Gu’s eyes, Kang Qingzhi was a kind and brave girl. She did not know about the grudge between Kang Qingzhi and Qiao Xi at all. This girl was injured in order to save her, so of course, she had to visit her.","“Miss Kang, you’re from Country Y!” Old Madam Gu’s tone was gentle. “I’ve long heard of Mr. Kang Ru and Young Master Kang Jichuan. I didn’t expect to meet your family under such circumstances.”","Kang Ru had a noble status and liked to be admired by others. Now that he heard Old Madam Gu say this, his face was filled with smiles. “Perhaps our Kang family is fated with you, Old Madam Gu.”","“Mr. Kang, you’re really blessed to have nurtured such an outstanding daughter like Miss Kang!” Old Madam Gu praised, but there was a trace of alienation in her eyes. After Kang Qingzhi woke up, she had been by the bed. This young lady looked weak and innocent, but there was a trace of scheming in her eyes from time to time.","!!","Old Madam Gu had been in charge of the Gu family her entire life and had seen many schemes and plots. Naturally, she would not make a mistake.","Although Old Madam Gu did not like this young lady, she was the one who saved her. Old Madam Gu pretended not to know anything and said with a loving expression, “Miss Kang, the Gu family is holding a banquet in two days. If you’ve recovered by then, how about you be a guest in the Gu family?”","Old Madam Gu felt a little afraid when she thought back to the dangerous scene today. If Kang Qingzhi had not rushed out, she would probably have died here. Hence, she was sincerely grateful to Kang Qingzhi.","A trace of success flashed past Kang Qingzhi’s eyes. She could not suppress the joy on her face. Just as she was about to speak, Aunt Fang’s excited voice came from the door. “Old Madam! Young Master and Young Madam are here.”","Qiao Xi, who was at the door, raised her eyebrows and looked at Kang Qingzhi. Her cold gaze instantly saw through her.","Kang Qingzhi’s expression froze slightly, then she lowered her head. Her thin body trembled as she said in horror, “Forget it, Grandma Gu. I... I won’t go.”","Old Madam Gu was a little surprised. “I’ve asked the doctor. The wounds on your body aren’t deep, but you can’t exert force on your wrist for the time being. It’s not a problem for you to attend the banquet. Your injuries will recover in three days. Can’t you come to the Gu family’s residence?”","“I-I...” Kang Qingzhi buried her head in her chest like an ostrich. Tears dripped onto her hospital gown, and her voice trembled. “It’s not because of my injuries, Grandma Gu. I saved you because of my subconscious reaction. Even if you weren’t the one in danger at that time, I would have helped you. I’m not using this incident to threaten you to repay me.”","Old Madam Gu was a little puzzled. “Why are you saying such things? Stop crying.”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face grew wider and wider. Kang Qingzhi was really a good actress. She cried in front of Grandma Gu the moment she saw her because she wanted Grandma Gu to misunderstand her.","Before Kang Qingzhi could speak, Kang Jichuan subconsciously turned around and saw the person standing at the door. He frowned and said in a distant tone, “Xi Xi?”","When Kang Ru heard this name, he hurriedly turned around with a trace of shock in his eyes. He quickly lowered his eyes and said angrily, “Xi Xi, what are you doing here?”","Old Madam Gu looked at Qiao Xi, who was at the door, then at Kang Qingzhi. She sensed that their relationship was not good.","Qiao Xi nodded slightly at the two of them. “Mr. Kang, Young Master Kang, what a coincidence that we’re meeting here.”","Kang Ru said with a displeased expression, “Xi Xi, you shouldn’t be appearing in front of Qingzhi at this time. She’s seriously injured now and can’t be agitated—”","Before he could finish, Kang Qingzhi coughed as if she was going to faint the next second.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Mr. Kang, that’s funny. I didn’t come here to see Kang Qingzhi. Does my visit to my grandma affect you?”","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and glanced coldly at the Kang family. Then, he said slowly, “We came to the hospital today to visit Grandma and see the person who saved her. However, if Mr. Kang doesn’t welcome us, we can leave immediately. However, this hospital isn’t run by Mr. Kang. You don’t seem to have the right to chase us away.”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Kang Ru’s expression froze.","“Dad, Old Madam Gu is Mr. Gu’s grandmother. Xi Xi and Mr. Gu are here to visit Old Madam Gu,” Kang Qingzhi explained softly, but her voice trembled slightly. She squeezed out a weak smile at Old Madam Gu. “Grandma Gu, I’m really sorry. Dad said those words because he’s worried about me.”","Kang Ru looked embarrassed and cleared her throat. “Xi Xi, you should know that Qingzhi almost lost her life to save Old Madam Gu. On the account of Old Madam Gu, don’t make things difficult for Qingzhi.”"]},{"number":1534,"title":"Chapter 1534 Retreat To Advance","paragraphs":["1534 Retreat To Advance","“Xi Xi, Old Madam Gu said that the Gu family is holding a banquet in a few days and even invited Qingzhi to attend. Qingzhi originally wanted to go, but she probably saw you and was afraid that you would be unhappy, so she rejected,” Kang Jichuan said with a frown.","When Old Madam Gu heard this, she naturally understood.","She could naturally tell how much Ah Zheng doted on Xi Xi. Moreover, she knew Xi Xi well. If Miss Kang had not done something to anger her, she would not have gone against the Kang family.","Before Old Madam Gu could think it through, Kang Qingzhi said with tears in her eyes, “Brother, I didn’t reject Grandma Gu because of Xi Xi. I’m not feeling well, so it’s not convenient for me to attend the banquet. Moreover, many of Sister Xi Xi’s friends will definitely attend the Gu family’s banquet. They definitely won’t want to see me.”","Aunt Fang’s eyes were filled with anxiety. She knew that the old madam doted on her granddaughter-in-law very much, but Miss Kang was the old madam’s savior. The old madam would definitely be in a difficult position if she was sandwiched in the middle.","Kang Jichuan’s heart ached when he saw his precious sister cry. He looked at Qiao Xi helplessly.","He knew that she had been wronged, but Qingzhi had already lost all her dignity and was even scolded by the netizens. The Kang family also lost a lot of money because of her nonsense. Now that Qingzhi only wanted to attend the Gu family’s banquet, would Qiao Xi really not agree?","Xi Xi had yet to officially return to the Kang family, yet she was already so intolerant of Qingzhi. If she really returned to the Kang family one day, would Qingzhi still be able to live?","Kang Jichuan was in a very conflicted mood. Before he could speak, the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. Her voice was sweet and soft with a trace of surprise. “Miss Kang saved Grandma. Why would I make things difficult for her?! I’m not such a petty person!”","Kang Ru’s expression was tense. He naturally did not believe her.","Qiao Xi sighed lightly when she saw this. “Since Young Master Kang and Mr. Kang don’t welcome me, then I’ll leave to avoid being disliked here.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and left the ward. Gu Zheng’s expression turned cold as he said softly to Old Madam Gu, “Grandma, Xi Xi and I will go to your ward first.”","Gu Zheng had just turned around when Old Madam Gu hurriedly stood up.","Kang Qingzhi’s face was ashen as she stared fixedly at Qiao Xi’s back. Why didn’t this woman cause a scene when she saw her becoming Old Madam Gu’s savior?","Qiao Xi took the initiative to leave the ward! This would make it seem like the Kang family was making things difficult for Old Madam Gu’s granddaughter-in-law!","Aunt Fang looked at the scene in a daze and frowned. Young Madam was clearly here to visit Old Madam Gu. What right did the Kang family have to chase Young Madam away? Even if Miss Kang was Old Madam Gu’s savior, she could not offend Young Madam like this!","Seeing the old madam stand up, Aunt Fang hurriedly supported her and reminded her softly, “Old Madam, let’s go. Young Master and Young Madam are waiting outside!”","Kang Qingzhi’s heart felt like it was stuffed with a huge rock, and she could not breathe.","She was deliberately pretending to be pitiful in front of the old madam to gain sympathy. Unexpectedly, not only was Qiao Xi not angry, but she even took a step back and caught her off guard.","If Old Madam Gu left just like this, she would not have the chance to attend the Gu family’s banquet. After all, she had already rejected it just now.","At this moment, Kang Ru saw that the situation was not looking good and hurriedly asked Qiao Xi to stay. “Xi Xi, you’ve misunderstood. How could we not welcome you?”","Old Madam Gu stopped in her tracks and turned slightly to say to Kang Ru, “Miss Kang was injured to save me. The Gu family will bear all the treatment costs. Miss Kang is my savior, but Xi Xi is my granddaughter-in-law. She’ll definitely attend the Gu family’s banquet. If Miss Kang doesn’t want to see Xi Xi, then pretend I didn’t say anything about the invitation just now. Miss Kang doesn’t have to worry about it.”","Kang Qingzhi’s face instantly turned pale. Of course, she wanted to go to the Gu family’s banquet. She just wanted Matriarch Gu to think that she was unwilling to go because Qiao Xi was making things difficult for her!","Old Madam Gu’s words had effectively blocked Kang Qingzhi’s plan. How was she going to attend the banquet now?","“Grandma.” Qiao Xi stood outside the ward and said softly, “Miss Kang is your savior, after all. We naturally have to invite her to the banquet, lest Miss Kang regrets it and blames me for not being able to attend. At most, I won’t go. I’m Gu Yao’s sister-in-law, so he won’t care whether I go or not.”","Qiao Xi’s voice was cold as she said slowly, “Miss Kang, you don’t have to care about me. You can go if you want. I don’t think you’re blackmailing me. After all, you saved Grandma. I’m sincerely grateful to you. I believe you saved Grandma from the bottom of your heart.”"]},{"number":1535,"title":"Chapter 1535 A Life-Saving Grace Should Be Returned","paragraphs":["1535 A Life-Saving Grace Should Be Returned","Kang Qingzhi abruptly looked up and met Qiao Xi’s cold eyes. Qiao Xi’s tone was clearly very kind, but Kang Qingzhi could still see a sense of warning in her eyes.","If this car accident was planned by her, then Qiao Xi would definitely not let her off!","Kang Qingzhi’s already pale face was even paler now. If she continued to remain silent, she would really not have a chance. She had to take the opportunity to curry favor with Old Madam Gu and occupy an important position in the Gu family.","She knew very well that Gu Zheng was the king of Li City. If she could become Old Madam Gu’s benefactor, Gu Zheng would naturally help her. It was reasonable for her to interact with Gu Zheng in the future.","A life-saving grace should be repaid. She could not let Qiao Xi ruin her plan!","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes turned slightly red, and her face was filled with a flattering smile. “Sister Xi Xi, it’s not that I hate you, but there’s a misunderstanding between us. I thought that you wouldn’t want to see me, so I rejected Old Madam Gu’s invitation. I won’t ask you to forgive me. As long as I can attend the banquet with Sister Xi Xi and make Grandma Gu happy, I’ll be satisfied.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart.","Fortunately, Grandma Gu liked her and was a clear-headed person. Otherwise, after hearing Kang Qingzhi’s words, Grandma Gu would definitely think that she had bullied Kang Qingzhi and deliberately made things difficult for Grandma Gu’s savior.","This was Kang Qingzhi’s usual method. When she wanted to deal with someone, she would intentionally or unintentionally approach all their relatives and friends to drive a wedge between them.","However, Grandma Gu would not fall for it easily. Qiao Xi was sure that Grandma Gu had long known that Kang Qingzhi was not a kind person. It was just that Kang Qingzhi had saved her life, so she took the initiative to invite her to the banquet.","At this moment, Gu Zheng stood at the door of the ward and said slowly, “Since you’re so considerate and your injuries haven’t recovered, it’s better if you don’t go. After all, there’ll be many people at the banquet. If your injuries relapse, it’ll be our fault.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing went forward immediately and said calmly, “Miss Kang, you’re Old Madam Gu’s savior. You’ll be a guest of the Gu family in the future. Do you have any requests?”","Kang Qingzhi: “...”","She gritted her teeth and was so angry that she could not say anything. She had already said that she wanted to go, so why was Gu Zheng stopping her with just a few words?","She heard that the Gu family had invited all the noble families in Li City to this banquet. When the time came, she would attend as Old Madam Gu’s savior. The entire Li City would know about her relationship with the Gu family. She got so seriously injured this time. She could not waste her effort in the end!","Gu Zheng definitely knew what she was thinking, but because Qiao Xi hated her, he did not let her attend the banquet. How could they treat Old Madam Gu’s savior like this?","Kang Qingzhi was so angry that she wanted to jump up from the bed, but Gu Zheng did not even bother to look at her. He looked at Old Madam Gu. “Grandma.”","“Yes, I’ve also received a shock. I should go back and rest. Miss Kang, I’ll visit you when I have time.” As she spoke, Old Madam Gu slowly walked out of the ward with Aunt Fang’s help.","Kang Qingzhi widened her eyes as she watched Old Madam Gu leave the ward heartlessly.","She had risked her life to save this old woman! The old madam should be grateful and treat her as the most respected guest in the Gu family, but the old madam was also letting Qiao Xi fool around. Why did they dote on Qiao Xi so much?","Only the three people from the Kang family were left in the ward. Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were instantly filled with tears. She looked at Kang Jichuan aggrievedly and choked out the words, “Brother, do they... hate me very much?”","Kang Jichuan seemed to be thinking about something. When he heard Kang Qingzhi’s words, he came back to his senses. His eyes were filled with heartache as he comforted her softly. “No, it’s just that Xi Xi...”","She had really changed. Five years ago, Xi Xi also hated Qingzhi, but she would always quarrel with Qingzhi. She would not scheme against Qingzhi like now.","On the surface, it seemed that Xi Xi was not attending the banquet to fulfill Qingzhi’s wish, but she was actually trying to sow discord between Qingzhi and Old Madam Gu.","Qingzhi had risked her life to save the old madam, but Xi Xi was not grateful at all. She actually schemed against Qingzhi like this. Was this how they treated their savior?","A trace of anger surged in Kang Jichuan’s heart. He said firmly, “Qingzhi, don’t worry. I’ll help you seek justice. You’re Old Madam Gu’s savior. No matter what misunderstanding there was before, Xi Xi shouldn’t have done this to you!”"]},{"number":1536,"title":"Chapter 1536 She’s Willing To Bet On Her Life","paragraphs":["1536 She’s Willing To Bet On Her Life","Kang Jichuan said gently, “Qingzhi, don’t be sad. Take good care of your body. If Old Madam Gu doesn’t want you to attend the banquet, then don’t go.”","Anger surged in Kang Qingzhi’s heart.","Why should she not go? She had to go!","However, in front of Kang Jichuan, she could not expose her true thoughts. After the Kang father and son left, she could not suppress the anger in her heart and slammed the cup beside her onto the floor.","“B*tch! B*tch!” Kang Qingzhi roared in a low voice. her eyes were bloodshot as she gritted her teeth. “She should have died a long time ago. Five years ago, I let her dodge the bullet. Now, she’s in front of me, disgusting me again!”","It was because of Qiao Xi that she was obstructed in all aspects. Originally, she could rely on saving Old Madam Gu to become the Gu family’s most respected guest. However, after Qiao Xi interfered, Old Madam Gu left just like that!","She really did not understand why Gu Zheng liked her and why so many noble families were protecting her. Even Old Madam Gu thought so highly of her!","In a high-end ward not far away...","“Old Madam, Miss Kang seems to have broken a glass,” Aunt Fang said in a low voice. She subconsciously glanced at the old madam’s expression, then probed, “Old Madam, forgive me for being blunt, but although Miss Kang looks gentle and polite on the surface, in reality...”","“Tell me.” Old Madam Gu lay on the bed with her eyes closed.","Aunt Fang continued, “Miss Kang is actually not a kind person. I keep having the feeling that she’s very scheming. Maybe she really approached you just so you would have to repay her.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Old Madam Gu did not respond for a long time. Aunt Fang thought that Old Madam Gu did not like her saying that about Miss Kang. Aunt Fang also thought that she had misunderstood Miss Kang.","At that time, when she saw that the car was about to hit the old madam, Miss Kang rushed over and pushed the old madam away. If she had not controlled herself well, this car accident would’ve taken Miss Kang’s life. Could it be that she was really willing to bet her life on it?","“You think so too.”","Just as Aunt Fang was starting to blame herself, Old Madam Gu suddenly spoke and slowly opened her eyes. Her eyes were clear. She remembered that after Kang Qingzhi saved her and was knocked down by the car, the corners of her mouth revealed a victorious smile.","As the situation was urgent, Kang Qingzhi had many wounds on her body. Old Madam Gu did not have time to think and hurriedly instructed the chauffeur to send her to the hospital. Under such circumstances, she would not doubt her savior.","Moreover, the moment Kang Qingzhi pushed her away and was hit by the car alone, her heart was filled with gratitude and heartache. She decided to treat this girl as her biological granddaughter. Originally, she could have pretended not to have seen Kang Qingzhi’s victorious smile, but when Xi Xi came to the ward, she heard Kang Qingzhi’s words and saw the trace of scheming in her eyes.","At this moment, Aunt Fang muttered, “What’s the relationship between Miss Kang and Young Madam?”","The next second, Gu Zheng suddenly pushed the door open and said coldly, “Kang Qingzhi is the adopted daughter of the Kang family.”","Old Madam Gu could see the disgust in his eyes at the mention of the Kang family.","“Kang Ru came to Li City this time to look for his long-lost biological daughter, Xi Xi,” Gu Zheng continued.","“Xi Xi is the daughter of the Kang family?” Matriarch Gu was surprised.","Gu Zheng nodded and said casually, “Xi Xi is the real daughter of the Kang family, but because of Kang Qingzhi’s interference, Xi Xi’s relationship with the Kang father and son is getting worse. Moreover, the Kang family hasn’t admitted Xi Xi’s identity in public yet.","The moment that was said, Old Madam Gu regretted it. She should not have been so polite to the Kang family in front of Xi Xi just now. Xi Xi would probably be sad.","She could also tell that although Kang Qingzhi looked weak and was just an adopted daughter, the Kang father and son were very obedient to her. That was why they thought that Xi Xi was deliberately making things difficult for her based on her one-sided story.","Gu Zheng said, “Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi stole Xi Xi’s perfume recipes and used Xi Xi’s work to participate in the perfume competition. She’s a two-time champion. After that, she bit back and said that Xi Xi stole her perfume recipes.”","“She actually treated Xi Xi like this!” Old Madam Gu suddenly sat up on the bed, her eyes filled with anger.","Gu Zheng’s voice was filled with mockery. “The funny thing is that the Kang family believed her.”","Old Madam Kang and Aunt Fang instantly choked. Of course, they believed Gu Zheng’s words. If he could find out what Kang Qingzhi had done, then with the Kang family’s power, they could naturally find out too. However, they blindly believed in their family’s adopted daughter and were unwilling to investigate.","Aunt Fang’s face was filled with disbelief. That seemingly weak and kind Miss Kang was actually such a person?"]},{"number":1537,"title":"Chapter 1537 Widowed If You Don’t Divorce","paragraphs":["1537 Widowed If You Don’t Divorce","“Also...”","Gu Zheng’s voice was calm, but Old Madam Gu raised her voice and asked, “What else is there?”","“Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi was seriously ill and couldn’t be treated. In order to survive, she took the blood from Xi Xi’s body and used hypnosis to erase Xi Xi’s memories. Recently, Xi Xi has recovered a portion of her memories. She remembers that she was forced down the cliff by Kang Jichuan and jumped into the sea.”","These words smashed heavily into Old Madam Gu’s heart. She felt her heart bleed. “Kang Qingzhi actually dared to...”","!!","Previously, Old Madam Gu was grateful to Kang Qingzhi for saving her life, so she had always called her Miss Kang. However, she gritted her teeth and said her full name now.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and said softly, “Grandma, Xi Xi didn’t want me to say anything at first, but I was afraid that you would hurt Xi Xi’s heart because of Kang Qingzhi, so I decided to tell you.”","At this moment, Old Madam Gu understood everything. Whether Kang Qingzhi really wanted to save her or not, as long as she treated Kang Qingzhi a little better, it would be like cutting Xi Xi’s heart with a knife.","Aunt Fang could not help but take a deep breath. Not only did Kang Qingzhi snatch away the young madam’s identity, but she also took her blood and her perfume recipes. After that, she even provoked the young madam to her face. Now, she actually wanted to interfere with the young madam’s family and snatch them away.","If Old Madam Gu and the Kang family were really deceived by Kang Qingzhi, what would it be like? Young Madam would probably be very sad!","How could she bear to see her enemy snatch away her family and identity?","“Grandma, Xi Xi doesn’t want to influence your decision. She won’t object if you treat Kang Qingzhi well, but I won’t allow this to happen.” Gu Zheng looked at Old Madam Gu with a burning gaze, his voice extremely serious.","Old Madam Gu looked at her grandson in front of her, and many memories of the past flashed through her mind. Ah Zheng had already experienced all kinds of pain at a young age, which was why his character was so cold. She even thought that Ah Zheng would die alone.","However, later on, he actually married Qiao Xi in a flash.","Old Madam Gu knew that this grandson of hers was stubborn. If he set his mind on someone, it would be for the rest of his life. Hence, she also doted on Xi Xi as if she were her granddaughter. However, because of Ah Zheng’s miserable childhood, he was still cold and heartless. He was filled with vigilance.","When she found out that Xi Xi had used her blood to save Ah Zheng, she reprimanded him for the first time. In order to save Ah Zheng, this girl disregarded her life. She even suspected that Ah Zheng had married Xi Xi for her blood.","However, it was only now that she understood how ridiculously wrong she was. Ah Zheng’s tragic childhood made him unable to express his love. He had hidden all his love in his heart, and it could only be revealed bit by bit with time. He did not mention love at all, but his love for Xi Xi had fused into his bones and blood.","If one day Xi Xi passed away, Ah Zheng would definitely follow her.","He came over to say these words so solemnly to tell her that he would not let her suffer no matter what, even if the person who dealt the blow was his grandmother.","Old Madam Gu’s heart ached. She had almost become the person who made Xi Xi suffer. Xi Xi was unwilling to let her know about the past probably because she was afraid that she would be stuck in the middle. As for Ah Zheng...","She smiled in relief. “Ah Zheng, you’ve done very well. If Xi Xi isn’t willing to tell me, you should tell me.”","Gu Zheng’s eyebrows relaxed. “Grandma, I know you. After you find out the truth, you won’t let Xi Xi suffer.”","“Xi Xi is my granddaughter-in-law, so I naturally have to help her. She doesn’t want to tell me those things, which only means that she doesn’t know me well enough.” Old Madam Gu smiled affectionately.","“Thank you, Grandma. Why don’t you move to Longwan Residential? Xi Xi will have time to understand you then. Moreover, you probably don’t want to stay in the Gu family either.” Gu Zheng also chuckled.","Old Master Gu and Old Madam Gu had lived separately for many years. Their marriage had long been in name only. Gu Weiming was a disappointment, and this family was already in pieces. It was also torture for Old Madam Gu to stay with the Gu family.","Old Madam Gu said coldly, “Your grandfather is unwilling to get a divorce, but that’s necessary. He won’t live for long. If he’s unwilling to get a divorce, then I’ll be a widow. In short, he won’t be able to trap me.”","Aunt Fang: “...” Old Madam Gu was really harsh with her words!","Gu Zheng could not help but laugh. “You’re really a heroine, but I can’t let Xi Xi learn from you.”","Old Madam Gu glared at him, and the two of them looked at each other and smiled. Gu Zheng slowly stood up. “Xi Xi is still waiting outside. She’s worried that you’ll be unhappy. I have to go and reassure her.”","Old Madam Gu waved her hand and teased, “Go quickly. Now that you’ve gotten married, your heart is filled with your wife. An old woman like me has no spot in your heart anymore!”"]},{"number":1538,"title":"Chapter 1538 Gu Yao’s Intention","paragraphs":["1538 Gu Yao’s Intention","At this moment in the Kang family’s villa.","Kang Jichuan was thinking in the study when he called Qiao Xi. His tone was filled with blame. “Xi Xi, Qingzhi is Old Madam Gu’s savior. You shouldn’t sow discord between them.”","Qiao Xi’s phone rang, and she answered the call without looking at whose number it was. She frowned when she heard Kang Jichuan’s voice on the other end of the phone.","Kang Jichuan waited for a long time, but there was only silence on the other end of the phone, so he called out tentatively, “Xi Xi?”","Qiao Xi resisted the urge to curse and took a deep breath. “Mr. Kang, when did you see me sowing discord between them?”","Such a distant and indifferent tone made Kang Jichuan instantly annoyed. “Xi Xi, can you speak nicely? Qingzhi suffered such a serious injury in order to save Old Madam Gu. Now, she just wants to attend the Gu family’s banquet. Why are you stopping her? Old Madam Gu clearly took the initiative to invite Qingzhi to the banquet, but after you left, Old Madam Gu suddenly stopped Qingzhi from going. What exactly did you do?”","Qiao Xi: “???”","Grandma Gu did not allow Kang Qingzhi to attend the banquet? What did this have to do with her? What right did Kang Jichuan have to question her?","She silently rolled her eyes and said helplessly, “Am I to blame for Miss Kang not being able to attend the banquet?”","Kang Jichuan had been educated by nobles since he was young and almost never lost his temper. At this moment, he forcefully suppressed his anger and tried his best to calm down. “Qingzhi is the savior of the old madam. Logically speaking, the old madam definitely wouldn’t refuse to let her attend the banquet. Who else but you would—”","“Hold on!” Qiao Xi did not want to listen to his nonsense and asked the person beside her, “Song Shiyu, why did Old Madam Kang refuse to let Miss Kang attend the banquet?”","Song Shiyu, who was in a daze, heard this and his heart trembled. He thought for a moment and said, “It was Young Master Gu Yao’s idea. This banquet is being held for Young Master Gu Yao. If he doesn’t want to see someone, he naturally has the right to stop them from attending.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Did you hear that clearly? It’s Gu Yao’s idea, not mine.”","However, Kang Jichuan was sure that it was Qiao Xi’s idea and questioned, “You’re Gu Yao’s sister-in-law. Of course, he’ll listen to you. If it weren’t for you, would Gu Yao hate Qingzhi?”","Song Shiyu: “???”","Was this person crazy? Now, everyone in Li City’s high society knew that Kang Qingzhi framed Young Madam. Even if it were not for Young Madam, Young Master Gu Yao would not like such a person who played dirty tricks behind the backs of others!","Qiao Xi was not angry, and her expression remained indifferent. Kang Jichuan was even more anxious. He did not want Qingzhi to suffer, nor was he willing to see his biological sister, Qiao Xi, distance herself from him.","He gritted his teeth. “Xi Xi! You—”","Before he could finish, Kang Jichuan’s assistant ran in anxiously. “Young Master, Miss asked me to tell you...”","“Let’s talk later,” Kang Jichuan interrupted impatiently, but the assistant was stunned for a moment and hurriedly said, “The Gu family sent someone to send an invitation to Miss Gu for the banquet. Miss asked me to bring the invitation to you.”","Kang Jichuan was instantly stunned. He looked at the invitation in the assistant’s hand. The Gu family’s name was indeed written on it, and it was even stamped with Old Madam Gu’s seal.","Qingzhi could finally attend the Gu family’s banquet, but...","“Young Master Kang.” Qiao Xi’s cold voice came from the other end of the phone, interrupting Kang Jichuan’s thoughts. “You just said that I sowed discord between Grandma Gu and Kang Qingzhi and stopped Kang Qingzhi from attending the banquet. But now that Miss Kang has received an invitation from the Gu family, you should apologize to me, right?”","Kang Jichuan instantly choked and gasped. The words of apology were stuck in his throat, and he could not say anything. “Xi Xi, I... I still have something to do. I’ll talk to you when I have time.”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Young Master Kang, you’re a noble count, after all. Don’t be so rash. Don’t be fooled when others cry in front of you, making you go crazy and look for trouble with me. It’s fine if you don’t apologize this time, but I won’t let it slide so easily the next time.”","Kang Jichuan’s face instantly turned red. He hurriedly hung up and asked with a frown, “When did the Gu family send the invitation?”","The assistant replied, “It was just delivered. That person said that Young Master Gu Yao doesn’t want Miss to attend the banquet, but Miss is Old Madam Gu’s savior. Old Madam Gu has been insisting on inviting Miss to attend, so Young Master Gu Yao had no choice but to agree.”","Kang Jichuan pursed his lips and was silent for a long time. He sighed helplessly. “Let’s go see Qingzhi.”"]},{"number":1539,"title":"Chapter 1539 The Doubts In Her Heart Gradually Dissipated","paragraphs":["1539 The Doubts In Her Heart Gradually Dissipated","Kang Jichuan suddenly recalled Qiao Xi’s words. “Don’t be fooled when others cry in front of you, making you go crazy and look for trouble with me.”","The assistant did not know what Kang Jichuan was thinking. On the way, he said, “The Gu family’s banquet is for Young Master Gu Yao. It’s being held in the Gu family’s old residence. I heard that Mr. Gu Zheng has already cut ties with the Gu family. If it weren’t for Old Madam Gu, Mr. Gu Zheng wouldn’t be attending.”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes flickered when he heard this. Gu Zheng would probably not attend the Gu family’s banquet. Since he was not going, Xi Xi would definitely not go either. If Old Madam Gu really wanted to invite Qingzhi, Xi Xi could not stop her from attending the banquet.","However, Qingzhi said in front of him that...","Kang Jichuan had mixed feelings. He knocked on Kang Qingzhi’s bedroom door and walked in.","Kang Qingzhi was leaning against the window. When she saw him enter, she smiled sweetly. “Brother, you’re here. Grandma Gu sent someone to send me an invitation! Brother, actually, I really want to go to the Gu family’s banquet. Because of the perfume competition, everyone is scolding me. It doesn’t matter if I suffer some insults, but I don’t want to see the Kang family’s perfume business suffer because of me.”","Her eyes were red, and her voice was soft. “If Old Madam Gu values me, Gu Zheng will definitely help me. At that time, the Kang family’s losses will be lessened.”","The doubts in Kang Jichuan’s heart gradually dissipated with her explanation. Perhaps Qingzhi had her own selfish motives for getting close to Old Madam Kang, but she was just trying to reduce the Kang family’s losses!","He should not suspect Qingzhi. She was so kind and cute. She would not target Xi Xi. Moreover, she rarely went out. How could she know how to frame someone?","Seeing that Kang Jichuan did not respond for a long time, Kang Qingzhi noticed his abnormality and asked worriedly, “Brother, you don’t look too good. Is it because of the company’s matter or...”","She suddenly paused and looked at Kang Jichuan’s phone that he was holding tightly. Her round eyes instantly widened, and her voice trembled slightly. “Brother, did you call Sister Xi Xi?”","Before Kang Jichuan could come back to his senses, Kang Qingzhi said, “Sister Xi Xi really didn’t stop me from going to the banquet. You must have misunderstood her!”","Kang Jichuan’s heart was suffocating. His heart ached when Qingzhi came home and refused to eat, so he called to question Xi Xi, hoping that she could look for Old Madam Gu and let Qingzhi attend the banquet.","At that time, Qingzhi had even cried and said that Sister Xi Xi and Gu Yao were very close, so she thought that Xi Xi had said something in front of Gu Yao that caused her to be unable to attend the banquet. However, when Kang Jichuan thought about it carefully, Qingzhi did not say that Xi Xi was in the wrong. He had indeed misunderstood Qingzhi and wrongly blamed Xi Xi.","Before he came, Kang Jichuan was still full of doubts, but now, they had all dissipated. He looked at Kang Qingzhi gently. “Qingzhi, you’re still so obedient and sensible. Attending the Gu family’s banquet this time can indeed help the Kang family reduce their losses. It’s been a long time since you attended a banquet. Those gowns are already old. I’ll buy you new ones!”","“Alright! Brother, help me choose the most beautiful one!” Kang Qingzhi’s eyes curved as she smiled very cutely.","Ever since her car accident, she had sent people to spread the news that she had saved Old Madam Gu. Hence, Old Madam Gu had to invite her to the banquet. Otherwise, she would definitely be accused of being heartless.","At this moment, at Longwan Residential.","Only now did Qiao Xi understand why Grandma Gu suddenly sent Kang Qingzhi an invitation. It was because the car accident had been posted online. The other party was an online broadcaster and happened to have captured the scene of Kang Qingzhi saving the old madam without hesitation.","The video circulated online, and soon, everyone recognized that the woman who saved the old madam was Kang Qingzhi, who was being insulted by the netizens over what happened during the perfume competition.","Kang Qingzhi and Xu Ling schemed to frame and reported Bright Moon. Later on, in order to clear Kang Qingzhi’s name, the Kang family did not allow Bright Moon to clarify things online. After the netizens found out what had happened in the perfume competition, they all hated Kang Qingzhi’s two-faced behavior.","However, no one expected that before the incident at the fragrance competition became popular, the video of Kang Qingzhi saving someone and getting into a car accident would occupy the trending topics.","In comparison, saving someone was more eye-catching. After all, Kang Qingzhi had saved a life. She pushed the old madam away at a critical moment while she was slammed by a car. From this, it could be seen that Kang Qingzhi was not a bad person.","After a while, many netizens stood up to clear Kang Qingzhi’s name."]},{"number":1540,"title":"Chapter 1540 Something Else","paragraphs":["1540 Something Else","[The decision she made at the critical moment was a subconscious reaction. Kang Qingzhi disregarded her life and rushed to save that old woman without hesitation. This means that she’s kind-hearted!]","[Since Kang Qingzhi is kind-hearted, why did she frame and report Bright Moon? Is there a possibility that Bright Moon did something that made the usually obedient and kind Kang Qingzhi unable to take it anymore and decide to take action? However, Miss Kang couldn’t prove it, so she could only admit defeat.]","[I agree with the person above. She may have been too impulsive to have framed someone, but a girl who saves others without hesitation must be kind-hearted. When the video of the perfume competition was released, everyone was scolding the Kang family and Kang Qingzhi. However, we actually don’t know what happened before. Maybe there was something else going on!]","Right on the heels of that, everyone checked Kang Qingzhi’s information. She was the champion of two consecutive perfume competitions. Why would such an outstanding perfumer frame the unknown Bright Moon?","Not only was Kang Qingzhi from a good family, but she was also gentle and had outstanding perfume skills. However, no information could be found on the rumored Bright Moon.","As the daughter of the Kang family and the champion of the perfume competition, why did she have to frame such a person with a blank background? Even if she did not like Bright Moon, she could use other means to attack her. Why bet on her future?","At this moment, everyone could not help but suspect that there was something else going on with the perfume competition. Many netizens ran to Kang Qingzhi’s account to apologize and praise her for being beautiful and kind. The investors and partners who terminated their contracts earlier also regretted it.","Not long after, the netizens found out that the person Kang Qingzhi had saved was the old madam of the Gu family. She was once the head of the Gu family and was also Gu Zheng and Gu Yao’s grandmother!","Kang Qingzhi had successfully cleared her name and became known as Old Madam Gu’s savior. She was sought after by everyone. Now that everyone in Li City’s high society knew that Old Madam Gu was holding a banquet in the Gu family, everyone could not help but guess if Old Madam Gu would invite Kang Qingzhi to the banquet.","Everyone was discussing fervently online. Kang Qingzhi was Old Madam Gu’s savior. If the Gu family did not invite her and did not show her the respect she deserved, that would be too heartless!","This time, the Gu family had invited the noble families of Li City to their residence. On the surface, it looked like they were holding a banquet, but in reality, they wanted Gu Weiming to hand over his shares and inheritance rights so that Gu Yao could become the head of the Gu family. If there was any problem with the Gu family’s reputation, it was very likely that this plan would fail. Hence, Old Madam Gu could only send an invitation to Kang Qingzhi. She had no other choice.","Qiao Xi sneered. “I didn’t expect Kang Qingzhi to be so capable at such a young age.”","Gu Zheng stopped flipping through the documents and asked softly, “What should we do about her, Xi Xi?”","Qiao Xi stretched and propped her chin with her hand as she smiled slyly. “If Kang Qingzhi wants to go to the Gu family’s banquet so badly, then let her go. In an unfamiliar environment where she’s without Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru’s protection, let’s see what else she can do!”","Gu Zheng’s deep eyes gradually turned cold as cold killing intent flashed past them.","...","Two days later, in the Gu family’s old residence.","Kang Qingzhi was wearing a white dress that revealed her shoulders. There were a few lilies embroidered on the corner of the dress and the chest. The dress was decorated with pink sparkles, making her look weak and pitiful.","The moment everyone saw Kang Qingzhi, they were stunned.","Perhaps the netizens did not know the inside story, but those who could attend the Gu family’s banquet were all nobles of Li City. They had long realized that Bright Moon who appeared in the video was Gu Zheng’s wife, Qiao Xi.","Kang Qingzhi clearly had a grudge against Qiao Xi. The young madam of the Gu family was wrongly accused by Kang Qingzhi of seducing the judges. Now that the Gu family had invited Kang Qingzhi to the banquet, with Gu Zheng’s love for Mrs. Gu, would he let the matter go?","At the entrance of the old residence...","Gu Yao looked at Qiao Xi, who got out of the car elegantly and unhurriedly. He stomped his feet anxiously. “Qiao Xi! Hurry up! Kang Qingzhi has already arrived. Why aren’t you anxious at all?! She’s here to provoke you!”","Although the entire Gu family hated Kang Qingzhi, she was Old Madam Gu’s savior, after all. On the account of her identity, Gu Yao had to endure it and not chase her out.","Kang Qingzhi knew very well that Gu Yao would not do anything to her, so she calmly went to the door. Even everyone in the Gu family had to be polite to her.","Gu Yao was so angry that his face turned red. He said angrily, “The car accident has already been resolved. The chauffeur who caused the accident insists that he was drunk and doesn’t know Kang Qingzhi and Grandma at all. This car accident looks like an accident, but I don’t believe it!”"]},{"number":1541,"title":"Chapter 1541 What Else Did He Have To Hide?","paragraphs":["1541 What Else Did He Have To Hide?","“Kang Qingzhi’s reputation was ruined, but then she saved Grandma. If she had saved someone else, I might have believed her. Why did she have to save Grandma? If this isn’t part of her plan, I’ll cut off my head and kick it like a ball for her!”","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu looked at each other. They naturally thought that the car accident was set up and that Kang Qingzhi had come up with a countermeasure to get rid of the evidence.","If they rashly criticized Kang Qingzhi, she would bite back. Hence, they could only suppress the anger and disgust in their hearts and invite Kang Qingzhi to the Gu family as a guest.","Qiao Xi patted Gu Yao’s shoulder and asked softly, “Kang Qingzhi arrived a long time ago?”","“That’s right! Why didn’t you come earlier? Why did you let her take the initiative?!” Gu Yao still looked angry.","Qiao Xi chuckled. “Since you’re here, I’ll chat with you and ask about your reaction to the car accident.”","With that, Qiao Xi turned around and left. Gu Yao watched her leave and looked at Gu Zheng beside him in confusion. “Your wife went to look for Kang Qingzhi. Aren’t you going to suppress the situation?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up into a gentle smile. His voice was magnetic. “I have something else to attend to. Go follow your sister-in-law.”","Gu Yao was dumbfounded. He was already in the Gu family’s old residence. What else did he have to hide?","In the guest room of the courtyard.","Xu Zhi sat on the chair in a panic and looked at the door from time to time. He stood up and wanted to leave, but he was stopped by a few bodyguards. “President Xu, please wait a moment. Our master will be here soon.”","Xu Zhi glanced at the note on the table. There was only one name written on it—Mo Yuan.","Mo Yuan... was that top hacker!","Before he came to the Gu family, he had received a mysterious call. The other party said that he was the hacker Mo Yuan and had the Xu family’s secrets. If Xu Zhi did not come to see him, these secrets would appear in front of the head of the Xu family tomorrow.","Xu Zhi was so scared that his forehead was covered in a cold sweat. He had heard of Mo Yuan’s deeds, but they had never crossed paths. It was impossible for him to have offended Mo Yuan. Moreover, why did Mo Yuan want to meet him in the Gu family’s old residence?","He was filled with confusion. After waiting for a while, he asked tentatively, “Who... Who exactly is the person who asked me out?”","“President Xu.” A young man in black stood at the door. He glanced at him and smiled meaningfully. “Who else could it be?”","Xu Zhi’s heart skipped a beat. Before he could think too much, steady footsteps came from outside.","Who was Mo Yuan?","Xu Zhi stared fixedly at the door and saw a tall figure appear in front of him. Although he already had a guess in his heart, when he saw the man walking over, he could not suppress the shock he experienced. His heart thumped violently.","Gu Zheng walked opposite him and sat down elegantly, taking a sip of tea.","“P-President Gu...”","The famous hacker, Mo Yuan, was actually Gu Zheng?","Who would have thought that other than doing business, Gu Zheng also had such ability? No one would ever think that the top figure in the hacker world and the big boss of Li City’s commercial world were the same person.","Many people had once investigated Mo Yuan’s identity and invited him to work for them at a price of more than 100 million yuan. The Lu family also looked for Mo Yuan in a high-profile manner. If the Lu family found out that the hacker they had been begging to work with was Gu Zheng, what would their expressions be?","As Xu Zhi was too shocked, he remained silent for a long time. The emotions in his heart were extremely complicated because he did not know why Gu Zheng was looking for him. After all, ever since Xu Anran left the Xu family and he divorced Xia Lan, the Xu family had always been very peaceful. Moreover, he had even done Qiao Xi a favor last time and pointed out Xia Lan in public. Gu Zheng had no reason to make things difficult for him!","Xu Zhi could not help but feel a little terrified. He picked up the cup and drank the tea in one gulp before slowly saying, “P-President Gu, why are you looking for me?”","Song Shijing bent down to pour him tea and said respectfully, “Don’t be nervous, President Xu. Our president just has something to ask you.”","Hearing his words, Xu Zhi panicked even more. He thought of all the bad things he had done in his life.","Gu Zheng glanced at him indifferently and asked slowly, “Xu Ling is from the Xu family, right?”","Xu Ling?","Xu Zhi was instantly enlightened. The news on the internet had long spread to Li City. Of course, he had also seen it. Xu Ling and Kang Qingzhi had framed Xi Xi.","Of course, Xu Ling was from the Xu family and was the precious daughter of the head of the family. He had long seen the news about the Xu family, but he did not expect Gu Zheng to look for him because of this."]},{"number":1542,"title":"Chapter 1542 Gu Yao’s Relationship With The Xu Family","paragraphs":["1542 Gu Yao’s Relationship With The Xu Family","“President Xu, you must have seen the news online.” Gu Zheng’s voice was low. His long fingers stroked the teacup slightly as his thin lips parted. “You know very well what Xu Ling has done.”","Xu Zhi said uneasily, “President Gu, I... I know that Xu Ling has offended Xi Xi, but Xu Ling and I... She’s the precious daughter of the head of the family. Our family has spoiled her rotten. She’s always been naughty and willful. I’m really...”","“I can handle Xu Ling’s matter.” Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the chair and said casually, “The Xu family of Shengdu is a little powerful, but it’s just a small matter for me to take revenge for Xi Xi.”","Xu Zhi’s heart trembled.","Gu Zheng actually said such bold words. Could it be that his power had already reached such a terrifying level?","The Xu family was a wealthy family in Shengdu. Xu Ling was the precious daughter of the head of the family and had been pampered since she was young. What Gu Zheng meant was that if he wanted to lay a hand on Xu Ling, it would be useless even if she ran to Shengdu to avoid trouble.","However, Gu Zheng could take revenge himself. Why did he still want to see him?","Gu Zheng slowly looked up at Xu Zhi with a deep gaze. His voice gradually turned cold. “President Xu, have you seen Xu Anran recently? Is she in contact with Xu Ling?”","Xu Anran... Xu Ling?","Xu Zhi instantly widened his eyes. He had no contact with Xu Ling, but Xu Anran was his adopted daughter, after all. He still knew her a little.","“Or may I ask, how was Xu Anran’s relationship with Xu Ling five years ago?”","Gu Zheng’s words hit Xu Zhi hard, making him fall into a daze for a moment.","Five years ago...","He and Xia Lan found out that Qiao Xi was their biological daughter, but they received news that Qiao Xi was naughty and crude. Xia Lan felt that her daughter was embarrassing, so she was unwilling to bring Qiao Xi home.","It was only when Xu Anran was chased out of the Xu family that he found out that the information they found back then was deliberately edited by Xu Anran. It made them think that their daughter was ignorant, incompetent, and extremely naughty, so they delayed their meeting with Qiao Xi for five years.","Xu Zhi knew very well in his heart that Xu Anran was afraid that her status would be threatened and did not want them to find their biological daughter. However, how could Xu Anran know Qiao Xi’s identity before them?","Now that Gu Zheng had mentioned five years ago, all his doubts seemed to have been resolved.","“President Xu, what did you think of?” Gu Zheng asked.","Cold sweat trickled down Xu Zhi’s forehead. He said while trembling, “President Gu, five years ago... Xu Ling might have told Xi Xi’s identity to Xu Anran, so what happened after that was also Xu Ling’s...”","The smile on Gu Zheng’s face widened. Actually, he had already guessed it. He just wanted to look for Xu Zhi to confirm it.","Xu Zhi felt as if he had fallen into an ice cellar. If that were the case, Gu Zheng would definitely not let Xu Ling off!","Xu Ling and Kang Qingzhi joining forces to frame Xi Xi had already violated Gu Zheng’s bottom line. If what happened five years ago was also related to her, then she...","Gu Zheng exuded a biting cold aura as he asked coldly, “When did Xu Ling and Kang Qingzhi meet?”","Xu Zhi wiped the cold sweat off his forehead. “I don’t have much contact with Xu Ling, and I’m not too sure about her matters either, but I’ve long heard that she had a noble friend in Y Nation who’s the daughter of an earl. If I remember correctly, the earl at that time should be Kang Ru.”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. He had really underestimated Kang Qingzhi!","“There’s one more thing.” Gu Zheng’s expression suddenly became serious. His sharp gaze landed on Xu Zhi as he asked word by word, “What’s Gu Yao’s relationship with the Xu family?”","Xu Zhi’s expression instantly stiffened, and his eyes were filled with horror. He hurriedly lowered his head and said while trembling, “P-President Gu, why... would you ask this? What relationship can Young Master Gu Yao have with the Xu family?”","Gu Zheng sneered. “President Xu, since I asked you, I’ve naturally discovered something. If you don’t explain yourself, it’ll be very difficult for you to walk out of this door today.”","Xu Zhi’s pupils suddenly constricted, and his body trembled uncontrollably. He had almost forgotten that apart from being the president of Gu Corporation, Gu Zheng was also the top hacker, Mo Yuan!","Since Gu Zheng asked him, he must have found some clues. With his strength, it was not impossible for him to investigate what had happened back then, but it would take some time.","Xu Zhi gulped. “President Gu, it’s not that I don’t want to tell you, but I really don’t know much. I just happened to hear from the head of the family that Young Master Gu Yao stayed with the Xu family for a period of time when he was still in infancy. I’m not too sure about what happened after that.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold. He was right. Gu Yao had been in contact with the Xu family."]},{"number":1543,"title":"Chapter 1543 The Same Method","paragraphs":["1543 The Same Method","Previously, Old Madam Yin thought that Gu Yao looked familiar. Gu Zheng investigated for a long time and found a secret. The Xu family had previously adopted a child, and that child was Gu Yao. After that, for some reason, Gu Yao came to Huang Lilan’s side.","Xu Zhi said sincerely, “President Gu, I’ve told you everything I know. I only happened to hear about Young Master Gu Yao.”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Song Shijing, send Mr. Xu out.”","Xu Zhi felt relieved. Just as he stood up and was about to leave, Gu Zheng’s cold voice came from behind. “I don’t want others to know about my conversation with you today. You’re a smart person and should know what to do.”","“Of course! I know!” Xu Zhi quickly said.","This matter concerned the two most important people in Gu Zheng’s life. If Xu Zhi told everyone about Qiao Xi and Gu Yao, wouldn’t he have a death wish?","After Xu Zhi left with Song Shijing, his heart gradually calmed down. He could not help but think about what Xu Ling and Xu Anran had done. Xu Ling was the daughter of the head of the family and had nothing to do with Qiao Xi. There was no need to target Qiao Xi. Did Kang Qingzhi ask Xu Ling to say those words?","If Kang Qingzhi had long used Anran to deal with Xi Xi, then she should have known Xi Xi’s true identity long ago and wanted to use Anran to get rid of her.","If Xi Xi had really died, the Kang family would never have known about their biological daughter. Kang Qingzhi would be the only daughter of the Kang family. Most importantly, no one would suspect Kang Qingzhi.","But Gu Yao...","Xu Zhi wanted to remind the head of the family about Gu Yao, but he suddenly recalled Gu Zheng’s warning and gave up in the end. Since he had promised Gu Zheng not to spread the news, he would not say a word and pretend not to know anything to avoid attracting trouble for himself.","In the Gu family’s backyard.","Qiao Xi sat on the rocking chair in the courtyard and looked at the door in confusion. Why was Gu Zheng not in yet?","On the surface, it was Grandma Gu’s banquet today, but everyone knew very well that the main character of this banquet was Gu Yao. Today, Grandma Gu wanted to force Gu Weiming to transfer the shares and inheritance to Gu Yao. Gu Weiming was only 50 years old, yet he was forced to hand over his real power. He would definitely not be willing. They did not know how Gu Weiming would react if he found out about this.","“Sister Xi Xi.” Suddenly, a familiar voice came from behind. Qiao Xi frowned and felt a little uncomfortable.","She ignored her, but Kang Qingzhi walked in front of her, her face filled with helplessness and difficulty. “Sister Xi Xi, there are some misunderstandings between us. It’s normal for you to hate me, but today is Grandma Gu’s banquet. For Grandma Gu’s sake, forgive me for a day. Don’t make things difficult for Grandma Gu because of us, okay?”","Qiao Xi glanced at her coldly. Where did she get the cheek to call her Grandma Gu?","Kang Qingzhi did not come to look for her to sincerely beg for forgiveness. Instead, she wanted to show her weakness and make others sympathize with her. Secondly, she wanted to provoke Qiao Xi. Kang Qingzhi had clearly framed her in the perfume competition, but she was still invited to the Gu family’s banquet. To outsiders, Old Madam Gu did not care about Qiao Xi, her granddaughter-in-law, at all. Not only was Kang Qingzhi valued by Old Madam Gu, but she was also thinking for Old Madam Gu’s sake, afraid that Old Madam Gu would be in a difficult position between them.","She was clearly just an outsider, yet Kang Qingzhi wanted to appear understanding in front of Qiao Xi, Old Madam Gu’s granddaughter-in-law. Wasn’t this a provocation?","Qiao Xi knew very well in her heart that everything Kang Qingzhi did was to anger her. It would be best if she could not suppress her anger and caused a scene at the banquet, disappointing Grandma Gu. That way, Kang Qingzhi could slowly sow discord between her and Grandma Gu.","This was Kang Qingzhi’s usual method. Back in the Kang family, she used this method to drive a wedge between her and Kang Jichuan.","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and sneered. “Kang Qingzhi, how many times do you have to use the same method on me? Don’t you find it boring?”","Kang Qingzhi’s pupils constricted abruptly, and her eyes were filled with resentment. “You’ve actually recovered your memory!”","Kang Qingzhi had always suspected that Qiao Xi had recovered her memory because she could sense the hostility Qiao Xi emitted. However, it did not matter even if she had recovered her memory. Qiao Xi did not have any evidence of what had happened five years ago.","Five years ago, she sowed discord between Qiao Xi and Kang Jichuan and made Kang Jichuan sacrifice Qiao Xi in order to save her. Now, she could use the same method to gradually make the Gu family hate Qiao Xi.","Everyone in the Kang family valued her. She was just an adopted daughter, but she could receive everyone’s love. She had already succeeded, so her next target was the Gu family."]},{"number":1544,"title":"Chapter 1544 The Things You Steal Can Never Be Yours","paragraphs":["1544 The Things You Steal Can Never Be Yours","The person with the highest status in the Gu family was Old Madam Gu. If she could obtain Old Madam Gu’s love, it would not be long before Gu Yao treated her differently. Then, it would be Gu Zheng...","Qiao Xi could only watch helplessly as the people beside her left and became her family and friends.","“Kang Qingzhi, you must be very happy to have stolen my perfume recipes to participate in the competition, right?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and looked at Kang Qingzhi, her tone carrying disdain. “The perfume recipes I left behind five years ago allowed you to win the championship twice!”","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth, and her eyes were filled with viciousness. “Your perfume recipes are indeed very good. They made me easily become the champion. Back then, you created more than 20 perfume recipes without eating or sleeping, but they all became mine in the end. You even brought me so much honor. I really feel sorry for you!”","!!","“What you steal will never become yours,” Qiao Xi said casually.","Kang Qingzhi stared fixedly at Qiao Xi. She was indeed different from before. Qiao Xi clearly knew that she had stolen her perfume recipes, but she was not angry at all. Kang Qingzhi bit her lip to calm her emotions, then smiled proudly. “No matter how much you hate me, it can’t change the fact that I’m Old Madam Gu’s savior. From now on, I’ll snatch everyone you care about away! I’ll make them leave you one by one!”","“Heh! You’re very confident, huh?” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with ridicule as she sneered. “Miss Kang, you got into a car accident this time. What should you do next? How else do you wish to please Old Madam Gu?”","Kang Qingzhi raised her head and said proudly, “I saved Old Madam Gu. I don’t need to please her. She’ll take me very seriously. If you target me and others see it, it’ll be equivalent to not showing Old Madam Gu any respect!","“I’m a noble guest of the Gu family. As Gu Zheng’s wife, you have to respect me. After all, if I suffer in the Gu family with my current identity, others will say that the Gu family is heartless. They’re even so heartless to their savior. Can you bear the consequences of that happening?”","“Miss Kang, are you still going to use the same trick as five years ago?” Qiao Xi looked at her coldly, her gaze seemingly able to pierce through Kang Qingzhi.","Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi deliberately cut her hand and went to Qiao Xi’s room while covering her wound. Coincidentally, Kang Jichuan returned at this time. When he saw the blood on the floor and the crying Kang Qingzhi, he thought that Qiao Xi had hurt Kang Qingzhi. From then on, no matter what Qiao Xi said, Kang Jichuan did not believe a word. Their relationship as siblings dissipated.","Now that Kang Qingzhi was still using the same trick, Qiao Xi had already seen through everything.","Kang Qingzhi’s face was filled with viciousness. “So what? As long as it can make you be abandoned by everyone, I’ll do anything!”","Qiao Xi slowly stood up. She was a little taller than Kang Qingzhi and looked down at her. “Kang Qingzhi, I really don’t know if I should say that you’re naive or vicious. Do you think everyone is as stupid as Kang Jichuan?”","There was no one with a low IQ in the entire Gu family. Only Gu Yao was a little naive, but he already knew what kind of person Kang Qingzhi was, so he would naturally not be deceived by her.","To use such methods to frame Qiao Xi, did Kang Qingzhi believe that such tricks were effective against the Gu family?","Kang Qingzhi’s expression was ferocious as she gritted her teeth and said, “You’re afraid, huh?! Qiao Xi, even if I fall into the fish pond now, everyone will think that you pushed me!”","“Is that so?” Qiao Xi suddenly took a few steps closer and pushed Kang Qingzhi fiercely. She was wearing a long dress, so it was difficult for her to move. She was also unprepared and fell into the fish pond.","Kang Qingzhi struggled in the water as water poured into her nose. The sound of water flowing filled her ears. At the same time, she heard Qiao Xi’s voice. “Since you want to fall into the fish pond so badly, I’ll satisfy you.”","Qiao Xi stood on the shore and looked at her coldly. Her eyes were filled with coldness as if she really wanted to kill her. Kang Qingzhi did not expect Qiao Xi to push her into the fish pond.","She was Old Madam Gu’s savior, yet Qiao Xi actually dared to do this to her!","Kang Qingzhi struggled a few times in the water before stabilizing herself. She looked at Qiao Xi with a cold gaze. It was a fact that Qiao Xi had pushed her into the water. She had not wronged Qiao Xi. She wanted to see how the Gu family would protect her in front of so many guests.","Qiao Xi pushed Old Madam Qiao’s savior into the water on such an important day. This time, no one could defend her.","At the thought of this, Kang Qingzhi pinched her thigh. Her eyes instantly turned red. Then, she bit her lip and sobbed softly."]},{"number":1545,"title":"Chapter 1545 Soak A Little Longer And Wash The Dirt Off Your Body","paragraphs":["1545 Soak A Little Longer And Wash The Dirt Off Your Body","“Miss Kang, stop pretending.” Qiao Xi was just about to leave when she suddenly stopped in her tracks and chuckled. “This is the Gu family’s backyard. Without the Gu family’s permission, outsiders won’t be able to enter. Who are you pretending for?”","Kang Qingzhi’s expression froze.","Qiao Xi stood at the side and sized up the disheveled Kang Qingzhi. She said with a smile, “Miss Kang, since you like the fish pond so much, why don’t you soak in it for a while longer to wash the dirt off your body?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi walked away elegantly in her high heels.","!!","Kang Qingzhi looked at her back with bloodshot eyes and a ferocious expression.","Qiao Xi left just like that? She was actually so arrogant?","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists. If she climbed ashore and ran out to say that Qiao Xi was the one who pushed her down, no one might believe her. However, if she continued to stay in the pond, she did not know when someone would save her.","B*tch!","Qiao Xi returned to the front hall. The guests gradually took their seats, and the banquet was about to start.","Gu Yao went to her side and asked curiously, “Qiao Xi, have you seen Kang Qingzhi?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and did not answer.","Gu Yao lowered his voice. “I saw her just now. Why did she disappear in the blink of an eye? Is she preparing to frame you again?!”","Qiao Xi glanced at him, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. Gu Yao instantly widened his eyes and asked in horror, “Why are you looking at me like that? Has Kang Qingzhi already attacked you?”","Just as Gu Yao was looking worried, Qiao Xi said with a faint smile, “Kang Qingzhi is in the fish pond in the backyard.”","Gu Yao had a confused expression and did not understand Qiao Xi’s words. Before he could ask, Qiao Xi explained with a smile, “I pushed her into the fish pond in the backyard. Why don’t you get someone to fish her out? It won’t be good if news of her soaking in the pond gets out. It’ll make outsiders think that we didn’t treat her well.”","Gu Yao: “??”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, he was stunned for a few seconds, then he widened his eyes and looked around. He lowered his voice and asked, “Damn! You really pushed her into the pond? Kang Qingzhi is Grandma’s savior. This... She’ll definitely look for trouble with you this time and publicize that you bullied her!”","Qiao Xi was really a ruthless person! She pushed the guest into the pond with just a word. Although the fish pond was not deep, it could still make Kang Qingzhi suffer a little. Even if Kang Qingzhi was not Grandma’s savior, it would be a big problem if others found out that Qiao Xi pushed a guest into the fish pond!","Gu Yao’s face was filled with worry. Qiao Xi thought that he was afraid that this matter would have a negative impact on the Gu family, but the next second, she heard Gu Yao say in a low voice, “Let’s not fish her out first, alright? No one is paying attention to her anyway. Let her soak in the pond for a while longer. We’ll talk about it when others notice her, lest they suspect you.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Gu Yao made the final decision. “Let’s do it this way! We’ll let her suffer a little.”","Ten minutes after the banquet began, someone ran to Gu Yao’s side and whispered about finding Kang Qingzhi in the fish pond. He hurriedly stood up and said in shock, “What? Quickly get her out!”","The assistant: “...” ‘You don’t have to be so deliberate!’","Kang Qingzhi stayed in the fish pond for half an hour before she was fished out. It was early autumn now, and the temperature dropped very quickly at night. Coupled with the fact that she was only wearing a thin dress, her face was turning green from the cold. She crossed her arms and trembled.","Everyone in the banquet hall was talking and clinking glasses. It was very lively.","Kang Qingzhi was wearing a black suit jacket. Her hair was wet and stuck to her face. Her face was pale, and her round eyes were red. She pursed her lips tightly as if she was trying her best not to cry. It made one pity her.","“Ah! What’s wrong, Miss Kang?”","“Why is she all wet?!”","When Kang Qingzhi saw Qiao Xi behind everyone, she was instantly terrified to the point her entire body trembled. However, she forced herself not to leave and looked aggrieved but strong. “Mrs. Gu, why did you do this to me?”","Mrs. Gu?","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi. Kang Qingzhi meant that the person who caused her to be in such a sorry state was Mrs. Gu.","Qiao Xi stood on the spot and said with a smile, “Miss Kang, I don’t understand what you mean.”","Kang Qingzhi had been soaking in the water for half an hour, and monstrous anger had accumulated in her heart. However, in front of everyone, she had no choice but to suppress her anger. Tears welled up in her eyes as she said with a sobbing tone, “Mrs. Gu, I know you hate me, but this is Old Madam Gu’s banquet. Even if there’s a huge grudge between us, you can’t bully me at the banquet. Moreover, you pushed me into the fish pond. If I hadn’t known how to swim, I might’ve choked to death. You’re clearly committing murder!”"]},{"number":1546,"title":"Chapter 1546 You’re Just An Outsider","paragraphs":["1546 You’re Just An Outsider","As soon as the word ‘murder’ was spoken, everyone gasped and looked at Qiao Xi in shock. Mrs. Gu was too bold to push someone into the water at the Gu family’s banquet!","At this moment, Kang Qingzhi’s entire body was drenched, and a long trail of water was left on the floor. She was in an extremely sorry state, and she did not look like she had been wrongly accused. Moreover, if she really slandered Qiao Xi and was discovered by the Gu family, her reputation would definitely be worse than before. Hence, there was a high chance that this matter was true.","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with gazes filled with doubt.","Kang Qingzhi could not stop her tears from flowing. Her body was trembling slightly like a little white flower that was still standing despite the wind and rain. “Mrs. Gu, you have a noble status, but today is the Gu family’s banquet, after all. You pushed me into the water without caring about the occasion. No matter what, you have to apologize to me. Otherwise, I’ll call the police!”","!!","Hearing that she was going to call the police, the event location instantly became noisy.","They were all famous figures in Li City, and they were attending a banquet. If the police were to make an appearance, everyone would feel awkward.","Gu Zheng glanced indifferently at Kang Qingzhi. His gaze was cold and sharp, causing Kang Qingzhi’s body to tremble uncontrollably. She hurriedly lowered her eyes. Since she had already accused Qiao Xi in public, she had to be as stubborn as a mule. Moreover, it was a fact that Qiao Xi had pushed her into the water. She had not wronged Qiao Xi!","Kang Qingzhi raised her voice and questioned, “Mrs. Gu, you brazenly pushed me into the water. Can’t I just ask for an apology? There are some misunderstandings between you and me, but I’ve already apologized and asked for peace humbly. You almost killed me. As the madam of the Gu family, can you do such evil things? You’re already so arrogant at the Gu family’s banquet. I don’t know how you’ll deal with me in the future! Moreover, since you dare to treat me like this today, you’ll definitely hurt others in the future!”","Although the guests did not speak, their eyes revealed agreement. When they looked at Qiao Xi, their gazes could not help but be tainted with a trace of disdain.","Kang Qingzhi’s words were sharp. Mrs. Gu was too arrogant. She was brazenly attempting murder at the Gu family’s banquet. If anyone offended her, wouldn’t they have no way out?","Under everyone’s gazes, Gu Yao broke the silence first. “Miss Kang, what right do you have to question Qiao Xi? Don’t you know what you’ve done?","“At the Gu family’s banquet, you’re just an outsider, and Xi Xi is the madam of the Gu family. Don’t keep bringing up the name of the Gu family. You’re pretending to show off your consideration for the Gu family in front of Xi Xi. I feel disgusted just listening to you!”","Gu Yao’s words made everyone present widen their eyes as they did not understand what he meant.","Showing off in front of Qiao Xi?","Kang Qingzhi understood what Gu Yao meant. A trace of panic flashed past her eyes, then she retorted with teary eyes, “Young Master Gu, when did I show off? You can’t malign me in public just to get Mrs. Gu out of trouble! Moreover, even if I really said something, Mrs. Gu shouldn’t have pushed me into the water, right?! I’m wearing such a long dress, which hindered me from swimming well. I choked a few times and almost died. Mrs. Gu wanted to kill me!”","Gu Yao looked at her in disdain. How did the Kang family raise such a scheming b*tch?","Perhaps Kang Qingzhi thought that she was acting well, looking all pitiful, but Gu Yao had long seen through her. Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with hatred and resentment. She did not just want an apology. She wanted to destroy Qiao Xi!","At this moment, Gu Zheng suddenly looked at Kang Qingzhi. His voice was low and dignified. “Miss Kang, have you forgotten what you said so quickly?”","Kang Qingzhi met Gu Zheng’s gaze and could not help but tremble. She was very puzzled. With Gu Zheng’s power and wealth, he could have any woman he wanted. Why did he have to be inflexible and stubborn with Qiao Xi?","She was clearly much more outstanding than Qiao Xi. Everyone in the Kang family liked her. Moreover, a domineering man like Gu Zheng needed a gentle woman by his side, not an arrogant and domineering woman like Qiao Xi who only knew how to cause trouble.","However, why did Gu Zheng have to protect Qiao Xi even if it meant offending the Kang family?","Kang Qingzhi was silent for a long time before gritting her teeth and saying, “Mr. Gu, I know you dote on Mrs. Gu and will definitely protect her, but she’s the one who pushed me into the water now. Why are you and Mr. Gu Yao making things difficult for me?”","With that, Kang Qingzhi’s tears gushed out as if a valve had been opened. His voice was filled with grievance. “Mrs. Gu, you have a noble status. I don’t dare to offend you, but I just want an apology. Can’t I even do this?”"]},{"number":1547,"title":"Chapter 1547 Killing At A Disagreement","paragraphs":["1547 Killing At A Disagreement","Qiao Xi clicked her tongue. Why was Kang Qingzhi crying again? She was using her tears to gain sympathy. Such methods were really despicable.","Gu Yao said angrily, “Qiao Xi has never been a bad person. Even if she really pushed you into the water, it was because you provoked her first! Kang Qingzhi, why don’t you tell us what you’ve done? You’re crying in front of everyone to seek justice. Do you want to use public opinion to target Qiao Xi?”","Kang Qingzhi’s expression carried a trace of panic. She knew that there would definitely be people who would not believe her if she said that Qiao Xi pushed her into the water, but there was only one chance. If she could pin this crime on Qiao Xi, her goal would be achieved. Otherwise, who knew when she would have something on Qiao Xi again?","She widened her eyes and looked at Gu Yao, her eyes filled with sorrow and confusion. “Mr. Gu Yao, I really don’t understand what you mean. I do have some grudges against Mrs. Gu. I did talk to her for a while, but it was just because I don’t know anyone in the Gu family, so I went forward to greet her. However, Mrs. Gu pushed me into the water, causing me to almost choke to death.","“What if I had really drowned? I was in the water for half an hour and suffered so much. All I want now is an apology. Young Master Gu Yao, are you unwilling to even give me an apology?","“Even if I really said something wrong and offended Mrs. Gu, she can’t kill me in a fit of anger!”","The guests present all had business dealings with the Gu family or Gu Corporation. No one wanted to offend Gu Zheng, but they had to admit that Kang Qingzhi’s words made sense. Even if Kang Qingzhi had offended Mrs. Gu, she could not kill someone without a word, right? This was not the way to do things!","At this moment, a socialite dressed exquisitely could not help but say, “Mr. Gu, Miss Kang is right. No matter what she said, Mrs. Gu shouldn’t have tried to kill her. She’s disregarding the law!","“If anyone dares to say a few words and anger Mrs. Gu, does that mean they’ll have to die? In that case, who will dare to interact with Mrs. Gu in the future? They’re afraid that they’ll die if they say anything wrong. If they accidentally quarrel, their entire family will be implicated!”","When Kang Qingzhi heard that person stand up and criticize Qiao Xi, the resentment in her heart was finally vented.","This scene seemed to be similar. Five years ago, Qiao Xi was also criticized by everyone like this. Five years later, she still fell into such a predicament and could not explain herself.","Kang Qingzhi looked at Gu Zheng with eyes filled with tears. “Mr. Gu, no matter what, I’m Old Madam Gu’s savior. Old Madam Gu was the one who invited me to this banquet. In everyone’s eyes, I’m an honored guest of the Gu family. Now, Mrs. Gu actually attacked me, her grandmother’s savior. Isn’t this too much?!","“At that time, Old Madam Gu was in danger. At that critical moment, I rushed over without hesitation. Old Madam Gu is also very grateful to me, but Mrs. Gu wants to kill me. Could it be that she thinks that I shouldn’t have saved Old Madam Gu, so she tried to get rid of me?”","Everyone’s expressions froze.","She made it sound as if Mrs. Gu did not want Old Madam Gu to live!","It would be fine if it was a conflict between two women. After all, the previous perfume competition had caused an uproar online. Everyone knew that Kang Qingzhi had framed Qiao Xi, but if it involved Old Madam Gu, the situation would change.","Kang Qingzhi was Old Madam Gu’s savior. Logically speaking, Mrs. Gu should be grateful to her, so why did she want to kill Kang Qingzhi? Could it be that Mrs. Gu and Old Madam Gu were not on good terms? Thinking about it more deeply, this car accident might have been Mrs. Gu’s doing. Unexpectedly, Kang Qingzhi appeared halfway and saved Old Madam Gu, ruining Mrs. Gu’s plan. That was why Mrs. Gu wanted to kill Kang Qingzhi in a fit of anger.","There were too many grudges between noble families. Everyone had experience with infighting. It was not as if they had never seen such a thing before, so they had to think of the worst.","At the thought of what Mrs. Gu might have done, everyone could not help but feel a chill run down their spine. A young lady in her 20s was actually so vicious. If Old Madam Gu knew that her granddaughter-in-law wanted to harm her, how would she feel?","Kang Qingzhi watched as everyone’s eyes gradually became filled with fear and disgust. She could not help but feel carefree.","Not only did she want Qiao Xi’s reputation to be ruined, but she also wanted the Gu family to hate her and make Old Madam Gu completely break off all ties with her. At that time, Gu Zheng would be stuck in the middle and would have no choice but to make a decision."]},{"number":1548,"title":"Chapter 1548 Suspicion","paragraphs":["1548 Suspicion","Kang Qingzhi had asked around about the Gu family. Gu Zheng had a cold personality, but he was very filial to Old Madam Gu. With Gu Zheng’s current identity, he only had one grandmother, but he could have many wives. There was no need for him to break off all ties with his biological grandmother for Qiao Xi.","After Qiao Xi lost Gu Zheng’s protection, she would be a person who was down on their luck. Anyone could trample on her.","Even if there was no evidence to prove that the car accident was Qiao Xi’s doing, once the seeds were planted, doubts would grow in everyone’s hearts. Old Madam Gu would definitely gradually hate Qiao Xi!","At the thought of this, Kang Qingzhi could not help but smile.","“Miss Kang, Xi Xi didn’t push you into the water because you saved me.” Just as Kang Qingzhi was feeling proud, an old but dignified voice came from the door.","Old Madam Gu was sitting in a wheelchair, but the aura she exuded was abnormally strong. Her sharp gaze landed on Kang Qingzhi. It was completely different from what Kang Qingzhi had expected.","“Miss Kang, I know Xi Xi very well. She’s very filial, and our relationship is very good, so Xi Xi must have pushed you into the water after you said something.”","Old Madam Gu’s words were very firm, making the smugness on Kang Qingzhi’s face disappear instantly.","Why? She was Old Madam Gu’s savior, yet Old Madam Gu suspected her in public?","Kang Qingzhi could not control her expression as it gradually became ferocious. What did this old woman mean? She had disregarded her own safety to save her, yet she actually wanted to protect Qiao Xi?","Moreover, what she said just now made sense. Why did Old Madam Qiao not suspect Qiao Xi at all?","She was clearly the one who was pushed into the water and the one who had suffered in the cold water, but she was still the one who was suspected in the end. Why were they all protecting Qiao Xi?","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and revealed a provocative smile at Kang Qingzhi.","She had long said that not everyone was as stupid as Kang Jichuan. Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi tried to drive a wedge between her and Kang Jichuan by attempting suicide, but Gu Yao, Grandma Gu, and Gu Zheng would not fall for her same tricks.","They really treated her as family and knew her character very well. How could they believe Kang Qingzhi’s words?","Gu Zheng casually looked at Qiao Xi. Ever since Kang Qingzhi appeared, she had been standing there with an indifferent expression without a trace of panic. He knew very well in his heart that since Xi Xi dared to push Kang Qingzhi into the water, she must be 100% confident that she would not suffer a loss.","Kang Qingzhi felt that she could accuse Xi Xi just because she had suffered. She would understand what it meant to shoot oneself in the foot later!","The event location was silent. Old Madam Gu spoke again, her voice even more serious than before. “Miss Kang, what did you say to Xi Xi?”","Everyone held their breaths and quietly waited for Kang Qingzhi to speak.","As the old madam of the Gu family with the highest status, she had already asked a question. Even if Kang Qingzhi was her savior, she should answer. However, she did not say anything for a long time, which meant that she was panicking.","Seeing Old Madam Gu’s cold gaze, Kang Qingzhi was instantly scared out of her wits. Her eyes were red as she said pitifully, “Grandma Gu, I do have some grudges against Mrs. Gu. Actually, I came to the banquet to explain myself and beg Mrs. Gu to forgive me, but before I could say anything, she pushed me down.","“Even if I did say something to Mrs. Gu that she didn’t like to hear, she can’t push me into the water. If I hadn’t known how to swim, I would’ve drowned to death.”","Kang Qingzhi had said this just now. Now that she repeated it in front of Old Madam Gu, she wanted everyone to know that Qiao Xi had attempted murder!","It was only a matter of morals if she said something wrong, but it was a crime for Qiao Xi to push her into the water. It was obvious which was more serious.","Qiao Xi curled her lips and slowly walked toward Kang Qingzhi. She said casually, “Miss Kang, are you sure you want to talk about some things in front of everyone?”","Kang Qingzhi watched as Qiao Xi walked over with her aura fully released. Her heart thumped, and her body trembled uncontrollably.","She forcefully suppressed the fear in her heart and pretended to be strong as she glared at Qiao Xi. Her face was pale, and her round eyes were filled with tears. She was like a flower swaying in the wind. “Mrs. Gu, no matter what, I have to seek an explanation for myself today. Even if this is Li City and the Gu family’s territory, I’m not easy to bully. I’m the daughter of a noble in Y Nation, but I was almost killed at the Gu family’s banquet. I can’t just swallow my anger and do nothing!”","Although her father had been looking for his biological daughter all these years, Kang Qingzhi was sure that her father still cared about her. Once they found out that Qiao Xi had almost caused her death, her father and brother would definitely not forgive Qiao Xi and would completely break off ties with her."]},{"number":1549,"title":"Chapter 1549 Miss Kang, Don’t Regret It","paragraphs":["1549 Miss Kang, Don’t Regret It","Qiao Xi looked at Kang Qingzhi’s indignant appearance, and the corners of her mouth revealed a trace of ridicule. “Then what do you want to do, Miss Kang?”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip and said in a weak voice, “Since you won’t admit to this, then call the police. Let the police investigate it. No matter what the final outcome is, it’ll be decided by the police. I won’t have any objections. Moreover, this is very fair to me and Mrs. Gu.”","Gu Yao was instantly unhappy. “Kang Qingzhi, where did you get your dignity from?! Who do you think you are? Don’t think that just because you’re invited to the banquet, you—”","Before he could finish, he was stopped by Qiao Xi with a wave of her hand. She said casually, “I agree with Miss Kang. After all, murder is not a small matter. If you want to call the police, I naturally won’t refuse.”","!!","Gu Yao stopped talking abruptly, and everyone looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief.","Did she agree to call the police because she was too confident that she would escape unscathed or because this had nothing to do with her?","Kang Qingzhi was also a little surprised. When she came back to her senses, her expression was gradually filled with mockery, but her voice was still filled with grievance and weakness. “Mrs. Gu, are you admitting it?”","“Where did you hear that?” Qiao Xi had an innocent expression.","Kang Qingzhi looked like she was about to cry. “You said that murder is not a small matter. You agreed to let me call the police!”","Qiao Xi had a surprised expression. “I did agree to let you call the police, but I didn’t admit it. Miss Kang, your thoughts are really strange!”","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth tightly, and her eyes were filled with viciousness. She was still unconvinced as she questioned, “Mrs. Gu, you agreed to call the police just now. Doesn’t that mean that you’ve admitted it? You’re the mistress of the Gu family, and I’m the daughter of the Kang family. My status isn’t lower than yours. I almost died in the Gu family this time. The Kang family definitely won’t let this go!","“Could it be...” Kang Qingzhi frowned with a disapproving expression. “Could it be that you think the Gu family’s power can protect you? You can disregard your reputation and commit crimes, but why do you want Grandma Gu and Mr. Gu to clean up your mess?”","Qiao Xi’s voice was extremely calm. “Miss Kang, this is between us. Why must you bring up others? Moreover, when did I ask Grandma Gu and Gu Zheng to help me?”","Everyone was surprised.","Without Gu Zheng’s help, how could Mrs. Gu escape unscathed after deliberately killing someone?","Kang Qingzhi was slightly surprised as well. What right did Qiao Xi have to be so confident? She looked at Qiao Xi’s calm face, and the anger in her heart suddenly surged. Then, she took out her phone and said loudly, “I know that this is the Gu family’s territory. No one wants to offend Mr. Gu, and no one will help me call the police. I can only rely on myself.”","Just as Kang Qingzhi was about to dial the number, Qiao Xi said casually, “Miss Kang, are you really going to call the police? Do you want to ask the Kang family first before deciding?”","Kang Qingzhi stopped what she was doing, and her eyes were filled with ridicule. She thought that Qiao Xi was so confident, but now that she was about to call the police, Qiao Xi finally showed her fear!","Moreover, even if she called her father and brother, they would definitely support her in calling the police if they found out that Qiao Xi had pushed her into the water!","Qiao Xi asked her to ask her father probably because she thought that her father would ask Kang Qingzhi to give up on calling the police to protect Qiao Xi’s reputation on the account of their relationship as father and daughter. However, how was this possible?","Kang Qingzhi stared fixedly at Qiao Xi, her eyes filled with resentment and disdain. She was clearly in a sorry state, but at this moment, she felt noble. She said with an arrogant expression, “Why are you asking about my family? They’re my family. Do you think they’ll help you?","“If Dad and Brother find out that you almost killed me, they’ll call the police and have you arrested even before I say anything. You’ll have to pay the price regardless!","‘Yes, I’m the adopted daughter of the Kang family. In the past, I was just your substitute, but now, my status in the Kang family has completely surpassed yours. You still want the Kang family to stand on your side? Dream on!’","The corners of Kang Qingzhi’s mouth curled into a proud smile. Moreover, in the eyes of the Kang family, her health had not been good since she was young. If they knew that Qiao Xi had pushed her into a pond and left her there for half an hour, they would definitely be very angry.","After she finished speaking, the event location suddenly fell silent. After a long time, Qiao Xi smiled strangely. “Miss Kang, don’t regret it.”","“I won’t regret it!” Kang Qingzhi shouted without hesitation. She wished for nothing more than to pierce through Qiao Xi’s body with her vicious gaze. She could no longer control her expression.","Why did Qiao Xi appear in front of Kang Ru? If Kang Ru had not seen Qiao Xi back then, the Kang family would forever have only one eldest daughter. No one would snatch her things. She targeted Qiao Xi to protect herself!"]},{"number":1550,"title":"Chapter 1550 No Chance To Regret If You Take The Wrong Step","paragraphs":["1550 No Chance To Regret If You Take The Wrong Step","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip tightly, the hatred in her heart about to overflow.","Qiao Xi was a calamity. The moment she appeared, she caused chaos in the Kang family. Because of her, the Situ and Xia families in the capital were also in trouble.","Among those wealthy families, the Kang family was nothing. There would be many more wealthy families and nobles who would be affected because of her. Since Xia Yunqiu had disappeared from everyone’s sight with her back then, why did she still appear? It did not matter if she got mixed up with other families, but why did she have to appear in front of the Kang family?","Because of Qiao Xi, the secret from many years ago was about to be revealed. At that time, not only would the Kang family be affected, but many families would also be affected!","Qiao Xi deserved to die! If she died, there wouldn’t be so much trouble!","Kang Qingzhi held the cell phone tightly and said firmly, “Mrs. Gu, no matter what you say today, I have to call the police. It’s not only for my own sake but also for everyone’s safety. I’m the one who suffered today, but it might be someone else tomorrow. If you don’t get punished, you definitely won’t stop!”","The matter involved everyone. Everyone supported Kang Qingzhi in calling the police, but they did not rashly say anything.","After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi waved her hand helplessly. “Since you’re so insistent, then call the police.”","Her tone was so calm, making everyone puzzled. Was Mrs. Gu so sure that even if the police came, they would not be able to do anything to her? Not only was Kang Qingzhi Old Madam Gu’s savior, but she was also the daughter of the Kang family. Mrs. Gu attempted to murder Miss Kang at the banquet. Why was she so confident that she could escape unscathed?","Kang Qingzhi stared fixedly at Qiao Xi. She really did not understand why Qiao Xi could still be so calm at this time. Without the Gu family’s help, how could she escape punishment? Gu Zheng had not spoken up for her until now. Moreover, Old Madam Gu had only said a few words before she stopped talking. Why was Qiao Xi still supporting her in calling the police? Could it be that she was not afraid?","Kang Qingzhi did not think too much about it and had already pressed the number. Qiao Xi, who was at the side, suddenly smiled playfully. “Miss Kang, actually, I’m very supportive of you calling the police, but I still want to remind you that there’s a camera in the backyard that’s facing where you were standing. Although it can’t record the sound, the image is very clear. It’s actually not difficult to know what you said. We just have to find a lip-reading expert to transcribe it.","“If you really call the police, guess who the police will arrest in the end?”","Kang Qingzhi’s mind exploded!","Qiao Xi’s tone was filled with ridicule. “Miss Kang, I asked you to consider it carefully before calling the police for your own good. After all, you won’t have a chance to regret it if you take the wrong step!”","“You’re doing this for my own good?” Kang Qingzhi sneered, her expression filled with viciousness. “You’re clearly stalling for time and don’t want me to call the police. You’re just guilty—”","“Miss Kang, that fish pond is less than a meter deep. With your height, you can quickly stabilize yourself even if you fall. It’s unlikely that you’ll drown unless you want to die.”","Qiao Xi said casually, but these words smashed heavily into Kang Qingzhi’s heart.","The fish pond... was less than a meter deep?","Kang Qingzhi’s face instantly turned pale. She did not have time to think and roared, “Nonsense! How can that fish pond be so shallow?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Yao ran in with a laptop and shouted, “Qiao Xi, I’ve gotten the surveillance footage, but there’s no sound. We can only take a look first. We’ll know the contents of the conversation when the police arrive.”","As he spoke, Gu Yao clicked on the video in public. Although they could not hear anything, everyone could tell something from Kang Qingzhi’s expression.","Kang Qingzhi’s face was filled with smugness and viciousness. It was completely different from her usual gentle and weak appearance. She seemed to have changed into a different person.","Everyone’s expressions changed instantly. Kang Qingzhi hurriedly explained, “I... I was just chatting with Mrs. Gu. I don’t know why my expression is like this.”","“I learned how to lip-read. Let me try.” At this moment, a voice came from the crowd. A socialite slowly walked over. She stared at the video for a while and frowned. “Miss Kang is standing sideways. From this angle, I can’t be sure what she said.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Kang Qingzhi, who was in the surveillance footage, suddenly changed direction. The socialite stared at the screen and slowly said, “I can see it clearly now. Miss Kang said, ‘Even if I fall into the fish pond now, everyone will think that you pushed me!’ I think my interpretation should be right. If you don’t believe me, we can get the police’s lip-reading experts to transcribe it...”"]},{"number":1551,"title":"Chapter 1551 Harming Others Without Benefiting Yourself","paragraphs":["1551 Harming Others Without Benefiting Yourself","The event location instantly fell silent. Right on the heels of that, a middle-aged man beside her said, “I’ve also learned how to lip-read. That’s probably what Miss Kang said.”","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale, and her body was trembling uncontrollably. She stood alone on the spot, surrounded by questioning gazes.","There was really a surveillance camera, and it coincidentally captured that sentence. Moreover, there were actually guests who knew how to lip-read. How could it be such a coincidence?","No! She suddenly recalled that she and Qiao Xi were talking face-to-face at that time. Later on, Qiao Xi specially adjusted the angle before she changed her position, allowing the surveillance camera to capture her saying that sentence.","!!","This was clearly a trap set up by her!","Kang Qingzhi’s hatred surged like a tide!","Qiao Xi, that b*tch, actually dared to scheme against her? What right did those people have to suspect her? She was the daughter of a noble family in Y Nation. Even if she really made a mistake, it was not their place to question her!","“Miss Kang, you just said that this is the Gu family’s territory, but you were fooling around at the Gu family’s banquet and even wanted to frame me. I’ve reminded you many times, but you don’t know how to repent. I didn’t call the police on the account that you’re Grandma Gu’s savior. I hope you can use your brain before you speak or do anything. Don’t do anything that harms others without benefiting yourself.","“There are some things that weren’t captured in the surveillance camera. I can repeat it for you. You showed off in front of me, saying that you’re Grandma Gu’s savior. You even threatened me by saying that Grandma Gu would blame me for going against you and even chase me out of the Gu family.”","Qiao Xi said word by word, “I reminded you just now to ask the Kang family if you should call the police, but you seemed to have lost your mind and insisted on calling the police. I had no choice but to bring out the surveillance footage. Let me ask you again. Are you sure you want to call the police?”","The banquet hall was silent. Kang Qingzhi’s body was cold, but her face was burning. She was about to break down.","No wonder Qiao Xi had always been so confident. It turned out that she had long gotten the surveillance camera to record her saying that sentence. She had clearly done it on purpose. Why did everyone believe her?","“Miss Kang, why are you doing this?”","“I believe everyone has heard about the farce during the perfume competition, right?” A noblewoman in the crowd said, “Miss Kang framed Mrs. Gu, and the Kang family even forced Mrs. Gu to let the matter rest. Anyone who has seen that video knows that the contestant who was threatened, Bright Moon, is Mrs. Gu herself!”","Hearing this, the event location instantly became noisy.","“Doesn’t Miss Kang know that Bright Moon is Mrs. Gu? Yet she actually dares to threaten her?”","“Although the Kang family is a noble in Y Nation, this is Li City. Who dares to threaten Mrs. Gu?! If Miss Kang still dares to threaten Mrs. Gu even though she knows that Bright Moon is Mrs. Gu, then she’s too arrogant!”","“That video was taken by Young Master Yang, who went to the wrong place. He just posted it on his Moments. I don’t know who posted the video online, but right on the heels of that, Kang Qingzhi was crazily insulted by netizens. A few days later, Kang Qingzhi became Old Madam Gu’s savior. Speaking of which, it’s a little strange!”","Everyone looked at each other, the doubt in their eyes obvious.","They had all been in high society for so many years and were all very smart. When they connected these things, they could not help but think of another possibility.","Kang Qingzhi’s body suddenly tensed.","Qiao Xi! This b*tch made everyone suspect that she was using the car accident to clear her name. She ruined all her plans and efforts!","Kang Qingzhi suppressed the anger in her heart and took a deep breath. “Mrs. Gu, when I saved Grandma Gu, I didn’t know her identity. The situation was critical, so I didn’t think too much—”","“Miss Kang.” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “I didn’t say I suspected you. Why are you explaining this to me?”","Kang Qingzhi’s heart trembled, and the suspicion in everyone’s eyes deepened.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Miss Kang, you’re indeed Grandma Gu’s savior. We’re grateful to you, but you can’t slander me at the Gu family’s banquet just because you did a good deed!","“I don’t want to hear you explain the car accident. I just want to know why you framed me again.” Qiao Xi’s gaze was cold as she sneered. “Do you think you can surpass my status as Mrs. Gu just because you’ve become Grandma Gu’s savior? Do you think you can provoke me without restraint? Miss Kang, please explain.”"]},{"number":1552,"title":"Chapter 1552 Don’t Talk Too Much","paragraphs":["1552 Don’t Talk Too Much","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth and could not say a word. She could only lower her head, her eyes filled with viciousness. After a long silence, she said in a trembling voice, “Sister Xi Xi, I... I was just joking back then, but you...”","“Qingzhi!” Suddenly, a worried male voice came from the door.","Kang Jichuan quickly ran over. The moment she saw him, Kang Qingzhi’s tears fell like pearls. Her eyes were filled with grievances. When Kang Jichuan saw his drenched and pitiful sister, anger surged within him.","“Qingzhi, what exactly happened?”","!!","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip and lowered her head like a frightened little white rabbit. “It’s... It’s nothing. I was careless...”","Seeing her like this, Kang Jichuan subconsciously looked at Qiao Xi with a questioning gaze.","It must be Qiao Xi! It was the same five years ago. Qingzhi was always bullied, but she still had to cover for Qiao Xi. She clearly felt aggrieved, but she could only silently cry.","Kang Jichuan knew very well in his heart that Qingzhi was afraid that he would be stuck in the middle and placed in a difficult position. She was also afraid that he would blame Qiao Xi and it would affect their relationship as siblings.","At first, when Qiao Xi made a mistake, he only reprimanded her a little and did not punish her. However, she refused to repent and continued to bully Qingzhi. He could not sit idly by anymore!","He frowned and said angrily, “Xi Xi, no matter what conflict you have with Qingzhi, you can just sit down and talk. Why are you doing this to her?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Yao exploded and said in a mocking tone, “Kang Jichuan, you’re accusing Qiao Xi without distinguishing right or wrong. You’re really a good brother!”","Gu Yao specially emphasized the words ‘good brother’ to mock Kang Jichuan. He was clearly Qiao Xi’s biological brother, but he always spoke up for Kang Qingzhi. He had just entered and did not know anything yet, but he insisted that Qiao Xi had bullied Kang Qingzhi. Wasn’t he biased against Qiao Xi?","When Kang Jichuan heard Gu Yao’s words, he felt uncomfortable all over. However, this was the Gu family, after all. He could not quarrel with Gu Yao. He could only suppress his anger and retort, “Second Young Master Gu! Can’t you see that Qingzhi is wet and even crying aggrievedly? She’s already like this. Could it be that she bullied Xi Xi?”","Gu Yao could not help but roll his eyes. At this moment, he deeply understood what it meant to be non-speculative.","Seeing that he was silent, Kang Jichuan looked at Qiao Xi and sighed helplessly. “Xi Xi, you also know that Qingzhi is an honored guest invited by Old Madam Gu. No matter how dissatisfied you are, you can’t do this! On the account of Old Madam Gu, we’ll forget about this matter, but you can’t bully Qingzhi anymore!”","Qiao Xi glanced at him coldly. Kang Jichuan was still the same as before. As long as Kang Qingzhi cried, he would feel that Kang Qingzhi had suffered a great grievance.","In her memory, many similar things had happened before, and some misunderstandings were even more serious than this. Perhaps in Kang Jichuan’s heart, she was a vicious girl. On the other hand, Kang Qingzhi was a pitiful but still strong and understanding woman.","Just as Kang Jichuan was about to help Kang Qingzhi leave, he suddenly heard an angry roar from behind. “Wait!”","The two of them stopped in their tracks and slowly turned around. Gu Yao’s expression was gloomy, and there was a cold smile on his lips. “Young Master Kang, don’t be in a rush to leave! I think you need to know the ins and outs of the matter.”","Kang Qingzhi’s body instantly tensed up.","Kang Jichuan frowned unhappily. “That’s not necessary. Second Young Master Gu, you don’t have to sow discord between Qingzhi and me—”","“I really can’t take it anymore!” The person who interrupted Kang Jichuan this time was the socialite who knew lip-reading just now. She looked at Kang Qingzhi with extreme disgust and said in a disdainful tone, “Young Master Kang, please use your brain to think. Kang Qingzhi is crying in the banquet hall, but why is everyone so indifferent?”","Before Kang Jichuan could say anything, the socialite continued, “Because she reaped what she sowed! She fell into the water to frame Mrs. Gu and even clamored to call the police. Unexpectedly, Second Young Master Gu found the surveillance footage and exposed the truth in front of everyone!","“She deliberately fell into the water to slander Mrs. Gu. Even if she’s dead, she’s not worthy of sympathy! We hate her not because this is the Gu family and we have to speak up for Mrs. Gu, but because Miss Kang is vicious. She failed to frame others and is now biting back!”","Kang Qingzhi’s already pale face instantly turned gray."]},{"number":1553,"title":"Chapter 1553 Taking Out Her Trump Card","paragraphs":["1553 Taking Out Her Trump Card","Kang Jichuan widened his eyes instantly, not understanding what this socialite was saying.","She said that Qingzhi was vicious and framed Xi Xi?","Previously, during the farce of the perfume competition, everyone said that Qingzhi and Xu Ling had joined forces to frame Xi Xi, but he believed that Qingzhi would not do that. Qingzhi was only instigated by Xu Ling, so he naturally believed that Qingzhi would not frame Xi Xi at the Gu family’s banquet.","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head as tears trickled down her face. Her already weak body trembled helplessly. Kang Jichuan’s heart ached, and the last trace of doubt in his heart gradually dissipated.","He frowned and retorted, “I’m Qingzhi’s brother. I know her very well. She won’t frame others! Qingzhi, since the Gu family can’t tolerate you, I’ll bring you away!","“Although this is Li City and the Gu family’s territory, the daughter of the Kang family can’t be slandered! I hope you can watch your words to avoid getting into trouble!”","The socialite widened her eyes and looked at Kang Jichuan in disbelief. Then, she rolled her eyes and looked at Gu Yao. She finally understood why Gu Yao did not retort. It was because talking to an idiot was really infuriating!","Kang Jichuan looked smart on the surface, but he was actually very stupid. He was probably thinking too highly of himself!","After a long silence, the socialite could not help but sneer. “Since you trust your sister so much, I have nothing to say. When the Kang family is defeated by Kang Qingzhi one day, don’t regret it!”","“Shut up!” Kang Jichuan’s expression was extremely gloomy. “Whose daughter are you? How dare you curse our Kang family like this? Qingzhi, let’s go!”","Kang Jichuan turned around and saw Old Madam Gu beside him. He seemed to want to say something, but when he saw everyone’s disdainful gazes, he swallowed the words in his mouth and pulled Qingzhi away.","“She ruined a good banquet. What a jinx!” Gu Yao complained.","When Kang Qingzhi heard this, she gritted her teeth and quickly left with Kang Jichuan.","After the two of them left, Kang Jichuan could not help but be a little curious about what had happened today. At that time, so many people were standing at the event location. Old Madam Gu was also watching from the side. Did they just watch helplessly as Qiao Xi bullied Qingzhi? No matter what, Qingzhi was Old Madam Gu’s savior. How could the old madam herself be indifferent?","Just as he was about to ask, Kang Qingzhi, who was beside him, started sobbing. She lowered her head, and tears fell to the floor one by one. Her voice was trembling. “Brother, I’m sorry. I’ve embarrassed you.","“I know that because of the perfume competition, Sister Xi Xi has always hated me. I wanted to take advantage of the banquet and wait for Sister Xi Xi to be in a good mood before explaining myself to her, but Sister Xi Xi refused to listen to me. In her eyes, I framed her with Xu Ling and almost caused her to lose her reputation. It’s normal for her to not be willing to forgive me. It doesn’t matter how she misunderstood me, but I was afraid that she would misunderstand you and Dad. She even said... she wanted to cut ties with you. I... I was just too agitated, so I said a few angry words.”","Seeing that his sister was crying so aggrievedly, Kang Jichuan hurriedly comforted her softly. “Qingzhi, don’t cry anymore. I know you’re kind...”","Kang Qingzhi raised her head. Her round eyes and small nose were red, and her voice was soft. “Brother, I don’t have any ill intentions. I just don’t want you and Dad to be sad, so I looked for Sister Xi Xi to explain. I didn’t expect her to misunderstand even more. I... I’ve let you and Dad down...”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with love, and his voice was extremely gentle. “Qingzhi, you don’t have to apologize. This isn’t your fault.”","His heart ached. Qingzhi had good intentions. She did it for them and the Kang family, but Xi Xi...","Xi Xi had suffered in the perfume competition, but Qingzhi could not be blamed for this. Qingzhi had suffered today, but she did not criticize Xi Xi. Instead, she kept explaining for Xi Xi.","A trace of anger surged out of Kang Jichuan for no reason. He frowned unhappily. “Why didn’t Old Madam Gu speak up for you just now? You’re her savior, yet she doesn’t care about your relationship at all...”","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with resentment, and her sharp nails almost dug into her palms.","Yes! The Gu family actually did not care about their relationship at all. In that case, they could not blame her for being heartless!","Qiao Xi pushed her into the pond, causing her to soak in the cold water for half an hour. She had to take revenge today. It seemed that she could only take out her trump card in advance!"]},{"number":1554,"title":"Chapter 1554 You’re The One Who Should Be Mocked","paragraphs":["1554 You’re The One Who Should Be Mocked","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes narrowed slightly, and her expression was extremely vicious. Her illness could only be treated with Qiao Xi’s blood. If her brother knew that her condition had worsened, what would he do?","She turned around and swallowed a pill when Kang Jichuan was not paying attention. Not long after, her body went limp and she fell into Kang Jichuan’s arms.","“Qingzhi? Qingzhi!”","Kang Qingzhi’s gaze was confused, and her face was as pale as paper. She said with difficulty, “Brother... I... I feel so uncomfortable.”","“Qingzhi!” Kang Jichuan roared, his eyes filled with sorrow. Then, he picked Kang Qingzhi up by the waist and hurriedly rushed to the car. After getting into the car, he ordered the chauffeur loudly, “Qingzhi’s illness has acted up! Quickly return to the villa!”","It had been a long time since Qingzhi’s illness acted up. When they left Y Nation, Doctor Hu said that Qingzhi’s condition had temporarily stabilized and she could come to Li City with them. They originally came to Li City to help Qingzhi recuperate, but now...","It was Qiao Xi! It was because of her that Qingzhi fell into the water. Qingzhi had been weak and sick since she was young. She was in the cold water for so long. Right on the heels of that, she was suspected and mocked by everyone, which was why she fell sick!","Kang Jichuan gritted his teeth as resentment arose in his heart.","Why was Qiao Xi bullying Qingzhi? Qingzhi was an orphan, and her health was not good. It was so difficult for her to survive. Xi Xi was Qingzhi’s sister. It was fine that she did not have the slightest affection for her, but she actually wanted to kill Qingzhi!","Suddenly, something flashed past Kang Jichuan’s mind. Five years ago, when Qingzhi’s illness acted up and she was incurable, it was only after Xi Xi’s blood was used that her illness was under control. Now, Qingzhi’s illness had acted up again...","His Adam’s apple bobbed as he lowered his eyes to look at his sister, whose face was pale as she leaned into his arms. At this moment, her breathing was weak and her brows were tightly furrowed. It was as if she was going to die in his arms the next second. He secretly made a decision.","This time, Qingzhi’s illness acted up because of Xi Xi. In that case, Xi Xi should be responsible for Qingzhi’s illness. This was her responsibility!","Kang Jichuan took a deep breath. Whether it was in the past or now, he could only choose one sister.","At the Gu family’s old residence.","Gu Weiming sat on the chair dispiritedly and was forced to hand the shares and inheritance to Gu Yao.","Back then, when he and Huang Lilan joined forces to kill Lu Qingyun, torture Gu Zheng, and pave the way for Lu Yan to take over the power, his future was already destined.","No one in the huge Gu family was on his side. They all supported Old Madam Gu’s decision. After Gu Weiming signed the last transfer document, he looked at Gu Yao with a complicated expression. “Ah Yao, I always thought that you were an ignorant and incompetent hedonistic son. Who would have thought that you would snatch everything from me in the end?”","Gu Yao’s expression was a little unnatural. After all, Gu Weiming had been his father for so many years. Whether Gu Weiming was sincere or not, Gu Yao had been given a superior life, a noble identity, and endless money all these years. If he had not come to the Gu family, he might have ended up living on the streets.","Actually, he was grateful to Gu Weiming, but the father-son relationship dissipated with a little disappointment.","Gu Weiming stared fixedly at Gu Yao. After a long silence, he suddenly laughed out loud. “Gu Yao! You’re so stupid! Why don’t you hate Gu Zheng? If he hadn’t exposed those secrets, you would’ve always been the noble second young master of the Gu family and not an orphan with an unknown identity. You actually treat Gu Zheng as your eldest brother. How laughable!”","Qiao Xi frowned and was about to speak when she heard Gu Yao say indifferently, “It’s not funny.","“You’re right. I’m just an outsider with an unknown identity, but I’ve become the head of the Gu family. Now that I’m the head of the Gu family, the entire Gu family has to listen to my orders.","“There are so many descendants in this huge Gu family, but in the end, the family business fell into the hands of an orphan without the Gu family’s bloodline. Aren’t you the one who should be mocked? Moreover, I got to this position because I received the support of the Gu family. As a true descendant of the Gu family, you don’t have anyone’s support. You should reflect on yourself.”","Gu Weiming’s expression froze.","Gu Yao looked at him indifferently and turned to walk to Qiao Xi’s side.","The surroundings suddenly fell silent. Gu Weiming widened his eyes and watched the scene. He suddenly stood up and shouted, “Gu Yao! Don’t you want to know who your biological parents are? If you kneel down and beg me now, I can tell you a clue. Otherwise, you can forget about finding your biological parents forever!”"]},{"number":1555,"title":"Chapter 1555 Another Chess Piece","paragraphs":["1555 Another Chess Piece","Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned cold as she glanced at Gu Zheng who was beside her. His eyes were calm, but Qiao Xi could clearly feel the coldness emanating from his body.","Gu Zheng looked cold to Gu Yao on the surface. He even beat him up every now and then, but Qiao Xi knew in her heart how much Gu Zheng valued his younger brother. He did not want Gu Yao to be hurt at all. During this period of time, Gu Zheng had also been secretly looking for Gu Yao’s biological parents, but there were no clues. Now that he heard Gu Weiming mention it, he should be suspecting whether Gu Weiming’s words were trustworthy.","Gu Weiming was Gu Yao’s adoptive father and the head of the Gu family at that time. Logically speaking, he would not accept a child of unknown origin, so it was very likely that he knew Gu Yao’s identity.","Gu Yao’s expression froze. He had always thought that he was just an orphan Huang Lilan had taken from the orphanage, but after hearing Gu Weiming’s words, he realized that things were not that simple.","!!","“Aren’t you curious why Huang Lilan and I adopted you? I clearly already have two biological sons, so why did I raise someone else’s child?” As if seeing Gu Yao’s expression darken, Gu Weiming’s tone was filled with pride. “Perhaps you think that it’s because of Lu Yan, but no one knows our plan at all. We had already swapped Gu Zheng’s and Lu Yan’s identities. Did we adopt you just to show off how outstanding Lu Yan is? Actually, it doesn’t matter whether you’re around or not!”","Yes! Thinking about it carefully, Gu Yao was like an additional chess piece in Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan’s plan. Whether he existed or not did not affect the plan at all.","Originally, Qiao Xi thought that Huang Lilan adopted Gu Yao only to highlight how outstanding Lu Yan was and let Lu Yan obtain the inheritance more smoothly. However, if Gu Yao did not exist at all, Lu Yan’s rise to power might have been even smoother. Hence, they must have other motives for adopting Gu Yao.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. Gu Weiming directly revealed his plan of swapping his two sons in front of Gu Zheng. He was not afraid of angering Gu Zheng at all. He was sure that Gu Zheng was afraid that Gu Yao would be hurt, so for Gu Yao’s sake, Gu Zheng would not dare to attack him. Instead, he had to treat him well.","Gu Yao lowered his eyes, making it impossible to see his emotions.","Gu Weiming’s voice carried a trace of sinisterness. “Gu Yao, you’re already the head of the Gu family, but you don’t have any relatives by your side. You must really want to know who your biological parents are! You must also want to know how your biological parents reacted after losing you!","“I can tell you clearly that it wasn’t a coincidence that you came to the Gu family. It was a conspiracy. Don’t you want to know who’s behind all this?”","Gu Weiming asked word by word as if he was a demon tempting the young man to fall into hell.","Qiao Xi’s eyes gradually turned cold. She and Gu Zheng had investigated Gu Yao’s background, but there were no clues. It was as if everything had been deliberately erased.","However, she remembered that Old Madam Yin had once mentioned that Gu Yao and Yue Tangqing were a little similar.","Yue Tangqing was a genius pianist from 20 years ago. The Yue family was once a reputable family in the capital, but because of some things, the Yue family fell bit by bit. Some of the descendants of the Yue family died, while others went crazy. Yue Tangqing also went missing.","At that time, Qiao Xi also had her doubts and immediately investigated the Yue family. However, when she found out that the Yue family did not have a missing son, she did not continue investigating.","Now that Gu Weiming said that Gu Yao being adopted by the Gu family was a conspiracy, it meant that Gu Yao’s identity was definitely not ordinary!","The surroundings were silent, and Gu Weiming became even prouder. He was sure that Gu Yao must want to find his biological parents, so he continued to deceive him. “Ah Yao, you know how I’ve been treating you all these years. You’re a famous good-for-nothing young master in Li City. Once anything happened, I’d help you settle it. No matter what you wanted, I’ve never refused. I dote on you as my biological son!","“You stole my shares today, but I don’t blame you. After all, this wasn’t your idea alone. As long as you return the shares and the position of the head of the family to me now, I’ll tell you everything about the past, alright?”","Qiao Xi frowned. If Gu Yao really returned the shares and the position of the head of the family to Gu Weiming, then all Gu Zheng’s efforts and plans would be in vain. However, Qiao Xi could also understand Gu Yao’s feelings. Who wanted to live without knowing their background?","Gu Weiming waited for a long time before Gu Yao slowly looked up and chuckled. “Dad.”"]},{"number":1556,"title":"Chapter 1556 He Found A Clue","paragraphs":["1556 He Found A Clue","“Ah Yao, you’re such a good child. I know you...” Gu Weiming was instantly overjoyed and praised Gu Yao excitedly.","However, before he could finish, he heard Gu Yao’s cold voice. “Dad, in your heart, am I still that impulsive, angry, ignorant, and incompetent good-for-nothing?”","His voice carried the unique coldness and gentleness of a young man, but it made Gu Weiming’s body tense up instantly.","Gu Yao’s eyes were filled with mockery. “Now that I’m the head of the Gu family, I can investigate it myself. Why should I be threatened by you? Do you still think I’m the same person as before? Or the idiot who was fooled by you and deliberately raised to be useless? After so many years, everyone has changed. Only you’re still as naive as before. You haven’t improved at all!”","!!","Qiao Xi: “...”","Gu Weiming’s expression froze. He gritted his teeth and could not say a word.","“I’m still willing to call you ‘Dad’ now because you gave me the identity of Young Master Gu and let me eat my fill and wear warm clothes. I’m even more grateful to you for letting me have Gu Zheng as my brother.” Gu Yao paused, and his voice suddenly became a little difficult. “Gu Zheng has been teaching me since I was young, while my parents were happy and carefree. If it weren’t for Gu Zheng, my life would have been ruined by you long ago.","“Dad, I know that in your eyes, I’ve always been a sentimental person who lets my emotions affect my decisions, but...”","For some reason, Gu Weiming suddenly became nervous.","Without a doubt, Gu Yao was indeed a person who let his emotions affect his decisions. They had always wanted to use Gu Yao to deal with Gu Zheng, but they did not expect the brothers’ relationship to grow stronger after all these years of companionship.","Gu Yao smirked. “Since you know what kind of person I am, you should know that Gu Zheng and I have a deep relationship. Although we’re not related by blood, I treat him as my real family, so I won’t betray Gu Zheng no matter what.","“I really want to know who my biological parents are, but I can investigate it myself, and Gu Zheng can help me. Why must I rely on you? Moreover, I’ve long known that I’m not your biological son, but I’ve never asked you about my biological parents. Why haven’t you thought that I’ve already found clues?”","Had he found a clue?","Gu Weiming’s eyes widened instantly, and his face alternated between green and white.","No! What happened back then was so secretive. It would not be easy for Gu Yao to find out. How could he have found out something so soon?","If Gu Yao had really found out something, he would no longer have anything to threaten Gu Yao with. He would not have a chance to make a comeback.","“Alright.” Gu Yao glanced at Gu Weiming indifferently, then turned to look at Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng with a big smile. “Alright, alright. I’m about to starve to death. Let’s go eat!”","Seeing his nonchalant look, Gu Weiming’s body swayed slightly.","He suddenly felt that he was really stupid. Gu Yao must have investigated his biological parents a long time ago. Gu Yao had never asked him about it, so he must have found some clues. Now that he was using this matter to threaten Gu Yao, the last bit of their relationship was gone.","Gu Weiming fell onto the chair, his expression gradually turning gray.","...","After Gu Zheng and the other two left the banquet hall, Gu Zheng suddenly grabbed Gu Yao’s arm and said in a low voice, “I’ve indeed found a clue. Follow me.”","Only then did Qiao Xi realize that Gu Yao’s nonchalant look just now was all an act for Gu Weiming. Actually, he did not find any clues. He just wanted Gu Weiming to know that this method was no longer feasible. He would not betray Gu Zheng.","Gu Yao smiled in embarrassment. “Gu Zheng, forget it. It doesn’t matter whether I find my biological parents or not. You, Qiao Xi, and Grandma are enough for me.”","Gu Zheng looked at him seriously. “You should know about these things.”","“What is it?” Gu Yao looked confused. Since he was not looking for his biological parents anymore, what else should he know?","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. She suddenly recalled that Gu Zheng had met Xu Zhi before entering the banquet hall. He had gone as Mo Yuan. In other words...","Her expression changed. In other words, Gu Yao being adopted by the Gu family was related to the Xu family? It must be the Xu family in the capital!","Gu Yao scratched his head and obediently followed Gu Zheng to the tearoom. Qiao Xi hurriedly followed.","A moment later, Gu Yao’s expression changed drastically, and his lips trembled slightly. “Gu Zheng, this... This is all true?”"]},{"number":1557,"title":"Chapter 1557 The Relationship Between The Kang And Yao Families","paragraphs":["1557 The Relationship Between The Kang And Yao Families","Qiao Xi stood at the door and waited. She did not know the past of the families in the capital, nor did she know what grudges or secrets there were between them. However, if it was really like the clue Gu Zheng had found, that some people had used schemes and plots to snatch their current glory and wealth, it was really despicable.","Gu Yao was probably a child from a certain family in the capital who was wandering outside. However, because the situation was complicated at that time, Gu Zheng could not confirm which family Gu Yao was from, so the clues were cut off here.","Gu Yao took a deep breath and asked, “Who are the families that are related to the Xu family? We should be able to find your family if we eliminate them one by one. If my biological parents really did do that, there’s no need for us to acknowledge each other anymore.”","Gu Zheng looked up at him. “Don’t take Gu Weiming’s words to heart. We won’t know the truth until we investigate everything clearly.”","After the two of them finished chatting, Gu Zheng stood up. “Let’s go see Grandma.”","At nine in the evening, Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi left the Gu family’s old residence after dinner.","On the way, Qiao Xi asked curiously, “What clues have you found? Is Gu Yao really a child of a family in the capital?”","Gu Zheng nodded, then looked at Qiao Xi with a complicated gaze. Not only had he found out about Gu Yao, but he had also found out about the Situ family.","Previously, when the grand old master of the Situ family came to Li City, he had given Xi Xi an expensive porcelain vase. That porcelain vase was the Situ family’s heirloom. The grand old master had specially prepared it for his great-granddaughter who had led a wandering life. When he gave it to Xi Xi, it could not help but make others think that Xi Xi was from the Situ family.","However... the Situ family should have already received the news that the Kang family had come to Li City this time. However, they did not do anything. Someone suspected that Grand Old Master Situ had made a mistake. Perhaps he just liked Qiao Xi, so he gave her a porcelain vase.","Gu Zheng, on the other hand, thought that something was wrong with this matter. After a careful investigation, he actually found some clues. Back then, the Situ and Yue families were plotted against. The whereabouts of the two heads of the Situ family was unknown. Seeing that the century-old families were about to collapse, all the major families in the capital were waiting to devour them. The Kang family was probably one of them.","Hence, when the Kang family came to Li City this time, the Situ family did not appear. They were probably worried that the Kang family would do something bad to Xi Xi. However, the prerequisite for all their guesses was that Xi Xi was indeed a child of the Situ family.","Gu Zheng could not confirm that Xi Xi was a descendant of the Situ family, but Kang Jichuan had acknowledged Xi Xi five years ago.","Gu Zheng pulled Qiao Xi into his arms and gently stroked her head. “Don’t worry, I’ll handle everything.”","Qiao Xi nodded, and her mood seemed to have calmed down a little. Right on the heels of that, his cold voice sounded in her ears again. “Yao Junjie will be returning to Li City soon.”","Yao Junjie?","This name suddenly sounded a little unfamiliar, but Qiao Xi would not forget it. He was Yao Mengqing’s brother, the adopted son of the Yao family. He was the person who had agreed to give her Yao Corporation’s shares.","Gu Zheng said casually, “I told you before that the Kang family and the Yao family are related. Yao Junjie’s surname was originally Kang, and there was originally a Kang family in Li City. The old heads of the Kang family in Y Nation and the Kang family in Li City are half-brothers. After Kang Ru and Yao Junjie’s parents took over the family, the two families were also in contact.","“Yao Junjie’s mother is from the Yao family. After his parents passed away, he was sent to live with the Yao family. After that, the Kang family in Y Nation and Li City completely lost contact. I don’t know what happened after that. Yao Junjie, whose career was originally at its peak overseas, suddenly came back. He wants to start afresh in Li City.","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. “I remember that Kang Jichuan has a company in Li City.”","In the past, she was a little curious about why Kang Jichuan always came to Li City. Later on, she realized that the Kang family had opened a cosmetics company in Li City and had been operating it for many years.","Back then, the Kang family had a total of two brothers. The head of the Kang family in Y Nation inherited the title of nobility, while Yao Junjie’s grandfather was a famous businessman. After Yao Junjie’s grandfather and parents passed away one after another, Li City’s assets fell into the hands of Yao Mengqing’s grandfather and became the later Yao Corporation. Yao Junjie was just a nominal figure in this company. He did not have to appear when he had nothing to do. Once something happened to Yao Corporation, he would appear to clean up the mess for the Yao family.","Not only was Yao Junjie Gu Zheng’s friend, but Yao Mengqing, who was such an arrogant person, also respected her brother so much. It was impossible for him to be just an adopted son without any real power. Now that he had suddenly announced his return to Li City when Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan were here, it was too strange.","However, Qiao Xi felt that Yao Junjie was no threat to her and Gu Zheng. Moreover, he had already expressed his sincerity by giving her so many shares."]},{"number":1558,"title":"Chapter 1558 You Have To Make A Choice","paragraphs":["1558 You Have To Make A Choice","“Is Yao Junjie in contact with Kang Jichuan? The Yao family’s business is on the rise. I don’t think anyone wants him to come back at this time, right?”","Gu Zheng smiled lightly. “Yao Junjie isn’t an impulsive person. Since he chose to come back at this time, he has the confidence to go against the Kang family. Moreover, if Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan want to gain a foothold in Li City, they still have to rely on Yao Junjie.”","Go against?","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed. Did Gu Zheng mean that Yao Junjie and the Kang family of Y Nation were not on good terms but were enemies?","!!","...","At the Kang family’s villa.","Kang Qingzhi’s sudden relapse broke the peace of the Kang family. She was the beloved daughter of the Kang family and had been weak and sick since she was young. Originally, the doctor had said that she would die five years ago, but she survived until she was 20 years old. Her sudden relapse at this time inevitably made the entire Kang family worried.","However, before coming to Li City, Doctor Hu had clearly said that her condition was very stable. Why did her illness suddenly flare up?","Old Madam Kang rushed to the bed in a panic and shouted, “Qingzhi! What’s going on? She was fine when she went out today. Why did Qingzhi suddenly fall sick after attending the banquet? Did something happen in the Gu family?”","Kang Jichuan felt as if a rock was stuck in his throat. He pursed his lips and still did not tell Old Madam Kang what had happened in the Gu family. Qingzhi had done everything for the Kang family. Xi Xi was unwilling to listen, so Qingzhi said something wrong in a moment of anger, causing the current consequences.","Xi Xi was also in the wrong here. Qingzhi could not be blamed for this!","However, Kang Jichuan’s silence only enraged Old Madam Kang. She instantly flew into a rage. “I know it even without you saying it! That b*tch Qiao Xi must have bullied Qingzhi!","“Qingzhi saved Old Madam Gu and is the most respected guest in the Gu family. No one else dares to offend her at all. Only that b*tch dares to bully Qingzhi! Qingzhi is weak and sick to begin with, but Qiao Xi actually caused Qingzhi to fall sick. She’s a vicious b*tch! If something happens to Qingzhi, I won’t let her off!”","Kang Jichuan’s expression darkened. He wanted to explain, but when he saw Kang Qingzhi’s pale face, he could not say anything.","Old Madam Kang was so angry that her face was livid. Her eyes were filled with viciousness as she shouted at the top of her voice, “Let me tell you, if you want that little b*tch to enter the Kang family, you’ll have to kill me first!”","Kang Jichuan frowned and did not say anything. Kang Ru said awkwardly, “Mom...”","“Kang Ru, I really don’t understand why you insist on bringing that little b*tch back. She hasn’t even entered the house yet and she has already caused Qingzhi’s illness to flare up. Qingzhi is the daughter who has been by your side for more than ten years! Even if you’re not related by blood, she’s still your daughter! If you bring that b*tch back, you’ll be cutting off Qingzhi’s life!”","Old Madam Kang pointed at Kang Ru with a trembling finger and said in exasperation, “You have to make a choice for me. Do you want Qiao Xi or me and Qingzhi? I’ll put it this way today. If Qingzhi can’t recover, I’ll make Qiao Xi pay the price!”","Pay the price?","Kang Ru only felt his mind buzzing. No matter what Xi Xi had done, she was still his biological daughter. How could he bear to attack his daughter?","Qingzhi was clearly so obedient, sensible, and understanding. Why did Xi Xi always have conflicts with Qingzhi? What exactly happened this time?","If Qingzhi’s body really could not recover or she could not wake up, it would be impossible for Xi Xi to return to the Kang family, much less return to Y Nation with him.","All these years, his wish had been to find Yunqiu and his daughter. After knowing that Yunqiu had passed away, his only wish was to let his daughter return to his side. Now, he could not even fulfill this small request? Was he destined to not be able to reunite with his daughter in this life?","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with sorrow, and Kang Jichuan saw everything. He knew his father’s thoughts very well. He did not want to give up on his biological sister, Xi Xi, either, but Xi Xi had caused Qingzhi’s illness to flare up. With Grandma’s character, it was absolutely impossible for her to agree to let Xi Xi return to the Kang family unless... Xi Xi could let Qingzhi’s body recover.","As long as Xi Xi could save Qingzhi and let her body recover to its original state, Grandma might agree to let her join the family.","Xi Xi would be the daughter of the Kang family and would be known as the person who saved Qingzhi. Everyone in the Kang family would be grateful to her, but the problem now was whether Xi Xi was willing to donate her blood to Qingzhi.","Five years ago, Xi Xi refused without hesitation, which made him use some methods to obtain Xi Xi’s blood. Five years later, Xi Xi would probably still not agree."]},{"number":1559,"title":"Chapter 1559 Won’t Do Anything If There’s No Benefit","paragraphs":["1559 Won’t Do Anything If There’s No Benefit","Kang Jichuan suddenly lowered his voice. “Dad, I know what you’re thinking. I have an idea that can change Grandma’s opinion of Xi Xi.”","Kang Ru’s eyes lit up. “What idea?”","“But this idea might... make Xi Xi suffer.” Kang Jichuan pretended to be troubled, but he had already made up his mind.","“Let Xi Xi suffer a little?” Kang Ru had a puzzled expression, then he said firmly, “As long as we can let Xi Xi return to the Kang family and return to Y Nation with me to become the noble daughter of the Kang family, it doesn’t matter if she suffers. Xi Xi should understand us.”","Kang Jichuan was a little uneasy and echoed, “Yes! As long as Xi Xi can come back and reunite with our family, it’s worth it to suffer a little. She definitely won’t blame us.”","They were related by blood, so Xi Xi should really want to live with them. In that case... it shouldn’t be a problem for her to suffer a little, right?","Just as Kang Jichuan took a deep breath and was about to say his thoughts—","The assistant rushed in and panted. “Sir, Young Master, um...”","“What’s wrong?” Kang Jichuan was a little unhappy to be suddenly interrupted.","“Yao Junjie has returned to Li City.” The assistant panted and continued, “He just got off the plane. He even announced to the public that he would be developing in the country from now on!”","Yao Junjie!","This name had not appeared for a long time, but when Kang Jichuan heard it again, it still made his heart skip a beat. A trace of panic flashed past his eyes. “Why did he suddenly come back?”","He was a member of the Kang family who had changed his surname to Yao. Kang Jichuan thought that he was a good-for-nothing, but Yao Junjie had unknowingly taken over Yao Corporation’s business. However, Yao Junjie had not been in contact with them for a long time. Both parties were developing their own businesses. Now that he had his own business in H Nation, why did he suddenly return to the country?","Back then, after the old master passed away, the two brothers of the Kang family developed their own businesses. Their family inherited the title of nobility in Y Nation and developed their own company. Yao Junjie’s parents had always been managing the company in Li City with the Yao family.","Now that Yao Mengqing was dead, the Yao family’s shares were all in Yao Junjie’s hands. Moreover, everyone thought that Yao Junjie was capable and had a good character. However, Kang Jichuan felt that Yao Junjie could not be underestimated. He looked gentle on the surface, but there were too many emotions hidden in his eyes. He was like a venomous snake hiding in the dark. He would kill you if you were careless.","Yao Junjie was a person who did not do anything if it did not benefit him. He must have a special purpose for returning to Li City this time.","Kang Ru had always been simple-minded and did not think too much about it. Instead, he sighed. “Junjie’s parents passed away a long time ago. He’s quite pitiful. It’s good that he’s willing to return to his hometown to develop. At least, he’s very familiar with this environment.”","Kang Jichuan’s expression suddenly darkened. Did Yao Junjie’s return have to do with Qiao Xi?","Back then, Yao Mengqing founded Sunshine in Li City. Yao Junjie and Gu Zheng made a deal. Moreover, the two of them seemed to have been in contact. In other words, they were allies?","The relationship between them was complicated. Kang Jichuan massaged his temples to wake himself up. Although he did not know what Yao Junjie’s intentions were, he at least understood that Yao Junjie must be up to something big this time.","What was more important than Yao Junjie was that Qingzhi’s body was about to collapse. He had to get Xi Xi’s blood as soon as possible.","Kang Jichuan sat by the bed for a while before getting up to go to the study to call Qiao Xi.","At the same time, in Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi’s phone rang. She glanced at the number on it and recalled that it seemed to be Kang Jichuan’s number.","Kang Qingzhi was sick, so Kang Jichuan must be very anxious at this time. Could it be that he suddenly called her for...","Qiao Xi instantly understood. Five years ago, her blood saved Kang Qingzhi’s life. Now that Kang Qingzhi’s illness had acted up again, Kang Jichuan could not help but ask her to donate her blood to Kang Qingzhi.","Kang Qingzhi had schemed against her time and again. Now, she even wanted her to donate her blood to Kang Qingzhi. No normal person would agree to this unreasonable request.","Qiao Xi had already guessed what Kang Jichuan would say, so she did not want to listen to it. She directly rejected the call and blocked his number. However, not long after, the landline of Longwan Residential rang.","Uncle Sheng was the one who picked up the call. “Hello, who is this?”","The other party’s tone was clearly a little impatient. “Is Qiao Xi there? Get her to answer the call.”"]},{"number":1560,"title":"Chapter 1560 Go To The Hospital To Get Your Brain Checked","paragraphs":["1560 Go To The Hospital To Get Your Brain Checked","Uncle Sheng had been a butler for so many years, so he could naturally tell that the other party’s tone was unfriendly. Hence, he asked again, “Sir, may I know who you are?”","The person on the other line tried his best to suppress his anger and said unhappily, “I’m Kang Jichuan. Give the phone to Qiao Xi.”","Kang Jichuan...","When Uncle Sheng heard this name, his heart was filled with disdain. It was definitely not a good thing for Young Master Kang to call Young Madam. He definitely wanted Young Madam to help Kang Qingzhi clear her name so that Kang Qingzhi could win the perfume competition.","He was silent for a few seconds, and when he spoke, his tone carried a trace of helplessness. “Mr. Kang, I’m really sorry. Our young madam isn’t at home. If you have anything to say, you can tell me first. I can help you pass the message.”","When Kang Jichuan thought of Kang Qingzhi, who was on the verge of death on the hospital bed, the anger in his heart surged.","Xi Xi had already caused Qingzhi to be unconscious, yet she still did not answer his calls. Where else could she be if she was not at home? Was she deliberately avoiding him?","His voice was filled with anger. “I said, get Qiao Xi to answer the phone!”","Uncle Sheng did not have a good impression of the Kang family. Previously, Kang Ru wanted to barge into Longwan Residential to see Young Madam. After that, the three of them came to Longwan Residential to visit. Kang Qingzhi pretended to be sick, and Kang Jichuan scolded Young Madam for it, saying that she insisted on making things difficult for Kang Qingzhi.","They were the ones who had rashly come to the house to disturb the master. When he could not rush back in time, they berated the young madam. How could there be such unreasonable people in the world?","Kang Jichuan was a brainless and blind fool. He had been played by that scheming woman, Kang Qingzhi, and now, he was even ordering Young Madam to answer the phone in such a tone. Who did he think he was?!","Uncle Sheng’s tone instantly turned cold. “Young Master Kang, what’s your relationship with our young madam?”","Kang Jichuan blurted out, “I’m her brother!”","“Brother?” Uncle Sheng pretended to be puzzled. “But I remember that Young Madam only has brothers from the Yin family. She doesn’t have any brothers with the surname Kang. Young Master Kang, did you make a mistake?”","Kang Jichuan was instantly infuriated. “What do you mean? I’m Xi Xi’s biological brother. How dare a butler like you interfere in the household’s private matters?”","“Biological brother?” Uncle Sheng asked coldly. “Then what reason do you have to look for Young Madam?”","“I...” Kang Jichuan was about to speak when he suddenly paused. How could he tell a butler about this?","At this moment, Uncle Sheng couldn’t care less about his identity and questioned, “I heard that Miss Kang is sick. Did you call to ask Young Madam to visit Miss Kang? In your opinion, Young Madam is Miss Kang’s sister. So if she doesn’t visit her, she’ll be considered heartless? If that’s the case, I advise you to quickly go to the hospital to get your brain checked!”","‘You should check when you got brain damage!’","Uncle Sheng did not say the last sentence. Instead, he just complained in his heart.","Kang Jichuan naturally heard the mockery in his tone, and the veins on his forehead twitched. A butler of Longwan Residential actually dared to mock the noble earl of Y Nation. He was indeed Xi Xi’s subordinate and was as unruly as her!","Perhaps Qiao Xi knew that he would call and deliberately let this old butler mock him!","He was furious, and his voice was trembling. “You... Shut up!”","“What?” Seeing that he was angry, Uncle Sheng was relieved. His tone became even more arrogant. “Young Master Kang, am I wrong? Miss Kang is sick because of herself. If you’re unconvinced, you can watch the Gu family’s surveillance footage. You keep saying that you’re Young Madam’s biological brother, but if I remember correctly, the Kang family hasn’t announced their relationship with Young Madam to the public yet.","“The Kang family dotes on their adopted daughter and doesn’t want to announce to the public that they have a biological daughter. Our young madam naturally doesn’t care, but you’ve provoked her time and again. You even used your status as her family to accuse her and blackmail her. Now, you’re even asking her to visit someone who framed her. Isn’t this a little too much?!”","Kang Jichuan was angered to the point his face turned red. A butler actually dared to speak to him like this? Could it be that he did not have any sympathy? Qingzhi was already unconscious now, while Qiao Xi was still fine. Why did they all think that Qiao Xi had been wronged?","Qingzhi was clearly the most pitiful person. She was an orphan. Although she was adopted by the Kang family, she had been weak and sick since she was young. She was tortured by illness. For the sake of letting Qiao Xi return to the Kang family, she had already given in step by step. Could it be that Qiao Xi would only feel happy if Qingzhi was really chased out of the Kang family?","“I’ll say it again. Get Qiao Xi to answer the phone!” Kang Jichuan raised his voice and retorted, “Qingqing is kind-hearted. What right do you have to say that about her? Qiao Xi must have said something in front of you that you have such thoughts about Qingzhi!”"]},{"number":1561,"title":"Chapter 1561 Grandpa’s Letter","paragraphs":["1561 Grandpa’s Letter","“Tell Qiao Xi that Qingzhi will always be the daughter of the Kang family. If she continues to spread rumors about Qingzhi and slander her reputation, our Kang family will sue all of you in court. I have to seek justice for Qingzhi!”","“Is there something wrong with you?!” Uncle Sheng snorted. “Young Master Kang, perhaps there’s something wrong with your eyes and brain. The sooner you realize it, the sooner you can treat your issues!”","With that, Uncle Sheng hung up.","The dignified earl of Y Nation was in charge of the Kang family’s business. Why was he so easily deceived by Kang Qingzhi?","Thinking of Kang Jichuan’s words just now, Uncle Sheng’s heart could not help but ache.","He had long heard that at the Gu family’s banquet last night, Kang Qingzhi deliberately framed Young Madam and it was all captured by one of the surveillance cameras. However, Kang Jichuan called to question Young Madam and look for trouble.","That adopted daughter would fall sick at any time to gain sympathy. In the eyes of the Kang family, no matter what happened between her and Young Madam, it was ultimately Young Madam’s fault.","Uncle Sheng’s heart was filled with anger. He waved at the girl beside him. “Xiao Lan, come here for a moment.”","Xiao Lan leaned forward, and Uncle Sheng said in a low voice, “Contact someone you know and spread the news of what happened at the banquet yesterday. Then, find a famous lip-reading expert. When the expert comes, get him to see me directly.","“Tsk! Kang Jichuan still wants to sue us? How laughable! Does he think I’m not telling the truth? Since he doesn’t recognize this fact, I’ll let everyone see what Kang Qingzhi has done!”","Xiao Lan smiled and promised, “No problem, Uncle Sheng!”","At this moment, in the Kang family’s villa, Kang Jichuan was so angry that he smashed the cup on the table.","All these years, he had always appeared as a gentle and elegant young master. Now, he was actually angered by a small butler.","Xi Xi must have said something at home, causing the butler to not take him seriously!","Five years ago, although Xi Xi and Qingzhi did not have a good relationship, at least she still acknowledged him as her brother. Now, she did not even pick up his calls. Seeing that Qingzhi was about to collapse, Qiao Xi did not pity her at all. She even got the butler to mock and patronize him. Qiao Xi was really going too far!","At this moment, Kang Jichuan no longer felt guilty toward Qiao Xi. His heart was filled with anger and unwillingness.","Qingzhi’s illness acted up because of Qiao Xi. He had to seek an explanation for Qingzhi. No matter what, he had to bring Qiao Xi over to donate her blood to Qingzhi’s blood!","After making up his mind, Kang Jichuan immediately left.","At this moment, in the backyard of Longwan Residential.","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi were sipping tea comfortably. The fragrance of tea surrounded them. Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle. “Kang Jichuan is here.”","Qiao Xi was truly helpless. Kang Jichuan did not even care about his reputation for Kang Qingzhi?","She took a sip of hot tea and narrowed her eyes. “When Kang Jichuan came to look for me to acknowledge him, he only came to Longwan Residential a few times. Now, for Kang Qingzhi’s sake, he first called to harass me before coming over directly.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as a trace of coldness flashed past his eyes.","“Let him in.” Qiao Xi stretched lazily with an indifferent expression. “Kang Qingzhi suddenly fell sick, so he’ll definitely covet my blood again. I’m very curious about who told him the secret about my blood. Why don’t we take this opportunity to test if it’s He Weinian?","“But where did He Weinian find out about it? Is it possible that this matter involves other families, or is it a family we’ve never paid attention to?”","Gu Zheng looked at her with a burning gaze. “What did you find out?”","“Grandpa wrote to me.” Qiao Xi’s eyes were slightly sad. After calming down for a while, she said again, “He’s in the capital.”","“In order to avoid others from finding out, he got someone from Ling Pavilion to send me the letter. He said that he’s in the capital, but he can’t meet me. He’s doing this to protect me.","“Only the people closest to me should know the secret of my blood. During this period of time, the secret of my blood has spread to some people. I keep having the feeling that someone is secretly doing research. Grandpa might be hiding in a research base in the capital.”","Qiao Xi took a deep breath, and her voice was filled with worry. “I know that Grandpa’s current situation is very dangerous. He seems to be investigating something that happened many years ago, and this matter involves many people. It’s even related to the Yin and Xia families as well as your mother, Lu Qingyun. The matter also includes my identity.”","According to the current clues, Qiao Xi felt that the person her grandfather wanted to investigate was the person who spread the secret of her blood. That was why she wanted to know how Kang Jichuan knew the secret of her blood."]},{"number":1562,"title":"Chapter 1562 Which Home Are You Bringing Her Back To?","paragraphs":["1562 Which Home Are You Bringing Her Back To?","It was very likely that the Kang family was behind some kind of research. Of course, it was also possible that they were just a shield used by others to hide their identities. Now that Kang Jichuan had come to visit, Qiao Xi naturally would not miss the opportunity to gather information.","At the thought of this, Qiao Xi picked up her phone and sent Qin An a message. A moment later, Song Shiyu walked over with Kang Jichuan.","Kang Jichuan said anxiously, “Xi Xi, come home with me now!”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and ignored him. Gu Zheng sneered. “Young Master Kang, Longwan Residential is Xi Xi’s home. Are you bringing her back to that house?”","!!","Kang Jichuan’s expression froze, then he said self-righteously, “Although Xi Xi is married to you, she’s still a member of our Kang family. Of course, I have to bring her back to the Kang family!”","Before Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng could respond, Kang Jichuan bent down slightly and said extremely anxiously, “Xi Xi, the car is still waiting outside. Quickly come back with me!”","Uncle Sheng and Xiao Lan looked at each other in disdain.","This man was the earl of Y Nation? He barged into Longwan Residential and wanted to take Young Madam away without saying anything. He was unwilling to say why. Moreover, Young Madam did not acknowledge him as her brother at all. What right did he have to bring her to the Kang family with him?","As soon as Kang Jichuan finished speaking, Qiao Xi elegantly put down the teacup and sneered. “Young Master Kang, why are you in such a rush to get me to go back with you?”","Kang Jichuan’s words were instantly stuck in his throat. He subconsciously glanced at Gu Zheng and said guiltily, “I... Of course, I came to look for you because you have something urgent to attend to. You’ll know when you go back with me.”","“Young Master Kang.” Gu Zheng slowly looked up, his light brown eyes filled with coldness. “You’re taking Xi Xi away without telling me the reason. Are you looking down on me?”","Kang Jichuan choked. Of course, he did not dare to offend Gu Zheng, but Xi Xi was his biological sister. Was there a problem with him taking Xi Xi away?","“President Gu, Xi Xi and I are siblings. Do I need a reason to take her away? It’s just that the matter is urgent, so I want to bring Xi Xi away first.”","“I’m sorry.” Gu Zheng had a cold smile on the corners of his mouth as he said casually, “Xi Xi has been very busy recently and doesn’t have time to care about the Kang family’s matters. Moreover, if you don’t give me a reasonable explanation, I’ll absolutely not agree to let you take Xi Xi away. Moreover, it’s been so long since you and Mr. Kang came to visit to acknowledge Xi Xi, but you still haven’t announced Xi Xi’s identity. Xi Xi has nothing to do with the Kang family now, so you have no right to take Xi Xi away.","“If you still refuse to let the matter go, I’ll call the police immediately and sue you for trespassing and kidnapping my wife. Have you thought it through? Are you sure you want to go this far?”","Kang Jichuan’s face instantly turned pale. During this period of time, the Kang family had not announced Xi Xi’s identity. It was his and his father’s fault for not thinking things through, but they were worried that Qingzhi would not be able to accept it. Moreover, Grandma had been objecting, so he and his father were in a difficult position.","At this moment, his expression was extremely ugly. After a moment of silence, he suddenly gritted his teeth and said, “Xi Xi, I know you blame your brother and father for not announcing your identity to the public, but we have our reasons. I promise you that as long as the Kang family’s perfume business opens and officially enters the hot market, Dad and I will immediately announce that you’re the daughter of the Kang family. Just wait a little longer, okay?”","Qiao Xi was drinking tea and eating pastries when she heard Kang Jichuan suddenly speak to her. She had a puzzled expression.","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not answer, Kang Jichuan confirmed her thoughts. His tone carried a trace of toughness. “When the time is right, you’ll naturally be able to return to the Kang family. You shouldn’t be throwing a tantrum with us. The Kang family’s blood flows in your veins, so you should listen to me and Dad. Follow me now!”","With that, Kang Jichuan reached out to pull Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi shook off his hand and raised her eyebrows as she looked at him. “Young Master Kang, seeing as you have the time, you should’ve explained your purpose for coming from the start. You’re not saying anything because you’re afraid that I won’t go back with you if you did.”","Kang Jichuan’s expression was slightly stiff, then he looked at Qiao Xi with a disappointed expression. They were clearly family! Why didn’t Xi Xi trust him? As long as she followed him back to the Kang family, she would naturally know.","He originally thought that Gu Zheng was unwilling to let Xi Xi go back with him, but now, it seemed that Xi Xi was unwilling!","Kang Jichuan’s expression darkened. “Xi Xi...”","“I know it without needing you to say it. It’s because of Kang Qingzhi, right?!” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with ridicule as she chuckled. “I heard that Kang Qingzhi has been sick recently. Could it be that you came to look for me to ask me to apologize to her?”","The moment that was said, the surrounding people looked at Kang Jichuan with unfriendly gazes."]},{"number":1563,"title":"Chapter 1563 A Waste Of Words","paragraphs":["1563 A Waste Of Words","Gu Zheng’s voice was low. “I heard that you called today. Uncle Sheng had already made himself clear on the phone. All the guests present saw what happened at the Gu family’s banquet. It’s already kind of us not to settle the score with Miss Kang. Now, you’re actually forcing Xi Xi to apologize to her?”","Kang Jichuan’s face flushed red. That was exactly what he came to do. After all, Qing Zhi’s illness had acted up. Xi Xi was mainly responsible for it. It was reasonable for her to apologize to Qing Zhi. If Xi Xi insisted on not apologizing and donating her blood to Qing Zhi, Grandma would not agree to Xi Xi returning to the Kang family. He was doing this for Xi Xi’s sake!","However, looking at everyone’s disdainful gazes, Kang Jichuan found it difficult to say what was on his mind.","“Young Master Kang, don’t you think your actions are too much?” Uncle Sheng’s tone was unfriendly. “If you’re here for this matter, then don’t waste your effort. Our young madam didn’t do anything wrong. Why should she apologize to the perpetrator?","“If there were no surveillance cameras in the old residence’s backyard, I’m afraid Miss Kang would have already caused Young Madam’s reputation to be ruined. Her scheme didn’t succeed and she was scolded by everyone for reaping what she sowed. She now wants Young Madam to apologize to her. How laughable!”","Kang Jichuan’s heart felt like it was stuffed with a huge rock. He knew that it must have been Xi Xi’s idea for these people from Longwan Residential to mock him.","The gaze he shot at Qiao Xi was filled with disappointment and anger. They were siblings whose blood was thicker than water! Why did Xi Xi do this to him, her brother? She actually let a butler mock and belittle him!","Kang Jichuan suppressed the anger in his heart. His rationality told him not to flare up because he had more important things to do.","He calmed down for a long time, and his tone became a little gentler. “Xi Xi, I don’t want to force you either. Qingzhi did something wrong this time, but she suddenly fell sick. I... I won’t force you to apologize, but can you not be so hostile to her? No matter what, she’s your younger sister.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Look at how fake this man in front of her was!","Kang Jichuan advised her earnestly, “Xi Xi, I know you think that Qingzhi has occupied your identity, so you’ve been unable to accept her. But think about it carefully. What did Qingzhi do wrong? She’s just an orphan. She couldn’t choose her family and fate. She was instigated by Xu Ling to participate in the perfume competition. She apologized to you after that. As for the Gu family’s banquet, she did it for the Kang family’s perfume business and wanted to look for you to resolve the misunderstanding. She doesn’t have any selfish motives, but you...”","“Young Master Kang.” Qiao Xi suddenly interrupted him. She rubbed her ears impatiently and raised her eyes slightly. She did not hide the disgust in her eyes and said word by word, “If you’re here to speak up for Kang Qingzhi today, then please leave. I was in a good mood before you came. I don’t want to listen to your nonsense.”","“Xi Xi?” Kang Jichuan widened his eyes in disbelief.","Qiao Xi said coldly, “Young Master Kang, I can tell you clearly that I hate Kang Qingzhi, and she hates me too. Our identities aren’t a problem. From the moment she schemed against me, I was never able to forgive her. We won’t become sisters, nor will we live under the same roof. Don’t waste your breath!”","The surroundings instantly fell silent. Kang Jichuan’s expression froze. His voice sounded a little torn as he asked in shock, “Xi Xi, you... What did you say?”","Five years ago, Xi Xi did hate Qingzhi, but she had never said these words directly. However, the current Xi Xi told him so heartlessly that she and Qingzhi would never get along harmoniously, much less live under the same roof. Hence, what she meant was that if the Kang family wanted their adopted daughter, Xi Xi would never return to the Kang family.","Xi Xi was forcing him and his father! Why did she have to make them choose?","Kang Jichuan gritted his teeth and said, “Xi Xi, don’t force me.”","“Young Master Kang, don’t you think your actions are very laughable?” Qiao Xi said casually, “At this point, you actually still think that Kang Qingzhi and I can become good friends?”","Qiao Xi’s cold eyes were filled with disdain and ridicule. There was no need for her to hide her thoughts in front of Kang Jichuan. It was better to directly fall out with him so that Kang Jichuan could completely give up on this thought.","“Young Master Kang, Kang Qingzhi has been framing me recently. Hasn’t the Kang family harmed me enough? Why don’t you ask the others in high society? If they were me, would they forgive Kang Qingzhi?”"]},{"number":1564,"title":"Chapter 1564 This Excuse Is Too Far-Fetched","paragraphs":["1564 This Excuse Is Too Far-Fetched","Kang Jichuan’s face was pale, but Qiao Xi still said casually, “Kang Qingzhi schemed to frame me during the perfume competition and made me suffer insults. She framed me again at the Gu family’s banquet. She repeatedly challenged my bottom line, but in the eyes of your Kang family, she’s still the weakest and most innocent person. It’s all my fault, and I’m not magnanimous enough. I’m too calculative, and I don’t care about kinship.","“But Young Master Kang, think about it from my perspective. How do you want me to forgive Kang Qingzhi? How can I treat someone who has framed me time and again as a good friend? Don’t you think your request is too much?”","“If you’re unconvinced, you can ask someone else. Am I being unforgiving or are you shameless? However, you’re a noble, after all. You know shame, so you probably won’t tell outsiders about your family matters. Since you don’t dare to say it, it means that you know very well that what Kang Qingzhi did to me was wrong. However, you’re still defending Kang Qingzhi!”","Kang Jichuan was instantly speechless. He wanted to explain that Qingqing was kind-hearted and those were all misunderstandings. Someone else instigated her to do it...","However, when he saw Qiao Xi’s eyes that were filled with ridicule, he could not say a word.","Even if Qingzhi had really done something, they were family, after all. On the account of him and her father, could Xi Xi not forgive Qingzhi?","“Young Master Kang, let me tell you clearly. If you want me to return to the Kang family, my only request is to chase Kang Qingzhi away. I’ll never be able to get along with her!”","Kang Jichuan pursed his lips tightly. Before he could respond, he heard Qiao Xi chuckle. “Young Master Kang, you probably think that I’m unreasonable now, right? No matter what you think, this is my intention. It can’t be changed.”","At this moment, Kang Jichuan was so anxious that sweat broke out on his forehead. He did not care about Qiao Xi’s attitude. He came to Longwan Residential today to ask Xi Xi to save Qingzhi, but in the current situation, it should be very difficult for Xi Xi to agree.","“Xi Xi, come home with me first. We’ll sit down and talk...”","After coaxing Xi Xi home, he and his father would try to persuade her. When Xi Xi saw Qingzhi lying on the hospital bed on her last breath, she might agree to donate her blood.","Kang Jichuan’s mind was filled with Qiao Xi’s blood. He did not care what she said at all. He looked at Qiao Xi anxiously, hoping that she could go home with him.","“Young Master Kang, Xi Xi has been talking for a long time, but you didn’t listen to a word she said.” Gu Zheng’s tone was cold. “I’ll only ask you a question. Why did you suddenly come to look for Xi Xi?”","Bang!","Gu Zheng slammed the teacup in his hand on the table, and it instantly broke into pieces. His voice carried a trace of coldness. “Young Master Kang, I’ll give you two minutes to explain why you’re here. Otherwise...”","He did not finish speaking, but Kang Jichuan had already understood what he meant. His face instantly turned pale. He knew very well in his heart that if he did not explain why he was here, Xi Xi would not go back with him. However, if he said it, Xi Xi would definitely not agree. He could not forcefully pull Xi Xi away in front of Gu Zheng. After thinking about it, he could only find an excuse. “Xi Xi, no matter what grudges you had against Qingzhi in the past, she’s really seriously ill this time. I just want you to go back and visit Qingzhi. I promise you that I’ll announce that you’re the daughter of the Kang family in the future and distinguish your status from Qingzhi’s status.”","Qiao Xi was speechless. Kang Jichuan was still unwilling to give in! Her attitude was already very firm. The Kang family could only choose between her and Kang Qingzhi. It was not as simple as distinguishing between their biological and adopted daughters.","At the end of the day, Kang Jichuan was still willing to patiently persuade her to go back because he hoped that she could donate her blood to Kang Qingzhi.","“Xi Xi...”","“Young Master Kang!” Before he could finish, an angry voice came from the door. Qin An strode over with a malicious expression. “You want Xi Xi to go to the Kang family just to visit Kang Qingzhi? This excuse is too far-fetched!","“Moreover, Kang Qingzhi has repeatedly framed Xi Xi. Why should Xi Xi visit her?” Qin An walked in front of Kang Jichuan and curled the corners of his lips. “Or did you hear that Xi Xi knows medicine and you hope that Xi Xi will treat Kang Qingzhi?”","The atmosphere instantly froze. In the silence, Qiao Xi smiled lightly.","Kang Jichuan was instantly stunned. He did not know Qin An, but seeing that Qin An could enter the backyard of Longwan Residential directly with such an arrogant attitude, he must be Xi Xi and Gu Zheng’s friend.","However, he did not know that Xi Xi knew medicine!"]},{"number":1565,"title":"Chapter 1565 Thank You For Your Cooperation, Third Brother","paragraphs":["1565 Thank You For Your Cooperation, Third Brother","Kang Jichuan knew that the excuse for Xi Xi to visit Qingzhi was very far-fetched, but there was no other reason. However, from what this gentleman said...","Kang Jichuan instantly had an idea and hurriedly echoed, “Yes! I... I heard that Xi Xi’s medical skills are brilliant. I hope she can go see Qingzhi. She’s been unconscious for a long time...”","Qiao Xi curled her lips. “But why did I hear that in order to save her, the Kang family didn’t hesitate to spend a lot of money to hire famous doctors? Even those famous doctors were helpless. Why did you think of me?”","Kang Jichuan hurriedly said, “Those famous doctors are outsiders, after all. I don’t believe them. You’re from the Kang family. Even if you have a conflict with Qingzhi, you won’t harm her.”","“Oh?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows as a trace of ridicule flashed past her eyes. “Alright, I can go back to the Kang family with you.”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with surprise as he said anxiously, “Alright! Xi Xi, let’s go quickly!”","“Wait.” Qin An suddenly said, “Young Master Kang, let me introduce myself. I’m Xi Xi’s senior, Qin An. I’m also the president of the Medical Association. Xi Xi’s medical skills were taught by me.”","Kang Jichuan was stunned for a moment before nodding slightly at Qin An. “Hello, Mr. Qin.”","Qin An continued, “Xi Xi usually calls me ‘Third Brother’. It just so happens that you’re Xi Xi’s brother, so we can be considered brothers.”","Kang Jichuan had a confused expression. He did not understand what Qin An wanted to say and only nodded stiffly.","“I heard that Miss Kang’s condition is serious, so let me go to the Kang family with you. After all, I was the one who taught Xi Xi her medical skills. If I can’t treat Miss Kang, it’s meaningless for Xi Xi to go. What do you think, Young Master Kang?”","The moment that was said, Kang Jichuan’s expression froze.","Qin An was the president of the Medical Association. He was naturally skilled, but if he went, Xi Xi would not go. If he insisted on asking Xi Xi to go, it would definitely arouse Gu Zheng’s suspicion.","Kang Jichuan did not respond for a long time. Qin An lowered his eyes and asked, “Is there a problem, Young Master Kang?”","“Uh... Alright.”","Qin An smiled. “Young Master Kang, why do you look troubled?”","Kang Jichuan did not know how to explain either. He just stood where he was with his body tense.","Uncle Sheng looked at the guilty Kang Jichuan and instantly understood that Kang Jichuan must have ill intentions for letting Young Madam go to the Kang family. Now that Mr. Qin was here and had taken the initiative to treat Kang Qingzhi, Kang Jichuan had no other excuse to let Young Madam go to the Kang family.","If Kang Jichuan rejected Mr. Qin’s suggestion, he would expose his ulterior motives.","Gu Zheng’s cold gaze landed on Kang Jichuan, then he looked at Qiao Xi. His voice was low. “No wonder you let Kang Jichuan in.”","Qiao Xi blinked at him and said in a low voice, “I have to thank Third Brother for his cooperation. I’m really too happy to see Kang Jichuan suffer!”","“Young Master Kang?” Qin An said again, “Do you have any concerns? I dare say that there’s no one in Li City who has better medical skills than me.”","“This...” Cold sweat broke out on Kang Jichuan’s forehead.","He knew that Qin An’s medical skills were brilliant, but Qingzhi’s illness was incurable. Back in Y Nation, they had already seen many famous doctors, but the final outcome was the same. Only Xi Xi’s blood could save Qingzhi. Although donating such a large amount of blood would hurt Xi Xi’s body, it was her honor that her blood could save someone. She should not refuse!","Moreover, Xi Xi had donated her blood five years ago and was still full of vigor now. However, if Qingzhi did not undergo a blood transfusion now, she would not be able to hold on anymore!","He could only say these words in his heart. He felt that he wasn’t doing anything wrong, but once he said it, Xi Xi and Gu Zheng would definitely not agree. It was even possible that they would directly chase him out. That would make it very difficult to obtain Xi Xi’s blood.","Actually, when he thought about it, it made sense. Xi Xi’s and Gu Zheng’s living environment was similar when they were young. They had never experienced kinship, so their personalities were indifferent when they grew up. They did not know how important family was at all.","Kang Jichuan was silent for a long time before he slowly said, “Mr. Qin, it’s good that you want to treat Qingzhi’s illness, but...”","“I heard that you dote on your younger sister very much. When you found out that she was sick, you spent a lot of money to hire famous doctors to treat her. You were so anxious that you rushed to Longwan Residential to look for Xi Xi. Why are you not anxious when I, the president of the Medical Association, am here? Time is tight. Let’s go quickly and not delay Miss Kang’s illness.”","Qin An’s tone was very calm, but Kang Jichuan’s expression became more and more complicated as he frowned."]},{"number":1566,"title":"Chapter 1566 How Can I Bear To Kill You?","paragraphs":["1566 How Can I Bear To Kill You?","Kang Jichuan gritted his teeth and suppressed the frustration in his heart.","Qin An was really too difficult to deal with!","He did not want Qin An to treat Qingzhi at all. He only wanted Xi Xi’s blood!","After all, Qin An was the president of the Medical Association. He was the one who taught Xi Xi her medical skills, so he definitely knew that Xi Xi’s blood could save lives. If he saw Qingzhi’s condition and knew that he could only use Xi Xi’s blood to save her, it would be troublesome!","With Qin An’s relationship with Xi Xi, he would definitely tell Xi Xi this news and even stop her from donating her blood. What should Qing Zhi do then? Could it be that he had to watch Qing Zhi die?","Kang Jichuan’s voice was difficult. “Mr. Qin, it’s not that I don’t want you to go. It’s just that Qingzhi has been weak and sick since she was young. She rarely goes out and is timid, so she doesn’t see strangers. Even if you go, she...”","“Strangers?” Qin An said in shock, “Could it be that the famous doctors you invited all watched Miss Kang grow up? Aren’t they all strangers? Since they can treat Miss Kang, why can’t I?”","Qiao Xi: “...” That made sense!","The corners of Kang Jichuan’s mouth twitched. “Uhh...”","Qin An did not give him a chance to speak and continued, “Moreover, I’m Xi Xi’s senior. You even said that Xi Xi is Kang Qingzhi’s sister. In that case, I can be considered Kang Qingzhi’s elder brother. As her elder brother, I’m just going there to treat her. What’s there to be afraid of?”","The veins on Kang Jichuan’s forehead popped out. This person was pestering him endlessly!","He suppressed his anger and said in a hoarse voice, “Mr. Qin, you and Qingzhi are not related by blood. How can you be considered her brother? Moreover, you’re a young man. Qingzhi has never interacted with young men. She should...”","“If I remember correctly, you and Kang Qingzhi aren’t related by blood, right? You and Xi Xi are biological siblings, while Kang Qingzhi is just an adopted daughter.” With that said, Qin An suddenly widened his eyes. “Besides, aren’t you a young man? Why isn’t Miss Kang avoiding you? Could it be that the two of you...”","“Mr. Qin, be careful with your words!” Kang Jichuan interrupted him, trembling with anger.","This person was clearly spouting nonsense!","“Young Master Kang, do you still need me to treat Miss Kang’s illness?” Qin An leaned lazily on the sofa and glanced sideways at Kang Jichuan. “I’ve been a doctor for so many years. It’s always been others who begged me to treat their illnesses. No one has ever rejected me! If you insist on letting Xi Xi treat her illness, you have to give me a reasonable explanation.","“Don’t you care a lot about Kang Qingzhi? In that case, why are you still so picky and not letting me treat her? Or... you didn’t come to Longwan Residential to ask Xi Xi to treat Kang Qingzhi and you’re just looking for an excuse to take Xi Xi away?","“After all, she’ll be in your territory if you take her away. It’s very easy for you to bully Xi Xi even if you want her to completely disappear. It’ll be too late by the time we realize it, right?”","As soon as the last word was spoken, a cold aura suddenly arose in the tea room. Everyone looked at Kang Jichuan. Qiao Xi’s gaze also landed on him as the corners of her mouth curled up. “Is that so? I originally thought that Young Master Kang invited me to treat Kang Qingzhi because he took a liking to my medical skills. It turns out that you think I caused Miss Kang’s illness to flare up and want to kill me to vent your anger on her?”","“Xi Xi!” Kang Jichuan shouted. His eyes were filled with panic as he retorted loudly, “You’re my biological sister. How could I bear to kill you?”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes, and her cold eyes met Kang Jichuan’s eyes that were filled with disappointment and panic. At that instant, the scene in her mind flashed crazily.","Five years ago, on the cliff, she raised her gun and aimed it at Kang Jichuan. She was forced to choose to jump into the sea to seek a chance of survival. At that time, didn’t Kang Jichuan want to kill her?","He had clearly done such a vicious thing once, yet Kang Jichuan was still pretending to be disappointed that he had been misunderstood. It was as if she was pestering him endlessly and making malicious guesses!","Kang Jichuan looked into Qiao Xi’s eyes, and his heart trembled for no reason. His body suddenly tensed up as a thought gradually appeared in his mind.","‘She... Could it be that she’s recovered her memory?’","Kang Jichuan’s face was pale, and his heart felt as if it was stabbed by a knife. It was so painful that he frowned. His body turned cold, and his voice trembled. “Xi Xi, I... I had my reasons. Back then...”","“What did you say?” Qiao Xi stared fixedly at Kang Jichuan as if her voice could pierce through his heart."]},{"number":1567,"title":"Chapter 1567 Fleeing","paragraphs":["1567 Fleeing","Kang Jichuan instantly came back to his senses. He seemed to have been hypnotized just now and almost told the truth. Did Xi Xi recover her memory?","At that instant just now, Kang Jichuan seemed to have returned to that day five years ago. At that time, Xi Xi’s gaze was the same as now. It was cold, full of despair and resentment as well as a trace of determination.","At this moment, his mind was a mess. For the first time, he felt flustered. Everyone’s eyes were filled with doubt as if they had already discovered the secret he had been hiding for many years.","He was the earl of Y Nation. If his past was exposed, not only would his reputation be ruined, but he would also lose his noble identity, money, and freedom.","Kang Jichuan’s heart was filled with fear. He did not dare to raise his head to look at Qiao Xi and could only say in a low voice, “Xi Xi, I shouldn’t have forced you. It’s my fault. I... I’ll take my leave first.”","With that said, Kang Jichuan left in a hurry. Qin An shouted, “Young Master Kang, don’t you need me to treat Miss Kang?”","Kang Jichuan naturally did not answer. He could not wait to fly out of Longwan Residential. Qin An watched him leave in a panic and sneered. “As expected, Kang Qingzhi isn’t sick at all. Otherwise, why isn’t he in a rush to find a doctor? He probably just wants to force Little Six to apologize to Kang Qingzhi, right?”","Uncle Sheng and Xiao Lan looked at each other and left together.","At this moment, only Qin An and the other two were left in the room. He asked, “Little Six, don’t you want to know how Kang Jichuan found out about your blood...”","He paused and looked around. “Let’s talk in the study.”","This matter was too important and concerned Little Six’s life, so he had always been careful.","The three of them entered the study together and closed the door. Only then did Qin An say again, “You asked me to help you out. Did I go overboard with my words just now? I scared Kang Jichuan away. How are you going to get information from him now?”","Gu Zheng walked to the table on the other side, put on his gold-framed glasses, and flipped open the document. He looked like he was preparing for work.","Qin An glanced at Gu Zheng, then leaned closer to Qiao Xi and asked in a low voice, “Gu Zheng... is Gu Weiming’s biological son?”","Qiao Xi looked at him in surprise. “Yes! What clues have you found? Are they related to Gu Zheng?”","Qin An shook his head. “It’s not a clue. I just think it’s quite strange that that good-for-nothing Gu Weiming actually gave birth to such an outstanding son like Gu Zheng. But on second thought, it seems to make sense now that Gu Zheng’s mother is Miss Lu Qingyun.","“Also, it’s a pity that Gu Zheng was born into the Gu family. If he had been born in a family that treated him well and supported his career, it might have been a different story.”","Qin An did have something to tell Qiao Xi because those things were too complicated. It was best not to let Little Six know that they involved the wealthy families in the capital.","Moreover, judging from the situation, Gu Zheng had not told Little Six. Since that was the case, he would not let it slip.","Qiao Xi sized up Qin An. She kept having the feeling that Third Brother was hiding something from her!","However, before she could ask, Qin An changed the topic. “Little Six, I recently obtained a clue. Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi’s illness acted up. Kang Jichuan spent a lot of money to seek treatment. At that moment, someone went to see Kang Jichuan.","“I’ve already found out who this person is. It’s He Weinian,” Qin An continued. “Actually, I don’t need to say anything. You should have already guessed it. You know that Kang Jichuan and He Weinian are in contact, but you can’t be sure who was the first to know the secret of your blood. After my investigation, I’m sure that person is He Weinian.”","Hearing He Weinian’s name, Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold.","Qiao Xi nodded. “Cheng Juan also told me a little about He Weinian, but I don’t understand how He Weinian found out about my relationship with the Kang family. How did he know that my mom was Kang Ru’s fiancee? I remember that Old Madam Kang didn’t acknowledge my mom’s identity back then, so she kept her existence a secret from the public. No one in Y Nation knows who my mom is.","“Moreover, even the Yin family doesn’t know about the matter between my mom and Kang Ru. How would He Weinian know? He even planned for many years? Moreover, what’s the point of taking my blood to save Kang Qingzhi? He Weinian spent so much effort planning all of this. What benefits can he get?","“I know Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru. The father and son are weak by nature. Although they’re not kind people, they couldn’t have come up with such a plan. In the entire Kang family, Kang Qingzhi is probably the only one who’s scheming.”"]},{"number":1568,"title":"Chapter 1568 Someone Wants To Invest In The Kang Family","paragraphs":["1568 Someone Wants To Invest In The Kang Family","Qin An replied, “Yes, I’ve always suspected that the person who first met He Weinian was Kang Qingzhi. However, it was Kang Jichuan who came forward to negotiate. Kang Qingzhi was manipulating things behind Kang Jichuan’s back, arranging for the two of them to meet. That’s how the blood transfusion happened.”","Gu Zheng paused. He Weinian was the mastermind behind all of this? The person who caused Xi Xi to almost lose her life five years ago was He Weinian.","He had always thought that He Weinian’s target was him. Now, it seemed that He Weinian’s target had always been Xi Xi, or rather, Xi Xi’s blood.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with doubt. “I’ve checked He Weinian’s information. He used to live in the capital. After he came to Li City and married his first wife, he gradually made a name for himself. I don’t have any contact with him. How could he...”","!!","Her voice suddenly stopped, and the air seemed to freeze.","Qin An followed Qiao Xi’s words as a guess appeared in his mind. He instantly felt his scalp tingle. “Then there’s only one possibility. There’s someone behind He Weinian!”","Qiao Xi suddenly found it difficult to breathe. It was as if a huge net had trapped her. There was a mysterious person who was pulling many strings and controlling others to achieve their goal. The people involved had complicated relationships, and everyone had ill intentions. She and Gu Zheng were prey in this net. They had to face the risk of being schemed against.","She had never offended anyone in the past. Why was she being targeted by so many people?","If the Yin family had offended someone, there was no need for those people to scheme against her. They should just look for the descendants of the Yin family to take revenge. Her mother had a gentle temperament since she was young and was kind-hearted. She never became enemies with others. Who would want to take revenge on her?","According to Third Brother’s clues, the forces behind them all belonged to the capital. However, she grew up in Li City while her mother grew up in Shengdu. She had nothing to do with the capital.","Qiao Xi felt a little dizzy and could not think of any clues, so she said, “Third Brother, you haven’t eaten yet, right? I’ll get the kitchen to prepare a meal.”","Qin An nodded. Qiao Xi looked up at Gu Zheng and realized that he was frowning.","Was Gu Zheng hiding something from her?","...","In the afternoon, when Xiao Lan went out to buy ingredients for dinner, she happened to meet the servants and butlers of the nearby villa. As Xiao Lan was a servant of Longwan Residential, her status was higher than the other servants. Coupled with her age and sweet mouth, everyone liked to chat with her.","While the few of them were talking, Xiao Lan unintentionally mentioned something about Kang Qingzhi.","“Miss Kang Qingzhi is pretending to be sick, but Kang Jichuan wanted to force our young madam to apologize. Because Miss Kang failed to frame her and our young madam proved her innocence, Miss Kang is unconvinced and even making things difficult for our young madam.","“She’s clearly the one who framed others, yet she still wants the victim to apologize to her. The daughter of the Kang family is too unreasonable. This young master of the Kang family is also muddle-headed. He actually came to our door and wanted to take Young Madam away by force.","“The people who are working with the Kang family need to widen their eyes, or they’ll be schemed against by the Kang family. People like them are too selfish. They only care about benefits. Their business partners will definitely suffer.”","This news quickly spread throughout Li City’s high society.","On the other hand, after Kang Jichuan left Longwan Residential, he received a call from the company and left in a hurry. The headquarters of the Kang family’s company had always been in Li City. After Kang Jichuan took over, the company was still stable.","However, they had invested four billion yuan in the perfume business this time. After that scandal broke out, investors and partners all proposed to terminate their contracts. Netizens also began to boycott the Kang family’s perfumes. They had already suffered heavy losses during this period of time.","On the way, Kang Jichuan’s phone rang again. His assistant’s excited voice came from the other end of the phone. “Young Master, come over quickly. Someone wants to invest in our company!”","Kang Jichuan was a little surprised. Who would invest in the Kang family at this time?","He did not dare to delay and hurriedly urged the chauffeur to rush to the company.","Ever since the video taken at the perfume competition was posted online, the investors had all withdrawn their investments. Back then, the Kang family had invested four billion yuan in perfumes. It was all their money. They were very determined to withdraw it now.","Before they could recover from the previous incident, that incident happened again when Qingzhi attended the Gu family’s banquet.","Kang Jichuan was full of sorrow and did not know how to clean up this mess. Hence, when his assistant said that someone wanted to invest in the Kang family, Kang Jichuan was very excited and immediately went to the company."]},{"number":1569,"title":"Chapter 1569 Don’t Think About Unattainable Things","paragraphs":["1569 Don’t Think About Unattainable Things","As soon as he arrived at the company, Kang Jichuan heard the people beside him discussing softly. “I heard that the gentleman who’s going to invest this time is also surnamed Kang! Maybe he’s related to the Kang family!”","“I heard that Mr. Kang is especially capable. His family has assets, but he went overseas to start from scratch. He started his own company overseas at such a young age!”","Kang Jichuan could not help but frown when he heard a few people praising Mr. Kang. He had heard too much praise since he was young. When he saw someone more outstanding than him, he could not help but feel uncomfortable. Moreover, he heard that that man’s surname was also Kang.","He was a little puzzled. Someone who had the ability to invest in the Kang family must have an extraordinary identity, but as far as he knew, there seemed to be no other family with the surname Kang in Li City.","When he went upstairs and pushed open the door of the meeting room, he was instantly stunned when he saw the man in front of him.","Yao Junjie?","Kang Jichuan’s expression instantly darkened. He thought of himself as a gentle gentleman, but at this moment, his tone was filled with disdain and annoyance. “Yao Junjie, what are you doing in the company?”","The higher-ups of Kang Corporation were all waiting for Kang Jichuan to come back and sign the contract. When they saw his attitude, they could not help but be shocked. This Mr. Kang was here to invest in their company. Was their young master chasing the God of Fortune out with such an attitude?","The higher-ups looked at each other and wanted to step forward to mediate the situation.","Before everyone could speak, Yao Junjie said in a gentle voice, “Cousin, long time no see. I’ve already changed my surname. I’m called Kang Junjie now.”","Cousin? Everyone was dumbfounded. In that case, Mr. Kang Junjie was Young Master Kang’s cousin? Yes! The surname Kang was rare. Moreover, Mr. Kang was willing to help the Kang family when they were in trouble. Only relatives would do that!","Everyone laughed, thinking that although Young Master Kang did not have much talent in business, he was lucky to be popular and have an outstanding and rich younger cousin.","However, the next second...","Kang Jichuan glanced at Kang Junjie arrogantly, then snorted. “This is the Kang family’s company. You shouldn’t be here. I don’t care what your surname is, the Kang family’s company has nothing to do with you. However, you have the Kang family’s bloodline, after all. I’ll allow you to visit Grandma.”","The higher-ups: “???”","Didn’t Young Master Kang know that Mr. Kang Junjie was an investor?","Kang Junjie’s attitude was still gentle, and his every move was so elegant. He smiled and said, “Cousin, I came to the company today to talk to you.”","When the higher-ups heard this, they all knew that Kang Junjie wanted to invest in them. They were all very excited, but when these words reached Kang Jichuan’s ears, the meaning changed.","Kang Jichuan said unhappily, “Since you’ve already changed your surname to Yao back then, you have nothing to do with the Kang family anymore. You have no right to interfere with the Kang family’s assets. Now that you have Yao Corporation in your hands, that’s enough for you to squander. You have to understand your identity and not think about those unattainable things!”","Kang Jichuan guessed that Yao Junjie was unwilling to see them start a perfume business and wanted to profit from it.","Not long after their family arrived in Li City, Yao Junjie came over from overseas. Wasn’t he just trying to get some benefits?","After Yao Junjie’s grandfather and parents passed away a few years ago, the Kang family in Y Nation and the Kang family in Li City cut off all contact with them. It was enough for Yao Junjie to have the Kang family’s assets in Li City, but human nature was greedy. He was not satisfied with the current situation, so he targeted them.","Yao Junjie was different from Qingzhi. Although Qingzhi was just an adopted daughter, she was the lucky star of the Kang family and the beloved daughter of everyone in the Kang family. Of course, he was not qualified to compare himself to Qingzhi.","Kang Jichuan also guessed that Yao Junjie had heard that they were prepared to give 10% of the shares to Qingzhi, so he came looking for them.","The coldness and disgust in his eyes were not concealed at all, and his tone was very impatient. “Yao Junjie, there’s nothing to talk about between us. Don’t even think about getting the Kang family’s shares. If you don’t know your place, we have the right to take back Yao Corporation’s current assets!”","Yao Junjie lowered his eyes slightly with a trace of mockery.","It was indeed as Gu Zheng had said. Rumor had it that Kang Jichuan was a gentle young master, but in reality, he was suspicious, narrow-minded, and heartless. He always wore a kind and gentle mask. He had just seen him, but did his mask crack so easily?","Was Kang Jichuan looking down on him?","Kang Junjie could not help but think of Qiao Xi. She was clearly the legitimate daughter of the Kang family, but she was not as favored as the adopted daughter. Even now, the Kang family had not announced Qiao Xi’s identity. It seemed that the Kang family looked down on her too!"]},{"number":1570,"title":"Chapter 1570 He Wants To Completely Destroy This Dirty Family","paragraphs":["1570 He Wants To Completely Destroy This Dirty Family","The Kang family kept saying that they were impartial, but in reality, they had let their biological daughter suffer so much for the sake of an adopted daughter. They thought that it was only right for them to sacrifice Qiao Xi to fulfill Kang Qingzhi’s wish. Unfortunately, they seemed to have forgotten something. The current Qiao Xi was no longer the young lady who acknowledged them as their family and trusted him.","He, Kang Junjie, was no longer the orphan who had to rely on others to survive. He came back this time to completely destroy this dirty Kang family!","At this moment, the higher-ups were dumbfounded and hurriedly stopped him. “Young Master Kang...”","Before they could finish, Kang Junjie suddenly took a few steps forward. His eyes were filled with a cold smile. “In that case... Cousin, are you unwilling to talk to me?”","!!","“What do you think?” Kang Jichuan was a little impatient. In his impression, although Kang Junjie had been down and out before, he had never been so shameless and greedy. Why did he suddenly come to the company today to talk to him?","Perhaps it was because the Kang family’s perfume business was being hindered one after another, so Kang Junjie wanted to take this opportunity to take his share of the cake. There was no need to hide his intentions.","Kang Junjie was a little disappointed and shook his head helplessly. “Alright then.”","Kang Jichuan snorted in disdain. He had long guessed that Kang Junjie had ulterior motives and did not have the guts to covet the Kang family’s shares. Kang Junjie should take a look at his identity.","The next second, Kang Junjie stood up and walked out of the door. His tone was calm. “Since you don’t want me to come to the company, I won’t come in the future...”","“M-Mr. Kang, wait!”","The expressions of the higher-ups and shareholders were extremely ugly as they tried to persuade him to stay.","At this moment, everyone’s impression of Kang Jichuan was even worse. They even thought that if the head of the Kang family was Kang Junjie, the Kang family would definitely not be in such a difficult situation. Kang Jichuan did not have any talent in business at all, but he thought highly of himself and was blindly confident. He only knew how to give orders, but he did not have the ability to be a leader. They had long had enough of this young master!","Now that Mr. Kang had brought funds that could help Kang Corporation survive this crisis, Kang Jichuan wanted to chase him away without saying anything. He even warned him not to think about the Kang family’s assets.","Kang Jichuan was probably muddle-headed. Kang Junjie today was not someone the Kang Corporation could compare to. He looked down on Kang Corporation’s shares and assets!","The Kang family was a noble earl in Y Nation, but without Y Nation, the Kang family’s business was not worth mentioning at all. Otherwise, they would not be in a crisis because of the four billion yuan.","Kang Jichuan’s expression darkened as he looked at the higher-ups and shareholders unhappily.","These people actually wanted Kang Junjie to stay in front of him? Wasn’t this a slap to his face?","Kang Junjie stopped in his tracks and looked helpless. “Everyone, I’m sorry. My cousin is the president of Kang Corporation. If he doesn’t agree, I won’t force him.”","“Actually, Cousin, you’re right. I indeed have nothing to do with the Kang family in Y Nation anymore. We haven’t contacted each other for many years. I naturally don’t have the right to work with you.”","“Mr. Kang!” A shareholder hurriedly stood up and shouted. Then, he quickly walked in front of Kang Junjie and said, “Don’t listen to Young Master Kang’s nonsense. How can you not be qualified to collaborate with us? With your current net worth and power, it’s our honor to take the initiative to discuss a collaboration with you!”","Kang Junjie’s face was gentle, but there was a trace of mockery in his eyes.","Kang Jichuan was instantly stunned. “You... What are you doing?”","He glared fiercely at Kang Junjie, and the disgust in his eyes was about to overflow. However, he prided himself on being cultured and could only suppress his anger. He said unhappily, “Junjie, your parents passed away early. No one in the Yao family was there to teach and educate you. You have to remember that be it in life or business, you have to be down-to-earth. Don’t play tricks. Otherwise, you’ll have to pay the price one day.”","“You’re right.” Kang Junjie nodded gently.","Kang Jichuan pretended to be an elder and said, “This is Kang Corporation’s territory. The higher-ups and shareholders of Kang Corporation are all in this meeting room. You’re just an outsider. They won’t—”","“Young Master Kang!” Before he could finish, a major shareholder stood up and roared, “Young Master Kang, you should have received a call from your assistant before you came. Do you still remember why you’re here?”","Kang Jichuan looked a little puzzled. “Isn’t it because someone wants to invest in us?”"]},{"number":1571,"title":"Chapter 1571 Forced To Lower His Head To Kang Junjie","paragraphs":["1571 Forced To Lower His Head To Kang Junjie","“That’s right, Young Master Kang!” The major shareholder was furious. “Mr. Kang wants to invest in the company, but you offended him after entering and even chased him away so rudely. Are you going to watch the company go bankrupt? Kang Corporation is in a crisis now, and it’s all because of your good sister, Kang Qingzhi, that we don’t have liquid assets. Now, you’re chasing the investor away. The two of you won’t stop until the Kang Corporation is ruined, huh?!”","When Kang Jichuan heard this, he felt as if he had been struck by lightning. His expression froze. After calming down for a long time, he said with a trembling voice, “This... This is impossible! Kang Junjie is just...”","He was just an orphan who could not even protect his family’s assets and surname!","“Young Master Kang, please open your eyes wide and take a look. Mr. Kang might have been living in poverty in the past, but he already has his own business. Kang Corporation is nothing to him. Is there a need for him to compete with you?","!!","“Ever since Kang Qingzhi’s scandal broke out, four investors have withdrawn their investments. Now, Mr. Kang wants to invest 800 million yuan in Kang Corporation, but you’re actually chasing him away as soon as you enter. Are you crazy?”","Kang Jichuan had been admired and respected since he was young. He had never been reprimanded like this. Moreover, the person in front of him was a shareholder in the company.","He slowly looked up, and everyone’s eyes were filled with disgust and anger. They actually looked down on him, the president of the company, and were all speaking up for Kang Junjie?","At this moment, Kang Junjie smiled gently at everyone. “Everyone, don’t be agitated. Actually, you should also understand that the Kang family’s current situation isn’t good. I only wanted to invest my personal funds on account of my relationship with the Kang family, hoping to help them tide over the crisis, but...”","He shook his head regretfully. “But if they’re unwilling to work with me, then forget it. I won’t waste everyone’s time. I’ll take my leave first.”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with loneliness.","If Mr. Kang left, where would they find investors? Moreover, Mr. Kang offered 800 million as soon as he opened his mouth! He could completely help Kang Corporation tide over this crisis! The Kang siblings were jinxes. Sooner or later, the Kang family would be destroyed at the hands of these siblings!","“Mr. Kang! Don’t go!”","Looking at Kang Junjie’s departing figure, the major shareholder said angrily, “Young Master Kang, if you want to throw a tantrum, go home. We don’t have time to play with you! Even if the company goes bankrupt, you can still return to Y Nation to inherit your noble title, but what about us? Can’t you think about us?","“We’re not asking you to invest, but how can you chase an investor away? Mr. Kang Junjie is going to fork out 800 million yuan, but you’re looking down on him. You have to think carefully. Mr. Kang is our bread and butter now. Without his investment, Kang Corporation’s perfume business won’t have any funds to start. The previous 4 billion yuan will be completely wasted!","“Young Master Kang, you’d better quickly invite Mr. Kang Junjie back!”","Everyone said indignantly. Kang Jichuan’s face was pale, and he felt like his head was about to explode.","They... They actually wanted him to beg that poor man? Who was Kang Junjie? He had clearly changed his surname to Yao. Now, he suddenly changed it back because he had ulterior motives. He was just a bastard with an unknown identity. Even if he was rich now, he could not hide his humble past!","However, he, Kang Jichuan, was the earl of Y Nation and a direct descendant of the Kang family. He was the head of the Kang Corporation. Why should he lower his head to Kang Junjie?","Impossible! He would never look for Kang Junjie!","“Young Master! Miss is awake! She called you!” At this moment, his assistant rushed in and placed the phone in Kang Jichuan’s hand.","When Kang Jichuan heard this, the gloominess in his heart instantly vanished. He hurriedly picked up the phone and shouted gently, “Qingzhi, how are you?”","Kang Qingzhi was talking on the other end of the phone. Kang Jichuan’s expression became uglier and uglier. After a long time, he took a deep breath. “Since you’ve said so, I’ll listen to you and look for him.”","After hanging up, Kang Jichuan leaned against the chair and closed his eyes. He gritted his teeth.","He had to admit that Qingzhi’s words made sense. If they did not have Kang Junjie’s funds, the Kang family would not have a chance to launch their perfumes.","The previous scandal caused the investors to withdraw their investments one after another. There were still two investors who did not withdraw their investments. That was also because they had worked together many times. Hence, without funds, it was meaningless even if Qingzhi won the perfume competition."]},{"number":1572,"title":"Chapter 1572 Jump Even If He Knows It’s A Trap","paragraphs":["1572 Jump Even If He Knows It’s A Trap","Originally, Kang Jichuan had decided to gather the current funds in their hands. He could probably fork out 500 million yuan. However, it was still a little difficult to completely help the Kang family tide over the crisis. After all, the Kang family only had the identity of an earl, and it was not as glamorous as they looked. Forking out that sum of money would be the best they could do.","He had always wanted Qingzhi to live a carefree life. She could spend money to shop as she pleased and buy jewelry and designer bags that she liked. What right did Qiao Xi have to squander money as she pleased after marrying Gu Zheng while Qingzhi had to worry about her family’s situation without daring to spend money? She even secretly sold her jewelry to make up for Kang Corporation’s lack of funds.","As long as the perfumes were successfully released, they would definitely sell well. At that time...","Kang Jichuan clenched his fists and hurriedly ran out. At the door, he met Kang Junjie, who was about to get into the car and leave.","“Junjie, wait!”","Kang Junjie paused and slowly turned around. His expression was gentle, and his eyes were smiling. He exuded the aura of a noble young master, making one unable to help but admire him. His thin lips parted slightly. “Cousin?”","Kang Jichuan was silent for a few seconds before saying with difficulty, “I said something wrong just now. I didn’t know you were here to invest. Why don’t we go back and talk?”","The higher-ups and shareholders who followed closely behind were speechless when they heard Kang Jichuan’s words. Young Master Kang still could not put down his arrogance as a young master. Since he was asking for an investment, he had to have the right attitude. Mr. Kang Junjie had 800 million yuan in his hands. Why should he invest it in him?","Unexpectedly, Kang Junjie smiled the next second. “Alright.”","Everyone’s impression of Kang Junjie increased exponentially. Not only was Mr. Kang cultured, but he also valued relationships. If it were not for the fact that he was related to the Kang family, Mr. Kang would definitely not have stayed.","Moreover, if it were not for Mr. Kang’s relationship with the Kang family, he would not be willing to spend 800 million to invest in Kang Corporation. After all, Kang Corporation was embroiled in scandals now, so it was very risky to invest in them.","Everything Mr. Kang did was because Kang Jichuan was his cousin, but Kang Jichuan did not know how to be grateful!","Right on the heels of that, Kang Jichuan, Kang Junjie, and the others returned to the meeting room. However, Kang Jichuan did not know how to sign the investment contract.","The major shareholder asked obsequiously, “Mr. Kang Junjie, how do you plan to sign the contract for this investment?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Kang Junjie said with a smile, “A bet agreement!”","...","At this moment, at Longwan Residential.","Gu Zheng received a call from Ye Qingyuan and curled his lips slightly. “A bet agreement?”","Qiao Xi curiously leaned over.","Gu Zheng’s voice was low with a trace of a smile. “If Kang Jichuan agrees to sign a bet agreement with Kang Junjie, the Kang family’s billions of investment will definitely be ruined.”","Qiao Xi was extremely surprised. It was very risky to make a bet.","If one won, one would receive double the returns. If one lost, one would lose everything.","Kang Junjie had been working overseas for so many years. To be able to create his own business from scratch, he was naturally a smart person. How could he be so kind as to invest in Kang Corporation?","Moreover, Gu Zheng had long said that Kang Junjie’s return this time was to completely destroy the Kang family.","With such thoughts in his heart, he still wanted to sign a bet agreement with Kang Jichuan. This meant that he already had a comprehensive plan.","The Kang family was in big trouble this time!","In Qiao Xi’s opinion, although Kang Jichuan did not have a business mind, he should be very clear that a bet agreement was very risky, so there was a high chance that he would not sign it.","However, after thinking for a moment, Qiao Xi changed her mind. The Kang family urgently needed funds now. As long as someone invested in them, Kang Jichuan had to sign it no matter what the agreement was.","Even though he knew that it might be a trap, he had no choice but to jump in!","At the same time, in Kang Corporation.","Kang Junjie was wearing a navy blue suit and leaned elegantly against the chair. His cold eyes glanced at Kang Jichuan as if he was looking at a funny clown. “Cousin, are you willing to sign the bet agreement?”","Everyone present was stunned.","Kang Junjie continued, “According to the original statement, I’ll invest 800 million yuan in Kang Corporation. After the perfumes are successfully released, you’ll give me dividends according to the percentage. If the business fails, I’ll ask Kang Corporation to compensate me six times the investment amount.”","Six times?","Everyone was stunned by this number. Six times 800 million? That was 4.8 billion!","Now, the Kang Corporation only had a total of three billion yuan. Otherwise, they would not have to seek investments. Now, Kang Junjie was willing to invest, but he was asking for a bet agreement."]},{"number":1573,"title":"Chapter 1573 You Can’t Take Advantage Of The Situation!","paragraphs":["1573 You Can’t Take Advantage Of The Situation!","Of course, Kang Jichuan also understood the meaning of the bet agreement. If the perfume business failed, all of Kang Corporation’s funds would have to be used to compensate Kang Junjie. Then, all their long efforts would be in vain!","He could not help but frown, and his tone became a little sharper. “Junjie, Kang Corporation can’t fork out the funds now. If we sign a bet agreement and the business fails, it’ll be a fatal blow to Kang Corporation. You can’t take advantage of the situation! If you’re willing to invest, I’ll be very grateful to you, but I definitely won’t sign a bet agreement!”","The atmosphere froze instantly. Kang Junjie still looked calm and smiled gently. “President Kang, actually, I don’t have to invest in Kang Corporation.”","This time, he did not call him ‘Cousin’ like before. It was obvious that he was deliberately clarifying their relationship. There were no familial relations in the business world, let alone cousins who had not contacted each other for a long time. Now, they were just business partners. They were all sitting together to talk to protect their own benefits.","Kang Junjie’s long fingers tapped on the table as he said indifferently, “800 million is not a small sum. I can’t be the only one taking this risk, right?”","The higher-ups knew very well that no one would invest in Kang Corporation in its current situation. Kang Junjie was willing to invest money because he and Kang Jichuan were cousins.","With Kang Junjie’s business mind, he had many options if he wanted to invest. There were many profitable projects, so there was no need to spend his funds on Kang Corporation. Moreover, Kang Corporation was now plagued by negative news. Although Kang Jichuan kept saying that he would guarantee the popularity of the perfumes, the netizens were already boycotting the Kang family’s products. If the perfumes could not be sold, Kang Junjie would not be able to get back his 800 million yuan!","Kang Junjie glanced at Kang Jichuan meaningfully and said gently, “Cousin, you also know that my investment projects have never failed. The 800 million yuan in my hands can be used to invest in many high-return and low-risk projects. Kang Corporation isn’t a good choice.","“But on the account of our relationship...” Kang Junjie did not finish his sentence, but everyone present understood what he meant.","On the account that he and Kang Jichuan were cousins and he was related to the Kang family, he was willing to invest 800 million yuan. However, he was not a fool and would not let this money go to waste. Hence, he made a request. If Kang Jichuan did not agree, then this collaboration could only be canceled.","Kang Jichuan also understood what he meant, and his face instantly turned ashen.","He clenched his fists and took a deep breath. He gritted his teeth and said, “Junjie, you... You’re also a member of the Kang family. It’s only right for you to invest in Kang Corporation. There’s no need to sign a bet agreement. If Kang Corporation has money, we’ll definitely give it to you. Why use these rules to restrain us?”","The moment that was said, everyone looked at Kang Jichuan.","Although they were all shareholders and higher-ups of Kang Corporation and should prioritize Kang Corporation’s interests, they still did not agree with Kang Jichuan’s words. When he first arrived at the company, he kept saying that Kang Junjie had nothing to do with the Kang family and should not dream of getting the Kang family’s shares. Now that he knew that Kang Junjie wanted to invest, he used kinship to guilt trip him and asked him to pay for Kang Corporation. Kang Junjie had not taken a single cent from Kang Corporation, so what right did he have to pay for Kang Corporation?","“President Kang, I’m sorry. I’m a businessman,” Kang Junjie said helplessly. “The company doesn’t belong to me alone. If I casually fork out 800 million yuan to invest, I won’t be able to explain it to the higher-ups of the company. If you find this request difficult to accept, then don’t force yourself.","“I heard that Sister Qingzhi has won the perfume championship twice. She’s very capable in perfumery. It seems that she’ll definitely win the championship this time. Actually, I believe that you can succeed this time. It’s just that there are too many rumors online now. I asked to sign a bet agreement just to reassure the higher-ups of the company,” Kang Junjie said and sighed. “Since you’re not confident in succeeding, then forget it.”","Kang Junjie’s words stunned Kang Jichuan.","That was right! Qingzhi’s perfumes were so powerful, so she would definitely win the championship. As long as she won the championship, Kang Corporation’s perfumes would sell well. At that time, all the crises would be resolved.","How could he not be confident in succeeding?","However, they lacked hundreds of millions of yuan. When the results of the perfume competition were out, they would immediately put the perfumes on the market. At that time, they would just give Kang Junjie dividends according to the agreement."]},{"number":1574,"title":"Chapter 1574 It Doesn’t Matter Who Wins","paragraphs":["1574 It Doesn’t Matter Who Wins","Just as Kang Jichuan was hesitating, Kang Junjie received a call. He did not hide from everyone and even smiled at Kang Jichuan. “Cousin, Bo Cheng Real Estate heard that I’m going to invest, so they called me. Their project is guaranteed to be profitable. If you don’t agree to my request, then I can only choose them.”","Bo Cheng Real Estate?","Everyone’s hearts trembled.","Kang Corporation’s perfumes were not comparable to Bo Cheng Real Estate at all. Anyone would choose to invest in Bo Cheng Real Estate.","!!","Everyone present knew that the bet agreement was too risky for Kang Corporation, but other than Kang Junjie, no one else was willing to invest in Kang Corporation.","Perhaps the perfume business might fail, but if they could not get the investment, they would not even have the chance to try. Moreover, when the perfume competition began, Old Madam Kang had already gotten someone to start producing perfumes with the funds. If they canceled the project now, they would not be able to recover the money they had invested previously. This project would definitely cause Kang Corporation to suffer a heavy blow.","Should they take a greater risk and take the challenge, or should they give up now?","Everyone looked at Kang Jichuan, waiting for his answer.","Seeing that he was hesitating, Kang Junjie shook his head regretfully and stood up to walk out. Kang Jichuan watched as he got farther and farther away from him. He could not help but think of Kang Qingzhi. He clenched his fists tightly, and his eyes were filled with anger and unwillingness. In the end, he sighed. “Junjie, has the contract been drawn up?”","Kang Junjie stopped in his tracks, and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. He won this bet in the end. Now, it was up to Qiao Xi’s performance.","The woman Gu Zheng liked would naturally not be bad. Moreover, Qiao Xi’s grudge against the Kang family was too deep. If she wanted to deal with the Kang family, she would definitely not show mercy!","At this moment, at Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi sat in the small pavilion in the backyard. The autumn wind brought with it a trace of coldness. She leaned against the rocking chair and swayed gently, looking extremely satisfied.","Qiao Xi was not surprised at all that Kang Jichuan had finally signed the bet agreement.","Gu Yao was chattering at the side. “Why don’t you have any reaction at all? When I heard the news, I was so excited that I jumped up! If the business fails, they’ll have to pay 4.8 billion yuan! Kang Jichuan actually agreed?”","Qiao Xi closed her eyes and said slowly, “What else can he do if he doesn’t agree? Is such a small matter worth getting excited about? The amount of money involved in this bet isn’t big. Kang Junjie can only choose a sum that Kang Jichuan can afford and force him to jump into the trap.”","Gu Yao: “...” He suddenly felt that it was good to do a small business. It was too scary to have billions at the drop of a hat.","“Speaking of which, why did Yao Junjie change his surname? Isn’t he Yao Mengqing’s brother?” Gu Yao asked curiously.","Qiao Xi replied, “Yao Junjie isn’t from the Yao family to begin with. His surname is Kang, but his parents passed away when he was very young. His mother is from the Yao family, so his parents’ business belongs to the Yao family. In order to survive in the Yao family, he took the initiative to change his surname to Yao. Now that he has the ability, he changed it back. Don’t call him by the wrong name when you see him in the future. He’s called Kang Junjie.”","Gu Yao nodded and sat down on the chair beside Qiao Xi. Looking at her resting with her eyes closed, he asked with a smile, “Qiao Xi, the finals are about to start. Why aren’t you anxious at all? If Kang Qingzhi wins, won’t that plan...”","“It doesn’t matter who wins.” Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes with a trace of ridicule. “Even if she wins, it’s meaningless. After all, I wrote that perfume recipe.”","Five years ago, Kang Qingzhi stole her perfume recipes and she did not pursue the matter. Did Kang Qingzhi think that the perfume recipes were hers?m","She had long said that what was stolen could never be hers, but Kang Qingzhi seemed to have forgotten about it. She would see her in the competition!","Gu Yao instantly understood what Qiao Xi meant and smiled extremely proudly. “Do you need my help? As long as you say the word, I’ll go through fire and water!”","“There’s no need. Don’t worry about the perfume competition.” Qiao Xi smiled and said, “We won’t do anything in the finals this time. We’ll just let the competition continue normally. Kang Qingzhi’s ranking will depend on her luck.","“But she’ll be using my perfume recipe, after all. If nothing goes wrong, it won’t be a problem for her to get second place. At the very least, she’ll get third place!”","Gu Yao asked in confusion, “The perfume recipe you came up with can only win second place? Then who’s impressive and awesome enough to win the championship?”","Qiao Xi smiled. “I’m participating in the competition. Who else could it be but me?!”"]},{"number":1575,"title":"Chapter 1575 Swindling","paragraphs":["1575 Swindling","Just as Gu Yao and Qiao Xi were chatting, Gu Zheng slowly walked over and said indifferently, “Kang Corporation and Kang Junjie have signed a contract.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “I knew it a long time ago. With Kang Jichuan’s character, how could he give up on this investment? Kang Junjie took the initiative to invest and gave him a chance to try. He could only choose to sign the contract.”","“Xi Xi, you already know!” Gu Zheng’s voice was calm, but the next second, he suddenly bent down and muttered in her ear, “Then do you know something else?”","Qiao Xi subconsciously asked, “What is it?”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “Xi Xi, you should know that there are two genius perfumers in the perfume world. One of them is Twilight.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She already knew that Gu Zheng was Twilight, so she felt inexplicably awkward when she heard Gu Zheng mention this name.","Qiao Xi paused. Gu Zheng looked at her and said with a smile, “You and Kang Qingzhi have both seen Twilight, and Kang Qingzhi knows very well that Mr. Twilight won’t help her.”","Of course! Gu Zheng would definitely not help Kang Qingzhi!","“As for the other genius...” Gu Zheng deliberately dragged out his voice with a trace of charm. “Do you know who it is?”","Qiao Xi gulped, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly.","Gu Zheng said casually, “The other one is called Mu Jin. Xi Xi, you’re so talented in perfumery. You should have heard of this name! Moreover, I think your work is very similar to Miss Mu Jin’s!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She squeezed out an awkward smile and avoided Gu Zheng’s gaze.","“There has always been a legend of Mu Jin in the perfume world, but no one seems to have seen her true face, nor does anyone know who she is. If Kang Qingzhi uses this to make an announcement to the public...”","Qiao Xi pretended to be indifferent and picked up the flower tea on the table to take a sip.","Gu Zheng continued, “Kang Qingzhi announced to the public that Mu Jin is her close friend. She learned how to make perfumes from Miss Mu Jin.”","As soon as these words were spoken, Qiao Xi instantly choked on her tea and coughed violently.","Gu Zheng smiled and asked softly, “Xi Xi, you don’t believe that Kang Qingzhi and Mu Jin are friends?”","Qiao Xi’s face flushed red as she grunted angrily. “Kang Qingzhi is shameless! Close friend? How dare she say such things?”","“She’s talking about Miss Mu Jin. Why are you so agitated?” Gu Zheng lazily leaned against the chair, his light brown eyes carrying a trace of teasing.","The angry expression on Qiao Xi’s face instantly stiffened: “...”","“How can you be so sure that Kang Qingzhi is lying?”","Qiao Xi thought in her heart that Kang Qingzhi was naturally lying because she was Mu Jin. How could she have become close friends with Kang Qingzhi? Even if she was friends with a dog, it was absolutely impossible for her to be friends with Kang Qingzhi. How unlucky!","But...","Qiao Xi’s expression was a little complicated. It was not that she wanted to hide it from Gu Zheng, but she could not tell Gu Zheng about Mu Jin’s identity for the time being. She hesitated for a moment and squeezed out a smile that she thought was innocent. “Oh! I don’t need to think to know that Kang Qingzhi is definitely lying! If she really knew Mu Jin, why did she only say it now?”","“Oh?” Gu Zheng chuckled.","Qiao Xi inexplicably felt a little flustered and did not dare to look into Gu Zheng’s eyes. She casually said, “I’m just angry that Kang Qingzhi always uses someone else’s name to swindle others!”","Gu Zheng smiled and stroked her head. He whispered in her ear, “Mrs. Gu, you’re so indignant. Those who don’t know might think that you know Miss Mu Jin.”","Qiao Xi denied it. “No! Don’t spout nonsense! I just think that a genius like Mu Jin won’t be friends with someone like Kang Qingzhi. I...”","“I understand, Mrs. Gu.” Gu Zheng pinched her cheek affectionately and interrupted her.","She suddenly had a feeling that Gu Zheng seemed to be coaxing a child.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi could not help but ask, “When did Kang Qingzhi say that she and Mu Jin are friends?”","Why had she not heard this news?","Gu Zheng said softly, “Kang Junjie invested 800 million yuan in Kang Corporation, so the Kang family naturally has to show the investors their ability. Coincidentally, someone realized that the perfume Kang Qingzhi made a few years ago was extremely similar to Mu Jin’s style...”","Gu Zheng handed the phone to Qiao Xi. “Take a look.”","Qiao Xi took it and took a look. A perfumer had posted a thread comparing Kang Qingzhi’s works in the past few years to Mu Jin’s from a few years ago. The similarity between their works had reached 75%.","The selection of spices and the techniques used were very similar. As soon as this news was released, netizens questioned Kang Qingzhi for plagiarism."]},{"number":1576,"title":"Chapter 1576 Plagiarism Storm","paragraphs":["1576 Plagiarism Storm","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a smile. Kang Qingzhi had already taken the first wrong step!","A lie needed to be covered up by countless lies. She wanted to see how Kang Qingzhi would cover this up. One wrong word could ruin her reputation.","At Kang Corporation.","Due to Kang Qingzhi framing Bright Moon, the Kang family had recently been boycotted by netizens. Although the Kang family had already pushed all the blame on Xu Ling, it still could not change everyone’s hatred for the Kang family. After all, they had all seen that video. At that time, the Kang family was arrogant and forced Bright Moon to give up clarifying things.","After that, Kang Qingzhi risked her life to save someone. Her reputation was cleared up a little, and everyone thought that she had a good character. Just as the Kang family’s reputation rose, Kang Qingzhi was suspected of plagiarizing Miss Mu Jin’s work.","Kang Qingzhi’s perfumes were indeed very similar to Miss Mu Jin’s work. The spices used and the smell were almost the same.","Kang Qingzhi, who had originally cleared her name a little, got into a plagiarism scandal. She was scolded by the netizens and became a trending topic again.","Kang Jichuan held an emergency meeting, and the shareholders protested unhappily. “Young Master Kang, don’t forget that Kang Junjie has already signed a bet agreement with us. It’s effective from now on. It hasn’t been long, but your sister is exposed for plagiarism. What are you siblings doing?!”","Kang Jichuan’s expression darkened as he retorted loudly, “Those are all rumors! Qingzhi wouldn’t have plagiarized!”","The shareholder snorted. “It’s useless to tell us this. Miss Kang’s work is similar to Miss Mu Jin’s. Miss Mu Jin is a genius girl in the perfume world and everyone believes in her. Miss Kang has offended Miss Mu Jin, so she’ll definitely incite public anger. Once it’s confirmed that Miss Kang plagiarized, not only will the Kang family be affected, but all of us will be implicated too!”","At this moment, the shareholders were not in the mood to coax this young master. Kang Qingzhi was embroiled in a scandal and caused a huge loss to Kang Corporation. At first, they could not bicker with her on account of Kang Jichuan, but now that Mu Jin was involved, they could not tolerate it anymore.","“President Kang, you have to remember that you signed a bet agreement. If the business fails, you have to compensate with 4.8 billion yuan. If this continues, will you have the money to compensate?”","With that, the shareholders stood up angrily and left. They were already extremely disappointed in Kang Jichuan. As for Kang Qingzhi, could she not just focus on making good perfumes? Why did she have to court death and plagiarize Miss Mu Jin?","Even though Kang Corporation had been explaining to the public that Kang Qingzhi did not plagiarize, anyone with discerning eyes could tell that their perfume styles were extremely similar. Everyone would not believe them just because they explained themselves.","Watching the shareholders leave resolutely, Kang Jichuan leaned against the chair dispiritedly. Emotions surged in his heart. He did not believe that Qingzhi would plagiarize. There must be a misunderstanding.","He had long heard of the name Mu Jin. She was known as a genius girl in the perfume world. Even if Qing Zhi wanted to plagiarize, she would not be so stupid as to plagiarize Mu Jin.","Moreover, Qingzhi was talented in perfumery and was so kind-hearted. Back then, when Xi Xi stole her perfume recipes, she did not care at all and was even willing to give them to Xi Xi. Qingzhi, a kind girl, would not plagiarize someone else’s hard work.","However, now that everyone thought that Qingzhi had plagiarized, he had to give a reasonable explanation to prove Qingzhi’s innocence.","Kang Jichuan slammed the documents on the table onto the floor. His eyes were red and filled with anger.","Qingzhi had been safe and sound all these years. Now that she was suddenly exposed for plagiarism, there was no doubt who was behind this. It was just that he did not expect Xi Xi to hate Qingzhi so much that she actually wanted to completely destroy her!","At the same time, in the Kang family’s villa.","Kang Qingzhi stared at the comments on her phone with resentment.","Who was Mu Jin? When did she plagiarize Mu Jin’s work? She did not know Mu Jin at all and had never smelled her work. Why was everyone saying that she plagiarized Mu Jin’s work?","It would be fine if it was just one perfume that happened to be the same, but there were actually five perfumes that were similar to Mu Jin’s work. Moreover, those perfumes were released by Mu Jin four years ago, while she released them three years ago, so she could not refute the rumors easily.","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists tightly, her sharp nails digging into her palms. The perfumes she made were done using Qiao Xi’s perfume recipes five years ago, which meant they were created even earlier than Mu Jin’s perfumes. Even if someone had plagiarized, it was definitely Mu Jin who plagiarized Qiao Xi. However, she could not say these words."]},{"number":1577,"title":"Chapter 1577 Giving Her A Big Gift","paragraphs":["1577 Giving Her A Big Gift","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip tightly. Once she told the truth, everyone would know that she had stolen Qiao Xi’s perfume recipes.","No! She absolutely could not admit it!","Kang Qingzhi’s expression was malicious as he hurriedly made a call. “I want to investigate the perfumer, Mu Jin. Name the price and give me the news as soon as possible.”","Soon, the hackers all saw this request and could not help but be a little curious. An hour ago, Black Tide posted a message saying that she would accept any requests to investigate Mu Jin. She even wanted to pass the message around. However, this message was written by her in advance.","What else could the people from Stars say? Of course, they agreed. It was just that they did not expect someone to place an order in less than an hour.","Not long after Kang Qingzhi placed the order, the hacker organization replied. Kang Qingzhi looked at the information and suddenly had a good idea.","Stars was a top organization in the hacker world. The news they found must be true. Moreover, investigating a perfumer was just a small matter to Stars.","Kang Qingzhi suddenly laughed. Qiao Xi wanted to ruin her with plagiarism, but she did not expect that this matter would bring her benefits instead. It was even to the extent that after this matter was clarified, she would become a sensational perfumer in the industry.","Speaking of which, she had to thank Qiao Xi for giving her such a big gift!","At this moment, Old Madam Kang and Kang Ru still did not know what was going on online. They were still fantasizing about how enthusiastic the press conference for their perfumes would be. The Kang family’s perfumes would definitely sell well, and Qingzhi would become a popular figure in the perfume world.","Just as the two of them were drinking tea and chatting downstairs, Kang Qingzhi walked down with a pale face and red eyes. She said in a sobbing voice, “Dad, Grandma, is Brother still in the company?”","Seeing Kang Qingzhi cry, Kang Ru’s and Old Madam Kang’s hearts instantly ached. They hurriedly asked, “Qingzhi, why are you crying? What happened?”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip and said pitifully, “I... I’m fine, but Brother...”","Before she could finish, the door of the villa slammed open and Kang Jichuan walked in dispiritedly. His face was ashen as he glanced at Kang Qingzhi gloomily.","Kang Ru looked at Kang Qingzhi, then at Kang Jichuan. She asked in confusion, “Jichuan, what happened? Weren’t you going to sign the investment agreement?”","Kang Jichuan’s heart felt like it was stuffed with a huge rock. He wanted to tell his father and Grandma everything that had happened today. The investor was Kang Junjie. What would Kang Corporation face after signing the bet agreement? However, he could not say anything.","If he had not received Qingzhi’s call, he would never have signed the bet agreement. However, there were rumors online of Qingzhi plagiarizing now. If Qingzhi could not clear her name, Kang Corporation would not be able to make a comeback this time!","Seeing that Kang Jichuan did not speak for a long time, Kang Ru could not help but feel a little flustered. “J-Jichuan, what exactly is going on? Say something!”","Kang Jichuan moved his lips and shook his head silently. If he said it out loud, Qingzhi would probably be sad. She would think that as her brother, he did not believe her. Qingzhi’s health was not good to begin with, so she should leave these troubles to him!","“Dad, I know what happened.” At this moment, Kang Qingzhi suddenly spoke. Tears trickled down her face, and her voice trembled. “It’s all my fault. I caused my brother to be annoyed. I caused Kang Corporation’s reputation to be damaged.”","Hearing Kang Qingzhi’s words, Kang Ru was even more confused. Kang Jichuan was about to explain when Kang Qingzhi beat him to it. “Brother signed the bet agreement today. If the perfume business fails this time, we’ll have to pay a large sum of money. I was originally confident about winning the championship. When I win, the new products will definitely be released smoothly, but...","“But the bet agreement was signed just this morning, and there are now rumors online that I plagiarized.”","Kang Qingzhi wiped her tears. Her eyes and nose were red, and she looked pitiful. “The investor just invested in Kang Corporation, and such a thing happened right on the heels of that. Someone must be deliberately messing with us. Someone wants Kang Corporation to compensate the investor with a huge sum of money. At that time, the company will definitely face the crisis of bankruptcy.”","Kang Qingzhi did not say that the investor was Kang Junjie because she wanted Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang to think that the person most likely to attack Kang Corporation was Qiao Xi.","The next second, Kang Ru suddenly frowned.","Kang Jichuan was a little surprised. “Qingzhi, how do you know about this?”","Kang Qingzhi looked at him with an aggrieved and worried gaze. “Brother, I know you’re worried that I’ll be sad, which is why you didn’t want to tell me, but these things happened because of me. I would’ve found out anyway.”"]},{"number":1578,"title":"Chapter 1578 Who’s Going Against The Kang Family Behind The Scenes?","paragraphs":["1578 Who’s Going Against The Kang Family Behind The Scenes?","“I hid my identity because I didn’t want others to think that I relied on my identity to win the championship. I didn’t expect someone to misunderstand me because of this.”","Kang Jichuan’s heart ached. On the way back, he even suspected that Qingzhi had plagiarized. However, now that he saw Qingzhi, he knew that he had misunderstood her. She would not plagiarize.","However, she said that she hid her identity. What was going on?","Before Kang Jichuan could think it through, he heard Kang Qingzhi’s soft voice. “Brother, actually, there’s something I’ve been hiding from you. Many years ago, I casually chose a name and used that identity to make a few bottles of perfumes. Unexpectedly, I somehow became a genius girl in the perfume world.”","There was a trace of confusion and surprise in her eyes. “I didn’t expect the perfumes I casually made to suddenly become popular and be liked by everyone. However, I didn’t want to expose my identity and participate in the competition using that identity. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be fair to the other contestants...”","Kang Jichuan gasped and looked at her in shock. “Qingzhi, you... You mean...”","Kang Qingzhi was a little embarrassed. After a few seconds of silence, she said softly, “Yes, I’m Mu Jin. I didn’t expect this matter to spread like wildfire online.","“I know that the name Mu Jin is a top existence in the perfume world. I thought that if I participated as Mu Jin, I’d definitely be given preferential treatment by everyone. No matter what work I submit, they’ll give me the highest evaluation. Hence, I changed my identity to participate in the competition. However, my style hasn’t changed much. I only changed some of the basic spices. Unexpectedly, so many years have passed and someone thinks they have something on me.”","Everyone heard Kang Qingzhi’s explanation clearly.","Kang Jichuan’s originally worried face was filled with surprise at this moment. He hurriedly pulled Kang Qingzhi back and asked excitedly, “Qingzhi, are you really Mu Jin?”","“Yes.” Kang Qingzhi nodded shyly.","“Alright!” The gloominess in Kang Jichuan’s heart was swept away. He said loudly, “You’re Mu Jin. Of course, there’s no problem with your work being similar to your previous works. You just modified your previous works. This is something many contestants have done before. Moreover, it’s allowed by the competition’s organizers. If the people who are scolding you online know that you’re Mu Jin, they’ll definitely regret it!”","“Qingzhi, don’t worry. I’ll tell the higher-ups of the company and get them to clarify things online.”","Kang Qingzhi nodded obediently. “Alright, Brother. I’ll also use Mu Jin’s account to send a message to prove that I didn’t plagiarize.”","At first, Kang Jichuan thought that the Kang family was really in big trouble this time. Unexpectedly, he found out that his sister was Mu Jin herself. The tables had turned.","Even if he was not from the perfume world, he had heard of the name Mu Jin. Unexpectedly, Qingzhi had hidden it from them for so many years and thought that it was not a big deal. This meant that not only was Qingzhi kind-hearted, but she was also humble and low-profile.","“But...” Kang Qingzhi suddenly frowned, her face filled with confusion. “But I haven’t used the name Mu Jin for many years, and the perfumes I released three years ago didn’t attract any attention. Why did someone suddenly compare our perfumes?","“I’m Mu Jin herself, which is how I’ll prove my innocence online. But if I wasn’t, then the Kang family would...” Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with panic and fear. “Who exactly is targeting the Kang family behind the scenes?”","At the mention of this, everyone’s expressions suddenly darkened.","The next second, Old Madam Kang slammed the cup on the table and gritted her teeth as she shouted, “It must be that b*tch! Who else could it be? Qiao Xi can’t wait to destroy the Kang family!”","Kang Qingzhi pretended to be surprised. “That’s impossible, right? No matter what, Sister Xi Xi is Dad’s biological daughter. The Kang family’s blood flows in her body. If the Kang family really collapses, what benefits will she get? Grandma, you must have misunderstood Sister Xi Xi.”","Seeing Kang Qingzhi take the initiative to defend Qiao Xi, Kang Jichuan could not help but sigh in his heart. Qingzhi was really too kind.","Actually, he also suspected that Qiao Xi was behind this. His father probably thought the same. Only Qingzhi was still willing to believe Qiao Xi and felt that she would not attack her family.","Old Madam Kang said angrily, “Qingzhi, she has always hated you, so she wants to label you as a plagiarist and ruin your reputation. She’s so vicious, so why are you still speaking up for her?","“She hates you for occupying her identity, and she hates the Kang family for not announcing her identity, so she wants to take revenge on us. This little b*tch is simply crazy!”"]},{"number":1579,"title":"Chapter 1579 Letting The Thief Walk Into The Trap","paragraphs":["1579 Letting The Thief Walk Into The Trap","“Little bastard! The moment she appeared, she turned the house upside down. She’s a jinx. Why didn’t she die outside?” Old Madam Kang cursed without caring about her image, then urged, “Qingzhi, quickly use Mu Jin’s account to post a clarification. We can’t let that little b*tch affect our Kang family’s reputation!”","In the past, when Old Madam Kang scolded Qiao Xi, Kang Ru would still stand up to stop her. However, Kang Ru no longer had any reaction. He felt that his mother was only scolding her a few times to vent the anger in her heart. There was nothing wrong with that. On the other hand, Qiao Xi had gone too far. She slandered Qingzhi and caused her reputation to be damaged. The Kang family’s business was also affected. Even if she was scolded, she reaped what she sowed.","Everyone in the Kang family thought that Qiao Xi was behind this, but in reality, Qiao Xi was innocent! She did not know who did it.","At this moment, in Longwan Residential, Xue Yi asked in surprise, “Little Six, you really didn’t do it?”","Qiao Xi: “???”","She exclaimed pretentiously, “Sister Yi, I’m such a weak, kind, and magnanimous person. How could I have done such a thing?”","Xue Yi: “...” Weak, kind, and magnanimous? These words did not seem to have anything to do with Qiao Xi, right?","She tried her best to control her expression and thought for a moment. “Since you didn’t do it, who else could it be? They compared Kang Qingzhi and Mu Jin’s perfumes together. Every spice was listed clearly. This person must be a perfumer too!”","Qiao Xi also had a puzzled expression. “I’m not too sure either. It’s possible that it’s a fan of mine! After all, I was quite a sensation in the perfume world back then and was known as a genius girl in the industry. Although I haven’t appeared for many years, it’s not strange for a strong, young, and beautiful woman like me to have a few fans who know how to make perfumes pay attention to me.”","Xue Yi: “...” She had never seen anyone praise themselves like this!","Qiao Xi really did not know who was dealing with the Kang family behind the scenes. She had checked the other party’s IP address, but there were no clues. From the current situation, that person did not have any ill intentions toward her and just wanted to mess with the Kang family.","“Oh my God! Little Six, I’ve never seen such a shameless person!” Suddenly, Xue Yi exclaimed and handed the phone to Qiao Xi. Her voice was filled with disdain.","“Um... Why did Kang Qingzhi use your account to send a message? Did she steal your account? Damn! This woman is really shameless!”","When Qiao Xi saw the news on the screen, she suddenly laughed. “Heh, as expected. She really took this path.”","Xue Yi: “???”","Qiao Xi said, “The entire internet is suspecting Kang Qingzhi of plagiarism, so Kang Qingzhi is forced to lie. If she admits to plagiarism, she and the Kang family won’t have a chance to make a comeback. She has to clear her name and elevate her identity. Of course, she can only say that she’s Mu Jin.","“Actually, I’ve long guessed her thoughts, so I specially arranged a path for her. I specially created Mu Jin’s account four years ago.”","Five years ago, Qiao Xi lost her memory, but she inexplicably lost more than 20 perfume recipes. Of course, she found it strange, but she did not know who stole her perfume recipes. Hence, she specially created an account to set up a trap because sooner or later, that thief would walk into a trap.","The news that Kang Qingzhi had plagiarized Mu Jin had spread like wildfire online. However, less than a day later, Mu Jin’s account suddenly posted a clarification message: [Everyone, I’m really sorry for causing trouble. I want to explain here that I left the perfume industry four years ago because of my health. After my body recovered, I decided to change my identity and start over. I’m Kang Qingzhi, and Kang Qingzhi is Mu Jin.","[I casually chose the name Mu Jin back then and even created a few bottles of perfume. I didn’t expect to be so famous, nor did I expect to be suspected of plagiarism one day. The perfumes I released three years ago were modified from the perfumes I released four years ago. Of course, the style is similar, and the spices used are almost the same.]","This news instantly caused a commotion online.","Everyone thought that Kang Qingzhi plagiarized a genius girl from the perfume world in order to become famous. No one expected the truth to be like this. Kang Qingzhi was Mu Jin.","If she was Mu Jin, then there was nothing wrong with her modifying the perfumes she previously released. Moreover, it was normal for the perfumes to smell similar."]},{"number":1580,"title":"Chapter 1580 They’ve Already Taken The Bait","paragraphs":["1580 They’ve Already Taken The Bait","[From what Mu Jin said, someone deliberately dug up this matter to target her!]","[Mu Jin hasn’t appeared in many years. Her perfumes were also made five years ago. That person specially compared their perfumes. I don’t think they’re trying to find the person who plagiarized Mu Jin but they’re trying to accuse Kang Qingzhi of plagiarism!]","[That makes sense. Kang Qingzhi is about to participate in the finals of the International Perfume Competition. I heard that she has always been the champion candidate. Once it’s exposed that she plagiarized Mu Jin, she won’t be qualified to continue participating in the competition. Who will be the beneficiary?]","When Qiao Xi saw these comments, the corners of her mouth curled up in disdain. How did this group of people think of this? Was it their own thoughts, or were they fake commenters hired by Kang Qingzhi?","!!","She continued to read the comments below. As expected...","[The beneficiary must be Bright Moon. She had a conflict with Miss Kang since the beginning of the perfume competition. If Miss Kang can’t participate in the competition, she’ll be the champion!]","[That’s right! Bright Moon has been wronged, but Mu Jin has already apologized. Moreover, it was clearly Xu Ling who schemed against Bright Moon. It has nothing to do with Mu Jin, right?!]","[It’s 100% Bright Moon. She must be deliberately targeting Kang Qingzhi to force her to withdraw from the competition. Unexpectedly, Kang Qingzhi and Mu Jin are the same person. Bright Moon will probably be angered to death. She originally wanted to slander Kang Qingzhi, but she accidentally exposed Kang Qingzhi’s identity as a big shot, Mu Jin!]","[Although Bright Moon has some talent in perfumery, she’s not worth mentioning in front of Goddess Mu Jin. I hope Bright Moon won’t put all her focus on crooked methods. It’s better to strengthen herself. Unfortunately, no matter how hard she works, she can’t catch up to Goddess Mu Jin!]","Xue Yi looked at the comments online and clenched her fists. She gritted her teeth. “These idiots...”","“Oh! Don’t be angry.” Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression and even comforted the angry Xue Yi. “Actually, I don’t believe that my fans are so stupid. They’re probably Kang Qingzhi’s fake commenters and fans.”","Xue Yi calmed down. She was angry for Qiao Xi, but when she thought about it carefully, Mu Jin had not released any new work for four years. Although there were many people who admired her, she did not have many fans. Most of the fans who paid attention to her until now were calm and rational people. They would not think that Bright Moon was framing Mu Jin just because of Kang Qingzhi’s words.","“When are you going to expose that little b*tch?” Xue Yi said angrily.","Qiao Xi smiled. “There’s no rush. Have you received Kang Corporation’s investment?”","Xue Yi said, “Yes, but Kang Corporation hasn’t invested all their money yet. However, according to the current situation, the Kang family will definitely invest more money. After all, Kang Qingzhi has announced online that she’s Mu Jin. On the surface, the sales of Kang Corporation’s perfumes are already guaranteed.","“As long as Kang Qingzhi wins the championship, coupled with Mu Jin’s celebrity status, the perfumes will definitely sell well. At that time, the Kang family will take this opportunity to earn a lot.”","Qiao Xi nodded and smiled meaningfully. “If I weren’t Mu Jin, I would have thought the same. Kang Jichuan definitely won’t miss this good opportunity.”","What was the Kang family thinking?","Kang Qingzhi was the champion.","The genius girl from the perfume world, Mu Jin, was from the Kang family. This business would definitely succeed!","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth slowly curled up. “The Kang family has already taken the bait. Soon, they’ll fall from heaven to the quagmire. I really want to see their expressions!”","She wanted to see Kang Qingzhi’s identity getting exposed during the perfume competition with her own eyes. She would be exposed for stealing her perfume recipes and her reputation would be ruined. She would never be able to make a comeback. She would become the public enemy of the entire perfume world. The Kang family would also be despised and boycotted by the public.","What right did a thief have to stand on stage to receive an award? If Kang Qingzhi could become a genius in the perfume world, how unfair would it be to the perfumer who had painstakingly created those perfumes?","At this moment, Xue Yi suddenly remembered. “By the way, can you sue the Kang family for producing the perfumes you made? This way, the Kang family will have to compensate you with a sum of money!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows slyly. “In theory, that’s the case. If the Kang family doesn’t provoke me during this period of time and knows their place, I can let this matter go on the day of the finals. However, with my understanding of them, they’ll definitely not let the matter go.”","Xue Yi lowered her voice. “Little Six, do you mean they’ll come for your blood?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Yes! Five years ago, when Kang Jichuan found out that my blood could save Kang Qingzhi, he tried his best to get close to me and gain my trust. After using me, he tried to kill me, causing me to almost lose my life.”"]},{"number":1581,"title":"Chapter 1581 The Way To Get The Blood","paragraphs":["1581 The Way To Get The Blood","“At that time, Kang Jichuan was able to abandon his biological sister to save Kang Qingzhi. Now, he can also do this. He’s even more vicious and heartless than before!”","Qiao Xi’s voice was icy-cold. “Kang Jichuan has been unable to restrain himself for a long time. It’s just that Gu Zheng has always been protecting me, so he doesn’t dare to act rashly. Think about it carefully. What other way does the Kang family have to avoid Gu Zheng and get my blood?”","Xue Yi held her chin and thought. Her face instantly turned pale. “Could it be... prison?”","The current Xi Xi almost never went out. Even when she went out, Gu Zheng would accompany her. However, if Xi Xi went to jail and Gu Zheng could not accompany her, it would be much easier for the Kang family to take her blood then.","!!","Once Xi Xi was really framed by the Kang family and sent to prison, she would become a lamb waiting to be slaughtered. In the end, she would become Kang Qingzhi’s blood bank.","Xue Yi felt a chill surge in her heart, and her voice was filled with anger and fear. “They... How dare they do this to you? Aren’t you Kang Ru’s biological daughter? How can they be so heartless? They actually want to kill their biological family member for an adopted one?”","“In their eyes, Kang Qingzhi is an existence more important than blood relations,” Qiao Xi said casually.","Xue Yi’s eyes turned red as she held Qiao Xi’s hand tightly. “I really don’t understand why Kang Jichuan would do this. He wants to kill his own sister for Kang Qingzhi?”","“I don’t understand either. What kind of drug did Kang Qingzhi give Kang Jichuan to make him sacrifice me to save her? If Kang Ru were to make a choice, he wouldn’t have the heart to take my blood even if he doesn’t like me.","“Old Madam Kang has always hated my mom. It’s normal for her to hate me, but Kang Jichuan and I are from the same mother. Why is he doing this to me?","“I keep having the feeling that when it comes to Kang Qingzhi, Kang Jichuan seems to have changed into a different person. After seeing that Kang Qingzhi’s condition is serious, he can’t wait anymore. He’ll definitely rack his brains to get me to go to jail during this period of time.”","Xue Yi’s body trembled, and her eyes were filled with worry. “Xi Xi...”","“It’s fine, don’t worry.” Qiao Xi grabbed Xue Yi’s hand. “It’s not that easy for them to deal with me. I want to see what Kang Jichuan can think of.”","At the Kang family’s villa.","“B*tch! She’s just jealous of Qingzhi and is trying her best to destroy her!” Old Madam Kang slammed the table and roared with a ferocious expression like a wild beast that was about to be released.","“Ah Ru, Jichuan, we can’t let this go. We’ll sue her now. She spread rumors and slandered Qingzhi. She even caused the Kang family to suffer a loss. I want her to go to jail!”","Kang Ru instantly widened his eyes and hurriedly stopped her. “No! Xi Xi is my daughter, after all. It wasn’t easy for me to find her. How can I...”","“She’s not a member of our Kang family. She’s a jinx! Ever since she appeared, she’s been causing trouble for the Kang family time and again. If you acknowledge this daughter of yours, the Kang family will be destroyed in her hands sooner or later! Qingzhi is lucky this time as she happens to be Mu Jin herself. If Qingzhi weren’t Mu Jin, she wouldn’t be able to make a comeback in her life. The company would also face bankruptcy!”","Old Madam Kang shouted at the top of her voice, “You only have eyes for your vicious daughter. Have you ever thought about Qingzhi’s feelings and how much she has suffered?!”","Kang Qingzhi shed tears aggrievedly, but she still pretended to be strong. “Grandma, I... I’m fine.”","Kang Ru was stunned on the spot, her eyes filled with conflict. “But Xi Xi...”","Kang Jichuan looked at Kang Qingzhi’s pale face and red eyes from crying. He suddenly recalled that if he did not get Xi Xi’s blood soon, Qingzhi would not be able to hold on anymore. However, Gu Zheng had been protecting Xi Xi. Ever since Qin An guessed his intentions last time, he had no chance of getting close to Xi Xi. How could he get Xi Xi’s blood?","It would take at least five months for Qingzhi to complete the blood transfusion, but Gu Zheng was so vigilant. Not to mention taking Xi Xi away for five months, even if he took Xi Xi away for a day, Gu Zheng would still come looking for him. If the blood transfusion was interrupted, not only would he not be able to save Qingzhi, but Qingzhi’s condition might even worsen.","At this point, there might only be one way. That was to let Xi Xi go to jail. If Xi Xi went to jail, she would be without Gu Zheng’s protection, and he could secretly bring Xi Xi out and imprison her for five months so that she could donate her blood to Qingzhi. This could be considered as her compensation for causing Qingzhi’s illness to flare up."]},{"number":1582,"title":"Chapter 1582 Legendary Figure","paragraphs":["1582 Legendary Figure","Kang Jichuan thought about it and felt that this was the only way. It was just that Xi Xi would definitely hate them, but he couldn’t care less now. Xi Xi was only going to jail, but Qingzhi would die if she did not undergo a blood transfusion!","After Qingzhi recovered, he would bring Xi Xi out of prison. This could be considered as him making it up to Xi Xi. It did not matter if Xi Xi hated him. In any case, he was extremely disappointed in his biological sister.","Kang Jichuan had never understood. He and his father were both kind and gentle people, and Qingzhi was even more so. Why was Xi Xi so cold-blooded? She could clearly use her blood to save Qingzhi, but she refused no matter what. Would she be happy to see Qingzhi die in pain?","He pondered for a moment and suddenly said, “Dad, I think Grandma is right. Xi Xi has been targeting Qingzhi time and again. This time, she was almost destroyed. If we don’t punish her a little, she won’t know her mistake and will hurt Qingzhi again in the future.","!!","“It’s fine that she usually bullies Qingzhi, but she went too far this time and even caused the Kang family to lose four billion yuan. We can’t indulge her anymore!”","Kang Ru was still in a dilemma. “What do you want to do...”","Kang Jichuan pretended to be helpless. “Let’s do as Grandma says. We’ll sue Xi Xi and lock her up for a period of time. If she really repents, we’ll issue a letter of understanding and bring her out of prison.”","A trace of pride flashed past Kang Qingzhi’s eyes, but there was worry and pity on her face. “Brother, even if Sister Xi Xi is in the wrong, you can’t punish her like this!”","At this point, Qingzhi was still thinking about Xi Xi, but Xi Xi had never thought about Qingzhi. The remaining guilt in Kang Jichuan’s heart instantly vanished as anger surged in his heart. “Qingzhi, you don’t have to pity her! She has to be punished for doing something wrong. We’re too indulgent of her, which is why she’s so unscrupulous. She has hurt you time and again!”","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head and smiled sinisterly.","How laughable! Qiao Xi was going to be personally sent to prison by her family. Soon, her biological brother would take this opportunity to extract her blood and make her become a living blood bank to be tortured.","Hahaha! It was really too satisfying!","Kang Qingzhi laughed loudly in her heart. She was looking forward to seeing Qiao Xi being imprisoned. She should look like a dog struggling at death’s door!","...","Gu Corporation.","Song Shijing stood beside Gu Zheng and said softly, “President, I’ve investigated what you instructed me to do. The Kang family’s investments have been transferred to us. They’ve already put the perfumes into production, but they seem to be very dissatisfied with Young Madam.”","“Dissatisfied?” Gu Zheng paused and raised an eyebrow.","Song Shijing nodded, took out a document, and placed it in front of Gu Zheng. “The Kang family announced to the public that they want to sue the person who slandered Kang Qingzhi for plagiarism. Now, the Kang family thinks that person is Young Madam. They even said that they have evidence. Kang Qingzhi also insists that the person who framed her is Young Madam.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold, and his voice was low and hoarse. “You said... the Kang family wants to sue Xi Xi?”","“Yes.”","Gu Zheng chuckled. “They want to sue Xi Xi for Kang Qingzhi? Are they crazy?”","Song Shijing was also speechless. Kang Qingzhi was just an adopted daughter. Even if they doted on their adopted daughter, they could not let their biological daughter go to jail for their adopted daughter!","Was the Kang family crazy?!","Moreover, why did they believe Kang Qingzhi’s one-sided story? Just because Kang Qingzhi liked to make perfumes and pretended to be Mu Jin, the Kang family invested all their money. Were they not afraid that if their business failed, they would lose everything?","“Song Shijing,” Gu Zheng suddenly said with a cold smile.","Song Shijing replied. His heart trembled when he saw the president’s expression.","The next second, Gu Zheng said casually, “The Kang family trusts Kang Qingzhi so much. They think that she’s the Kang family’s money tree and can bring endless money to the Kang family. Since that’s the case, let’s use their trust.”","“Use Mr. Zheng’s identity...” Gu Zheng paused. “To invest in Kang Corporation.”","Song Shijing was stunned!","It had been a long time since his identity as Mr. Zheng appeared, but there had always been rumors of him in the business world. No one knew who he was, but he had many companies and businesses under his name. His net worth was even higher than the president’s true identity. He was a famous venture capital expert.","No one knew his full name. They only knew that he was called Mr. Zheng. There were many people who wanted to collaborate with him, but the projects he was willing to invest in were all in the range of billions or even tens of billions. However, they would all succeed without exception."]},{"number":1583,"title":"Chapter 1583 Sudden Investment","paragraphs":["1583 Sudden Investment","Song Shijing asked hesitantly, “President, are you sure you want to invest in Kang Corporation?”","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “Send someone to talk to Kang Jichuan.”","Hearing his words, Song Shijing knew that the president had made up his mind. It was useless no matter what others said. “Yes! I’ll arrange it now.”","Kang Junjie had invested 800 million yuan and wanted the Kang family to compensate 4.8 billion yuan. If Mr. Zheng made another move...","!!","At that time, the Kang family would probably empty their assets and only an empty shell would be left!","At this moment, Kang Jichuan was collecting evidence to sue Qiao Xi. He originally did not want things to end up like this, but when he thought of Qingzhi’s red eyes from crying, he could not suppress this thought.","Moreover, Qingzhi was still waiting for blood. He could only get Qiao Xi to go to jail before he had a chance to obtain her blood. He already had evidence in his hands, so he had to succeed this time.","“President Kang.”","At this moment, a higher-up walked in excitedly. He could not suppress the joy on his face. “President Kang! Someone from Sky Eye Venture Corporation came to ask to collaborate with us. The other party said that Mr. Zheng likes Miss Kang’s perfumes very much!”","Kang Jichuan was stunned for a few seconds before standing up abruptly.","Mr. Zheng?","The higher-up said excitedly, “I didn’t expect Miss Kang to really be talented in perfumery. Mr. Zheng from Sky Eye Venture is actually interested in her perfumes. She definitely wouldn’t have plagiarized. Those are all rumors!”","After a long silence, Kang Jichuan reacted and was instantly overjoyed. He did not dare to delay at all and hurriedly went to welcome that person.","After the two parties talked, they quickly signed the agreement. The higher-ups and shareholders sighed. “Miss Kang is really a lucky star! The people from Sky Eye Venture didn’t make any other requests and directly invested such a large sum of money in us. This means that Mr. Zheng trusts Miss Kang very much. As long as Miss Kang wins the championship, our Kang Corporation’s perfumes will definitely be internationally renowned!”","Kang Jichuan sat on the chair, his mind a little empty. All of this was too unreal. It was like a dream. Qingzhi was clearly at the center of the storm a day ago, but now, so many people wanted to invest in Kang Corporation.","Qingzhi must be too outstanding to attract everyone to invest, but he was inexplicably uneasy. The people from Sky Eye Venture did not have any requests. They only wanted to invest in Kang Corporation, making Kang Jichuan think that there was another reason behind this.","However, Kang Corporation had nothing to do with Sky Eye Venture. There was no grudge between them.","Kang Jichuan took a deep breath. Perhaps because he had been troubled by too many things recently, so he was at a loss when good things suddenly came knocking on his door.","...","The day before the finals of the perfume competition, Kang Jichuan sat in the study and looked at the evidence on the table in a daze with a complicated expression.","He could not bear to treat Xi Xi like this, but Xi Xi was really too mischievous. If she had agreed to donate her blood to Qingzhi, he would not have had to spend so much effort thinking of such a method. Moreover, Xi Xi had wronged Qingzhi and caused her reputation to be damaged. It was her fault, so she should pay the price for her actions.","With the Kang family’s power, it was feasible to sue Xi Xi and have her go to jail, but the crime of slander was not serious. Moreover, Gu Zheng was protecting her. If this crime could not make Xi Xi go to jail... However, Xi Xi deliberately pushed Qingzhi down five years ago. Qingzhi fell from upstairs and was almost disabled. In short, this time...","“Brother!” At this moment, Kang Qingzhi pushed the door open and looked at him worriedly with his round eyes. “Brother, I know you’re doing this for me, but Sister Xi Xi...”","Kang Jichuan’s expression darkened as he said seriously, “Even now, you’re still speaking up for her. She’s bullied you time and again. She almost ruined you this time. If we don’t punish her, she won’t change.”","Kang Qingzhi walked forward and advised softly, “Brother, if we have to punish Sister Xi Xi, can we wait until the finals are over? You also know how much Sister Xi Xi likes to make perfumes. She has already entered the finals. If we sue her now, she won’t be able to participate in the competition. Even if we issue a letter of understanding in the future, she probably won’t have a chance. Hence, this is probably Sister Xi Xi’s only chance to participate in the competition. Brother, let’s talk about this after the competition, alright?”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes instantly softened.","Qingzhi... Why was she so kind? Just to let Xi Xi participate in the competition, Qingzhi would rather suffer. She was always considerate to Xi Xi, but Xi Xi was unwilling to save Qingzhi.","Hearing her words, the trace of conflict in Kang Jichuan’s heart instantly dissipated. He knew that doing this was too cruel to Xi Xi, but some things were bound to be sacrificed. Xi Xi was a member of the Kang family, so she had the obligation to do this. This was her responsibility."]},{"number":1584,"title":"Chapter 1584 Absolutely No Chance Of Making A Comeback","paragraphs":["1584 Absolutely No Chance Of Making A Comeback","Kang Jichuan was silent for a few seconds before agreeing. “Alright, Qingzhi, we’ll do as you say. After the competition, you’ll stay in Li City to recuperate. With me around, you’ll definitely be healthy and happy. You’ll always be the most favored daughter of the Kang family!”","Kang Qingzhi smiled sweetly, but her eyes were filled with pride. It would be too easy for Qiao Xi to go to jail now. She should let her see the glory that belonged to her get snatched away and her family members abandoning her one by one. Only then could she enter prison in despair and pain. In the end, she would have to endure the torture of having her blood drawn.","Kang Qingzhi returned to the bedroom in satisfaction, picked up her phone, and made a call. “I made a mistake previously. Qiao Xi definitely won’t have a chance to make a comeback this time!”","A young and arrogant voice came from the other end of the phone. “Are you so sure?”","Kang Qingzhi smiled. “All the plans have been arranged. Moreover, the Kang family believes in me. We have evidence too. Qiao Xi has Gu Zheng by her side, but our Kang family also has power. When the matter blows up, even Gu Zheng won’t be able to protect her.”","The other party was silent for a few seconds before replying coldly, “Alright! We have to succeed this time! If Qiao Xi goes to jail, we have many ways to kill her. As long as she dies, we won’t have anything to worry about. She won’t be a threat to both of us anymore. She should have died a long time ago. There’s no need for her to appear again.”","Kang Qingzhi replied and hung up. Her eyes were filled with viciousness.","She picked up the perfume recipe on the table and memorized the spices and the production process. She then fell asleep in satisfaction.","The next day.","Many people were gathered at the venue of the International Fragrance Competition. As the finals were being broadcasted live, reporters and cameramen from various platforms had long rushed to the event location. They set up their machines and were waiting for the competition to start.","Gu Yao asked anxiously, “Kang Qingzhi is already riding on your head. Why aren’t you reacting at all? If it’s not convenient for you to do anything, I’ll help you deal with her. Who does she think she is?! She even said that she’s Mu Jin. Is she worthy?”","Ever since the previous incident, Gu Yao had always felt that the perfume competition was unfair. Now that Kang Qingzhi had the identity of a genius like Mu Jin, even if Qiao Xi’s perfume was more outstanding than Kang Qingzhi’s perfume, those judges who were blinded by fame and fortune would still stand on Kang Qingzhi’s side.","Qiao Xi did not say anything. Gu Yao looked around and frowned unhappily. “Where’s Gu Zheng? Today is the day of your finals. Why isn’t he here to send you off? He even specially asked me to accompany you. How is he your husband? He doesn’t even care about you! If this goes on, you’ll run away with someone else sooner or later!”","Qiao Xi could not help but laugh in her heart. If Gu Zheng heard Gu Yao’s words, he would definitely be beaten up.","After Gu Yao finished speaking angrily, there was a commotion outside. Then, he saw a man wearing a black mask.","Gu Yao: “...”","At the thought of how he had been beaten up in the past, he trembled nervously. “I think my brother didn’t accompany you here because he had something urgent to attend to. He likes you so much. If he wasn’t busy, he would definitely have accompanied you here.”","“Oh.” Qiao Xi glanced at him with a faint smile, then looked at the man at the door.","Hah! Bastard!","At this moment, the Kang family’s car slowly stopped outside the door.","Kang Jichuan helped Old Madam Kang out of the car and went to the audience section with Kang Ru. Every participant could bring their family to watch the competition. As it was the finals, the Kang family was all here.","Kang Jichuan instructed, “Qingzhi, don’t talk to Xi Xi when you see her. You can’t be blamed for what happened before. She brought it upon herself. If she comes looking for trouble with you again, I’ll support you.”","Kang Qingzhi shrunk her neck in fear and smiled sweetly. “Brother, I’m fine. If my sister doesn’t bully me anymore, don’t sue her. She’s your biological sister, after all.”","Kang Jichuan had a complicated expression. “The competition is about to start. Hurry up and go in.”","The moment Kang Qingzhi appeared, it immediately became lively. The reporters came over one after another. “Miss Kang, I’m your fan! Mu Jin was a sensation in the perfume world back then. Why did you give up this identity?”","“I bought all the perfumes you concocted back then, but the production has already stopped. Those perfumes have all become a collection. May I ask if there’s still a chance to resume production?”"]},{"number":1585,"title":"Chapter 1585 There Will Be A Fierce Battle Between Us","paragraphs":["1585 There Will Be A Fierce Battle Between Us","Faced with everyone’s questions, Kang Qingzhi replied very patiently, “At that time, I was young and just liked to make perfumes, so I casually chose a name and made a few bottles of perfumes. I didn’t expect the response to be so big. As for the ‘Smell of the Wind’ series of perfumes, my contract has expired and I can’t reproduce them.","“However, don’t be disappointed. Soon, Kang Corporation will release perfumes that represent the four seasons. I carefully concocted every bottle. They’ll definitely be more outstanding than ‘Smell of the Wind’ back then.”","If it were anyone else who said this, everyone would definitely think that this person was very arrogant. However, when Mu Jin said this, everyone could not help but look forward to it.","Now, Kang Qingzhi was hyping herself up before the competition and even publicizing Kang Corporation’s perfumes. Once she won the perfume competition, Kang Corporation would naturally not have to worry about sales.","!!","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the chair. “Other than Kang Junjie, did someone else invest in Kang Corporation?”","“Yes, Mr. Zheng from Sky Eye Venture,” Xue Yi replied.","Mr. Zheng? The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up.","“Little Six, are you prepared to expose this liar in the competition?” Xue Yi asked.","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “I do want to expose her, but I don’t want to expose my identity as Mu Jin.”","Xue Yi looked puzzled. If she did not expose her identity, how could she expose Kang Qingzhi?","“Don’t be anxious. We’ll talk about it after the competition.”","Seeing that Qiao Xi was so confident, Xue Yi did not ask further and muttered, “The Kang family has already praised Kang Qingzhi online as a genius that’s hard to come by in a hundred years. She’s the daughter of the Kang family to begin with. Now that her identity as Mu Jin has helped her gain a foothold, her evil plan will succeed if she really wins the championship for this competition.","“I heard that the Kang family wants to sue you. Unless you want to go to jail, you have to expose this liar’s identity and win the championship. You have to slap the Kang family’s faces!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and said casually, “I don’t intend to compete for the championship at all.”","Xue Yi instantly choked, looking shocked.","At this moment, Twilight was standing beside them and looking over.","“Even if I can’t win the championship, I can still expose her.”","Xue Yi said, “But...”","“Actually, the title of champion of the perfume competition isn’t attractive to me. For someone like Kang Qingzhi to win the championship twice in a row, it means that this position isn’t important. It’s meaningless even if I get it.”","Xue Yi: “...” That made sense. Little Six was capable enough to be a judge. Being the champion was indeed meaningless to her.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “I came to the event location today to announce to the world that not only is Kang Qingzhi pretending to be Mu Jin, but she also stole my perfume recipes five years ago. She’s a liar who doesn’t know how to make perfumes.”","Xue Yi suddenly became nervous. “But if you expose what happened five years ago, Kang Jichuan will know that you’ve recovered your memory.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Kang Jichuan is already prepared to send me to jail. Why should I still hide this fact? He hasn’t told Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang about what happened five years ago because he’s afraid that Kang Ru will blame him.","“If it were Kang Ru and I only wanted to find my biological daughter back then, I would definitely blame Kang Jichuan and take my anger out on Kang Qingzhi. However, the Kang family treats me as a thorn in their side now. Kang Jichuan can just say that he found me back then but because I was bullying Kang Qingzhi and wanted to expel her from the Kang family, he had no choice but to abandon me and use my blood to save Kang Qingzhi. How do you think... Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang will react?”","Firstly, Old Madam Kang would very much agree with Kang Jichuan’s actions. She would support Kang Jichuan and even urge him to continue taking Qiao Xi’s blood. As for Kang Ru, he could only reluctantly agree. However, there was another possibility. Kang Jichuan might draw Qiao Xi’s blood himself without telling anyone.","Qiao Xi chuckled. “I’ve been hiding the fact that I’ve recovered my memory because I wanted to see Kang Jichuan’s hypocritical appearance. He should be shocked by the sudden return of someone who should have died five years ago!”","“But I didn’t expect the Kang family to be so heartless. Back then, for Kang Qingzhi’s sake, they almost caused me to lose my life. Now that they completely hate me, they don’t care about my life anymore.","Xue Yi’s heart ached. “Xi Xi...”","Qiao Xi leaned against the chair, and a trace of ridicule suffused her eyes. “After Kang Jichuan finds out that I’ve recovered my memory, we’ll completely fall out. There’ll definitely be a fierce battle between us.”","From now on, she was no longer related to the Kang family by blood."]},{"number":1586,"title":"Chapter 1586 Confession Before The Competition","paragraphs":["1586 Confession Before The Competition","“Kang Ru keeps saying that he loves Mom, but he wasn’t able to marry her in his life. This time, not only do I want to cut ties with the Kang family, but I also want Mom to completely leave the Kang family!","“Five years ago, I didn’t understand why my mother left the Kang family. Now, I finally know that although Old Madam Kang bullied my mother, Kang Ru had always stood on his mother’s side. He thought that it didn’t matter if my mother suffered a little. As a woman of the Kang family, she had to learn to tolerate. The love that Kang Ru has is a shackle!","“He used my mother’s departure to create an affectionate image for himself. He got to enjoy everyone’s admiration and respect. The Kang family is really too hypocritical!”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Xue Yi’s heart ached a little. She held Qiao Xi’s hand tightly. “Little Six, no matter what you want to do, I’ll support you. Even if you cut off all ties with the Kang family, you still have many brothers and sisters. With the Yin family and Gu Zheng as your backers, dealing with the Kang family is easy.”","!!","Qiao Xi nodded wearily.","Xue Yi continued, “Actually, Gu Zheng doesn’t know how to express himself, but he really loves you. The Kang family once hurt you, so Gu Zheng won’t let them off.”","...","In Twilight’s lounge.","“Mrs. Gu is about to start a war with the Kang family, but you’re hiding here.” Ye Qingyuan walked in with a smile. “You were right before. I was indeed blind.”","Gu Zheng smirked. “She has never been a weak person. She just likes to pretend to be weak.”","Ye Qingyuan was a little embarrassed. “It’s all because your wife acts too well. Moreover, she’s so weak. The first time I saw her, you kissed her until she fainted. Of course, I thought that she was too weak, but I didn’t expect that the seemingly weak Mrs. Gu could actually stir up trouble in the Kang family alone. Kang Qingzhi’s evil nature can’t be hidden anymore!”","“She fainted from me kissing her?” Gu Zheng glanced at him and chuckled. “If you dare to tell her this, then you’ll have to face the consequences alone.”","Ye Qingyuan was speechless. Did Gu Zheng think he would do such a foolish thing?","“Gu Zheng, when I came, I saw the Kang family going to the contestants’ lounge. Old Madam Kang looked very angry. I went to the door of the lounge to listen and they seemed to be talking about something from five years ago.”","Gu Zheng instantly understood. Was Kang Jichuan trying to take the initiative and push all the blame on Xi Xi?","At the same time, in the Kang family’s lounge.","Kang Jichuan brought the family in. Kang Ru looked puzzled. “Jichuan, the competition is about to start. Why did you bring Qingzhi over?”","The competition was indeed very important, but that matter had to be said now. Kang Jichuan could not give Qiao Xi a chance. Once Qiao Xi obtained second or third place in the perfume competition, Dad would definitely take this opportunity to let Xi Xi return to the Kang family. The media would also publish news about the Kang family’s two daughters being perfumers. At that time, he would not be able to sue Qiao Xi.","However, if Qiao Xi did not go to jail, how could he get her blood to save Qingzhi?","After a few seconds of silence, Kang Jichuan braced himself. “Dad, there’s something I have to say now.”","Of course, Kang Qingzhi knew what Kang Jichuan was going to say. She pretended to be puzzled and looked at him.","“Dad, Grandma, I’m sorry. I’ve been hiding something from you. I found Xi Xi five years ago but didn’t bring her home.”","Kang Ru’s eyes widened. “What?”","“Five years ago, I met Xi Xi by chance and thought that she was very similar to my mother. After an investigation, I realized that she was the child my mother was pregnant with back then. At that time, you and Grandma were not in Y Nation, so I brought her home and transferred her to another university. I wanted to wait for you to come back and give you a surprise, but...”","He paused for a moment. “I didn’t tell you about Xi Xi because she couldn’t accept Qingzhi. Xi Xi knew that Qingzhi was an adopted daughter, so she thought that Qingzhi was occupying her identity. She kept bullying Qingzhi and even wanted to chase her away. It was fine if she bullied Qingzhi verbally, but she even stole Qingzhi’s perfume recipes and pushed Qingzhi down the stairs, causing Qingzhi to almost become disabled.”","The Kang family gasped.","Kang Ru looked up in shock. “Xi Xi... really did such a thing?”","“Yes.” Kang Jichuan looked heartbroken.","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with resentment. When she looked up again, she appeared confused. “Brother... But... But I don’t remember what you said. Sister didn’t know me five years ago!”","“It’s because Xi Xi pushed you down the stairs that time. You hit your head and lost your memory.”","Of course, Kang Jichuan would not tell Kang Qingzhi that she had lost her memory because of hypnosis. The reason he did that back then was because he hoped that Qingzhi and Xi Xi would forget their bad memories and start new lives. He did not expect things to develop to this point."]},{"number":1587,"title":"Chapter 1587 That Unique Perfume","paragraphs":["1587 That Unique Perfume","“As Xi Xi had done too many things that I couldn’t forgive, I had no choice but to let her leave. Later on, I was afraid that Dad would be sad if he found out, so I simply pretended that she never appeared.","“When Xi Xi appeared again, I thought that Xi Xi had turned over a new leaf after five years. However, I didn’t expect that she still couldn’t tolerate Qingzhi. She even...”","Before Kang Ru could speak, Old Madam Kang flew into a rage. “Vicious little b*tch! I already said that we can’t bring her home! Ah Ru, you’re worse than Jichuan!","“Five years ago, she pushed Qingzhi down the stairs. Now, she’s even slandering Qingzhi. We have to sue her and let her go to jail! We can’t let Qingzhi suffer!”","Kang Ru felt as if he had been struck by lightning, and his face suddenly turned pale.","He knew that Xi Xi did not like Qingzhi, but he did not expect Yunqiu’s daughter to actually push Qingzhi down the stairs and make her lose her memory. His heart was filled with sorrow, and he could not say a word.","Kang Jichuan took a deep breath. “Dad, I also want to make it up to her and dote on her, but she has disappointed me time and again. All these years, she has been wandering outside and has been tainted by too many bad habits. She can’t change them!”","Kang Ru frowned and clutched his chest in pain.","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head and smiled proudly.","“Dad, although Xi Xi is related to us by blood, she doesn’t treat us as family. Why force her?!”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was sitting in the lounge and listening to the Kang family’s conversation.","“Look at how he’s distorting the truth. Kang Jichuan is really shameless!” Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Ah Zheng, can you still find the surveillance footage from five years ago?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was extremely gentle. “Do you know the exact location and time?”","“In a villa in Y Nation’s Kang family. I remember that there’s a park nearby. That day, Kang Qingzhi fell down the stairs and was injured, but I can’t remember the details.”","Xue Yi: “...”","Her gaze shifted between Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi with a shocked expression.","Little Six was too forceful! She wanted Gu Zheng to look for the surveillance footage from five years ago just based on a vague location and time?","However, the next second, Gu Zheng nodded gently. “Alright, I’ll find the surveillance footage as soon as possible, but what do you want to do with it?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly. “Let’s talk after the competition ends. It’s better to be prepared!”","20 minutes later, the finals officially began. The ten contestants at the event location would compete, and in the end, three contestants would advance to compete for the championship.","“The champion will definitely be Kang Qingzhi! She’s Mu Jin. To be honest, there’s no need for her to participate at all. She’ll simply crush the other contestants.”","“The competition’s organizers didn’t stipulate that top perfumers can’t participate. Moreover, the remaining people are all famous in the industry. They’re just not as famous as Mu Jin.”","“Only Bright Moon is a newcomer. She entered the top ten in her first competition. Why haven’t I heard of such a powerful contestant before?”","Everyone sized up Bright Moon in confusion.","The perfume competition began. The theme of the competition was ‘scenery’. This theme was not difficult, but it was not that easy to make someone smell this perfume and think of the corresponding beautiful scenery.","When Qiao Xi saw this theme, she instantly recalled that there was a perfume recipe in Kang Qingzhi’s hand that had not been used. At that time, she named that perfume ‘Rime’.","The theme was scenery, so everyone would think of blooming flowers and the blue sky. If Kang Qingzhi was a little smarter, she would think of this unique perfume recipe. Rime was a natural scenery in the northern part of the country. It was neither ice nor snow. Instead, it was white sediment condensed by water vapor on tree branches. This sediment was beautiful, bright, and sparkling. It was like a blooming flower. It was a work of art bestowed by nature to humans.","There were definitely many people who would choose warm scenery. The judges wouldn’t find it interesting anymore. If a perfume based on cold scenery suddenly appeared, it would naturally attract everyone’s attention and liking. Hence, Kang Qingzhi would definitely use this perfume recipe.","Qiao Xi pondered for a moment and glanced at Kang Qingzhi. She seemed to have thought of something, and her eyes flashed. Then, she picked up a pen and wrote something on the paper.","The final battle would last for a total of three days. The contestants would start making incense at nine in the morning and end at seven in the evening. They would return to the lounge arranged by the competition’s organizers. They were not allowed to leave midway.","Soon, two days later, most of the contestants were almost done. There were still a few hours left tomorrow morning. The contestant could make the final adjustments. At 12 o’clock, the competition would officially end. After everyone had lunch, the judges would give the final results in the afternoon. They would also invite the 20 participants to judge together to ensure that the competition was fair."]},{"number":1588,"title":"Chapter 1588 Internally Decided Champion","paragraphs":["1588 Internally Decided Champion","“Qingzhi, the competition is about to end. Are you confident?” Kang Jichuan had just returned from the company. The packaging of the perfumes had already been put into production after much difficulty. What was next was publicity. When the results of the competition were out, the perfumes would immediately be released. This time, Kang Corporation’s perfumes would definitely be internationally renowned.","Kang Qingzhi smiled sweetly. “Don’t worry, Brother. I’m confident about winning the championship. I know those contestants very well. Their perfumes can’t compare to mine.”","“Alright!” Kang Jichuan’s eyes flashed with excitement.","“But Sister Xi Xi...” Kang Qingzhi said worriedly, “I don’t know Sister Xi Xi’s perfume skills, nor have I seen her perfumes. The judges gave her a very high evaluation during the audition and said that she has the ability to compete in the championship. I’m afraid that she...”","“Qingzhi, did Qiao Xi steal your perfume recipes to participate in the competition?” Old Madam Kang suddenly asked, her eyes filled with disdain.","“I... I don’t know.”","Kang Jichuan’s expression was serious. “You can participate in the competition in peace. If she really stole your perfume recipes to participate in the competition, I’ll get them back from her. Don’t think about past matters as that’ll only upset you.”","Kang Qingzhi raised her head, and her round eyes curved into crescents. “Alright, Brother. I’m just afraid that Sister Xi Xi... If she wins the championship...”","“Nonsense!” Old Madam Kang shouted sharply and cursed, “Jichuan, you absolutely can’t let that little b*tch become the champion. I don’t care what method you use, you must stop her!”","Kang Jichuan’s expression was a little subtle. Actually, even without tampering, Qingzhi would still be the champion. After all, those judges all knew that Qingzhi was the daughter of the Kang family and Mu Jin. If she was not the champion, it would definitely cause many people to be dissatisfied.","However, in order to ensure that nothing went wrong, he looked for the judges to have a chat with. After all, the Kang family’s assets were all in the perfume business. There could not be any mistakes.","The next day, on the last day of the finals.","At this moment, everyone’s perfumes had basically been completed. They also had some understanding of their rankings. The only thing they did not know was Bright Moon’s ranking. However, it was already rare for a new perfumer to enter the finals. She probably did not have the ability to compete for the top three.","At midnight, the staff took away the contestants’ perfumes and handed them to the judges for review.","Qiao Xi looked at Kang Qingzhi, who was surrounded by everyone trying to please her, and the corners of her mouth curled up in disdain.","...","Two in the afternoon.","The ten bottles of perfume were placed on the table in order. Qiao Xi’s number was ten, while Kang Qingzhi’s number was nine.","According to the judges’ average scores, Kang Qingzhi was ranked first after the first nine scores were given.","“Mu Jin’s perfume does smell good and is very special. She’ll definitely be in first place this time!”","“That’s right! Let’s decide on the champion first. We’ll consider the second and third-place winners after that.”","“Alright, then we’ll confirm that it’s Miss Kang.”","The judges unanimously agreed on this decision. Qiao Xi did not need to think to know that Kang Jichuan must have talked to the judges.","It had only been a few years, but the selection for the International Perfume Competition was already so casual. She remembered that when Madam Leng was still alive, the judges had to write down their thoughts on paper after giving their scores. In order to avoid getting overwhelmed by the perfumes and letting that affect their judgment, Madam Leng appointed judges at the event location to grade from the first perfume. Two would start from the tenth perfume while the other two would grade from the middle. Moreover, the interval between each time they smelled perfumes was fixed to ensure the fairness of the competition.","However, now... Ignoring the hidden tricks, they were not even willing to put on an act. They hurriedly decided on the championship as they were afraid that something would happen.","The judges subconsciously looked at each other and understood that Young Master Kang had already looked for them. Miss Kang had the identity of Mu Jin, and the perfume she made was indeed outstanding. Could Bright Moon be better than Mu Jin?","Kang Qingzhi smiled proudly and subconsciously glanced at Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi stood there indifferently and did not pay attention to the scene.","Her calm appearance made Kang Qingzhi furious.","Why was Qiao Xi always so cold? It was as if nothing she did could affect Qiao Xi. She wished for nothing more than to rush over and tear Qiao Xi’s face apart!","However, the International Perfume Competition was just the beginning. Soon, Qiao Xi would know what she was about to face. She wanted to see if Qiao Xi could still be arrogant at that time!","The contestants had also smelled the perfumes of the other nine candidates and had no objections to the rankings. As for the last bottle of perfume, they had not smelled it yet. It was to keep the competition in suspense. However, this was the first time the champion was announced before the score was even given.","Everyone agreed, except for Qiao Xi. The judge asked her unhappily, “Miss Bright Moon, what do you think?”"]},{"number":1589,"title":"Chapter 1589 Ask Mr. Twilight For His Opinion","paragraphs":["1589 Ask Mr. Twilight For His Opinion","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi while she blinked and asked with a surprised expression, “Why are you asking me? You’ve already decided. Is there a point in asking me? Could it be that you’ll listen to me if I don’t agree?”","The judge’s face instantly darkened. “Miss Bright Moon, in that case, do you mean to say that you don’t agree with our decision?”","A cold smile appeared on the corners of Kang Qingzhi’s mouth. Qiao Xi actually doubted the judges in public. She was really too stupid.","Qiao Xi chuckled and said, “I agree! If the judges think that Miss Kang is the champion, then so be it. However, shouldn’t you ask Mr. Twilight and the panel for their opinions? They weren’t invited here for show. They should express their opinions too, right?”","!!","The surroundings instantly fell silent. Kang Qingzhi’s body suddenly tensed up.","Gu Yao looked at Qiao Xi’s treacherous smile and could not help but gulp.","At this moment, the live-stream of the finals had already begun. The audience had all heard Qiao Xi’s words. Most of the audience came to watch the competition for Twilight. After all, he was popular. Other than being powerful in the perfume industry, his tall figure and temperament also won the hearts of many women.","As soon as the audience entered the live-stream, they realized that the judges had already determined the winner before Mr. Twilight could say anything. Then why did they invite Mr. Twilight?","The audience protested in the live-stream. When the person in charge realized this situation, he immediately informed the judges through the in-ear device. Their faces were ashen, but no one dared to offend Twilight. However, they had already promised Kang Jichuan that Kang Qingzhi would be the champion. Bright Moon actually used Twilight to suppress them. If there was a change in the championship, would Kang Jichuan let the matter go?","“I’m sorry...” At this moment, Kang Qingzhi said with a guilty expression, “It’s my fault for making things difficult for everyone.”","“I agree with Miss Bright Moon. The winner can’t be pre-determined to be me just because I’ve affected the rules of the competition. I believe that the judges can give a fair result. I also believe in my own strength. Even if we go through a re-selection, I’ll still be the champion.”","The judges looked at Kang Qingzhi gratefully, thanking her for standing up for them.","Seeing that Kang Qingzhi had given in, the audience in the live-stream suddenly felt that everyone seemed to have gone too far just now. They all knew that Kang Qingzhi was Mu Jin, so it was reasonable for her to be the champion!","“Alright, let’s have a re-evaluation. Mr. Twilight and the jury will also be included in the selection this time, in case anyone says that it’s unfair,” a judge said sarcastically.","Kang Qingzhi raised her head arrogantly with a confident expression. Qiao Xi wanted Twilight to participate in the judging because she wanted to snatch the championship. Unfortunately, Qiao Xi did not know that her brother had already met the six judges. Kang Qingzhi was definitely the winner of this competition!","So what if Twilight had the right to veto? Would he question everyone for Qiao Xi? If that were the case, everyone might suspect that Qiao Xi had bribed Twilight!","Kang Qingzhi agreed to the re-selection because she wanted Qiao Xi to lose all her dignity. She wanted her to know that even if she had the talent and strength to make perfumes, she would always be suppressed by her.","However, when Kang Jichuan, who was below the stage, heard about the reselection, his face suddenly turned pale. He had indeed bribed six judges, but he had never contacted the jury. If these people all supported Qiao Xi...","No! Impossible! With Mu Jin’s identity, they would choose Qingzhi!","Kang Jichuan was relieved as his gaze landed on Qiao Xi. He did not want to abandon his biological sister either, but he could only choose one between her and Qingzhi. Qingzhi had been by his side for so many years, so it was understandable for him to choose Qingzhi.","After the competition ended, he would sue Xi Xi and send her to jail. However, at the same time, he would arrange for someone to give Xi Xi the best environment so that she could repent for her mistakes in prison.","At this moment, the judges stood up and walked toward the perfumes. Twilight, who was sitting on the high seat, curled her lips into a meaningful smile.","His wife was really awesome. She made the competition’s organizers change their minds with just one sentence. Kang Qingzhi agreed to the selection because she thought that with Mu Jin’s identity, the judges would choose her. Unfortunately...","These people on the judging panel were the main judges chosen by Madam Leng when she was still alive. They could not be manipulated and only spoke the truth, they were not like the others who curried favor with the powerful. They would not accept Kang Jichuan’s money to decide the champion. Ever since Madam Leng passed away, these people lost their status as judges and gradually became juries who were not qualified to speak.","Actually, these people’s evaluation standards were higher than the six main judges. Moreover, the rankings they gave were absolutely fair. Kang Jichuan felt that the juries could not decide the final outcome of the competition, so he did not contact them at all."]},{"number":1590,"title":"Chapter 1590 Bright Moon And I Are Indeed Friends","paragraphs":["1590 Bright Moon And I Are Indeed Friends","Twilight glanced at Qiao Xi, suddenly stood up, and walked toward the stage.","The live-stream instantly became lively. Mr. Twilight was their idol. Although he did not make many perfumes, every one of them was a classic. Everyone finally waited for Mr. Twilight’s review and stared at the screen.","The judges had already smelled the first nine bottles of perfume, then turned to Bright Moon’s perfume. One of the jurors gently sniffed the fragrance and instantly widened his eyes.","They were all perfumers who had been in the industry for many years. They were people who really knew how to judge perfumes. The base notes of this bottle of perfume were very similar to Kang Qingzhi’s perfume, but it was completely different in the middle notes. It had a special charm that made one close one’s eyes and be immersed in the beautiful scenery.","Who was Bright Moon? The perfume she made was actually better than Kang Qingzhi’s!","After the 12 jurors smelled Bright Moon’s perfume, they already had an answer in their hearts.","At this moment, Twilight was already standing on the stage. His tall figure was especially eye-catching among the crowd. Kang Qingzhi’s work was very similar to Xi Xi’s, but Xi Xi’s work had a hint of infatuation compared to Kang Qingzhi’s.","Kang Qingzhi’s perfume recipes were stolen from Xi Xi five years ago, but five years had passed. Xi Xi’s standards had naturally improved. In the eyes of the six judges, Kang Qingzhi’s perfume was already outstanding enough, but in the eyes of a top perfumer like him, Kang Qingzhi’s perfume should not have used sandalwood.","It was supposed to be a perfume that evoked a cold feeling, so it seemed a little strange to use a sandalwood scent. Xi Xi probably would not make such a mistake. In other words, five years ago, Xi Xi knew that Kang Qingzhi was stealing her perfume recipes and deliberately changed one of the spices. Although the smell was still pleasant, it was flawed.","The truly perfect and flawless perfume Qiao Xi’s work today. It was a perfume that even a top perfumer like him could not help but praise.","“Mr. Twilight, may I what you think the best work is?” a judge asked respectfully, then glanced at Qiao Xi with disdain. How could a new perfumer compare to Mu Jin?","“Some people should see the truth as soon as possible and not put up a useless fight!” one of the judges said sarcastically.","Everyone looked at Twilight and waited for his answer. His eyes were calm as he said in a low voice, “The best perfume is”","The entire venue fell silent.","“Number 10, Miss Bright Moon.”","The atmosphere froze instantly, and it was eerily quiet. The proud expression on Kang Qingzhi’s face suddenly stiffened, turning from joy to shock and anger.","Everyone present was stunned, and they even suspected that they had heard wrongly.","How could it be Bright Moon?","Back then, Mu Jin’s Smell the Wind series stunned the entire perfume world. Was that new perfumer even better than Mu Jin?","After a long silence, the judges came back to their senses and asked in shock, “Mr. Twilight, what did you say?”","Kang Qingzhi also looked at Twilight with a pleading expression, hoping that he was wrong.","Twilight smirked. “What’s wrong with my answer?”","“Miss Kang is Mu Jin. How could you choose Bright Moon? Why didn’t you choose Miss Kang?” a judge couldn’t help but shout.","A trace of coldness flashed past Twilight’s eyes, then he sneered. “Why? Do I have to choose Kang Qingzhi just because you chose her? Then why did you invite me here? You can just choose on my behalf then.”","The netizens in the live broadcast were very dissatisfied when they saw the judges doubting Twilight. Everyone had different tastes and senses. Why couldn’t Twilight like Bright Moon’s perfume? Why did he have to choose Kang Qingzhi’s perfume?","Seeing that the situation was not good, Kang Qingzhi hurriedly went forward to stop the judges. Her tone was gentle. “Mr. Twilight, you’ve misunderstood. The judges aren’t forcing you to choose me. They’re just a little shocked to hear that you chose Bright Moon.","Everyone looked at Twilight. They all wanted to hear Twilight’s opinion. Everyone heard that Twilight had once saved Bright Moon and stood up for her. Could it be that she was chosen for personal reasons?","The next second, Twilight answered everyone’s doubts, “Bright Moon and I are indeed friends.”","Everyone instantly gasped, and Qiao Xi looked at him in confusion.","The corners of Kang Qingzhi’s mouth curled into a cold smile. With their relationship, Twilight’s selection would lose its fairness. Even if Qiao Xi’s score surpassed hers, she would not be acknowledged.","“If you don’t agree with the results I gave, I have no objections. However” He paused for a moment, and his voice carried a trace of mockery. “The six judges and Miss Kang’s brother, Mr. Kang Jichuan, have eaten meals together and the judges even received gifts from Mr. Kang. Are Mr. Kang and the six judges also friends?”"]},{"number":1591,"title":"Chapter 1591 The Jury’s Opinion","paragraphs":["1591 The Jury’s Opinion","The event location was eerily silent. Everyone was instantly dumbfounded, then they looked at Kang Qingzhi.","Before the finals, Kang Qingzhi’s brother, Kang Jichuan, treated the judges to a meal and gave them gifts. His intentions were too obvious!","The six judges looked embarrassed and quickly retorted, “Mr. Twilight, we’re friends with Mr. Kang. It was just a meal. If you say so”","“Yes, Miss Bright Moon and I are just friends,” Twilight said casually. His voice was so calm, but it was like a rock smashing into the judges’ hearts.","“Miss Kang and Mr. Kang can be friends with the judges, so can’t Bright Moon and I be friends?”","The judges instantly choked. Twilight and Bright Moon were friends, and they had dinner with Kang Jichuan and even accepted his gifts. If Twilight’s selection did not count, then theirs would be the same. How could this competition continue?","They looked at each other. After a while, they gritted their teeth and said, “Mr. Twilight, of course, we’ll agree with your opinion, but we should listen to the jury.”","Twilight had the right to veto. He was the most powerful judge present, but the final outcome was not up to him alone.","“Of course,” Twilight said without hesitation.","Right on the heels of that, a judge hurriedly said, “Please grade the ten contestants!”","They did not believe that all 12 jurors would choose Bright Moon. These people would not be bribed. Previously, Miss Kang had interacted with them, but those people were unwilling to meet Miss Kang at all, so they could only be forced to be jurors.","The jurors began to give their scores. The 12 of them gathered together to discuss for a while. In the end, they chose the most qualified person to speak on their behalf. “The results of this selection are basically the same. The champion we’ve decided on is the same as well.”","As soon as they finished speaking, everyone could not help but look at Kang Qingzhi. Kang Jichuan’s tense heart trembled. It seemed that these people had finally chosen Qingzhi.","The middle-aged man beside Kang Jichuan was an investor in Kang Corporation. He said excitedly, “Young Master Kang, do you know Miss Bright Moon? Someone who can obtain Mr. Twilight’s recognition must be very powerful!”","Kang Jichuan’s expression instantly darkened. Every time Qiao Xi appeared, she would snatch away Qing Zhi’s limelight. Why could they only see Qiao Xi?","The investor he had spent so much effort to get was not paying attention to Qingzhi at all at this moment. He was actually asking if he knew Qiao Xi?","“I can invest more, but the prerequisite is that the perfumes I invest in have to be made by Miss Bright Moon.”","The corners of Kang Jichuan’s mouth twitched. “Bright Moon is just a new perfumer. I’m afraid”","“I don’t mind!” The middle-aged man’s tone was firm. “I don’t care if she’s a newbie or not, but I believe in Mr. Twilight. Even if the investment fails, I won’t regret it. Mr. Kang, do you know Miss Bright Moon?”","Kang Jichuan’s expression froze as he gritted his teeth.","It was all Twilight’s fault. Why was he speaking up for Qiao Xi? Qingzhi was clearly more outstanding, yet he still determined Qiao Xi to be the champion!","President Mo instantly understood what he meant and smiled brightly. “Mr. Kang, don’t worry. Since I promised to invest in Kang Corporation, I won’t go back on my word. However, in business, when I meet someone I like more, I have the right to invest in others.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he turned around and said a few words to his assistant before the assistant left in a hurry.","When Kang Jichuan saw this scene, his expression was as gloomy as ink. He gritted his teeth and calmed down for a long time before smiling. “President Mo, after the competition ends, I’ll treat you to a meal. Qingzhi can come and see you then.”","President Mo agreed with a smile.","At this moment, the representative of the jurors said, “The first place winner we’ve decided on is”","Kang Jichuan held his breath. Qingzhi had participated in so many competitions, and this was the first time he was watching Qingzhi win the championship. At the dinner later, he had to make President Mo give up on investing in Qiao Xi. He raised his eyebrows confidently. “The reason Qingzhi could win the championship this time is”","Before he could finish, the jury’s voice resounded throughout the venue. “Bright Moon!”","This name echoed in the silent venue, shocking everyone until they could not come back to their senses for a long time.","The smile on Kang Jichuan’s face froze instantly. His eyes widened bit by bit, and his breathing suddenly stopped.","“Huh? Young Master Kang, what’s going on?” President Mo was a little surprised. “They’re saying that Miss Bright Moon is the champion!”"]},{"number":1592,"title":"Chapter 1592 Why Should We Sympathize With Her?","paragraphs":["1592 Why Should We Sympathize With Her?","Kang Jichuan’s teeth were chattering. “No No”","At this moment, Kang Qingzhi’s face was livid. She could not control her gradually ferocious expression. The judges were also stunned. One of them, Judge Sun, immediately pointed at the jurors and roared, “Say that again. Who’s the first-place winner?”","The representative of the jurors said seriously, “We all agree that the champion is Miss Bright Moon. Judge Sun, don’t be so agitated.”","“Miss Kang is Mu Jin. Why did you choose Bright Moon? Did you all accept Bright Moon’s money?”","When the jurors heard this, they could not help but sneer. “Judge Sun, what you said is laughable. Didn’t you all unanimously choose Miss Kang? Could it be that you accepted Miss Kang’s money?”","“Mr. Twilight chose Bright Moon, and you said that they’re friends so the selection is unfair. Now that we’ve chosen Bright Moon, you’re standing up to object. Will you only be satisfied if we choose Miss Kang? It looks like Judge Sun accepted Miss Kang’s money!”","Kang Qingzhi’s face instantly turned pale.","At this moment, the audience in the live-stream also belatedly realized that these six judges had been acting strange since the beginning. First, they chose the champion without asking Twilight and the jurors’ opinions. When Twilight and the judges unanimously chose Bright Moon, they stood up to object. Could it be that they were bribed by Miss Kang?","“Why do I feel that these judges have been bribed by Kang Qingzhi?! Even if Kang Qingzhi is really outstanding, it doesn’t mean that everyone has to choose her. If the rules say that they have to choose her, then what’s the point of this competition?”","Everyone’s doubtful voices came from the audience. President Mo subconsciously looked at Kang Jichuan and waved at his assistant to come over. “Bring some of Miss Bright Moon’s perfume over.”","Kang Jichuan felt as if he had been struck by lightning. His voice was filled with panic. “President Mo, you’re Qingzhi”","Before he could finish, everyone’s disdainful voices came from the surroundings. “Those six judges are so protective of Kang Qingzhi. They must have been bribed by her. Do you think Kang Qingzhi also bribed the judges to win the championship in the previous two competitions?”","At this moment, Kang Qingzhi, who was on the stage, bit her lip tightly. Tears welled up in her eyes. The people sitting in the audience were the families of the contestants, famous perfumers, and investors. When they saw her pretending to be weak, they snorted in disdain.","“They actually dare to question Mr. Twilight’s decision. No wonder they didn’t want Mr. Twilight to participate in the selection just now. It seems that they’ve already planned it out.”","Hearing the mocking voices around him, Kang Jichuan was instantly infuriated and roared, “Shut up!”","The few socialites and young masters who were muttering were shocked by this angry roar. They were stunned for a few seconds before retorting stubbornly, “Why are you shouting? Are we wrong?”","“She’s already crying. Can’t you have some sympathy?” Kang Jichuan shouted at the top of his voice. When he saw Qingzhi cry, he was annoyed. However, these people were still insulting Qingzhi!","When they heard Kang Jichuan’s words, they instantly laughed. “Why should we pity her?”","One of the girls stood up and retorted, “Bright Moon and Twilight are friends, so you said that she cheated. The Kang family treated the six judges to a meal and gave them gifts, but Kang Qingzhi is aggrieved?","“Now, the 12 jurors and Twilight all think that Bright Moon’s perfume is better, so Kang Qingzhi is crying. If she can’t afford to lose, then she should just go home and play. She shouldn’t disgust others here. This perfume competition isn’t held for her. If she can’t win the championship, she’ll cry to gain sympathy? We’re not her parents, so we won’t fall for her tricks!”","When everyone heard the girl’s words, they could not help but clap in their hearts. At the same time, they looked at Kang Jichuan strangely.","Kang Jichuan sensed the disdainful gazes around him, and his heart turned cold. He hurriedly explained to President Mo, “I’m sorry, President Mo. I’ve made a fool of myself. Actually, I I know Bright Moon. Her perfume skills can’t compare to Qingzhi, so I”","When President Mo heard the girl’s words, he also felt that the Kang family was unreasonable. He looked away coldly. “Young Master Kang, you like Miss Kang’s perfumes, but you have to allow others to like Miss Bright Moon’s perfumes too.”","Kang Jichuan’s face instantly turned pale, and he could not say anything for a moment.","At this moment, the assistant walked over and handed him a thumb-sized bottle. “President Mo, this is Miss Bright Moon’s work.”"]},{"number":1593,"title":"Chapter 1593 Deserved Champion","paragraphs":["1593 Deserved Champion","President Mo opened the bottle, and a refreshing and sweet smell spread out. It was as gentle as a young woman’s scent, making one unknowingly fall into it.","“Good! As expected of a perfume recognized by Mr. Twilight. It smells really good! I actually met a genius in this perfume competition. I’ll go look for Miss Bright Moon to discuss a collaboration later,” President Mo said excitedly.","Kang Jichuan’s lips moved. “President Mo, didn’t you say that you wanted to collaborate with Kang Corporation?”","“That was my original plan, but Miss Kang’s results have already been questioned. If I continue to invest in Kang Corporation, it’ll inevitably be risky. It shouldn’t be a problem for me to choose someone more outstanding, right?” President Mo had been in the business industry for so many years and naturally knew how to weigh the pros and cons.","In the beginning, he was only prepared to invest in Kang Corporation because of Mu Jin. However, the fact that the Kang family had bribed the judges meant that Miss Kang was not capable enough and did not have the confidence to win the championship. Moreover, the finals were live-streamed this time. If news of this got out, the Kang family’s reputation would definitely be affected. The risk of investing in Kang Corporation was too high. He did not need to take this risk.","Everyone looked at Kang Jichuan with ridicule.","“You’ve already bribed the judges, yet you still want investors to invest in Kang Corporation? Dream on!”","Kang Jichuan’s heart felt like it was stuffed with a huge rock, and his breathing was blocked. He wanted to reprimand this group of people, but he did not know how to retort.","He fell onto the chair weakly and looked at the stage with a cold gaze.","Now, the six main judges had all chosen Kang Qingzhi, while Twilight and the 12 jurors had all chosen Bright Moon. Who exactly was the champion?!","Judge Sun immediately stood up. “The jurors’ opinions are just a reference. They can’t interfere with the final outcome of the competition!”","“But Twilight also chose Bright Moon.”","Judge Sun gritted his teeth and retorted, “Twilight said that they’re friends. It’s normal for him to have selfish intentions.”","The jurors smiled. “You guys ate with Kang Qingzhi’s family and received expensive gifts from them. Are you considered friends?”","Judge Sun was speechless: “”","At this moment, Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Kang Qingzhi. She saw that her face was pale and her eyes were red. Her eyes were filled with resentment and horror.","Kang Qingzhi cared a lot about this competition because it involved the Kang Corporation’s perfume business. The Kang family had invested so much money. If they lost money because of an adopted daughter, she would not be able to raise her head in the Kang family anymore.","She looked at Kang Jichuan for help with a pitiful expression. Kang Jichuan’s heart ached. At the same time, he had an idea.","At this point, he could not show mercy anymore. As long as he posted the news of Qiao Xi secretly stealing the perfume recipes online and talked about what had happened five years ago, would everyone still think that she was the champion? Such an immoral person should not even be qualified to participate in the competition!","This was a little cruel to Xi Xi, but if Xi Xi had not wanted to compete with Qingzhi for the championship, he would not have had to harden his heart and treat her like this.","Xi Xi clearly knew that this perfume competition was very important to the Kang family. It concerned the Kang family’s business. If they were not careful, they would lose billions. It was fine if she did not help the Kang family, but she kept causing trouble behind their backs. She was not worthy of pity at all.","At the thought of this, Kang Jichuan made up his mind and sent his assistant a message.","At this moment, the judges were still arguing on the stage. Twilight just stood quietly at the side and looked at Qiao Xi. However, she had an indifferent expression as if she did not care about the championship at all.","Twilight’s eyes flickered. Had she never wanted to be the champion?","He chuckled and instantly understood Mrs. Gu’s thoughts. How could someone who could become a genius girl in the perfume world care about the title of champion?","However, she was undoubtedly the champion of this competition. Even if she did not want it, they could not let Kang Qingzhi have it easy.","“Everyone,” Twilight suddenly said and raised a jade token.","This jade pendant belonged to Madam Leng, the former president of the Perfume Association. The person who had this jade pendant could choose the final champion during a dispute. Twilight took out the jade pendant at this time.","Judge Sun said indignantly, “Mr. Twilight, you can’t do this. You’re friends with Miss Bright Moon. It’s unfair to Miss Kang for you to choose her.”","“Oh?” Twilight sneered and looked at the audience. “Do you think it’s fair?”","The perfume that President Mo had sent his assistant to bring over had already been distributed to the audience. The refreshing fragrance had already spread. Everyone said in unison, “It’s fair!”","“Miss Bright Moon is the champion!”","When Kang Qingzhi heard the deafening sound, her body swayed uncontrollably. She had never thought that she would lose so completely. Even the audience was on Qiao Xi’s side."]},{"number":1594,"title":"Chapter 1594 You Chose A Thief","paragraphs":["1594 You Chose A Thief","Twilight turned to look at Judge Sun and said with a disdainful smile, “Judge Sun, listen to the public’s opinion. Are you convinced now?”","Judge Sun was instantly speechless.","Apart from the six of them, everyone else supported Bright Moon. Even Kang Corporation’s investor was going to collaborate with Bright Moon. If it were just Twilight, they could say that Twilight and Bright Moon were friends, but could they say that everyone was bribed by Bright Moon?","Judge Sun looked at Kang Jichuan in a dilemma, then at Kang Qingzhi. He really had no choice.","“We We agree with Mr. Twilight’s decision. The champion of this perfume competition is”","Kang Qingzhi bit her lip tightly, her eyes filled with resentment and unwillingness.","Why?! Why did Qiao Xi become the champion? She should have died five years ago. Now, not only was she alive and well but she even became Gu Zheng’s wife and stole the championship title that originally belonged to her!","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with tears. Every cell in her body was clamoring to kill Qiao Xi, but no matter how angry she was, she could not change this outcome.","“The champion is Bright Moon!”","“I object!” At this moment, an old and sharp voice sounded from below the stage. Old Madam Kang abruptly stood up with a ferocious expression as she glared at Qiao Xi like a wild beast.","“This b*tch isn’t worthy to be the champion at all! Are you all blind? Qingzhi is clearly more outstanding than her. Have you all been bewitched by this vixen?! You bunch of trash and idiots! What right do you have to snatch Qingzhi’s championship?”","Old Madam Kang’s life had been smooth sailing. She had a noble status and endless money. Now, she just wanted Kang Qingzhi to be the champion of the perfume competition. With the Kang family’s power, it was completely possible.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Old Madam Kang continued to roar, “Bright Moon, that b*tch, doesn’t know how to make perfumes at all. She stole all her perfume recipes from Qingzhi! Our Qingzhi is Mu Jin. She keeps a low profile and isn’t willing to show off, but you actually chose a thief and let her steal Qingzhi’s championship title! If you don’t return the championship title to Qingzhi today, I’ll turn the world upside down and let the netizens know that there’s a conspiracy in the perfume competition!”","Old Madam Kang’s eyes were muddy and vicious. She gritted her teeth and said, “Bright Moon! You little bastard, if you dare to bully Qingzhi again, I’ll kill you!”","The venue fell into a dead silence.","Wasn’t Old Madam Kang a noble? Why were her words so harsh?","Qiao Xi looked at Kang Ru calmly, and he looked over as well. There was blame in his eyes. He felt that she had snatched Kang Qingzhi’s championship title and thought that she was being unreasonable. She deserved it even if Old Madam Kang insulted her.","Qiao Xi withdrew her gaze and sneered in her heart.","The jury all looked at Twilight. “Sir, this”","Before they could finish, someone exclaimed, “Look at the news online! Bright Moon stole Kang Qingzhi’s perfume recipes five years ago. Even after she was exposed, she refused to return them.”","Everyone hurriedly took out their phones. The first piece of news on the trending topics was about Bright Moon.","[Everyone is condemning Kang Qingzhi, but you don’t know the truth at all. Qingzhi just doesn’t want a thief to win the championship. I didn’t want to participate in this matter, but I really can’t bear to see Qingzhi being wronged.]","This post was released by a famous perfumer, Yun Cang. He had not produced any works for many years, but he still had a certain status in the perfume world.","[Five years ago, Bright Moon deliberately approached Qingzhi and stole her perfume recipes. However, Qingzhi didn’t suspect Bright Moon. It wasn’t until the 20 or so perfume recipes she lost were all found in Bright Moon’s room that she believed this fact. However, Qingzhi was afraid that this matter would have a negative impact on Bright Moon, so she didn’t announce it to the public. Qingzhi and I have been friends for many years, so I’ve always known about this.","[Qingzhi has always treated Bright Moon as a friend. Not only did she not make things difficult for her, but she also supported her in continuing to learn how to make perfumes. Bright Moon refused to return the perfume recipes, but Qingzhi didn’t mind. Now, Bright Moon actually shamelessly used Qingzhi’s perfume recipes to participate in the competition and even stole the championship title that should belong to Qingzhi. Of course, Young Master Kang and Old Madam Kang would be angry. Bright Moon is clearly a thief, but she could become the final champion. All of you are scolding Qingzhi right now. Is there any justice in this world?!]"]},{"number":1595,"title":"Chapter 1595 Flawless Perfume","paragraphs":["1595 Flawless Perfume","When everyone saw the news released by Yun Cang, they were instantly stunned and looked at Qiao Xi.","“Miss Bright Moon, is what Yun Cang said true?”","Originally, everyone was lamenting that another genius girl had appeared in the perfume world. Unexpectedly, Bright Moon stole Kang Qingzhi’s perfume recipes.","Suddenly, someone broke the silence. “If Bright Moon stole Miss Kang’s perfume recipes five years ago, then were the perfume recipes used for today’s competition Miss Kang’s too?”","The judges instantly reacted and compared the two perfumes.","“If you take a closer sniff, the first notes of the two bottles of perfume are indeed identical. The middle and end notes are also a little similar!”","Perfume might smell different even if it was made with the same spices. However, the smell of these two bottles of perfume was so similar, which meant that the ingredients were mostly the same. It was obvious that someone had plagiarized the other party!","Kang Qingzhi had long caused a sensation in the perfume world as Mu Jin. There was also the perfumer, Yun Cang, who testified, so everyone thought that the person who plagiarized was Bright Moon!","Judge Sun immediately said self-righteously, “No wonder Mr. Twilight and the judges thought that Miss Bright Moon’s perfume was good. After all, this bottle of perfume was copied from Miss Kang!","“Perfume No. 10, which everyone likes, was actually developed by Miss Kang, so the championship should belong to Miss Kang. I’ll revoke the qualifications of this plagiarist. What do you think?”","Twilight did not answer and instead glanced at Qiao Xi. Her expression was calm, and the corners of her mouth even curled into a cold smile as if she had long expected this scene.","“Mr. Twilight, what do you think?” Judge Sun smiled obsequiously.","Gu Zheng’s light brown eyes were extremely deep as he said in a low voice, “Mr. Sun, as a judge for the competition, you should be able to distinguish it too. These two bottles of perfume are similar, but the feeling they evoke is worlds apart. Bright Moon’s perfume is clearly softer. The cold aura is mixed with a hint of sweetness, like wild roses blooming in the snow. As for Miss Kang’s perfume, it’s a little strange.”","The moment that was said, all the judges’ expressions changed.","Since they could become judges, they naturally had the ability to judge. There was only one difference between Bright Moon’s and Kang Qingzhi’s perfumes, but it was this one difference that made Bright Moon’s perfume have a better effect while it gave Kang Qingzhi’s perfume an indescribable feeling.","If Bright Moon had really plagiarized Kang Qingzhi and made a more perfect perfume, it meant that she was stronger than Kang Qingzhi. However, since she had the ability to make perfumes, why did she plagiarize?","The representative of the jury said softly, “It’s obvious that Miss Bright Moon’s perfume is more perfect. Every spice is fused together, making it softer and sweeter. As for Miss Kang’s perfume, although it’s not bad, one of the spices is inappropriate, making the fragrance a little abrupt. Miss Bright Moon has the ability to change the flaws in the original perfume recipe. In that case, she doesn’t need to steal someone else’s perfume recipes, right?”","When Old Madam Kang heard this, she was instantly infuriated. “Nonsense! It’s that little b*tch who stole Qingzhi’s perfume recipes. Are you being unreasonable?! Do you have to protect this little vixen?!”","Twilight’s eyes suddenly turned cold.","There were still tears on Kang Qingzhi’s face as she said pitifully, “I admit that Bright Moon is very talented in perfumes, but she did steal my perfume recipes. I wrote this recipe five years ago. It’s just that I never released it.”","Five years ago Everyone gasped.","Kang Qingzhi looked at Qiao Xi with a complicated gaze. “Miss Bright Moon, you approached me back then for the perfume recipes. I didn’t want to ruin your future, so I didn’t bicker with you. However, this competition is very important to me”","She sighed softly. “You’ve indeed improved very quickly in the past five years. I’m very happy that you were able to change the flaw in my perfume recipe, but even if you’ve improved it, the perfume recipe belongs to me. Miss Bright Moon, I hope you can face reality.”","After a few seconds of silence, Kang Qingzhi said helplessly, “I have a special relationship with Bright Moon. I owe her, so I didn’t expose her even though I knew that she stole my perfume recipes.”","Below the stage, Kang Jichuan instantly understood what Qingzhi meant. She occupied the identity of the daughter of the Kang family and felt that she owed Xi Xi, so she had been tolerating it. This time, Qingzhi did not continue to give in because it involved the Kang family’s interests. She had to stand up for her rights!","Kang Qingzhi suddenly choked. “I’ve always been tolerant in the past, but I didn’t get a trace of gratitude in return. Hence, I don’t intend to tolerate it this time. This is my perfume recipe from five years ago”","With that, Kang Qingzhi took out her phone and handed it to the judges. There was a photo of the perfume on the screen. It was taken five years ago."]},{"number":1596,"title":"Chapter 1596 Counter-Attack","paragraphs":["1596 Counter-Attack","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly. She had to admit that Kang Qingzhi was really smart and had made sufficient preparations.","However, at that time, she was imprisoned by Kang Jichuan and had to have a few tubes of blood drawn every once in a while. When Kang Jichuan was not around, Kang Qingzhi would abuse her and force her to write perfume recipes.","In order to survive, she could only listen to Kang Qingzhi. However, every perfume recipe she wrote was flawed, so the perfume recipes in Kang Qingzhi’s hand were deliberately planted by her.","After that, she was hypnotized by Kang Jichuan and lost a portion of her memory. However, she still remembered the perfect versions of the perfume recipes.","At this moment, the judges specially displayed that photo on the big screen to ensure that everyone could see it. The spices in the perfume recipe were exactly the same as the ones used in Kang Qingzhi’s perfume.","The judges’ representative looked at Qiao Xi helplessly. “Miss Bright Moon, can you take out the perfume recipe you wrote? Moreover, it has to be done before Miss Kang.”","Kang Qingzhi had written this perfume recipe five years ago. If Bright Moon did not have an earlier photo, it would prove that Kang Qingzhi was the original creator. It would also prove that Bright Moon stole the perfume recipe.","Everyone looked at Bright Moon with anticipation. They were unwilling to believe that such an outstanding perfumer was a thief!","However, in the next second, Qiao Xi said frankly, “No.”","Everyone shook their heads in disappointment.","“So you admit it, right?!” Judge Sun shouted excitedly.","Kang Qingzhi also smiled proudly. It was impossible for Qiao Xi to have a photo because she was imprisoned at that time and did not have the chance to take a photo.","“Mr. Sun was right just now. Plagiarists indeed shouldn’t be standing in the arena,” Qiao Xi suddenly said. Her eyes burst with light, and her tone was firm. “But I’m not the one who’s going to be chased out! Today, I’m going to report Miss Kang under my real name. She stole more than 20 of my perfume recipes five years ago!”","The huge venue instantly fell silent. Everyone even thought that they had heard wrongly.","Kang Qingzhi’s heart trembled violently. She could not control the ferocious look on her face and roared, “Nonsense!”","“Bright Moon!” Kang Jichuan also roared. “You were the one who stole Qingzhi’s perfume recipes, yet you’re actually biting back? How did you become like this?!”","Qiao Xi did not even bother to look at Kang Jichuan. Her cold gaze landed on Old Madam Kang and Kang Ru.","The moment their eyes met, Old Madam Kang’s eyes were filled with panic and uneasiness. Qiao Xi was very sure that Old Madam Kang knew very well what Kang Qingzhi had done back then.","She was clearly the real daughter of the Kang family, but Old Madam Kang helped the adopted daughter abuse her, plot against her, and take away everything that belonged to her.","As for Kang Ru, his face was filled with shock, causing Qiao Xi to find it laughable.","Kang Qingzhi sobbed pitifully. “Bright Moon, it was you five years ago You stole my perfume recipes when I wasn’t paying attention. Everyone in the Kang family knows about it, yet you’re actually maligning me in public!","“I really treated you as a friend in the past, so I didn’t say anything. I thought that you would turn over a new leaf, but I didn’t expect you to push all the blame on me. How can you be so heartless?”","Everyone was instantly stunned.","“Miss Bright Moon and Miss Kang are friends?”","“Miss Kang treats her as a friend, but she took the opportunity to steal her perfume recipes. Now, she’s even slandering Miss Kang in public. This is too much!”","“Get out of here! Bright Moon isn’t worthy to be a perfumer!”","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head and revealed a sinister smile.","At this moment, Kang Jichuan had already rushed to the stage and protected Kang Qingzhi. He looked at Qiao Xi with anger in his eyes. “Let’s end it here!”","“Mr. Kang, do you believe in Miss Kang so much?” Qiao Xi asked coldly.","“Of course. Qingzhi wouldn’t lie,” Kang Jichuan replied without hesitation.","Qiao Xi nodded. “Alright! I hope you won’t regret it.”","She wanted to see Kang Jichuan’s expression when the truth was revealed. His sister, whom he trusted so much, had a different side to her. He probably could not accept it!","“Everyone here knows how to make perfumes, so everyone can also tell that there’s a difference between these two bottles of perfumes. Although there’s only one spice that’s different, the smell is very different. Most importantly, the theme of this perfume competition is ‘scenery’. Some people would think of flowers and a blue sky when they think of the word ‘scenery’, while others would think of snow.","“Miss Kang’s perfume evokes a cold feeling at first glance, but a large amount of sandalwood was added to it, making the originally clear and sweet smell heavy. It’s so nondescript that people can’t tell what’s trying to be expressed.”"]},{"number":1597,"title":"Chapter 1597 Too Smart","paragraphs":["1597 Too Smart","“Miss Kang, you claim to be Mu Jin, so why would you make such a mistake? Could it be that the scenery in your heart fluctuates between hot and cold?”","Everyone could not help but laugh.","Kang Qingzhi’s face instantly turned pale. “Bright Moon, you Why are you saying all this? Even if my perfume is flawed, it can’t prove that it’s yours.”","Qiao Xi glanced at her indifferently. “Miss Kang, don’t be agitated. I’m not done.”","“Most of the participants would prepare some perfume recipes before the competition and improve them according to the theme. However, Miss Kang actually took out a perfume recipe that was not released five years ago. Moreover, this perfume recipe even deviated from the main theme. Why is that?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth suddenly curled up as she said slowly, “Could it be because Miss Kang only has this one recipe that barely fits the theme of ‘scenery’?”","Everyone gasped.","Everyone understood what Bright Moon meant. Kang Qingzhi’s perfume recipe did not match the theme and was flawed. It was understandable if it was written in a hurry before the competition, but this perfume recipe was from five years ago. In the past five years, she should have produced more outstanding works or made some preparations for the theme. Why did she choose an incongruous recipe from five years ago?","There was only one reason, and that was that she had no other choice. It also meant that she did not know how to make perfumes at all!","The jury and Twilight both noticed the flaw in her perfume recipe, but as Mu Jin, Kang Qingzhi did not notice it at all. In that case","“You’re framing me!” Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were red as she defended herself aggrievedly. “Everyone has different understandings of the theme. I think this perfume recipe matches the theme very well. I even took out a photo from five years ago!","“Bright Moon, you deliberately chose the same perfume recipe as me to snatch my championship title. You’re too despicable!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Miss Kang, you’ve misunderstood.”","Kang Qingzhi’s expression froze, and her heart suddenly thumped violently.","Qiao Xi smiled wantonly with a trace of laziness and carefreeness. “I didn’t choose this perfume recipe to compete for the championship. I just wanted to expose you in public!”","Kang Qingzhi’s mind buzzed, and her ears seemed to have quietened down.","“Miss Kang, you stole more than 20 of my perfume recipes. In the past five years, you’ve participated in competitions and released more than ten perfumes in succession. There aren’t many recipes left in your hands now. Among the remaining perfume recipes, only Rime matches the theme. Moreover, it’ll stand out from the other contestants’ perfumes, which can help you gain the upper hand.","“I guessed your thoughts, so I used the same perfume recipe as you. Miss Kang, you thought you were so smart, didn’t you?”","The moment that was said, the entire venue was in an uproar. Kang Qingzhi felt as if she had been struck by lightning.","“That’s right! Miss Bright Moon knows so much about Kang Qingzhi’s perfume recipe, but Kang Qingzhi doesn’t know anything about the flaws in the perfume recipe. Isn’t that obvious enough?”","“Shut up!” Kang Jichuan shielded Kang Qingzhi behind him and glared at him. “Bright Moon, can you stop fooling around? Are you really going to ruin Qingzhi?”","Qiao Xi smiled without commenting.","That was right! She wanted to destroy Kang Qingzhi. She wanted the Kang family to know that Kang Qingzhi was the real jinx!","She looked up slightly and said casually, “I guess Miss Kang might say that this is just a coincidence. Well, don’t be in a rush to retort. I have other evidence.","“Everyone knows very well that in order to prevent anyone from copying and plagiarizing, high-level perfumers won’t announce their formulas. Miss Kang has released more than ten perfume recipes in the past five years, and I have the complete versions of them.”","As soon as she finished speaking, more than ten bottles of perfume were sent to the stage.","Qiao Xi casually picked up a bottle and introduced it. “This bottle of perfume was the work of Miss Kang who won the championship two years ago. Miss Kang named it ‘Green Jade’. Actually, the agarwood in it should’ve been changed to lily orchid. Moreover, this bottle of perfume was originally called ‘Immortal Land’.","Kang Qingzhi’s body trembled. Qiao Xi opened the bottle of ‘Immortal Land’ in public. Everyone present had smelled Kang Qingzhi’s perfume that won the championship. At first, the smell was a little similar, but they gradually realized that this bottle of ‘Immortal Land’ was even fresher and the smell was higher.","Everyone knew how to make perfumes, so they naturally knew that this bottle of ‘Immortal Land’ was better than Kang Qingzhi’s ‘Green Jade’.","Right on the heels of that, Qiao Xi picked up another bottle. “This is Miss Kang’s work that won the championship three years ago. Miss Kang called it ‘Sunset’, but the real name of this bottle of perfume is ‘Hot Love’. These two bottles of perfume are also different from the other perfumes.”"]},{"number":1598,"title":"Chapter 1598 We Want To Take The Suspect Away","paragraphs":["1598 We Want To Take The Suspect Away","A member of the jury muttered, “Three years ago, when I first smelled Miss Kang’s perfume, I thought it was very stunning. It’s just that the end notes were a little strange, and the name didn’t match. So this is how it is”","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale. The horror in her heart drowned her bit by bit like a tide. She gritted her teeth and retorted, “Nonsense! If I really stole your perfume recipes, why would I release those flawed versions? You were clearly the one who deliberately researched my perfumes and modified them to malign me. You’re using this to go against me!”","Everyone was also very puzzled. Kang Qingzhi was not a fool. Since she wanted to steal, why didn’t she steal the perfect perfume recipes but the flawed ones?","“Heh.” Qiao Xi sneered, and her eyes were filled with ridicule. “Miss Kang, don’t you know this? Since the perfume recipes I wrote were destined to be stolen or snatched away by you, why should I leave the perfect versions to you? Five years ago, when I was in the Kang family’s villa, I knew that you would steal my perfume recipes, so I deliberately changed one of the spices. Hence, the 20 or so perfume recipes you stole are all flawed.”","Kang Qingzhi’s heart trembled, and her body gradually stiffened.","At this moment, Kang Jichuan could not help but think of five years ago. Xi Xi had told him that Qingzhi had stolen her perfume recipes, but Qingzhi cried aggrievedly and said that the perfume recipes were hers. Xi Xi wanted to steal them and fought back after she was discovered.","At that time, he believed Qingzhi’s words. All these years, Qingzhi had not let him down. She had won two consecutive championships in the perfume competition, which made him even more sure of his choice back then.","However, at this moment, he felt inexplicably flustered.","He said with a gloomy expression, “Bright Moon, let’s talk about this in private.”","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with heartache. Qingzhi stole Xi Xi’s perfume recipes? Then why didn’t Xi Xi tell him? Did she not trust him?","Everyone looked at Kang Qingzhi with strange gazes. Her expression was extremely ugly, and she could only lower her head and grit her teeth. Fortunately, Qiao Xi did not have any substantial evidence. All of this was just her side of the story, so there was still room for negotiation.","Right!","Kang Qingzhi instantly looked up, and her expression was vicious for a moment. “Bright Moon, you said that you knew that I would steal your perfume recipes, so you deliberately changed one of the spices. In that case, why did you stay in the Kang family’s villa?”","At this moment, Old Madam Kang pointed at Qiao Xi and cursed, “That little b*tch was greedy for the Kang family’s wealth, so she was unwilling to leave!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Since you have such a question, I’ll answer it. I’m just afraid that you won’t dare to confront me after.”","She glanced coldly at the Kang family. “Old Madam Kang said that I wanted to stay with the Kang family because I coveted the Kang family’s wealth. In that case, don’t blame me for not showing the Kang family any mercy.”","Kang Ru hurriedly went forward and said in a gentle voice, “Xi Xi Bright Moon, you can talk to me about it if you have problems. You don’t have to I’m not targeting you. Jichuan and Qingzhi don’t want to make things difficult for you either. How did you end up like this? At that time, you were the one who wanted to stay in the Kang family. How could you blame Qingzhi? Moreover, even if those perfume recipes were yours, it won’t be a problem to give them to Qingzhi. After all, you’re”","At this point, Kang Ru paused. He did not have the courage to reveal Qiao Xi’s identity in public.","Kang Ru looked at her in disappointment. “Bright Moon, since you gave the perfume recipes to Qingzhi but changed the important spices, you Aren’t you harming her?”","A member of the jury was unhappy. “Mr. Kang, whether the perfume recipes were stolen or given by Bright Moon, Kang Qingzhi can’t participate in the competition with someone else’s perfume recipes. She even accused Bright Moon of plagiarism. You’re Miss Kang’s father, so of course, you have to protect her. However, you can’t be so unreasonable.”","Kang Ru retorted with an ashen expression, “What do you know? Qingzhi is careful and kind. It’s impossible for her to”","Qiao Xi looked at the man in front of her and lost her patience. She interrupted coldly, “Everyone, let’s return to the original question. Why did I still stay in the Kang family’s villa when I clearly knew that my perfume recipes would be stolen?”","Kang Qingzhi’s face was pale, and her thin body swayed slightly as if she was going to faint the next second.","“Because” Qiao Xi’s voice was cold.","Judge Sun’s expression froze as he hurriedly stopped him loudly. “Mr. Xue, what are you doing? Your Xue family is indeed an investor in the perfume competition, but you can’t be so arrogant!”","Xue Liang glanced at him coldly. “We want to take a suspect away. Don’t you agree, Judge Sun?”","Suspect? Everyone was puzzled."]},{"number":1599,"title":"Chapter 1599 Imprisoned For A Hundred Days","paragraphs":["1599 Imprisoned For A Hundred Days","At this moment, the police officer behind Xue Liang, Yuan Shan, walked in front of everyone and raised the arrest warrant. “I’m sorry to have disturbed this competition for everyone. After investigation, Madam Qiao Xi was imprisoned in the Kang family’s villa for a hundred days five years ago. The evidence is conclusive. We’ll take the two suspects away to cooperate with the investigation. Mr. Kang Jichuan, Madam Kang Qingzhi, please.”","Boom!!!","Yuan Shan’s words were like a thunderclap that exploded in everyone’s ears. They understood what the police officer meant. Bright Moon’s real name was Qiao Xi. Most importantly, it was not Bright Moon who wanted to stay with the Kang family five years ago. In fact, Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan were the ones who imprisoned Bright Moon for a hundred days!","Kang Ru’s expression instantly stiffened, and her eyes were filled with shock. “How is that possible?!”","Xue Liang said coldly, “I think I heard Mr. Kang say that Little Six willingly stayed in the Kang family’s house. In that case, you know about the imprisonment too. Mr. Kang, please go to the police station to cooperate with the investigation.”","Kang Ru’s face turned red as he gritted his teeth. “Y-You”","Xue Liang looked at the Kang family coldly. “If Mr. Kang and Old Madam Kang can’t give me a reasonable explanation, I can only take the two of you away.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Miss Kang, this is the reason why I couldn’t leave the Kang family. It’s because I was imprisoned by you. Moreover, you forced me to write those perfume recipes. In order to survive, I was forced to hand the perfume recipes to you.”","Kang Qingzhi gritted her teeth and explained, “I didn’t imprison you. I just let you come to our house as a guest!”","Officer Yuan Shan had already said that the evidence was conclusive, so naturally, no one believed Kang Qingzhi’s words.","Kang Ru watched as the police cuffed Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi away. He instantly panicked and hurriedly chased after them. “Qingzhi! Jichuan! What exactly is going on?”","Kang Jichuan’s mind was a mess. He was still in shock and did not answer Kang Ru’s words. Kang Qingzhi, who was at the side, had tears in her eyes as she said aggrievedly, “Dad! I didn’t do it! Sister Xi Xi gave the perfume recipes to me, but she’s saying that I stole them. Dad, you have to save me!”","At this moment, Kang Jichuan suddenly turned his head and stared at Kang Qingzhi. He suddenly felt that the sister in front of him was so unfamiliar. Back then, Qingzhi insisted that she wrote those perfume recipes and even said that Xi Xi stole her perfume recipe. He reprimanded Xi Xi, but Xi Xi said that Qingzhi was the real thief.","At that time, he thought that Xi Xi had made a mistake but refused to repent. Hence, in a fit of anger, he locked her in the basement.","Could it be that the perfume recipes were really Xi Xi’s? Had Qingzhi lied?","“Brother, you don’t believe me either?” Kang Qingzhi sensed Kang Jichuan’s gaze, and her tears welled up even more. She looked at him with a sad expression. “I’m really not lying. Sister Xi Xi did steal my things, but she didn’t steal the perfume recipes. I was indeed selfish, so I didn’t make myself clear. I was afraid that you would listen to Sister Xi Xi and chase me out of the house.","“Brother, my health has been poor since I was young. If I was really chased out of the house, I definitely wouldn’t be able to live. I was really afraid”","Kang Qingzhi sobbed helplessly. Kang Jichuan was silent for a moment and could only comfort her helplessly. “Don’t cry. It’s not all your fault.”","They could not blame her, but could they blame Xi Xi? Xi Xi was clearly the victim!","For the first time, Kang Jichuan doubted his decision. He did not expect Xi Xi to have suffered so much. No wonder her eyes were filled with despair when she looked at him.","“Little bastard, she called the police over such a small matter! Not only will she embarrass the Kang family, but our perfume business will also be affected. Why won’t this b*tch die?!”","Ignoring the fact that everyone was present, Old Madam Kang cursed crazily, “We should have killed her and her damned mom back then. There wouldn’t have been so much trouble if we had done that!”","Kang Jichuan suddenly came back to his senses.","That was right! Xi Xi was wronged, but everything she did would have a huge negative impact on the Kang family. She was a child of the Kang family. Couldn’t she think about the Kang family?","The guilt that had just surged in his heart suddenly dissipated. Instead, there was a trace of anger and blame.","When Kang Ru heard that Old Madam Kang wanted to kill Xia Yunqiu and Qiao Xi, he did not react. He knew that his mother had always had a sharp tongue but a soft heart. Her words were a little vicious, but she would not really hurt Yunqiu and Xi Xi."]},{"number":1600,"title":"Chapter 1600 We Know We’ve Lost To You","paragraphs":["1600 We Know We’ve Lost To You","Officer Yuan Shan had a serious expression. At this point, the Kang family did not feel guilty or repentant. They actually said that they wanted to kill Miss Qiao?","Was there no law here? As a noble family in Y Nation, could they hurt others at will?","Before the final results of the competition were out, Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan were taken away by the police. Everyone present was shocked.","“Sigh” A member of the jury sighed and broke the silence. “I really didn’t expect the genius young lady of the perfume world, Mu Jin, to be such a person”","Everyone was also extremely disappointed. Mu Jin was their goddess. They did not expect all her work to be stolen.","“No.” Suddenly, Twilight, who had been silent all this while, said, “Kang Qingzhi isn’t the real Mu Jin. She stole Mu Jin’s account.”","The jury exclaimed, “Mr. Twilight, how do you know this?”","Twilight subconsciously glanced at Qiao Xi, then the corners of his mouth twitched. “Because I know the real Mu Jin.”","Qiao Xi’s heart instantly skipped a beat. What did this man mean?","“I knew it! It’s impossible for Mu Jin to do those things! Not only did Kang Qingzhi steal Bright Moon’s perfume recipes, but she also pretended to be Mu Jin. Such a person should be arrested!”","“Kang Qingzhi still wants to be the champion? I think she should return the trophies from the previous two competitions. She’s underserving!”","“She stole the perfume recipes, imprisoned Bright Moon, pretended to be Mu Jin, and even bit back. After she was discovered, she cried to gain sympathy. How can there be such a disgusting person in the world?!”","“When I think of Kang Qingzhi’s face, I feel nauseous. She always looks pitiful as if she has suffered a great grievance when in fact, she has done too many bad things!”","“The Kang family is powerful. They’ll protect Kang Qingzhi this time, right?” someone suddenly asked.","“That’s right! The Kang family is all blind, especially Old Madam Kang. She’s so vulgar. I really don’t know how she became the madam of a noble family!”","Old Madam Kang was about to leave when she heard this. Anger instantly surged in her heart. Her eyes were bloodshot and filled with resentment. The muscles on her face were trembling.","Little b*tch!","Back then, when she failed to kill Xia Yunqiu, that b*tch ran away with her child. Now, she had to kill Qiao Xi! The Kang family could not be destroyed in the hands of this little b*tch!","As long as Qiao Xi did not die, the Kang family would not have peace!","After the Kang family left dejectedly, someone said tentatively, “Then the champion is”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone looked at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi had an uninterested expression. “I came here today to expose Kang Qingzhi’s true colors, not to win the championship. Continue the competition.”","As she spoke, Qiao Xi put her perfumes into her bag and prepared to leave. Everyone had regretful expressions.","“Miss Bright Moon! Wait!” Just as Qiao Xi was about to leave, a female participant spoke with an urgent voice. “You’re undoubtedly the champion of this perfume competition. Our standards are utterly inferior to yours. We know that we’ve lost to you. If you’re not the champion, who among us is qualified to be the champion?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise, and the eight participants present nodded.","She smiled sweetly. It seemed that not all people in the perfume competition were vermin like Judge Sun and Kang Qingzhi. Most people still advocated fairness and justice!","However, Qiao Xi did not accept the championship trophy in the end. She walked outside. The autumn wind blew, and the fallen leaves on the street fell. She subconsciously gathered her coat.","“Miss Qiao, where are you going?”","A cold male voice sounded. Qiao Xi turned around slightly and met those deep light brown eyes.","Twilight stood at the door. His dark blue coat perfectly accentuated his figure, and his black mask added a sense of mystery to the man in front of her. As long as he appeared, he could easily attract the attention of girls.","Qiao Xi stared at him for a few seconds before slowly saying, “I remember you saying that you wore a mask because you were disfigured, but why do I feel that you just don’t want others to see your true appearance?”","Twilight chuckled. “So, you’re curious about this, Miss Qiao. I thought you’d ask about me knowing Mu Jin.”","Qiao Xi instantly choked and looked away in embarrassment. “What does it have to do with me that you know Mu Jin? Why should I ask anything about that?”"]}]);
